module.exports = [{"id":"m-geo-tuxing-chubu","title":"几何图形初步","subtitle":"人教版七上 · 第6章 几何图形初步","grade":"7a","tags":["图形与几何","几何图形初步"],"blocks":[{"type":"note","title":"教材章节","text":"人教版七上 · 第6章 几何图形初步"},{"type":"note","title":"一句话概述","text":"认识立体图形与平面图形，掌握直线、射线、线段与角的表示、度量及基本性质。"},{"type":"h","text":"先看图里有什么：把线段与角画出来"},{"type":"p","text":"几何题先把图形画出来：线段有两个端点，角由共顶点的两条射线组成。图上要标清「谁与谁相等」——AM=MB 表示 M 把 AB 分成两段相等的线段，∠ AOC=∠ BOC 表示 OC 把 ∠ AOB 分成两个相等的角。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-tuxing-jichu-1","title":"线段与角的基本图形","caption":"线段有中点、角有平分线，都表示「两段相等」","view":"square","alt":"上半部分是线段 AB，点 M 是它的中点，AM 与 MB 相等；下半部分是以 O 为顶点的角 COD，射线 OE 平分这个角，角 COE 与角 EOD 相等。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":15,"y1":30,"x2":85,"y2":30},{"t":"line","x1":32.5,"y1":27.6,"x2":32.5,"y2":32.4,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":67.5,"y1":27.6,"x2":67.5,"y2":32.4,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":21,"text":"AM=MB","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":15,"y":30,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":85,"y":30,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":30,"label":"M","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":4.6},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":86,"x2":18,"y2":54},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":86,"x2":82,"y2":54},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":86,"x2":50,"y2":54,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":86,"from":45,"to":90,"r":9,"label":"∠1"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":86,"from":90,"to":135,"r":9,"label":"∠2"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":86,"label":"O","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":18,"y":54,"label":"C","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":-1},{"t":"dot","x":82,"y":54,"label":"D","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-1},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":54,"hollow":true,"tone":"accent","label":"E","labelDx":1,"labelDy":-2.5}]}},{"type":"h","text":"抓住相等的量：中点与平分线都给出「一半」"},{"type":"p","text":"把已知标到图上：C 是 AB 的中点就标出 AC=CB，D 是 AC 的中点就标出 AD=DC。中点的作用是「把一条线段二等分」，角平分线的作用是「把一个角二等分」，两者都是把整体写成一个量的一半。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-tuxing-jichu-2","title":"把已知条件标在线段上","caption":"AB=10，C 是 AB 中点，D 是 AC 中点","view":"square","alt":"线段 AB 长为 10 厘米，点 C 是 AB 的中点，AC 与 CB 相等；点 D 是 AC 的中点，AD 与 DC 相等，要求出线段 BD 的长。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":15,"y1":46,"x2":85,"y2":46,"width":0.7},{"t":"line","x1":32.5,"y1":43.4,"x2":32.5,"y2":48.6,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":67.5,"y1":43.4,"x2":67.5,"y2":48.6,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":23.7,"y1":44.2,"x2":23.7,"y2":47.8,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":41.3,"y1":44.2,"x2":41.3,"y2":47.8,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":62,"text":"AB=10 cm","size":3.8,"anchor":"middle"},{"t":"dot","x":15,"y":46,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":85,"y":46,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":46,"label":"C","labelDx":-1,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"dot","x":32.5,"y":46,"label":"D","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":5}]}},{"type":"h","text":"建立关系：把条件翻译成等式再运算"},{"type":"p","text":"把几何语言翻成等式：OC 平分 ∠ AOB 就写 ∠ BOC=∠ AOC=(1)/(2)∠ AOB；再按位置关系决定用加法还是减法，如 ∠ AOB=∠ AOC+∠ BOC（相加）、∠ AOC=∠ AOB-∠ BOC（相减）。未知量多时设未知数，借互余、互补列一元一次方程。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-tuxing-jichu-3","title":"用角平分线写出等角关系","caption":"OC 平分 ∠ AOB，∠ AOC=∠ BOC","view":"square","alt":"以 O 为顶点的角 AOB 等于 140 度，射线 OC 把它平分，角 AOC 与角 BOC 相等，各为 70 度。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":45,"y1":80,"x2":87,"y2":80},{"t":"line","x1":45,"y1":80,"x2":12.8,"y2":53},{"t":"line","x1":45,"y1":80,"x2":59.4,"y2":40.5,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":45,"y":80,"from":0,"to":70,"r":11,"label":"70°"},{"t":"angle","x":45,"y":80,"from":70,"to":140,"r":11,"label":"70°"},{"t":"dot","x":45,"y":80,"label":"O","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":87,"y":80,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":12.8,"y":53,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":59.4,"y":40.5,"label":"C","labelDx":1,"labelDy":-2.5}]}},{"type":"h","text":"换个图形再想：点在「直线」上不止一种位置"},{"type":"p","text":"「点 C 在直线 AB 上」与「C 在线段 AB 上」只差一个字：C 也可能在 A 外侧的延长线上。此时两点在定点 A 同侧用减法、异侧用加法，答案往往有两解。见到「直线」「射线」就先想一想是否需要分类讨论。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-tuxing-jichu-4","title":"点 C 的位置不同，结论也不同","caption":"C 在线段上或在延长线上，要分类讨论","view":"square","alt":"上图点 C 在线段 AB 上，M、N 分别是 AB、AC 的中点，MN 等于 AM 减 AN；下图点 C 在点 A 外侧的延长线上，M、N 在点 A 的两侧，MN 等于 AM 加 AN。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":14,"y1":30,"x2":86,"y2":30},{"t":"dot","x":14,"y":30,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":86,"y":30,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":38,"y":30,"label":"C","labelDx":-1,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":30,"label":"M","labelDx":0.5,"labelDy":4.8},{"t":"dot","x":26,"y":30,"label":"N","labelDx":-1,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":44,"text":"MN=AM−AN","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":6,"y1":74,"x2":96,"y2":74},{"t":"dot","x":8,"y":74,"label":"C","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":44,"y":74,"label":"A","labelDx":-1,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"dot","x":92,"y":74,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":68,"y":74,"label":"M","labelDx":0.5,"labelDy":4.8},{"t":"dot","x":26,"y":74,"label":"N","labelDx":-1,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":88,"text":"MN=AM+AN","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"h","text":"核心概念"},{"type":"p","text":"立体图形与平面图形：各部分不都在同一平面内的几何图形叫立体图形（如棱柱、圆柱、圆锥、球），各部分都在同一平面内的叫平面图形。同一个立体图形从正面、左面、上面看可得到不同的平面图形，沿某些棱剪开还能展开成平面图形。"},{"type":"p","text":"直线、射线、线段：直线没有端点、向两方无限延伸；射线有一个端点、向一方无限延伸；线段有两个端点。记法必须写清端点，射线 OA 与射线 AO 不是同一条射线：端点不同、方向相反。"},{"type":"p","text":"两个基本性质（直线与线段）：经过两点有且只有一条直线，这是直线的基本性质，常用来解释「木板钉两个钉子就能固定」；两点之间的所有连线中，线段最短，这是线段的基本性质，也是「两点间距离」的依据。两条性质描述的对象不同，不能混用。"},{"type":"p","text":"线段的中点（判定与性质）：性质：若 M 是线段 AB 的中点，则 AM=MB=(1)/(2)AB。判定：若点 M 在线段 AB 上，且 AM=MB（或 AM=(1)/(2)AB），则 M 是线段 AB 的中点。判定中「点在线段上」这个条件不能丢，否则点可能落在延长线上。"},{"type":"p","text":"角与角的度量：有公共端点的两条射线组成的图形叫做角，公共端点叫角的顶点。度、分、秒之间是 60 进制：1^°=60，1=60，加减运算要注意借位与进位。"},{"type":"p","text":"角的平分线（判定与性质）：性质：若 OC 是 ∠ AOB 的平分线，则 ∠ AOC=∠ BOC=(1)/(2)∠ AOB。判定：若射线 OC 在 ∠ AOB 的内部，且 ∠ AOC=∠ BOC，则 OC 平分 ∠ AOB。判定里「在角的内部」是前提，两条射线分居角外侧时结论不成立。"},{"type":"p","text":"互为余角与互为补角：两角之和等于 90^°，则这两个角互为余角；之和等于 180^°，则互为补角。互余、互补只与角的度数有关，与两个角的位置无关。性质：同角（或等角）的余角相等，同角（或等角）的补角相等。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"线段中点与角平分线的基本计算\n多以选择、填空出现，常与余角补角、度分秒换算综合，也会设未知数列方程求角；踩分靠先画图标量，写清「因为……所以……」并注明中点、角平分线依据，度分秒按 60 进制进退位。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"正方体的展开图与相对面判断\n常以展开图识别命题，与空间想象、动手操作结合；踩分点是按「一四一」「二三一」等类型核对，先确定三组相对面再想象折叠，含「田」字形的图形一定不能折成正方体。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"互余互补关系的方程综合题\n解答题中给出角之间的倍分、和差关系求角度，常与一元一次方程综合；踩分靠设未知数、依据互余互补列方程并回代检验，注意「同角或等角的余角相等」要先有同角或等角的前提。"},{"type":"table","title":"公式与定理","head":["公式/定理","表述","注意"],"rows":[["线段中点的数量关系","AM=MB=(1)/(2)AB","必须满足点 M 在线段 AB 上；若 M 在线段外，即使 AM=MB 也不是中点"],["两点之间线段最短","连接两点的所有连线中，线段最短；两点之间线段的长度，叫做这两点之间的距离。","不能说成「两点之间直线最短」——直线是向两方无限延伸的，本身没有长度"],["度、分、秒的换算","1^°=60, 1=60","60 进制。减法不够减时先借 1^° 当 60，例如 90^°=89^° 60"],["互为余角","∠ A+∠ B=90^°","只有锐角才可能有余角；「同角或等角的余角相等」中「同角或等角」是前提"],["互为补角","∠ A+∠ B=180^°","互补的两个角不一定相邻，位置关系不影响结论；两个钝角不可能互补"]]},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"已知线段 AB=10 cm，点 C 是 AB 的中点，点 D 是 AC 的中点，求线段 BD 的长。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-tuxing-zhongdian-2","title":"两次取中点求 BD","caption":"C 是 AB 中点，D 是 AC 中点","view":"square","alt":"线段 AB 长为 10 厘米，C 是 AB 的中点，D 是 AC 的中点；要求线段 BD 的长，可先求 AD 再用 AB 减去它。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":12,"y1":46,"x2":88,"y2":46,"width":0.7},{"t":"line","x1":31,"y1":43.4,"x2":31,"y2":48.6,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":69,"y1":43.4,"x2":69,"y2":48.6,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":21.5,"y1":44.2,"x2":21.5,"y2":47.8,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":40.5,"y1":44.2,"x2":40.5,"y2":47.8,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":62,"text":"AB=10 cm","size":3.8,"anchor":"middle"},{"t":"dot","x":12,"y":46,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":88,"y":46,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":46,"label":"C","labelDx":-1,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"dot","x":31,"y":46,"label":"D","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":5}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["由 C 是 AB 的中点（已知），得 AC=CB=(1)/(2)AB=(1)/(2)× 10=5（cm）（线段中点的性质）。","由 D 是 AC 的中点（已知），得 AD=DC=(1)/(2)AC=(1)/(2)× 5=2.5（cm）。","点 D 在线段 AB 上，故 BD=AB-AD=10-2.5=7.5（cm）。","检验：用另一种拆法，BD=BC+CD=5+2.5=7.5（cm），两种算法结果一致。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：BD=7.5 cm。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"线段计算题先把已知量标在图上，再判断未知线段该用「整体减部分」还是「部分加部分」，最后换一种拆法验算。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"已知 ∠ AOB=140^°，OC 平分 ∠ AOB，OD 在 ∠ BOC 的内部且 ∠ BOD=20^°，求 ∠ AOD 的度数。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-tuxing-jiao-1","title":"角的平分线与和差","caption":"OC 平分 ∠AOB，OD 在 ∠BOC 的内部","view":"wide","alt":"以 O 为顶点的角 AOB 等于 140 度，射线 OC 平分该角，角 AOC 与角 BOC 各为 70 度；射线 OD 在角 BOC 内部，角 BOD 为 20 度、角 COD 为 50 度，角 AOD 等于角 AOC 加角 COD 为 120 度。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":40,"y1":66,"x2":80,"y2":66},{"t":"line","x1":40,"y1":66,"x2":12.4,"y2":42.9},{"t":"line","x1":40,"y1":66,"x2":53.7,"y2":28.4},{"t":"line","x1":40,"y1":66,"x2":71.9,"y2":54.4},{"t":"dot","x":40,"y":66,"label":"O","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":12.4,"y":42.9,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":80,"y":66,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":53.7,"y":28.4,"label":"C","labelDx":1,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":71.9,"y":54.4,"label":"D","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":2},{"t":"angle","x":40,"y":66,"from":70,"to":140,"r":8,"label":"70°"},{"t":"angle","x":40,"y":66,"from":20,"to":70,"r":6,"label":"50°"},{"t":"angle","x":40,"y":66,"from":0,"to":20,"r":6,"label":"20°"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["由 OC 平分 ∠ AOB（已知），得 ∠ BOC=∠ AOC=(1)/(2)∠ AOB=(1)/(2)× 140^°=70^°（角平分线的性质）。","因为 OD 在 ∠ BOC 的内部，所以 ∠ COD=∠ BOC-∠ BOD=70^°-20^°=50^°。","所以 ∠ AOD=∠ AOC+∠ COD=70^°+50^°=120^°。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：∠ AOD=120^°。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"把「谁在谁的内部」用图形标清，再决定用减法还是加法；位置关系判断错是这类题丢分的主要原因。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"一个角的补角比它的余角的 3 倍还大 10^°，求这个角。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-tuxing-yuvu-2","title":"同一个角的余角与补角","caption":"x 的余角是 90^°-x，补角是 180^°-x","view":"square","alt":"以 O 为顶点，一条射线把平角分成角 x 与它的补角 180 度减 x；再作一条与一边垂直的射线，分出角 x 与它的余角 90 度减 x。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":2,"y1":82,"x2":92,"y2":82},{"t":"line","x1":28,"y1":82,"x2":28,"y2":16},{"t":"line","x1":28,"y1":82,"x2":70.4,"y2":31.4,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":28,"y":82,"from":0,"to":50,"r":10,"label":"x"},{"t":"angle","x":28,"y":82,"from":50,"to":90,"r":14,"label":"90°−x"},{"t":"angle","x":28,"y":82,"from":90,"to":180,"r":17,"label":"180°−x"},{"t":"dot","x":28,"y":82,"label":"O","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":4.5}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["设这个角为 x^°，由互为补角、互为余角的定义，它的补角是 (180-x)^°，余角是 (90-x)^°。","由题意列方程：180-x=3(90-x)+10。","解方程：180-x=280-3x，移项得 2x=100，所以 x=50。","检验：50^° 的补角是 130^°，余角是 40^°，3× 40^°+10^°=130^°，符合题意。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：这个角是 50^°。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"求角度设未知数列方程比逐步推算更稳；注意「有余角」隐含这个角小于 90^°，解得的结果要检验。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"一个正方体的平面展开图按「一四一」型排列：中间一排 4 个正方形从左到右依次记为 A、B、C、D，A 的正上方是 E，D 的正下方是 F。写出折成正方体后与 B、E 相对的面，并说明判断依据。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-tuxing-zhengfangti-1","title":"正方体展开图「一四一」型","caption":"同色的一对面，折成正方体后相对","view":"square","alt":"正方体展开图，一四一型：中间一排从左到右四个正方形 A、B、C、D，A 的正上方是 E，D 的正下方是 F；其中 B 与 D 同色、E 与 F 同色，折成正方体后分别相对。","prims":[{"t":"rect","x":18,"y":18,"w":16,"h":16,"label":"E","tone":"ok"},{"t":"rect","x":18,"y":34,"w":16,"h":16,"label":"A"},{"t":"rect","x":34,"y":34,"w":16,"h":16,"label":"B","tone":"accent"},{"t":"rect","x":50,"y":34,"w":16,"h":16,"label":"C"},{"t":"rect","x":66,"y":34,"w":16,"h":16,"label":"D","tone":"accent"},{"t":"rect","x":66,"y":50,"w":16,"h":16,"label":"F","tone":"ok"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["先把中间一排围成正方体的侧面：A、B、C、D 依次相邻，隔一个面的两个面相对，所以 A 对 C、B 对 D。","E、F 分别折成正方体的上、下两个底面，它们折好后不相邻，正好相对，所以 E 对 F。","检验：六个面两两相对恰好分成三组，A 与 C、B 与 D、E 与 F，没有遗漏也没有重复，与正方体恰有三组相对面的事实一致。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：与 B 相对的是 D，与 E 相对的是 F（三组相对面为 A 对 C、B 对 D、E 对 F）。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"展开图找相对面抓住两点：同一排中间隔一个正方形的两个面相对；分布在这排两侧、折后当上、下底的两个面相对。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"已知线段 AB=12 cm，点 C 在直线 AB 上且 AC=4 cm，点 M、N 分别是线段 AB、AC 的中点，求线段 MN 的长。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-tuxing-zhongdian-3","title":"点 C 的两种位置","caption":"C 在线段上 MN=4，在延长线上 MN=8","view":"square","alt":"上图点 C 在线段 AB 上，AB 为 12、AC 为 4，M、N 分别是 AB、AC 的中点，MN 等于 AM 减 AN 为 4；下图点 C 在 A 外侧的延长线上，M、N 在 A 的两侧，MN 等于 AM 加 AN 为 8。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":16,"y1":30,"x2":88,"y2":30},{"t":"dot","x":16,"y":30,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":88,"y":30,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":40,"y":30,"label":"C","labelDx":-1,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"dot","x":52,"y":30,"label":"M","labelDx":0.5,"labelDy":4.8},{"t":"dot","x":28,"y":30,"label":"N","labelDx":-1,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"text","x":46,"y":44,"text":"MN=6−2=4","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":4,"y1":74,"x2":90,"y2":74},{"t":"dot","x":4,"y":74,"label":"C","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":24,"y":74,"label":"A","labelDx":-4.5,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"dot","x":84,"y":74,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":54,"y":74,"label":"M","labelDx":0.5,"labelDy":4.8},{"t":"dot","x":14,"y":74,"label":"N","labelDx":-1,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"text","x":44,"y":88,"text":"MN=6+2=8","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["点 C 只说在「直线 AB 上」，可能在线段 AB 上，也可能在点 A 外侧的延长线上（AC=4<AB=12，不可能在 B 外侧），所以先画两种位置的图，分类讨论。","情况一：C 在线段 AB 上。AM=(1)/(2)AB=6，AN=(1)/(2)AC=2，且 N、M 都在射线 AB 上，故 MN=AM-AN=6-2=4（cm）。","情况二：C 在点 A 外侧的延长线上。仍有 AM=6、AN=2，但 M、N 位于点 A 的两侧，故 MN=AM+AN=6+2=8（cm）。","用坐标法检验：令 A=0、B=12，情况一 C=4 时 M=6、N=2，距离为 4；情况二 C=-4 时 M=6、N=-2，距离为 8，两种结果都成立。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：MN 的长为 4 cm 或 8 cm。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"「点在直线上」与「点在线段上」一字之差，前者要分类讨论；中点的一半照算，但两点在定点同侧用减法、异侧用加法。"},{"type":"list","title":"易错点","items":["射线 $OA$ 与射线 $AO$ 不是同一条射线：端点不同、延伸方向相反，只有端点相同且延伸方向相同的射线才是同一条。","「两点之间线段最短」不能写成「两点之间直线最短」，直线无限延伸、没有长度，不存在「最短」的说法。","度分秒是 60 进制，计算 $90^\\circ-37^\\circ 28\\prime$ 时要把 $90^\\circ$ 化成 $89^\\circ 60\\prime$ 再减，按十进制直接减会得到错误结果。","判断线段中点必须同时满足「点在线段上」和「到两端点距离相等」；例如 $AM=MB$ 但 $M$ 在线段 $AB$ 外的延长线上时，$M$ 不是中点。","「同角（或等角）的余角相等」有前提，只有同一个角或相等的角才成立，随意两个角的余角不一定相等。","正方体的表面展开图共有 11 种，判断能否折成正方体要按「一四一」「二三一」「二二二」「三三」几类核对或动手折，凭感觉很容易错。"]},{"type":"list","title":"解题方法","items":["线段与角的计算先画图、把已知量标在图上，再用「整体减部分」或「部分加部分」求未知量。","见中点先写「一半」的等量关系，见角平分线先写两个相等的角，把几何条件翻译成等式再运算。","求角度时设未知数，利用互余、互补、角平分线的关系列一元一次方程，比逐步推算更不易出错。","度分秒的加减按 60 进制列式计算：相加满 60 进 1，相减不够减向前借 1 当 60。","立体图形与展开图问题动手做模型或折叠验证，把空间关系转化成平面图形关系再判断。"]}],"questions":[{"id":"m-geo-tuxing-chubu-q1","type":"choice","stem":"下列说法中正确的是","answer":"C","explain":"直线 AB 与直线 BA 是同一条直线，A 错；射线 AB 与射线 BA 端点不同、方向相反，不是同一条射线，B 错；经过两点有且只有一条直线，不在同一直线上的三点画不出同一条直线，D 错；两点之间线段最短是线段的基本性质，C 正确。","options":["直线 AB 与直线 BA 是两条不同的直线","射线 AB 与射线 BA 是同一条射线","两点之间的所有连线中，线段最短","经过平面内不在同一直线上的三点，一定可以画出一条直线"],"difficulty":1,"tags":["直线射线线段","基本性质"]},{"id":"m-geo-tuxing-chubu-q2","type":"choice","stem":"一个角的补角是它的 3 倍，则这个角是","answer":"B","explain":"设这个角为 x^°，由互为补角得 180-x=3x，解得 x=45。检验：45^° 的补角是 135^°，正好是 45^° 的 3 倍。","options":["30^°","45^°","60^°","135^°"],"difficulty":1,"tags":["互为补角","列方程求角"]},{"id":"m-geo-tuxing-chubu-q3","type":"choice","stem":"90^°-37^° 28 的结果是","answer":"A","explain":"度分秒是 60 进制，把 90^° 化成 89^° 60，再作差：89^° 60-37^° 28=52^° 32。选项 52^° 72 是忘记「分」满 60 进 1 而写成 72 分，属于典型错误。","options":["52^° 32","53^° 32","52^° 72","53^° 28"],"difficulty":1,"tags":["度分秒","角的计算"]},{"id":"m-geo-tuxing-chubu-q4","type":"fill","stem":"已知线段 AB=8 cm，点 M 是 AB 的中点，点 N 是 AM 的中点，则 MN= ____ cm。（只填数字）","answer":"2","explain":"由 M 是 AB 的中点得 AM=(1)/(2)× 8=4（cm）；由 N 是 AM 的中点得 MN=(1)/(2)× 4=2（cm）。","difficulty":1,"tags":["线段中点","线段计算"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-tuxing-chubu-q4","title":"M 是 AB 的中点，N 是 AM 的中点","caption":"同一种记号表示两段相等：AN=NM，所以 MN 是 AM 的一半、AB 的四分之一","view":"wide","alt":"一条线段 AB，点 M 在 AB 的正中间（M 是 AB 的中点），点 N 在 A 与 M 的正中间（N 是 AM 的中点）；AN 与 NM 上画有相同的等长记号。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":8,"y1":40,"x2":92,"y2":40,"width":0.8},{"t":"line","x1":18.5,"y1":38.5,"x2":18.5,"y2":41.5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":39.5,"y1":38.5,"x2":39.5,"y2":41.5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"dot","x":8,"y":40,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":92,"y":40,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":40,"label":"M","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":29,"y":40,"label":"N","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8}]}},{"id":"m-geo-tuxing-chubu-q5","type":"fill","stem":"已知 ∠ A=30^° 25，则 ∠ A 的补角是 ____。（写成「149°35′」这样的度分形式，中间不加空格）","answer":"149°35′|149度35分","explain":"180^°-30^° 25：把 180^° 化成 179^° 60，再相减得 149^° 35。写成十进制的 149.58^° 虽然相等，但不符合度分秒的书写规范。","difficulty":2,"tags":["互为补角","度分秒"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-tuxing-chubu-q5","title":"互为补角：两角拼成一个平角","caption":"∠DAB 与 ∠BAC 拼成平角 CAD，所以 ∠BAC = 180° − ∠DAB","view":"square","alt":"点 A 在直线 CD 上，射线 AB 在直线上方：∠DAB 等于 30 度 25 分，它与 ∠BAC 合起来正好是平角 180 度，所以 ∠BAC 等于 149 度 35 分。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":5,"y1":72,"x2":95,"y2":72},{"t":"line","x1":26,"y1":72,"x2":70.8,"y2":45.7,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":26,"y":72,"from":0,"to":30.42,"r":14,"tone":"ok","label":"30°25′"},{"t":"angle","x":26,"y":72,"from":-180,"to":-329.58,"r":22,"label":"149°35′"},{"t":"dot","x":5,"y":72,"label":"C","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":26,"y":72,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":95,"y":72,"label":"D","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":70.8,"y":45.7,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":92,"text":"补角就是「凑成 180° 的那只角」","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"}]}},{"id":"m-geo-tuxing-chubu-q6","type":"short","stem":"「经过两点有且只有一条直线」与「两点之间的所有连线中线段最短」都是基本性质，请说明它们各自刻画的是什么，并各举一个生活中的例子。","answer":"「经过两点有且只有一条直线」刻画的是直线的确定性：只要确定两个点，直线就被唯一确定，其中的「有」说明存在性，「只有一条」说明唯一性，常用来解释木板上钉两个钉子就能固定木条。「两点之间的所有连线中线段最短」刻画的是线段在长度上的最小性：连接两点的曲线、折线都比线段长，它给出「两点间距离」的定义依据，常用来解释为什么走直路比绕路近、为什么把弯曲的河道改直可以缩短航程。两条性质的区别在于：前者讲「直线有几条」，后者讲「哪种连线的长度最小」。","explain":"本题考查对两条基本性质的辨析与迁移。评分要点：一是分别说明两条性质各自回答的问题（一条是「经过两点有几条直线」，另一条是「哪种连线最短」）；二是各举一个合理的生活实例；三是指出两者侧重点不同。常见失分点：把两条性质混为一谈只背条文不举例，或把「两点之间线段最短」说成「直线最短」。","difficulty":2,"tags":["基本性质","辨析"],"rubric":["说明第一条性质表达的是一条直线被两点唯一确定（存在且唯一）","说明第二条性质表达的是线段在所有连线中长度最短","各举出一个合理的生活实例","指出两条性质的侧重点不同（确定直线条数 / 连通长度最小）"]},{"id":"m-geo-tuxing-chubu-z1","type":"choice","stem":"下列关于正方体展开图的说法，正确的是","answer":"D","explain":"6 个正方形随意连成的图形（如「田」字形、一排 6 个）折时会重叠或缺面，A、C 错；相对的面折好后没有公共棱，B 错；先分组找相对面再想象折叠是规范的判断方法，D 正确。","options":["只要含有 6 个正方形的平面图形，就一定能折成正方体","正方体展开图中，原来相对的两个面一定相邻且有一条公共边","展开图中出现「田」字形的四个正方形时，仍能折成完整的正方体","判断能否折成正方体时，可先在展开图中找出三组相对的面，再想象折叠过程验证"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["基本性质","辨析"]},{"id":"m-geo-tuxing-chubu-z2","type":"fill","stem":"下午 2 时 30 分，时钟的时针与分针所成的较小角是 ____ 度。（只填数字）","answer":"105","explain":"分针 30 分指向 6，对应 180^°；时针每小时走 30^°、每分钟再走 0.5^°，2 时 30 分指向 2×30^°+30×0.5^°=75^°。两针夹角为 180^°-75^°=105^°（小于 180^°，即为较小角）。","difficulty":2,"tags":["角的计算"]}]},{"id":"m-geo-xiangjiao-pingxing","title":"相交线与平行线","subtitle":"人教版七下 · 第7章 相交线与平行线","grade":"7b","tags":["图形与几何","相交线与平行线"],"blocks":[{"type":"note","title":"教材章节","text":"人教版七下 · 第7章 相交线与平行线"},{"type":"note","title":"一句话概述","text":"掌握对顶角与垂线的性质，分清平行线的判定与性质，会用平移刻画图形的变换。"},{"type":"h","text":"先看图里有什么：相交线与「三线八角」"},{"type":"p","text":"两条直线相交，得到一个公共顶点和四个角，其中有对顶角、也有邻补角；两条直线被第三条直线所截，就出现「三线八角」——同位角、内错角、同旁内角。读题先分清图里是哪一种关系，再把已知角标上去。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xiangjiao-jichu-1","title":"两条直线相交成的四个角","caption":"对顶角相等，邻补角互补","view":"square","alt":"两条直线相交于点 O，形成四个角；其中相对的两个角 ∠1 与 ∠3 是对顶角，相等；相邻的两个角 ∠1 与 ∠2 是邻补角，之和为 180 度。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":10,"y1":52,"x2":90,"y2":52},{"t":"line","x1":26,"y1":20,"x2":74,"y2":84},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":52,"from":-53.1,"to":0,"r":12,"label":"∠1"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":52,"from":126.9,"to":180,"r":12,"label":"∠3"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":52,"from":0,"to":126.9,"r":17,"label":"∠2"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":52,"label":"O","labelDx":-1,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":96,"text":"∠1=∠3，∠1+∠2=180°","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"h","text":"抓住位置关系：先认出是哪种角"},{"type":"p","text":"同位角在截线同旁、被截两直线同侧；内错角在截线两旁、两被截直线之间；同旁内角在截线同旁、两被截直线之间。位置认错，后面用「相等」还是「互补」就全错，这一步必须盯着截线看。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xiangjiao-jichu-2","title":"三线八角","caption":"同位角、内错角、同旁内角都是位置关系","view":"square","alt":"两条直线 a、b 被直线 c 所截，交点分别是 G、H；在 G、H 处标出一对同位角 ∠1 与 ∠2，并标出一对内错角 ∠3 与 ∠4。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":10,"y1":30,"x2":90,"y2":30},{"t":"line","x1":10,"y1":76,"x2":90,"y2":76},{"t":"line","x1":34,"y1":8,"x2":58,"y2":96},{"t":"angle","x":40,"y":30,"from":0,"to":105.3,"r":8,"label":"∠1"},{"t":"angle","x":52.3,"y":76,"from":0,"to":105.3,"r":8,"label":"∠2"},{"t":"angle","x":40,"y":30,"from":-74.7,"to":0,"r":13,"label":"∠3"},{"t":"angle","x":52.3,"y":76,"from":105.3,"to":180,"r":13,"label":"∠4"},{"t":"dot","x":40,"y":30,"label":"G","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":-1},{"t":"dot","x":52.3,"y":76,"label":"H","labelDx":2,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"text","x":6,"y":26,"text":"a","size":4},{"t":"text","x":6,"y":72,"text":"b","size":4},{"t":"text","x":60,"y":12,"text":"c","size":4}]}},{"type":"h","text":"建立关系：判定由角推平行，性质由平行推角"},{"type":"p","text":"同位角相等、内错角相等、同旁内角互补，都能判定两直线平行（判定）；反过来，已知两直线平行，才有同位角相等、内错角相等、同旁内角互补（性质）。依据的方向不能写反，用性质前必须先说明「两直线平行」。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xiangjiao-jichu-3","title":"判定与性质的方向","caption":"同位角相等 ⇒ 两直线平行","view":"square","alt":"两条直线 a、b 被直线 c 所截，交点 G、H；在 G、H 处标出一对相等标记的同位角 ∠1 与 ∠2，说明同位角相等时两直线平行，反过来两直线平行时同位角相等。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":8,"y1":32,"x2":92,"y2":32},{"t":"line","x1":8,"y1":74,"x2":92,"y2":74},{"t":"line","x1":34,"y1":10,"x2":56,"y2":94},{"t":"angle","x":39.8,"y":32,"from":0,"to":104.8,"r":9,"label":"∠1","tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":50.8,"y":74,"from":0,"to":104.8,"r":9,"label":"∠2","tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":39.8,"y":32,"label":"G","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":-1},{"t":"dot","x":50.8,"y":74,"label":"H","labelDx":2,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"text","x":8,"y":28,"text":"a","size":4},{"t":"text","x":8,"y":70,"text":"b","size":4},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":94,"text":"∠1=∠2 ⇒ a∥b","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"h","text":"换个图形再想：折线、拐点怎么办"},{"type":"p","text":"两条平行线之间出现折线时，已知角被拐点隔开，无法直接用；这时过拐点作一条与已知直线平行的辅助线，把大角拆成两个角，再用内错角（或同旁内角）与已知角建立起联系。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xiangjiao-jichu-4","title":"过拐点作平行线","caption":"过 E 作 EF∥AB，把 ∠BED 拆成两个内错角","view":"square","alt":"两条平行的直线 AB 与 CD，点 E 在两线之间，连接 BE、DE 构成折线；过 E 作 EF 平行于 AB，图中标出角 ABE 为 40 度、角 CDE 为 30 度，角 BEF 与角 DEF 分别等于这两个角，角 BED 为 70 度。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":20,"y1":26.3,"x2":76.6,"y2":26.3},{"t":"line","x1":30,"y1":73,"x2":82.4,"y2":73},{"t":"line","x1":76.6,"y1":26.3,"x2":46,"y2":52},{"t":"line","x1":82.4,"y1":73,"x2":46,"y2":52},{"t":"line","x1":46,"y1":52,"x2":68,"y2":52,"dashed":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":20,"y":26.3,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":-1},{"t":"dot","x":76.6,"y":26.3,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-1},{"t":"dot","x":30,"y":73,"label":"C","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":82.4,"y":73,"label":"D","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":46,"y":52,"label":"E","labelDx":-1,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"dot","x":68,"y":52,"hollow":true,"tone":"muted","label":"F","labelDx":2,"labelDy":-1},{"t":"angle","x":76.6,"y":26.3,"from":180,"to":220,"r":8,"label":"40°"},{"t":"angle","x":82.4,"y":73,"from":150,"to":180,"r":8,"label":"30°"},{"t":"angle","x":46,"y":52,"from":0,"to":40,"r":7,"label":"40°"},{"t":"angle","x":46,"y":52,"from":-30,"to":0,"r":7,"label":"30°"}]}},{"type":"h","text":"核心概念"},{"type":"p","text":"邻补角与对顶角：两条直线相交，有一条公共边、另一边互为反向延长线的两个角叫邻补角，它们的和是 180^°；两边分别互为反向延长线的两个角叫对顶角。对顶角相等是由邻补角互补推出的性质，不能用来判定两条直线相交。"},{"type":"p","text":"垂线与点到直线的距离：两条直线相交所成的四个角中有一个是直角，就说这两条直线互相垂直。在同一平面内，过一点有且只有一条直线与已知直线垂直；连接直线外一点与直线上各点的线段中，垂线段最短。从直线外一点到这条直线的垂线段的长度，叫做点到直线的距离。"},{"type":"p","text":"同位角、内错角、同旁内角：两条直线被第三条直线所截形成「三线八角」：在截线同旁、被截两直线同侧的两个角是同位角；在截线两旁、两被截直线之间的是内错角；在截线同旁、两被截直线之间的是同旁内角。它们刻画的是位置关系，两直线不平行时这三类角并不满足相等或互补。"},{"type":"p","text":"平行公理与传递性：经过直线外一点，有且只有一条直线与这条直线平行，这是平行公理。由它可得：如果两条直线都与第三条直线平行，那么这两条直线也互相平行（平行的传递性）。"},{"type":"p","text":"平行线的判定：由角的关系推「形」的依据：同位角相等，两直线平行；内错角相等，两直线平行；同旁内角互补，两直线平行。此外，在同一平面内，垂直于同一条直线的两条直线平行；平行于同一条直线的两条直线平行。"},{"type":"p","text":"平行线的性质：由「形」推角的关系的依据：两直线平行，同位角相等；两直线平行，内错角相等；两直线平行，同旁内角互补。使用性质必须先有「两直线平行」这个前提，否则角的关系不成立。判定与性质的前提和结论恰好互换，书写依据时不能写反。"},{"type":"p","text":"平移：图形沿某一条直线方向移动一定的距离叫平移。平移前后的两个图形全等，对应线段平行（或在同一条直线上）且相等，对应点的连线平行（或在同一条直线上）且相等。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"平行线判定与性质的综合推理\n解答题常以拐点、三角板拼接为背景，与角平分线、垂直、对顶角综合求角；踩分靠先判定后性质、依据不写反，过拐点作平行线是首选辅助线，书写要交代平行的传递过程。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"平移性质的计算与作图\n常以网格作图或图形平移命题，与对应点坐标、周长面积计算结合；踩分点是对应点连线平行（或共线）且相等，平移距离看对应点而不是图形间距，作图要保留连线痕迹。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"「三线八角」的识别与条件辨析\n选择题高频命题，常把判定与性质、同位角与同旁内角混在选项里；踩分靠先确认截线与被截线、再判断角的位置，使用「同旁内角互补」必须先写明两直线平行。"},{"type":"table","title":"公式与定理","head":["公式/定理","表述","注意"],"rows":[["对顶角相等","∠ 1=∠ 3","两条直线相交所成的四个角中，位置相对（两边互为反向延长线）的两个角才是对顶角"],["平行线的判定（同位角、内错角）","∠ 1=∠ 2⇒ a∥ b","∠ 1 与 ∠ 2 必须是两条直线被第三条直线所截形成的同位角或内错角"],["平行线的判定（同旁内角）","∠ 1+∠ 2=180^°⇒ a∥ b","两个角必须是同旁内角；同旁内角相等不能判定两直线平行"],["平行线的性质","a∥ b⇒∠ 1=∠ 2","与判定方向相反，使用前必须先有「两直线平行」，否则属于无依据推理"],["平行公理的推论（传递性）","a∥ c,\\ b∥ c⇒ a∥ b","前提是三条直线在同一平面内"],["垂线段最短","连接直线外一点与直线上各点的所有线段中，垂线段最短，它的长度就是点到直线的距离。","注意是「垂线段」最短而不是「垂线」最短——垂线是直线，没有长度"]]},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"直线 a∥ b，直线 c 分别与 a、b 相交，∠ 1=58^°，∠ 2 与 ∠ 1 是同旁内角，求 ∠ 2 的度数。"},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["因为 a∥ b（已知），所以 ∠ 1+∠ 2=180^°（两直线平行，同旁内角互补）。","把 ∠ 1=58^° 代入得 ∠ 2=180^°-58^°=122^°。","检验：58^°+122^°=180^°，且 ∠ 2 是钝角，与图形中同旁内角为钝角相符。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：∠ 2=122^°。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"先判断两个角属于同位角、内错角还是同旁内角，再决定用「相等」还是「互补」，顺序颠倒极易用错定理。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"直线 a、b 被直线 c 所截，∠ 1 与 ∠ 2 是内错角且 ∠ 1=∠ 2，∠ 3=100^°，∠ 4 与 ∠ 3 是同旁内角，求 ∠ 4 的度数。"},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["因为 ∠ 1=∠ 2，且 ∠ 1、∠ 2 是内错角，所以 a∥ b（内错角相等，两直线平行）。","因为 a∥ b，所以 ∠ 3+∠ 4=180^°（两直线平行，同旁内角互补）。","所以 ∠ 4=180^°-100^°=80^°。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：∠ 4=80^°。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"这是一道判定与性质连用的题：第一步由角推平行，依据写「判定」；第二步由平行推角，依据写「性质」。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"直线 AB、CD 相交于点 O，OE⊥ AB 于 O，OD 在 ∠ EOB 的内部且 ∠ EOD=25^°，求 ∠ AOC 的度数。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xiangjiao-oe","title":"OE⊥ AB，OD 在 ∠ EOB 内部","caption":"OE⊥ AB 得 ∠EOB=90°；∠EOD=25°，所以 ∠BOD=65°，它的对顶角 ∠AOC 也是 65°","view":"square","alt":"直线 AB 与直线 CD 相交于点 O，射线 OE 垂直 AB 于 O，点 O 处画有直角方框；射线 OD 在角 EOB 的内部、与 OE 的夹角是 25 度，角 AOC 与角 BOD 是对顶角。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":8,"y1":55,"x2":92,"y2":55},{"t":"line","x1":33,"y1":91,"x2":67,"y2":19},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":55,"x2":50,"y2":12,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":51,"x2":54,"y2":51,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":54,"y1":51,"x2":54,"y2":55,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":55,"from":90,"to":64.72,"r":12,"label":"25°"},{"t":"dot","x":8,"y":55,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":92,"y":55,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":33,"y":91,"label":"C","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":67,"y":19,"label":"D","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":12,"label":"E","labelDx":-1.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":55,"label":"O","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":3.6}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["因为 OE⊥ AB，所以 ∠ EOB=90^°（垂直的定义）。","因为 OD 在 ∠ EOB 的内部，所以 ∠ BOD=∠ EOB-∠ EOD=90^°-25^°=65^°。","因为 ∠ AOC 与 ∠ BOD 是对顶角，所以 ∠ AOC=∠ BOD=65^°（对顶角相等）。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：∠ AOC=65^°。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"垂直条件要立刻翻译成 90^°，再用「整体减部分」求角；注意先确认 OD 确实在 ∠ EOB 内部。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"如图，AB∥ CD，点 E 在两直线之间，连接 BE、DE，已知 ∠ ABE=40^°，∠ CDE=30^°，求 ∠ BED 的度数。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xiangjiao-zhedian-1","title":"拐点问题：过拐点作平行线","caption":"EF∥AB，把 ∠BED 拆成两个内错角","view":"square","alt":"两条水平平行线 AB 与 CD，点 E 在两线之间，连接 BE、DE 构成折线；过 E 作 EF 平行 AB，图中标出角 ABE 为 40 度、角 CDE 为 30 度，由内错角相等得角 BEF 为 40 度、角 DEF 为 30 度，所以角 BED 为 70 度。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":12,"y1":25,"x2":62,"y2":25},{"t":"line","x1":30,"y1":75,"x2":85,"y2":75},{"t":"line","x1":62,"y1":25,"x2":36.1,"y2":46.7},{"t":"line","x1":85,"y1":75,"x2":36.1,"y2":46.7},{"t":"line","x1":36.1,"y1":46.7,"x2":64,"y2":46.7,"tone":"muted","dashed":true},{"t":"dot","x":12,"y":25,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":62,"y":25,"label":"B","labelDx":2,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":30,"y":75,"label":"C","labelDx":-5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":85,"y":75,"label":"D","labelDx":2,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":36.1,"y":46.7,"label":"E","labelDx":0.5,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"dot","x":64,"y":46.7,"hollow":true,"tone":"muted","label":"F","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"angle","x":62,"y":25,"from":180,"to":220,"r":7,"label":"40°"},{"t":"angle","x":85,"y":75,"from":150,"to":180,"r":7,"label":"30°"},{"t":"angle","x":36.1,"y":46.7,"from":0,"to":40,"r":6,"label":"40°"},{"t":"angle","x":36.1,"y":46.7,"from":-30,"to":0,"r":6,"label":"30°"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["已知的两个角被点 E 隔开，不能直接用上；想把 ∠ BED 拆成两个能与已知角挂钩的角，于是过点 E 作 EF∥ AB（辅助线思路：见折线拐点作平行线）。","因为 AB∥ CD（已知），EF∥ AB（已作），所以 EF∥ CD（平行于同一条直线的两条直线互相平行）。","所以 ∠ BEF=∠ ABE=40^°，∠ DEF=∠ CDE=30^°（两直线平行，内错角相等）。","因此 ∠ BED=∠ BEF+∠ DEF=40^°+30^°=70^°。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：∠ BED=70^°。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"两条平行线之间出现折线，就过拐点作平行线，把大角拆成两个内错角；辅助线的作法与平行传递过程都要写进证明。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"如图，直线 AB∥ CD，直线 EF 分别交 AB、CD 于点 G、H，射线 HP 在 ∠ GHD 的内部且平分这个角，∠ EGB=70^°，求 ∠ PHD 的度数。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xiangjiao-tongwei-1","title":"同位角与角平分线","caption":"HP 平分 ∠GHD，∠PHD 是它的一半","view":"square","alt":"两条水平平行线 AB 与 CD 被直线 EF 所截，交点 G 在 AB 上、H 在 CD 上，角 EGB 为 70 度；射线 HP 平分角 GHD，角 GHP 与角 PHD 各为 35 度。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":12,"y1":30,"x2":90,"y2":30},{"t":"line","x1":12,"y1":74,"x2":90,"y2":74},{"t":"line","x1":51.5,"y1":9.3,"x2":23.2,"y2":87.2},{"t":"line","x1":28,"y1":74,"x2":49.3,"y2":59.1,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":12,"y":30,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":3},{"t":"dot","x":90,"y":30,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-1},{"t":"dot","x":12,"y":74,"label":"C","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":90,"y":74,"label":"D","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":51.5,"y":9.3,"label":"E","labelDx":1,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":23.2,"y":87.2,"label":"F","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":44,"y":30,"label":"G","labelDx":2,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":28,"y":74,"label":"H","labelDx":3,"labelDy":5},{"t":"dot","x":49.3,"y":59.1,"label":"P","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"angle","x":44,"y":30,"from":0,"to":70,"r":7,"label":"70°"},{"t":"angle","x":28,"y":74,"from":35,"to":70,"r":6.5,"label":"35°"},{"t":"angle","x":28,"y":74,"from":0,"to":35,"r":6.5,"label":"35°"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["∠ EGB 与 ∠ GHD 在截线 EF 的同旁、又分别在 AB、CD 的同一侧，是同位角；因为 AB∥ CD，所以 ∠ GHD=∠ EGB=70^°（两直线平行，同位角相等）。","因为 HP 平分 ∠ GHD（已知），所以 ∠ PHD=∠ GHP=(1)/(2)∠ GHD（角平分线的定义）。","代入得 ∠ PHD=(1)/(2)×70^°=35^°。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：∠ PHD=35^°。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"平行线给角相等，角平分线给角的一半，两步各写各的依据；先认准同位角、内错角还是同旁内角，再决定用相等还是互补。"},{"type":"list","title":"易错点","items":["把判定与性质写反：由「内错角相等」推出「两直线平行」是判定，由「两直线平行」推出「内错角相等」是性质，证明中的依据不能互换。","同旁内角互补只在两直线平行时成立；三条直线互不平行时，同旁内角不一定互补，同位角也不一定相等。","同位角、内错角、同旁内角是两条直线被第三条直线所截形成的，图形中若没有第三条截线，就不能说某两个角是同位角。","点到直线的距离是垂线段的长度，不是垂线段本身；「垂线段最短」也不能说成「垂线最短」。","「在同一平面内，垂直于同一条直线的两条直线平行」必须保留「在同一平面内」，去掉前提后在空间中不成立。","平移的对应线段满足「平行（或在同一条直线上）且相等」，漏掉「或在同一条直线上」会把沿直线方向平移的情形判错。"]},{"type":"list","title":"解题方法","items":["见平行线先找「三线八角」，把图中的角按同位角、内错角、同旁内角分类，再决定用相等还是互补。","先判定后性质：要证平行就找角的关系，已知平行就求角的度数，两步的依据必须分清。","图形中出现折线或拐点，过拐点作已知直线的平行线，把一个大角拆成两个与已知角相关的角。","出现角平分线加平行线时，用等角传递得到等腰三角形，这是求线段长的常用模型。","平移作图抓住对应点：先确定平移方向与距离，再逐个平移关键点，最后依次连线。"]}],"questions":[{"id":"m-geo-xiangjiao-pingxing-q1","type":"choice","stem":"下列说法中正确的是","answer":"C","explain":"同位角、内错角只是位置关系，只有在两直线平行时才相等，A、B 都缺少「两直线平行」这个前提；两直线平行时同旁内角互补，C 正确；两条直线相交时对顶角相等，一般并不互补，只有两个角都是 90^° 时才互补，D 错。","options":["两条直线被第三条直线所截，同位角相等","两条直线被第三条直线所截，内错角相等","两直线平行，同旁内角互补","两条直线相交，对顶角互补"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["判定与性质辨析","三线八角"]},{"id":"m-geo-xiangjiao-pingxing-q2","type":"choice","stem":"直线 a∥ b，直线 c 与 a、b 分别相交，∠ 1=65^°，∠ 2 与 ∠ 1 是同旁内角，则 ∠ 2 的度数是","answer":"C","explain":"由 a∥ b 得同旁内角互补，∠ 2=180^°-65^°=115^°。选 25^° 是把同旁内角误当成互余，选 65^° 是把同旁内角误当成同位角或内错角。","options":["25^°","65^°","115^°","125^°"],"difficulty":1,"tags":["平行线的性质","同旁内角"]},{"id":"m-geo-xiangjiao-pingxing-q3","type":"choice","stem":"∠ 1 与 ∠ 2 是直线 AB、CD 被同一条直线所截形成的角，下列条件中能判定 AB∥ CD 的是","answer":"C","explain":"同位角相等可判定两直线平行，C 正确。同旁内角应互补才能判定平行，相等不能判定，A 错；内错角应相等才能判定平行，互补反而是矛盾条件，B 错；对顶角相等是两条直线相交的性质，与两直线是否平行无关，D 错。","options":["∠ 1 与 ∠ 2 是同旁内角，且 ∠ 1=∠ 2","∠ 1 与 ∠ 2 是内错角，且 ∠ 1+∠ 2=180^°","∠ 1 与 ∠ 2 是同位角，且 ∠ 1=∠ 2","∠ 1 与 ∠ 2 是对顶角，且 ∠ 1=∠ 2"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["平行线的判定","条件辨析"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xiangjiao-tongweijiao","title":"直线 AB、CD 被直线 EF 所截","caption":"∠1 与 ∠2 在截线 EF 同旁、在两条被截直线的同方，这样的一对角叫同位角","view":"wide","alt":"两条水平直线 AB 与 CD 被一条斜线 EF 所截，在截线右侧、两条直线下方的位置画出并标注了同位角 ∠1（在交点处、AB 所在的位置）与 ∠2（在另一个交点处、CD 所在的位置）。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":6,"y1":22,"x2":94,"y2":22},{"t":"line","x1":6,"y1":52,"x2":94,"y2":52},{"t":"line","x1":18,"y1":8,"x2":82,"y2":60,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":35.2,"y":22,"from":0,"to":-39.08,"r":9,"tone":"ok","label":"∠1"},{"t":"angle","x":72.2,"y":52,"from":0,"to":-39.23,"r":9,"tone":"ok","label":"∠2"},{"t":"dot","x":6,"y":22,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":94,"y":22,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":6,"y":52,"label":"C","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":94,"y":52,"label":"D","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":18,"y":8,"label":"E","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":82,"y":60,"label":"F","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2}]}},{"id":"m-geo-xiangjiao-pingxing-q4","type":"fill","stem":"直线 AB∥ CD，直线 EF 与它们分别相交于点 G、H，∠ EGB=72^°，∠ GHD 与 ∠ EGB 是同旁内角，则 ∠ GHD= ____ 度。（只填数字）","answer":"108","explain":"因为 AB∥ CD，所以 ∠ EGB+∠ GHD=180^°（两直线平行，同旁内角互补），故 ∠ GHD=180^°-72^°=108^°。","difficulty":1,"tags":["平行线的性质","同旁内角"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xiangjiao-tongpangnei","title":"AB∥ CD，∠ EGB 与 ∠ GHD 是同旁内角","caption":"同旁内角在截线同旁、两条平行线之间，它们互补：∠EGB+∠GHD=180°","view":"square","alt":"两条水平直线 AB 与 CD 互相平行，一条斜线 EF 与它们分别交于点 G（在 AB 上）与 H（在 CD 上）；∠EGB 等于 72 度，∠GHD 与它是同旁内角，两角互补。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":6,"y1":44,"x2":94,"y2":44},{"t":"line","x1":6,"y1":67,"x2":94,"y2":67},{"t":"line","x1":39.8,"y1":25,"x2":56.8,"y2":77.3,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":46,"y":44,"from":-72.03,"to":0,"r":10,"tone":"ok","label":"72°"},{"t":"angle","x":53.5,"y":67,"from":108.06,"to":0,"r":8,"tone":"ok","label":"∠GHD"},{"t":"dot","x":6,"y":44,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":94,"y":44,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":6,"y":67,"label":"C","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":94,"y":67,"label":"D","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":56.8,"y":77.3,"label":"E","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":39.8,"y":25,"label":"F","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":46,"y":44,"label":"G","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":53.5,"y":67,"label":"H","labelDx":2.4,"labelDy":2.4}]}},{"id":"m-geo-xiangjiao-pingxing-q5","type":"short","stem":"说明「内错角相等，两直线平行」与「两直线平行，内错角相等」的区别，并指出它们在解题中各自的作用。","answer":"第一句是平行线的判定定理，前提是「内错角相等」，结论是「两直线平行」，作用是由角的关系推出两直线平行，主要用于证明两条直线平行；第二句是平行线的性质定理，前提是「两直线平行」，结论是「内错角相等」，作用是由已知的平行关系推出角的相等关系，主要用于求角的度数。两句话的前提与结论恰好互换（互为逆命题），书写证明时依据不能写反：凡是用到性质，必须先说明「两直线平行」，否则推理没有依据。","explain":"本题考查判定与性质的方向辨析。评分要点：分别指明哪一句是判定（由角推平行）、哪一句是性质（由平行推角），说明两者前提与结论互逆，并强调使用性质前必须先有「两直线平行」。常见失分点：只重复两句话的字面意思而不说明方向差别；把性质当判定用；漏掉「使用性质必须先有平行这一前提」，说明对推理依据的严密性理解不到位。","difficulty":2,"tags":["判定与性质","互逆命题"],"rubric":["指出第一句是判定定理：由角推平行","指出第二句是性质定理：由平行推角","说明两句话的前提与结论互换了位置（互逆）","强调使用性质前必须先有「两直线平行」这一前提","分别说出适用场景：证平行用判定，求角度用性质"]},{"id":"m-geo-xiangjiao-pingxing-z1","type":"choice","stem":"下列说法中，正确的是","answer":"D","explain":"平行公理要求该点在直线外，A 漏前提；点到直线的距离是垂线段的长度而不是垂线段本身，B 错；同位角只有在两直线平行时才相等，C 漏前提；平移的性质正是对应点连线平行（或共线）且相等，D 正确。","options":["经过一点有且只有一条直线与已知直线平行","从直线外一点到这条直线的垂线段，叫做点到直线的距离","两条直线被第三条直线所截，同位角相等","图形平移后，对应点的连线平行（或在同一条直线上）且相等"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["判定与性质辨析"]},{"id":"m-geo-xiangjiao-pingxing-z2","type":"short","stem":"如图，直线 AB、CD 被直线 EF 所截，交点分别为 G、H，∠ EGB=∠ GHD。（1）判断 AB 与 CD 是否平行，并写出依据；（2）若 ∠ EGB=110^°，射线 HP 平分 ∠ GHD，求 ∠ PHD 的度数。","answer":"（1）$\\angle EGB$ 与 $\\angle GHD$ 是直线 $AB$、$CD$ 被 $EF$ 所截形成的同位角，且 $\\angle EGB=\\angle GHD$，由「同位角相等，两直线平行」得 $AB\\parallel CD$。（2）因为 $AB\\parallel CD$，$\\angle EGB$ 与 $\\angle GHD$ 是同位角，所以 $\\angle GHD=\\angle EGB=110^\\circ$（两直线平行，同位角相等）；又 $HP$ 平分 $\\angle GHD$，所以 $\\angle PHD=\\frac{1}{2}\\angle GHD=\\frac{1}{2}\\times110^\\circ=55^\\circ$。","explain":"本题考查判定与性质的规范连用。评分要点：先确认两个角是同位角，用判定定理由角等推平行；再用性质由平行得同位角相等；最后用角平分线定义取一半。常见失分点：直接写「角相等所以平行」不说明角的位置关系；判定与性质的依据写反；第二问忘记角平分线要除以 2。","difficulty":3,"tags":["平行线的判定","平行线的性质"],"rubric":["由同位角相等判定 AB∥ CD，依据写「同位角相等，两直线平行」","由平行得 ∠ GHD=110^°，依据写平行线的性质（同位角相等）","由角平分线的定义写出 ∠ PHD=(1)/(2)∠ GHD=55^°"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xiangjiao-panju-1","title":"同位角相等，两直线平行","caption":"∠EGB 与 ∠GHD 是同位角，HP 平分 ∠GHD","view":"square","alt":"两条水平直线 AB 与 CD 被直线 EF 所截，交点 G 在 AB 上、H 在 CD 上，角 EGB 与角 GHD 相等且为 110 度，射线 HP 平分角 GHD，角 GHP 与角 PHD 各为 55 度。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":10,"y1":30,"x2":90,"y2":30},{"t":"line","x1":10,"y1":74,"x2":90,"y2":74},{"t":"line","x1":28.5,"y1":9.3,"x2":56.8,"y2":87.2},{"t":"line","x1":52,"y1":74,"x2":66.9,"y2":52.7,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":10,"y":30,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":3},{"t":"dot","x":90,"y":30,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-1},{"t":"dot","x":10,"y":74,"label":"C","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":90,"y":74,"label":"D","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":28.5,"y":9.3,"label":"E","labelDx":1,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":56.8,"y":87.2,"label":"F","labelDx":3,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":36,"y":30,"label":"G","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":52,"y":74,"label":"H","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":5},{"t":"dot","x":66.9,"y":52.7,"label":"P","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"angle","x":36,"y":30,"from":0,"to":110,"r":7,"label":"110°"},{"t":"angle","x":52,"y":74,"from":55,"to":110,"r":6.5,"label":"55°"},{"t":"angle","x":52,"y":74,"from":0,"to":55,"r":6.5,"label":"55°"}]}}]},{"id":"m-geo-pingmian-zuobiao","title":"平面直角坐标系","subtitle":"人教版七下 · 第9章 平面直角坐标系","grade":"7b","tags":["图形与几何","平面直角坐标系"],"blocks":[{"type":"note","title":"教材章节","text":"人教版七下 · 第9章 平面直角坐标系"},{"type":"note","title":"一句话概述","text":"理解有序数对与坐标的意义，掌握点的坐标特征、平移规律与用坐标表示图形的方法。"},{"type":"h","text":"先认坐标系：两轴分成四个象限"},{"type":"p","text":"平面上两条互相垂直、原点重合的数轴组成平面直角坐标系：水平的是 x 轴，竖直的是 y 轴，交点 O 是原点。点的坐标是一对有序数对 (x,y)，x 在前是横坐标、y 在后是纵坐标，顺序颠倒就变成另一个点。图里 A(3,2) 在第一象限，B(-2,1) 在第二象限。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zuobiao-s1","title":"平面直角坐标系与四个象限","caption":"两条数轴把平面分成四个象限，点的坐标是有序数对","view":"square","alt":"平面直角坐标系中，水平的 x 轴与竖直的 y 轴相交于原点 O，两轴把平面分成四个象限；第一象限内的点 A(3,2) 横纵坐标都为正，第二象限内的点 B(-2,1) 横坐标为负纵坐标为正，第三象限内的点 C(-2,-1) 横纵坐标都为负，第四象限内的点 D(2,-1) 横坐标为正纵坐标为负。","prims":[{"t":"plane","x":50,"y":52,"right":44,"left":30,"up":42,"down":40,"xLabel":"x","yLabel":"y","xTicks":[{"at":-16,"label":"-2"},{"at":-8,"label":"-1"},{"at":8,"label":"1"},{"at":16,"label":"2"},{"at":24,"label":"3"}],"yTicks":[{"at":-16,"label":"-2"},{"at":-8,"label":"-1"},{"at":8,"label":"1"},{"at":16,"label":"2"},{"at":24,"label":"3"}]},{"t":"dot","x":74,"y":36,"label":"A(3,2)","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-2,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":34,"y":44,"label":"B(-2,1)","labelDx":-21,"labelDy":-1.5},{"t":"dot","x":34,"y":60,"label":"C(-2,-1)","labelDx":-21,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":66,"y":60,"label":"D(2,-1)","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"text","x":72,"y":24,"text":"第一象限","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":32,"y":24,"text":"第二象限","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":32,"y":84,"text":"第三象限","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":74,"y":84,"text":"第四象限","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"(x,y) 是有序数对，(2,3) 与 (3,2) 表示两个不同的点。"},{"type":"h","text":"抓坐标的含义：到两轴的距离"},{"type":"p","text":"点 P(x,y) 的横坐标 x 是它到 y 轴的距离（带正负号），纵坐标 y 是它到 x 轴的距离（带正负号）。所以求坐标时先向两条坐标轴作垂线，读出两个垂足对应的数；垂线段就是距离，符号由点所在的区域决定。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zuobiao-s2","title":"点的坐标就是到两轴的距离","caption":"向两轴作垂线，垂线段的长度就是坐标的绝对值","view":"square","alt":"点 P(3,2) 分别向 x 轴、y 轴作虚线垂线，两个垂足处都画有直角标记；点 P 到 x 轴的距离等于纵坐标的绝对值 2，到 y 轴的距离等于横坐标的绝对值 3，两条垂线与两坐标轴围成一个 3 乘 2 的矩形。","prims":[{"t":"plane","x":48,"y":58,"right":44,"left":26,"up":44,"down":34,"xLabel":"x","yLabel":"y","xTicks":[{"at":9,"label":"1"},{"at":18,"label":"2"},{"at":27,"label":"3"}],"yTicks":[{"at":9,"label":"1"},{"at":18,"label":"2"}]},{"t":"line","x1":75,"y1":40,"x2":75,"y2":58,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":75,"y1":40,"x2":48,"y2":40,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":75,"y":58,"from":90,"to":180,"r":4,"right":true},{"t":"angle","x":48,"y":40,"from":0,"to":90,"r":4,"right":true},{"t":"text","x":34,"y":44,"text":"3","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":44.5,"y":49,"text":"2","size":3.6,"anchor":"end","tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":75,"y":40,"label":"P(3,2)","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-2,"tone":"accent"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"距离是绝对值：到 x 轴的距离是 |y|，到 y 轴的距离才是 |x|，两者最容易记反。"},{"type":"h","text":"看符号规律：四个象限各不同"},{"type":"p","text":"两条坐标轴把平面分成四个象限，按逆时针依次是第一、二、三、四象限，象限内点的符号依次为 (+,+)、(-,+)、(-,-)、(+,-)。记住符号规律后，只要知道点到两轴的距离，再结合它所在象限，就能唯一确定坐标。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zuobiao-s3","title":"四个象限内点的坐标符号","caption":"按逆时针，符号依次为（+,+）、（-,+）、（-,-）、（+,-）","view":"square","alt":"平面直角坐标系中四个象限内各画一个点：第一象限的点横纵坐标都为正，第二象限的点横坐标为负纵坐标为正，第三象限的点横纵坐标都为负，第四象限的点横坐标为正纵坐标为负。","prims":[{"t":"plane","x":50,"y":52,"right":42,"left":30,"up":40,"down":40,"xLabel":"x","yLabel":"y","xTicks":[{"at":-16,"label":"-2"},{"at":-8,"label":"-1"},{"at":8,"label":"1"},{"at":16,"label":"2"}],"yTicks":[{"at":-16,"label":"-2"},{"at":-8,"label":"-1"},{"at":8,"label":"1"},{"at":16,"label":"2"}]},{"t":"dot","x":66,"y":36,"label":"(+,+)","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"dot","x":34,"y":36,"label":"(-,+)","labelDx":-20,"labelDy":4,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":34,"y":68,"label":"(-,-)","labelDx":-20,"labelDy":-5,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"dot","x":66,"y":68,"label":"(+,-)","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-5}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"坐标轴上的点不属于任何象限，不要把它归入某个象限。"},{"type":"h","text":"换个情境：平移与对称怎么变坐标"},{"type":"p","text":"平移只改一个坐标：左右平移改横坐标（左减右加），上下平移改纵坐标（下减上加）；关于坐标轴对称则是「关于哪条轴，哪个坐标不变，另一个变相反数」。把平移看成给坐标加常数、对称看成变号，坐标变化就能一眼写出。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zuobiao-s4","title":"点的平移与关于 x 轴对称","caption":"A 右移 4、下移 2 得 B；A 关于 x 轴对称得 C","view":"square","alt":"平面直角坐标系中，点 A(-2,3) 沿箭头平移，横坐标加 4、纵坐标减 2，得到点 B(2,1)；点 A 与 x 轴下方的点 C(-2,-3) 关于 x 轴对称，虚线连接 A 与 C 并垂直于 x 轴，垂足处画有直角标记。","prims":[{"t":"plane","x":46,"y":50,"right":44,"left":30,"up":44,"down":42,"xLabel":"x","yLabel":"y","xTicks":[{"at":-16,"label":"-2"},{"at":-8,"label":"-1"},{"at":8,"label":"1"},{"at":16,"label":"2"}],"yTicks":[{"at":-24,"label":"-3"},{"at":-16,"label":"-2"},{"at":-8,"label":"-1"},{"at":8,"label":"1"},{"at":16,"label":"2"},{"at":24,"label":"3"}]},{"t":"arrow","x1":30,"y1":26,"x2":62,"y2":42,"tone":"accent","width":0.6,"label":"右4下2","labelDx":3,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"line","x1":30,"y1":26,"x2":30,"y2":74,"dashed":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":30,"y":50,"from":0,"to":90,"r":3.5,"right":true},{"t":"dot","x":30,"y":26,"label":"A(-2,3)","labelDx":-20,"labelDy":-2},{"t":"dot","x":62,"y":42,"label":"B(2,1)","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":3.5,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":30,"y":74,"label":"C(-2,-3)","labelDx":-20,"labelDy":4}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"连续平移要一步步作用在正确的坐标上，别把「右加」用到纵坐标上。"},{"type":"h","text":"核心概念"},{"type":"p","text":"有序数对与平面直角坐标系：有顺序的两个数 a 与 b 组成的数对叫有序数对，记作 (a,b)。平面内两条互相垂直、原点重合的数轴组成平面直角坐标系：水平的叫 x 轴（横轴），竖直的叫 y 轴（纵轴），它们的交点是原点 O(0,0)。"},{"type":"p","text":"象限与坐标的符号特征：两条坐标轴把平面分成四个象限，按逆时针依次为第一、二、三、四象限。第一象限 (+,+)，第二象限 (-,+)，第三象限 (-,-)，第四象限 (+,-)。坐标轴上的点不属于任何象限，所以符号特征只对象限内的点成立。"},{"type":"p","text":"点的坐标与距离：点 P(x,y) 到 x 轴的距离是 |y|，到 y 轴的距离是 |x|，到原点的距离是 √(x²+y²)（由勾股定理得到）。距离都是非负数，因此式子中必须带绝对值，不能直接用坐标本身。"},{"type":"p","text":"与坐标轴平行的线段上的点（判定与性质）：性质：平行于 x 轴的直线上的点纵坐标相同，平行于 y 轴的直线上的点横坐标相同。判定：若两点纵坐标相同，则它们的连线平行于 x 轴（或在 x 轴上）；若两点横坐标相同，则连线平行于 y 轴（或在 y 轴上）。"},{"type":"p","text":"坐标与平移：点 (x,y) 向右（左）平移 a 个单位得到 (x+a,y)（即 (x-a,y)）；向上（下）平移 b 个单位得到 (x,y+b)（即 (x,y-b)）。口诀是横坐标「左减右加」，纵坐标「下减上加」。图形的平移就是把它所有关键点按同一规律平移后重新连线。"},{"type":"p","text":"关于坐标轴对称的点的坐标（拓展）：点 P(x,y) 关于 x 轴的对称点是 (x,-y)，关于 y 轴的对称点是 (-x,y)，关于原点的对称点是 (-x,-y)。口诀：关于哪条轴对称，那条轴对应的坐标不变，另一个坐标变为相反数；关于原点对称，两个坐标都变为相反数。"},{"type":"p","text":"用坐标表示地理位置：用坐标系描述地理位置时，要先选合适的原点（如学校、广场），确定 x 轴、y 轴的正方向，规定单位长度。原点或单位长度选得不同，同一地点的坐标就不同，所以答题时要说明所用的坐标系。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"由坐标判断点所在象限，或根据象限、距离条件确定点的坐标\n选择题常给坐标或含字母的坐标判象限，填空题给点到两轴距离与象限定坐标。踩分点：坐标轴上的点不属于任何象限；距离必须加绝对值，再按象限符号配正负，未指定象限时四种情况分类讨论。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"用平移规律与轴对称规律求对应点坐标或字母的值\n常把平移、关于坐标轴对称综合出填空或解答。关键是左右只改横坐标、上下只改纵坐标，关于哪条轴对称则哪个坐标不变；求字母时把规律写成方程，解出后回代验证对应关系。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"在平面直角坐标系中求线段长与图形面积\n解答题高频题型：先找平行于坐标轴的边，用坐标差的绝对值求底和高；没有平行边时用外接矩形补形或分割成三角形。书写要写明平行依据与高的来源，倾斜边用勾股定理求。"},{"type":"table","title":"公式与定理","head":["公式/定理","表述","注意"],"rows":[["点到两坐标轴的距离","d_x=|y|, d_y=|x|","到 x 轴的距离看纵坐标的绝对值，到 y 轴的距离看横坐标的绝对值，容易记反"],["平行于坐标轴的线段长","AB=|x₁-x₂|","两点纵坐标相同（连线平行于 x 轴）时成立；纵坐标不同时要构造直角三角形用勾股定理求长度"],["点的平移规律","(x,y)to(x+a,\\ y+b)","向右、向上平移时 a、b 为正；向左、向下平移时 a、b 取负数"],["关于坐标轴对称的点的坐标","P(x,y)to P_x(x,-y), P_y(-x,y)","关于 x 轴对称时横坐标不变、纵坐标变号；关于 y 轴对称时纵坐标不变、横坐标变号"],["线段中点的坐标（拓展）","M((x₁+x₂)/(2),\\ (y₁+y₂)/(2))","已知两端点坐标时可直接求中点，避免分段讨论绝对值"],["两点间的距离（拓展）","AB=√((x₁-x₂)²+(y₁-y₂)²)","由勾股定理得到，初中阶段了解结论，考试中更常用「构造直角三角形再求斜边」的方法"]]},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"已知点 P(2a-1,\\ a+3) 在 y 轴上，求点 P 的坐标。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zuobiao-e1","title":"点在 y 轴上，横坐标为 0","caption":"点 P 在 y 轴上，横坐标为 0、纵坐标为 3.5","view":"square","alt":"平面直角坐标系中，点 P 落在竖直的 y 轴上，它的横坐标为 0，纵坐标为 3.5，即 P(0,3.5)。","prims":[{"t":"plane","x":50,"y":56,"right":42,"left":32,"up":44,"down":40,"xLabel":"x","yLabel":"y","xTicks":[{"at":-16,"label":"-2"},{"at":-8,"label":"-1"},{"at":8,"label":"1"},{"at":16,"label":"2"}],"yTicks":[{"at":8,"label":"1"},{"at":16,"label":"2"},{"at":24,"label":"3"}]},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":28,"label":"P(0,3.5)","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-2,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":90,"text":"y 轴上的点，横坐标为 0","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["点 P 在 y 轴上，所以它的横坐标是 0（y 轴上点的坐标特征），即 2a-1=0。","解这个方程得 a=(1)/(2)。","把 a=(1)/(2) 代入纵坐标，得 a+3=3.5。","所以点 P 的坐标是 (0,\\ 3.5)，即 (0,\\ (7)/(2))。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：P(0,\\ (7)/(2))。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"「在 y 轴上」等价于横坐标为 0，「在 x 轴上」等价于纵坐标为 0，这是求字母取值时最常用的隐藏条件。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"△ ABC 的三个顶点分别是 A(-2,-1)、B(3,-1)、C(1,2)，求 △ ABC 的面积。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zuobiao-mianji-1","title":"在坐标系中求三角形面积","caption":"以 AB 为底，C 到 AB 的距离为高","view":"wide","alt":"平面直角坐标系中，三角形 ABC 的顶点分别为 A(-2,-1)、B(3,-1)、C(1,2)，AB 平行于 x 轴且长为 5，C 到 AB 的距离为 3，图中画出 C 到 AB 的垂线段，三角形面积等于二分之一乘 5 乘 3 为 7.5。","prims":[{"t":"axis","x":23,"y":78,"w":63,"h":45,"xLabel":"x","yLabel":"y","origin":true,"xTicks":[{"at":0.14,"label":"-2"},{"at":0.29,"label":"-1"},{"at":0.57,"label":"1"},{"at":0.71,"label":"2"},{"at":0.86,"label":"3"}],"yTicks":[{"at":0.2,"label":"-1"},{"at":0.6,"label":"1"},{"at":0.8,"label":"2"}]},{"t":"poly","points":[[32,69],[77,69],[59,42]],"closed":true,"tone":"accent","fill":true},{"t":"line","x1":59,"y1":42,"x2":59,"y2":69,"tone":"muted","dashed":true},{"t":"angle","x":59,"y":69,"from":0,"to":90,"r":4,"right":true},{"t":"dot","x":32,"y":69,"label":"A(-2,-1)","labelDx":-24,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":77,"y":69,"label":"B(3,-1)","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":59,"y":42,"label":"C(1,2)","labelDx":2,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"text","x":54.5,"y":75.5,"text":"5","size":3.6},{"t":"text","x":61.5,"y":56,"text":"3","size":3.6,"anchor":"start","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["因为 A、B 两点的纵坐标都是 -1，所以 AB∥ x 轴（纵坐标相同的两点连线平行于 x 轴），AB=|3-(-2)|=5。","点 C 到直线 AB 的距离等于 C 的纵坐标与 -1 的差的绝对值，即 |2-(-1)|=3，这就是 AB 边上的高。","所以 S_(△ ABC)=(1)/(2)× AB× h=(1)/(2)× 5× 3=7.5。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：△ ABC 的面积是 7.5。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"坐标系中求面积，先找与坐标轴平行的边作底，再用坐标差的绝对值求高；没有平行边时用外接矩形补形或分割法。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"把点 A(-3,4) 先向右平移 5 个单位，再向下平移 2 个单位得到点 B，求点 B 的坐标；并求点 A 关于 x 轴的对称点 C 的坐标。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zuobiao-pingyi-1","title":"点的平移与轴对称","caption":"A 右移 5、下移 2 得 B；A 关于 x 轴对称得 C","view":"wide","alt":"平面直角坐标系中，点 A(-3,4) 向右平移 5 个单位再向下平移 2 个单位得到点 B(2,2)，图中用箭头表示平移方向；点 A 与 x 轴下方的点 C(-3,-4) 关于 x 轴对称，虚线连接 A、C 且垂直于 x 轴。","prims":[{"t":"axis","x":20,"y":92,"w":60,"h":80,"xLabel":"x","yLabel":"y","origin":true,"xTicks":[{"at":0.13,"label":"-3"},{"at":0.27,"label":"-2"},{"at":0.4,"label":"-1"},{"at":0.67,"label":"1"},{"at":0.8,"label":"2"}],"yTicks":[{"at":0.1,"label":"-4"},{"at":0.7,"label":"2"},{"at":0.9,"label":"4"}]},{"t":"arrow","x1":28,"y1":20,"x2":68,"y2":36,"tone":"accent","width":0.6},{"t":"text","x":48,"y":22,"text":"右 5，下 2","size":3.4,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":28,"y1":20,"x2":28,"y2":84,"tone":"muted","dashed":true},{"t":"text","x":31,"y":49,"text":"关于 x 轴对称","size":3.2,"anchor":"start","tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":28,"y":20,"label":"A(-3,4)","labelDx":-27,"labelDy":-2},{"t":"dot","x":68,"y":36,"label":"B(2,2)","labelDx":3,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":28,"y":84,"label":"C(-3,-4)","labelDx":3,"labelDy":1.5}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["向右平移 5 个单位，横坐标加 5：(-3+5,\\ 4)=(2,4)。","再向下平移 2 个单位，纵坐标减 2：(2,\\ 4-2)=(2,2)，所以 B(2,2)。","关于 x 轴对称的点横坐标不变、纵坐标互为相反数，所以 C(-3,-4)。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：B(2,2)，C(-3,-4)。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"连续平移可以合并计算，但每一步都要作用在正确的坐标上：左右只改横坐标，上下只改纵坐标。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"已知点 P 到 x 轴的距离是 2，到 y 轴的距离是 3，且点 P 在第二象限，求点 P 的坐标。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zuobiao-e4","title":"由距离与象限定坐标","caption":"第二象限内符号为（-,+）","view":"square","alt":"点 P 在第二象限，它到 x 轴的距离是 2、到 y 轴的距离是 3；向两轴作虚线垂线并画出直角标记，按第二象限的符号规律得 P(-3,2)。","prims":[{"t":"plane","x":48,"y":54,"right":44,"left":28,"up":44,"down":40,"xLabel":"x","yLabel":"y","xTicks":[{"at":-24,"label":"-3"},{"at":-16,"label":"-2"},{"at":-8,"label":"-1"},{"at":8,"label":"1"}],"yTicks":[{"at":8,"label":"1"},{"at":16,"label":"2"}]},{"t":"line","x1":24,"y1":38,"x2":24,"y2":54,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":24,"y1":38,"x2":48,"y2":38,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":24,"y":54,"from":90,"to":180,"r":4,"right":true},{"t":"angle","x":48,"y":38,"from":0,"to":90,"r":4,"right":true},{"t":"text","x":36,"y":42,"text":"3","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":45,"y":47,"text":"2","size":3.6,"anchor":"end","tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":24,"y":38,"label":"P(-3,2)","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":-3,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":30,"y":20,"text":"第二象限","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["点到 x 轴的距离是纵坐标的绝对值，所以 |y|=2，即 y=2 或 y=-2；同理 |x|=3，即 x=3 或 x=-3。","点 P 在第二象限，第二象限内点的坐标符号是 (-,+)，所以横坐标取负、纵坐标取正。","因此 x=-3，y=2，点 P 的坐标是 (-3,\\ 2)。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：P(-3,\\ 2)。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"距离只给绝对值、不给符号，坐标一般有四种可能；象限符号的作用就是从四种可能中选出唯一一种，两步缺一不可。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"已知点 A(2m-1,\\ 3) 与点 B(5,\\ n+2) 关于 x 轴对称，求 m、n 的值。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zuobiao-e5","title":"关于 x 轴对称的两点","caption":"A(5,3) 与 B(5,-3) 横坐标相同、纵坐标互为相反数","view":"square","alt":"点 A(5,3) 与点 B(5,-3) 关于 x 轴对称：两点横坐标相同、纵坐标互为相反数，虚线连接 A、B 并垂直于 x 轴，交点处画有直角标记。","prims":[{"t":"plane","x":40,"y":50,"right":54,"left":30,"up":44,"down":40,"xLabel":"x","yLabel":"y","xTicks":[{"at":7,"label":"1"},{"at":14,"label":"2"},{"at":21,"label":"3"},{"at":28,"label":"4"},{"at":35,"label":"5"}],"yTicks":[{"at":-21,"label":"-3"},{"at":-14,"label":"-2"},{"at":-7,"label":"-1"},{"at":7,"label":"1"},{"at":14,"label":"2"},{"at":21,"label":"3"}]},{"t":"line","x1":75,"y1":29,"x2":75,"y2":71,"dashed":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":75,"y":50,"from":0,"to":90,"r":3.5,"right":true},{"t":"dot","x":75,"y":29,"label":"A(5,3)","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-2},{"t":"dot","x":75,"y":71,"label":"B(5,-3)","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4,"tone":"accent"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["关于 x 轴对称的两个点横坐标相同、纵坐标互为相反数，这是列方程的依据。","横坐标相同：2m-1=5，解得 2m=6，m=3。","纵坐标互为相反数：n+2=-3，解得 n=-5。","回代检验：A(5,3)、B(5,-3)，横坐标相同、纵坐标相反，确关于 x 轴对称。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：m=3，n=-5。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"对称条件本质是坐标之间的等量关系，把「相同」「互为相反数」翻译成方程即可；做完务必回代，防止把关于哪条轴记反。"},{"type":"list","title":"易错点","items":["坐标轴上的点不属于任何象限，把 $x$ 轴正半轴上的点当作第一象限内的点是常见错误。","点 $P(x,y)$ 到 $x$ 轴的距离是 $|y|$ 而不是 $y$；到 $y$ 轴的距离是 $|x|$，符号与轴名极易记反。","已知点到两坐标轴的距离求坐标时，要按四个象限分四种情况讨论，答案通常不唯一，漏解是高频失分点。","平移规律中「左减右加」只作用于横坐标，「下减上加」只作用于纵坐标，把两者对应错坐标就全错。","在坐标系中求图形面积时不能直接把坐标当边长，边长要用坐标差的绝对值；倾斜边的长度还要用勾股定理求。","用坐标表示地理位置时，原点、正方向、单位长度不同则坐标不同，答题必须说明所建立的坐标系。"]},{"type":"list","title":"解题方法","items":["求点的坐标先向两坐标轴作垂线，读出两个垂足对应的数，再按点所在象限确定符号。","求坐标系中图形的面积，优先找平行于坐标轴的边作底；没有就用外接矩形补形，或把图形分割成几个易求的三角形、矩形。","判断三点能否构成特殊三角形，先看有没有纵坐标相同或横坐标相同的两点，由此得到水平、竖直的边与直角。","平移问题先取一对对应点，用它们的坐标差确定平移方向与距离，再平移其余各点。","凡是涉及距离的式子一律加绝对值，再按符号分类讨论，避免漏解。"]}],"questions":[{"id":"m-geo-pingmian-zuobiao-q1","type":"choice","stem":"点 P(-3,4) 到 x 轴的距离是","answer":"B","explain":"点到 x 轴的距离等于纵坐标的绝对值，即 |4|=4。到 y 轴的距离才是 |-3|=3；到原点的距离是 √((-3)²+4²)=5。","options":["3","4","-3","5"],"difficulty":1,"tags":["坐标与距离","绝对值"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zuobiao-q1","title":"点 P(-3,4) 到两轴的距离","caption":"到 x 轴的距离是纵坐标的绝对值 |4|=4；到 y 轴的距离才是横坐标的绝对值 |-3|=3","view":"square","alt":"平面直角坐标系中，点 P 在第二象限、坐标是 (-3,4)；从 P 分别向 x 轴、y 轴作垂线，到 x 轴的垂线段长 4，到 y 轴的垂线段长 3。","prims":[{"t":"plane","x":50,"y":56,"right":42,"left":36,"up":44,"down":26,"xLabel":"x","yLabel":"y","xTicks":[{"at":-24,"label":"-3"},{"at":-16,"label":"-2"},{"at":-8,"label":"-1"},{"at":8,"label":"1"},{"at":16,"label":"2"}],"yTicks":[{"at":8,"label":"1"},{"at":16,"label":"2"},{"at":24,"label":"3"},{"at":32,"label":"4"},{"at":-8,"label":"-1"},{"at":-16,"label":"-2"}]},{"t":"line","x1":26,"y1":24,"x2":26,"y2":56,"tone":"accent","dashed":true},{"t":"line","x1":26,"y1":24,"x2":50,"y2":24,"tone":"muted","dashed":true},{"t":"dot","x":26,"y":24,"label":"P","labelDx":2.4,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"text","x":30,"y":19,"text":"P(-3,4)","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":26,"y":63,"text":"长 4","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":52,"y":24,"text":"长 3","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"}]}},{"id":"m-geo-pingmian-zuobiao-q2","type":"choice","stem":"若点 M(a-1,\\ a+2) 在 y 轴上，则 a 的值是","answer":"A","explain":"点在 y 轴上，则横坐标为 0，即 a-1=0，解得 a=1，此时 M(0,3) 确实在 y 轴上。若把「在 y 轴上」误当成纵坐标为 0，会错选 -2。","options":["1","-2","2","-1"],"difficulty":1,"tags":["坐标轴上点的特征"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zuobiao-q2","title":"点在 y 轴上：横坐标为 0","caption":"M(a-1, a+2) 在 y 轴上，所以 a-1=0，解得 a=1，此时 M(0,3)","view":"square","alt":"平面直角坐标系中，点 M 落在竖直的 y 轴上，横坐标为 0、纵坐标为 3，即 M(0,3)。","prims":[{"t":"plane","x":50,"y":56,"right":40,"left":32,"up":44,"down":26,"xLabel":"x","yLabel":"y","xTicks":[{"at":-16,"label":"-2"},{"at":-8,"label":"-1"},{"at":16,"label":"2"}],"yTicks":[{"at":8,"label":"1"},{"at":16,"label":"2"},{"at":24,"label":"3"},{"at":-16,"label":"-2"}]},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":32,"label":"M","labelDx":3,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"text","x":54,"y":28,"text":"M(0,3)","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":92,"text":"y 轴上的点：横坐标 = 0","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"}]}},{"id":"m-geo-pingmian-zuobiao-q3","type":"choice","stem":"把点 A(2,-5) 先向左平移 3 个单位，再向上平移 4 个单位，得到的点的坐标是","answer":"A","explain":"向左平移 3 个单位，横坐标减 3：2-3=-1；向上平移 4 个单位，纵坐标加 4：-5+4=-1。所以得到的点是 (-1,-1)。","options":["(-1,-1)","(5,-1)","(-1,-9)","(5,-9)"],"difficulty":1,"tags":["坐标与平移"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zuobiao-q3","title":"点 A(2,-5) 向左、向上平移","caption":"向左 3 个单位：横坐标减 3；向上 4 个单位：纵坐标加 4，得到 (-1,-1)","view":"square","alt":"平面直角坐标系中，点 A 的坐标是 (2,-5)；沿虚线箭头向左平移 3 个单位、向上平移 4 个单位后到达点 A′，坐标是 (-1,-1)。","prims":[{"t":"plane","x":50,"y":44,"right":44,"left":32,"up":30,"down":48,"xLabel":"x","yLabel":"y","xTicks":[{"at":-18,"label":"-3"},{"at":-12,"label":"-2"},{"at":-6,"label":"-1"},{"at":6,"label":"1"},{"at":12,"label":"2"}],"yTicks":[{"at":6,"label":"1"},{"at":12,"label":"2"},{"at":-6,"label":"-1"},{"at":-12,"label":"-2"},{"at":-18,"label":"-3"},{"at":-24,"label":"-4"},{"at":-30,"label":"-5"}]},{"t":"arrow","x1":62,"y1":74,"x2":46,"y2":52,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent","label":"左 3·上 4","labelDy":-3},{"t":"dot","x":62,"y":74,"label":"A","labelDx":3,"labelDy":2},{"t":"dot","x":44,"y":50,"label":"A′","labelDx":-9,"labelDy":2},{"t":"text","x":66,"y":79,"text":"A(2,-5)","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":32,"y":52,"text":"A′(-1,-1)","anchor":"end","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"}]}},{"id":"m-geo-pingmian-zuobiao-q4","type":"fill","stem":"已知点 A(3,-2) 与点 B(-1,-2)，则线段 AB 的长是 ____。（只填数字）","answer":"4","explain":"两点纵坐标都是 -2，所以线段 AB 平行于 x 轴，AB 的长等于横坐标之差的绝对值：|3-(-1)|=4。","difficulty":1,"tags":["坐标与线段长"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zuobiao-q4","title":"纵坐标相同的两点：AB∥ x 轴","caption":"纵坐标都是 -2，所以 AB∥ x 轴，AB=|3-(-1)|=4","view":"square","alt":"平面直角坐标系中，点 A(3,-2) 与点 B(-1,-2) 都在 x 轴下方的同一条水平线上，线段 AB 平行于 x 轴。","prims":[{"t":"plane","x":50,"y":56,"right":42,"left":34,"up":44,"down":30,"xLabel":"x","yLabel":"y","xTicks":[{"at":-24,"label":"-3"},{"at":-8,"label":"-1"},{"at":8,"label":"1"},{"at":24,"label":"3"}],"yTicks":[{"at":16,"label":"2"},{"at":8,"label":"1"},{"at":-8,"label":"-1"},{"at":-16,"label":"-2"}]},{"t":"line","x1":42,"y1":72,"x2":74,"y2":72,"tone":"accent","width":0.8},{"t":"dot","x":74,"y":72,"label":"A","labelDx":3,"labelDy":2},{"t":"dot","x":42,"y":72,"label":"B","labelDx":-8,"labelDy":2},{"t":"text","x":58,"y":79,"text":"AB = 4","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"accent"}]}},{"id":"m-geo-pingmian-zuobiao-q5","type":"fill","stem":"点 A(-2,3) 平移后得到点 B(1,3)，则平移的方向是向 ____（填「左」或「右」）。","answer":"右|向右","explain":"横坐标由 -2 变为 1，增加了 3；纵坐标由 3 变为 3，没有变化。所以是沿 x 轴正方向平移 3 个单位，即向右平移。","difficulty":1,"tags":["坐标与平移","对应点坐标差"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zuobiao-q5","title":"平移前后两点在同一水平线上","caption":"横坐标由 -2 变为 1（增加 3）、纵坐标不变，所以是向右平移 3 个单位","view":"square","alt":"平面直角坐标系中，点 A(-2,3) 与点 B(1,3) 在同一水平线上，从 A 指向 B 的箭头表示向右平移 3 个单位。","prims":[{"t":"plane","x":50,"y":56,"right":40,"left":32,"up":34,"down":26,"xLabel":"x","yLabel":"y","xTicks":[{"at":-16,"label":"-2"},{"at":-8,"label":"-1"},{"at":8,"label":"1"}],"yTicks":[{"at":8,"label":"1"},{"at":16,"label":"2"},{"at":24,"label":"3"}]},{"t":"arrow","x1":34,"y1":32,"x2":56,"y2":32,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":34,"y":32,"label":"A","labelDx":-9,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"dot","x":58,"y":32,"label":"B","labelDx":3,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"text","x":45,"y":39,"text":"向右 3","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"accent"}]}},{"id":"m-geo-pingmian-zuobiao-q6","type":"short","stem":"说明「点在 y 轴上」与「点的横坐标为 0」的关系，并写出四个象限内点的坐标符号特征。","answer":"在平面直角坐标系中，$y$ 轴上的点的横坐标都为 0（纵坐标可以是任意实数），所以「点在 $y$ 轴上」等价于「点的横坐标为 0」；反过来，只要点的横坐标为 0，它就一定落在 $y$ 轴上。两个说法互为充要条件，判断时用哪一个都可以。四个象限内点的符号特征是：第一象限 $(+,+)$，第二象限 $(-,+)$，第三象限 $(-,-)$，第四象限 $(+,-)$。需要注意，坐标轴上的点不属于任何象限，因此上述符号特征只对象限内的点成立。","explain":"本题考查坐标特征的双向理解与象限符号的整体记忆。评分要点：说明 y 轴上点的横坐标为 0（纵坐标任意），并指出两个说法互为充要条件；完整写出四个象限的符号特征；补充「坐标轴上的点不属于任何象限」。常见失分点：把坐标轴上的点归入某个象限；象限符号顺序记乱（尤其第二、三象限）；只说「横坐标为 0」而不交代它与「在 y 轴上」的双向等价关系。","difficulty":2,"tags":["坐标特征","象限符号"],"rubric":["指出 y 轴上点的横坐标是 0，纵坐标任意","说明「横坐标为 0」与「在 y 轴上」互为充要条件（判定与性质统一）","四个象限的符号特征全部写对","补充说明坐标轴上的点不属于任何象限"]},{"id":"m-geo-pingmian-zuobiao-z1","type":"choice","stem":"点 P 在第四象限，且它到 x 轴的距离是 2，到 y 轴的距离是 3，则点 P 的坐标是","answer":"C","explain":"点到 x 轴的距离是 |y|=2，到 y 轴的距离是 |x|=3；第四象限内点的符号为 (+,-)，所以横坐标取 3、纵坐标取 -2，即 P(3,-2)。选 A、B 的同学把横坐标符号配错，选 D 的同学把纵坐标符号配反。","options":["(-3,\\ 2)","(-3,\\ -2)","(3,\\ -2)","(3,\\ 2)"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["坐标特征","象限符号"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zuobiao-z1","title":"第四象限内由「到两轴的距离」定坐标","caption":"到 x 轴的距离给 |y|=2、到 y 轴的距离给 |x|=3；第四象限的符号是 (+,-)，所以 P(3,-2)","view":"square","alt":"平面直角坐标系中，点 P 在第四象限：它到 x 轴的距离是 2（虚线竖段）、到 y 轴的距离是 3（虚线横段），因此横坐标取 3、纵坐标取 -2。","prims":[{"t":"plane","x":50,"y":52,"right":34,"left":28,"up":34,"down":28,"xLabel":"x","yLabel":"y","xTicks":[{"at":24,"label":"3"},{"at":16,"label":"2"},{"at":-16,"label":"-2"}],"yTicks":[{"at":16,"label":"2"},{"at":8,"label":"1"},{"at":-8,"label":"-1"},{"at":-16,"label":"-2"}]},{"t":"line","x1":74,"y1":68,"x2":74,"y2":52,"tone":"accent","dashed":true},{"t":"line","x1":74,"y1":68,"x2":50,"y2":68,"tone":"muted","dashed":true},{"t":"dot","x":74,"y":68,"label":"P","labelDx":3,"labelDy":2},{"t":"text","x":76,"y":61,"text":"2","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":60,"y":72,"text":"3","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"}]}},{"id":"m-geo-pingmian-zuobiao-z2","type":"fill","stem":"点 P(-6,\\ 8) 到原点 O 的距离是 ____。（只填数字）","answer":"10","explain":"过点 P 向 x 轴作垂线，构造出两直角边分别为 |-6|=6 和 |8|=8 的直角三角形，OP 是斜边。由勾股定理得 OP=√(6²+8²)=√(100)=10。","difficulty":2,"tags":["坐标与距离"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zuobiao-z2","title":"过 P 作 x 轴的垂线，用勾股定理求 OP","caption":"构造直角三角形 OQP：两直角边是 |-6|=6 与 |8|=8，斜边 OP=6²+8²=10","view":"square","alt":"坐标系中，点 P 在第二象限，从 P 向 x 轴作垂线，垂足为 Q；直角三角形 OQP 里 OQ 长 6、QP 长 8、斜边 OP 长 10。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":4,"y1":52,"x2":94,"y2":52,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":76,"y1":20,"x2":76,"y2":84,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":76,"y1":52,"x2":46,"y2":12,"width":0.8},{"t":"line","x1":46,"y1":12,"x2":46,"y2":52,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":46,"y1":48,"x2":50,"y2":48,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":48,"x2":50,"y2":52,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":76,"y":52,"label":"O","labelDx":3,"labelDy":2},{"t":"dot","x":46,"y":52,"label":"Q","labelDx":-9,"labelDy":2},{"t":"dot","x":46,"y":12,"label":"P","labelDx":-9,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"text","x":61,"y":58,"text":"6","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":41,"y":32,"text":"8","anchor":"end","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":64,"y":28,"text":"10","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"}]}}]},{"id":"m-geo-sanjiaoxing","title":"三角形","subtitle":"人教版八上 · 第13章 三角形","grade":"8a","tags":["图形与几何","三角形"],"blocks":[{"type":"note","title":"教材章节","text":"人教版八上 · 第13章 三角形"},{"type":"note","title":"一句话概述","text":"理解三角形的边角关系与重要线段，掌握内角和定理、外角性质及多边形内角和公式。"},{"type":"h","text":"判断三边能否围成三角形"},{"type":"p","text":"三条线段首尾相接要围成三角形，关键是较短的两条边「接起来」能否够到最长边的两端：把较短两边接成一条线段后，它的长度必须大于最长边。图里 3,4,5 满足 3+4>5，能围成；而 3,4,7 恰好 3+4=7，三条线段只能退化成一条线段。检验时只需比较较短两边之和与最长边，不必把三个不等式都验一遍。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sanjiao-s1","title":"三边关系：能围成与不能围成","caption":"3、4、5 能围成三角形；3、4、7 会退化成一条线段","view":"square","alt":"左图是边长分别为 3、4、5 的三角形，顶点 C 处画有直角符号，斜边 AB 标 5、直角边 AC 标 4、直角边 CB 标 3；右图是长 3 与 4 的两条线段首尾相接后总长恰好等于长 7 的线段，三个端点 P、Q、R 落在同一条直线上，两条短线段接不到一起，不能围成三角形。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[24,18],[51,54],[24,54]],"closed":true,"fill":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"angle","x":24,"y":54,"from":0,"to":90,"r":5,"right":true},{"t":"text","x":20.5,"y":36,"text":"4","size":3.6,"anchor":"end","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":37.5,"y":58.5,"text":"3","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":43,"y":31,"text":"5","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":24,"y":18,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":0},{"t":"dot","x":51,"y":54,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":24,"y":54,"label":"C","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":3},{"t":"text","x":37.5,"y":10,"text":"能围成","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"ok"},{"t":"text","x":55,"y":65,"text":"不能围成","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"danger"},{"t":"line","x1":24,"y1":76,"x2":51,"y2":76,"tone":"accent","width":0.9},{"t":"line","x1":51,"y1":76,"x2":87,"y2":76,"tone":"danger","width":0.9},{"t":"text","x":37.5,"y":71,"text":"3","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":69,"y":71,"text":"4","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":24,"y":76,"label":"P","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":0},{"t":"dot","x":51,"y":76,"label":"Q","labelDx":-2,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":87,"y":76,"label":"R","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":0},{"t":"text","x":55,"y":86,"text":"3+4=7，退化成一条线段","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"检验时只看「较短两边之和 > 最长边」；取等号时三条线段只能接成一条线段，不能围成三角形。"},{"type":"h","text":"画出高、中线与角平分线"},{"type":"p","text":"三条重要线段都是「从顶点连到对边」的线段：高是顶点到对边的垂线段，所以要过顶点向对边作垂线；中线连到对边的中点，关键是先找中点；角平分线把顶角分成两个相等的角，关键是平分那个角。作图时先定出「对边上那个特殊的点」，再与顶点相连，三者就不会画混。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sanjiao-s2","title":"高、中线与角平分线","caption":"高作垂线到垂足，中线连到对边中点，角平分线平分顶角","view":"wide","alt":"三个三角形并排：左边三角形从顶点 A 向底边 BC 作垂线段 AH，垂足 H 处画有直角符号；中间三角形从顶点 A 连到底边 BC 的中点 M，BM 与 MC 上画有等长标记；右边三角形从顶点 A 连到底边上的点 D，顶点 A 被分成两个相等的角。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[17,14],[8,48],[26,48]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":17,"y1":14,"x2":17,"y2":48,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":17,"y":48,"from":90,"to":180,"r":4,"right":true},{"t":"dot","x":17,"y":14,"label":"A","labelDx":-1.5,"labelDy":-4},{"t":"dot","x":8,"y":48,"label":"B","labelDx":-4,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":26,"y":48,"label":"C","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":17,"y":48,"label":"H","labelDx":2,"labelDy":4},{"t":"text","x":17,"y":57,"text":"高：垂线段","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"poly","points":[[49,14],[40,48],[58,48]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":49,"y1":14,"x2":49,"y2":48,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":44.5,"y1":46.4,"x2":44.5,"y2":49.6,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":53.5,"y1":46.4,"x2":53.5,"y2":49.6,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":49,"y":14,"label":"A","labelDx":-1.5,"labelDy":-4},{"t":"dot","x":40,"y":48,"label":"B","labelDx":-4,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":58,"y":48,"label":"C","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":49,"y":48,"label":"M","labelDx":2,"labelDy":4},{"t":"text","x":49,"y":57,"text":"中线：连中点","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"poly","points":[[79,14],[72,48],[90,48]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":79,"y1":14,"x2":80.9,"y2":48,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":79,"y":14,"from":-101.6,"to":-86.9,"r":5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"angle","x":79,"y":14,"from":-86.9,"to":-72.1,"r":5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"dot","x":79,"y":14,"label":"A","labelDx":-1.5,"labelDy":-4},{"t":"dot","x":72,"y":48,"label":"B","labelDx":-4,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":90,"y":48,"label":"C","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":80.9,"y":48,"label":"D","labelDx":1,"labelDy":4},{"t":"text","x":79,"y":57,"text":"角平分线：平分顶角","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"三者都是线段：高必须垂直对边，中线必须过对边中点，角平分线必须把顶角平分；「三角形的角平分线」不是射线。"},{"type":"h","text":"用内角和求未知的角"},{"type":"p","text":"三角形三个内角的和恒等于 180^°，所以只要知道两个角，第三个角就能用减法求出来。直角三角形的两个锐角一定互余；把某个角用「另一个角的式子」表示后再代入内角和，就能一次解出所有角。图里 ∠ A=65^°、∠ B=35^°，于是 ∠ C=180^°-65^°-35^°=80^°。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sanjiao-s3","title":"内角和定理求第三个角","caption":"∠A+∠B+∠C=180°，已知两角可求第三角","view":"square","alt":"三角形 ABC 中，顶点 A 处的角标为 65 度、顶点 B 处的角标为 35 度、顶点 C 处的角标为 80 度，三个内角之和正好等于 180 度。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[14,76],[86,76],[31.7,38]],"closed":true,"fill":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"angle","x":14,"y":76,"from":0,"to":65,"r":10,"label":"65°"},{"t":"angle","x":86,"y":76,"from":145,"to":180,"r":10,"label":"35°"},{"t":"angle","x":31.7,"y":38,"from":-115,"to":-35,"r":10,"label":"80°"},{"t":"dot","x":14,"y":76,"label":"A","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":86,"y":76,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":31.7,"y":38,"label":"C","labelDx":-1.5,"labelDy":-4},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":90,"text":"∠A + ∠B + ∠C = 180°","size":3.8,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"已知两角求第三角，直接用 180^° 减去已知两角；求出后可用「外角等于不相邻两内角之和」来检验。"},{"type":"h","text":"外角与多边形的内角和"},{"type":"p","text":"把三角形的一条边延长，延长线与相邻的边所成的角就是外角；它等于与它不相邻的两个内角之和，因为「外角 + 相邻内角 = 180^°」，而三内角之和也是 180^°，两式相减就得到这条性质。把多边形从一个顶点出发连对角线，可以把它分成 (n-2) 个三角形，所以内角和是 (n-2)× 180^°；而外角和永远等于 360^°。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sanjiao-s4","title":"外角与多边形内角和","caption":"三角形外角 = 不相邻两内角之和；五边形分成 3 个三角形","view":"wide","alt":"左边是三角形 ABC，把边 BC 延长到点 D，顶点 C 处由 CA 与 CD 组成的角是外角，它等于与它不相邻的两个内角 ∠A 与 ∠B 之和；右边是五边形 ABCDE，从顶点 A 向 C、D 连两条虚线对角线，把五边形分成三个三角形，因此五边形的内角和等于 3 个 180 度，即 540 度。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[12,56],[38,56],[26,26]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":26,"y1":26,"x2":21.2,"y2":13.9,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":26,"y":26,"from":111.8,"to":245,"r":7,"label":"外角","tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":12,"y":56,"from":0,"to":65,"r":8,"label":"∠A"},{"t":"angle","x":38,"y":56,"from":111.8,"to":180,"r":8,"label":"∠B"},{"t":"dot","x":12,"y":56,"label":"A","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":38,"y":56,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":26,"y":26,"label":"C","labelDx":-1.5,"labelDy":-4},{"t":"dot","x":21.2,"y":13.9,"label":"D","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-1},{"t":"poly","points":[[72,14],[51.1,29.2],[59.1,53.8],[84.9,53.8],[92.9,29.2]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":72,"y1":14,"x2":59.1,"y2":53.8,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":72,"y1":14,"x2":84.9,"y2":53.8,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":72,"y":14,"label":"A","labelDx":-1.5,"labelDy":-4},{"t":"dot","x":51.1,"y":29.2,"label":"B","labelDx":-4,"labelDy":-2},{"t":"dot","x":59.1,"y":53.8,"label":"C","labelDx":-1,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":84.9,"y":53.8,"label":"D","labelDx":2,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":92.9,"y":29.2,"label":"E","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-1}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"外角只等于与它不相邻的两个内角之和，不要把相邻内角也算进去；多边形外角和恒为 360^°，与边数无关。"},{"type":"h","text":"核心概念"},{"type":"p","text":"三角形的三边关系：三角形任意两边之和大于第三边，任意两边之差小于第三边。判断三条线段能否组成三角形，只要检验较短两边之和是否大于最长边：大于就能组成，等于或小于就不能。三边关系是「能否构成三角形」的判定依据。"},{"type":"p","text":"三角形的高、中线与角平分线：从三角形的一个顶点向它的对边所在直线作垂线，顶点与垂足之间的线段叫三角形的高，钝角三角形有两条高落在三角形外部；连接顶点与对边中点的线段叫中线；顶点与对边上角平分线交点的线段叫三角形的角平分线。三条中线交于一点（重心）。它们都是线段，不是射线或直线。"},{"type":"p","text":"三角形的稳定性：三边的长度确定后，三角形的形状和大小就唯一确定，这种性质叫三角形的稳定性，生产中常用它固定框架（如自行车的三角架）；四边形三边确定后仍可变形，不具有稳定性。"},{"type":"p","text":"三角形内角和定理：三角形三个内角的和等于 180^°。由它可以推出：直角三角形的两个锐角互余；一个三角形中最多有一个直角或一个钝角；一个三角形中至少有两个锐角。"},{"type":"p","text":"三角形的外角及其性质：三角形的一边与另一边的延长线组成的角叫做三角形的外角。性质：三角形的一个外角等于与它不相邻的两个内角的和，并且大于任何一个与它不相邻的内角。注意外角与相邻内角互补，不要把相邻内角也加进去。"},{"type":"p","text":"多边形的内角和与外角和：从 n 边形的一个顶点出发可把它分成 (n-2) 个三角形，所以 n 边形的内角和是 (n-2)× 180^°。任意多边形的外角和都等于 360^°，与边数无关；求正多边形的边数时常用外角和来计算。"},{"type":"p","text":"用同一种正多边形镶嵌（平面镶嵌）：用同一种正多边形铺满地面时，拼在同一个顶点处的各内角之和必须恰好等于 360^°。能单独铺满平面的正多边形只有正三角形、正四边形（正方形）、正六边形三种。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"用三边关系判断能否构成三角形、求第三边范围或等腰三角形周长\n选择与填空高频。只需检验较短两边之和是否大于最长边；给等腰两边求周长时必须分两种腰长讨论，再用三边关系舍去不能构成的情况，端点取等号的情形一律排除。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"用内角和定理与外角性质求角度\n常与角平分线、平行线、高综合出解答题。踩分点：外角只等于与它不相邻的两个内角之和；设未知数列方程时写清依据，求出后用内角和或外角两种算法互相检验。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"多边形内角和、外角和公式与平面镶嵌的判定\n选择题考边数与内角和互求，解答题考正多边形能否镶嵌。每个内角相等求边数走外角和 360^° 最快；镶嵌要说明同一顶点处各内角之和恰好为 360^°，注意书写判定过程。"},{"type":"table","title":"公式与定理","head":["公式/定理","表述","注意"],"rows":[["三角形内角和定理","∠ A+∠ B+∠ C=180^°","对任意三角形都成立，是求角度的基本依据"],["三角形的三边关系","|a-b|<c<a+b","两端都不能取等号；取等号时三条线段只能首尾相接成一条线段，不能组成三角形"],["三角形的外角性质","∠ ACD=∠ A+∠ B","∠ ACD 是顶点 C 处的外角，∠ A、∠ B 必须是与它不相邻的两个内角"],["多边形的内角和","(n-2)× 180^°","n 是边数；三角形 n=3 时正好是 180^°，不要写成 (n-1)× 180^°"],["多边形的外角和","360^°","任意多边形的外角和都等于 360^°，与边数无关；求正多边形边数时用 360^°÷ 每个外角最快"]]},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"三角形的两边长分别是 3 和 7，第三边长是整数，求第三边长的所有可能取值。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sanjiao-e1","title":"第三边的取值范围","caption":"7−3 < x < 7+3，即 4 < x < 10，整数只能取 5 到 9","view":"wide","alt":"一条水平数轴上，4 与 10 两个位置各画一个空心圈表示不能取到，中间的 5、6、7、8、9 五个整数各画一个实心点；粗线标出第三边 x 满足 4 小于 x 小于 10 的取值范围，说明第三边只能是 5 到 9 这五个整数。","prims":[{"t":"arrow","x1":8,"y1":40,"x2":92,"y2":40,"tone":"muted","width":0.4},{"t":"line","x1":12,"y1":40,"x2":88,"y2":40,"tone":"accent","width":1.2},{"t":"line","x1":12,"y1":36,"x2":12,"y2":44,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":88,"y1":36,"x2":88,"y2":44,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":12,"y":40,"hollow":true,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"dot","x":88,"y":40,"hollow":true,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"dot","x":24.7,"y":40},{"t":"dot","x":37.3,"y":40},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":40},{"t":"dot","x":62.7,"y":40},{"t":"dot","x":75.3,"y":40},{"t":"text","x":12,"y":50,"text":"4","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"danger"},{"t":"text","x":88,"y":50,"text":"10","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"danger"},{"t":"text","x":24.7,"y":50,"text":"5","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":37.3,"y":50,"text":"6","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":50,"text":"7","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":62.7,"y":50,"text":"8","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":75.3,"y":50,"text":"9","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":25,"text":"7 − 3 < x < 7 + 3","size":3.8,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":15,"text":"第三边的取值范围","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["设第三边长为 x，由三角形三边关系得 7-3<x<7+3，即 4<x<10（两边之差小于第三边，两边之和大于第三边）。","因为 x 是整数，所以 x 可以取 5,6,7,8,9。","检验端值：x=4 时 3+4=7，三条线段不能组成三角形；x=10 时 3+7=10，同样不能组成三角形，都要舍去。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：第三边长可以是 5,6,7,8,9，共 5 种可能。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"三边关系要写成「两边之差 < 第三边 < 两边之和」，两端都是开区间，取等号的情形必须舍去。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"在 △ ABC 中，∠ A:∠ B:∠ C=1:2:3，求三个内角的度数，并判断三角形的形状。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sanjiao-e2","title":"内角比为 1:2:3 的直角三角形","caption":"三角依次为 30°、60°、90°，是直角三角形","view":"square","alt":"直角三角形 ABC，顶点 C 处画有直角符号并标 90 度，顶点 A 处标 30 度，顶点 B 处标 60 度；三个内角中最小角 30 度与 60 度之比为 1 比 2，与 90 度之比为 1 比 3。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[26,29],[52,74],[26,74]],"closed":true},{"t":"angle","x":26,"y":74,"from":0,"to":90,"r":6,"right":true},{"t":"angle","x":26,"y":29,"from":-90,"to":-60,"r":8,"label":"30°"},{"t":"angle","x":52,"y":74,"from":120,"to":180,"r":8,"label":"60°"},{"t":"text","x":33,"y":67,"text":"90°","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":26,"y":29,"label":"A","labelDx":-1.5,"labelDy":-4},{"t":"dot","x":52,"y":74,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":2},{"t":"dot","x":26,"y":74,"label":"C","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":2},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":90,"text":"∠A:∠B:∠C = 1:2:3","size":3.8,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["设 ∠ A=x^°，则 ∠ B=2x^°，∠ C=3x^°（按比例设未知数）。","由三角形内角和定理得 x+2x+3x=180。","解得 x=30，所以 ∠ A=30^°，∠ B=60^°，∠ C=90^°。","因为 ∠ C=90^°，所以 △ ABC 是直角三角形，且 ∠ A 与 ∠ B 互余。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：∠ A=30^°，∠ B=60^°，∠ C=90^°，△ ABC 是直角三角形。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"比例型条件用「设一份为 x」最省事，求出各角后要回头判断三角形的形状。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"一个多边形的每个内角都等于 144^°，求这个多边形的边数。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sanjiao-e3","title":"每个内角 144° 的正十边形","caption":"内角 144° → 外角 36°；360°÷36° = 10","view":"square","alt":"正十边形的顶点 P 处，两条相邻的边把内角分成 144 度，一条边的延长线与另一条相邻边组成 36 度的外角；每个外角都是 36 度，十个外角相加正好是 360 度，所以这个正多边形是十边形。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[50,10],[26.5,17.6],[12,37.6],[12,62.4],[26.5,82.4],[50,90],[73.5,82.4],[88,62.4],[88,37.6],[73.5,17.6]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":10,"x2":36.7,"y2":5.7,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":10,"from":162,"to":198,"r":9,"label":"36°","tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":10,"from":198,"to":342,"r":9,"label":"144°"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":10,"label":"P","labelDx":3,"labelDy":-2}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["设边数为 n。方法一：由内角和公式得 (n-2)× 180^°=144^°× n，展开得 180n-360=144n，解得 n=10。","方法二：每个内角是 144^°，则每个外角是 180^°-144^°=36^°（邻补角互补）。","因为多边形外角和是 360^°，所以边数 n=360^°÷ 36^°=10。","两种方法结果一致，这个多边形是十边形。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：这个多边形是十边形（n=10）。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"已知「每个内角相等」求边数时，改算外角再用外角和 360^° 最快，还能避开解较复杂的方程。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"如图意：在 △ ABC 中，∠ A=65^°，∠ B=35^°，CD 平分 ∠ ACB，交 AB 于点 D，求 ∠ BDC 的度数。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sanjiao-pingfen-1","title":"角平分线求角","caption":"CD 平分 ∠ACB，在 △BCD 中用内角和","view":"wide","alt":"三角形 ABC 中，角 A 为 65 度、角 B 为 35 度、角 C 为 80 度，CD 平分角 ACB 交 AB 于点 D，角 ACD 与角 BCD 各为 40 度，在三角形 BCD 中由内角和得角 BDC 为 105 度。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":15,"y1":70,"x2":85,"y2":70},{"t":"line","x1":15,"y1":70,"x2":32.3,"y2":33},{"t":"line","x1":85,"y1":70,"x2":32.3,"y2":33},{"t":"line","x1":32.3,"y1":33,"x2":42.1,"y2":70,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":15,"y":70,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":85,"y":70,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":32.3,"y":33,"label":"C","labelDx":0,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"dot","x":42.1,"y":70,"label":"D","labelDx":1,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"angle","x":15,"y":70,"from":0,"to":65,"r":7,"label":"65°"},{"t":"angle","x":85,"y":70,"from":145,"to":180,"r":7,"label":"35°"},{"t":"angle","x":32.3,"y":33,"from":245,"to":285,"r":6.5,"label":"40°"},{"t":"angle","x":32.3,"y":33,"from":285,"to":325,"r":6.5,"label":"40°"},{"t":"angle","x":42.1,"y":70,"from":0,"to":105,"r":8,"label":"105°"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["先由三角形内角和定理求被平分的角：∠ ACB=180^°-65^°-35^°=80^°。","因为 CD 平分 ∠ ACB，所以 ∠ ACD=∠ BCD=(1)/(2)∠ ACB=40^°。","在 △ BDC 中再用内角和：∠ BDC=180^°-∠ B-∠ BCD=180^°-35^°-40^°=105^°。","换外角性质检验：∠ BDC 是 △ ADC 的外角，∠ BDC=∠ A+∠ ACD=65^°+40^°=105^°，结果一致。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：∠ BDC=105^°。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"求角思路：先用内角和求出与平分线相关的角，再在目标三角形内用内角和；外角等于不相邻两内角之和可以当检验，两种算法一致才稳妥。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"在 △ ABC 中，AD 是 BC 边上的中线，△ ABD 的周长比 △ ADC 的周长大 3，且 AB+AC=13，求 AB、AC 的长。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sanjiao-zhongxian-1","title":"中线分出的两个三角形","caption":"D 是 BC 中点，两三角形周长之差 = AB−AC","view":"wide","alt":"三角形 ABC 中，D 是边 BC 的中点，BD 与 DC 上画有相同的等长标记，线段 AD 是中线；按真实比例 AB 长为 8、AC 长为 5，两个三角形有公共边 AD，周长之差等于 AB 与 AC 之差为 3。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[10,70],[70,70],[72.5,20]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":72.5,"y1":20,"x2":40,"y2":70,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":25,"y1":68.2,"x2":25,"y2":71.8,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":55,"y1":68.2,"x2":55,"y2":71.8,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":10,"y":70,"label":"B","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":70,"y":70,"label":"C","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":72.5,"y":20,"label":"A","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-2},{"t":"dot","x":40,"y":70,"label":"D","labelDx":0.5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"text","x":36,"y":46,"text":"8","size":3.6,"anchor":"end","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":75,"y":46,"text":"5","size":3.6,"anchor":"start","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["中线的定义给出 BD=DC；两个三角形又有公共边 AD，所以周长之差只来自 AB 与 AC。","由题意得 AB-AC=3（△ ABD 周长较大，说明 AB>AC），又有 AB+AC=13。","两式相加：2AB=16，所以 AB=8；代回得 AC=5。","检验：8+5=13，8-5=3，且 5+8>8，能构成三角形，结果合理。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：AB=8，AC=5。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"中线分三角形所得两个小三角形周长之差，就等于原三角形两条边之差——中线本身和公共边在作差时全部消掉，抓住这一点就不用分别求两段底边。"},{"type":"list","title":"易错点","items":["钝角三角形的三条高中有两条落在三角形外部，画图时只往三角形内部画高会漏解。","三角形的高、中线、角平分线都是线段；「三角形的角平分线」与「角的平分线」（射线）不是同一个概念，不能混写。","三角形的一个外角等于与它不相邻的两个内角之和，把相邻内角也算进去，或写成「三个内角之和」都会出错。","多边形内角和是 $(n-2)\\times 180^\\circ$，把 $(n-2)$ 写成 $(n-1)$，或把 $n$ 当成对角线条数是高频错误。","求第三边取值范围时两端不能取等号：$4<x<10$ 中 $x=4$、$x=10$ 都必须舍去。","用同一种正多边形镶嵌时，只有正三角形、正方形、正六边形能单独铺满平面；正五边形每个内角 $108^\\circ$，$360\\div 108$ 不是整数，因此不行。"]},{"type":"list","title":"解题方法","items":["求角度优先用内角和定理，遇到外角就用「不相邻两内角之和」，两条性质配合可以少算一步。","判断三边能否构成三角形或求第三边范围，先找出最长边，再检验较短两边之和是否大于最长边。","条件中出现比例（如 1:2:3）时设一份为未知数，用内角和列方程求解。","已知每个内角相等求多边形的边数，改从外角入手，用外角和 360^° 计算。","同一个三角形的面积可以用不同的底和对应的高表示，这种「面积相等」是求线段长与证明线段相等的常用技巧。"]}],"questions":[{"id":"m-geo-sanjiaoxing-q1","type":"choice","stem":"下列长度的三条线段能组成三角形的是","answer":"C","explain":"判断时只看较短两边之和是否大于最长边：1+2=3 不大于 3，A 不能；2+3=5<6，B 不能；3+4=7>5，C 能；4+5=9<10，D 不能。","options":["1,2,3","2,3,6","3,4,5","4,5,10"],"difficulty":1,"tags":["三边关系","能否构成三角形"]},{"id":"m-geo-sanjiaoxing-q2","type":"choice","stem":"在 △ ABC 中，∠ A=50^°，∠ B=60^°，则 ∠ C 的度数与顶点 C 处外角的度数分别是","answer":"A","explain":"由三角形内角和定理得 ∠ C=180^°-50^°-60^°=70^°；顶点 C 处的外角与 ∠ C 互补，为 180^°-70^°=110^°，也等于不相邻两内角之和 50^°+60^°=110^°，两种算法一致。","options":["70^°,110^°","70^°,70^°","80^°,100^°","110^°,70^°"],"difficulty":1,"tags":["内角和定理","外角性质"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sanjiaoxing-q2","title":"△ ABC 的三个内角与顶点 C 处的外角","caption":"按题目给的角度作图：∠ A=50^°、∠ B=60^°、∠ C=70^°；延长 BC 到 D，∠ ACD 是与 ∠ C 相邻的外角，为 110^°","view":"wide","alt":"三角形 ABC 中，角 A 等于 50 度、角 B 等于 60 度、角 C 等于 70 度；把边 BC 延长到点 D，顶点 C 处的外角 ACD 等于 110 度。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[14,54],[74,54],[49.6,11.6]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":49.6,"y1":11.6,"x2":43.6,"y2":1.2,"dashed":true},{"t":"angle","x":14,"y":54,"from":0,"to":49.98,"r":7,"tone":"ok","label":"50°"},{"t":"angle","x":74,"y":54,"from":-180,"to":-240.08,"r":7,"tone":"ok","label":"60°"},{"t":"angle","x":49.6,"y":11.6,"from":-130.02,"to":-60.08,"r":7,"tone":"ok","label":"70°"},{"t":"angle","x":49.6,"y":11.6,"from":-130.02,"to":-240.02,"r":9,"tone":"danger","label":"110°"},{"t":"dot","x":14,"y":54,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":74,"y":54,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":49.6,"y":11.6,"label":"C","labelDx":2.4,"labelDy":-3.2},{"t":"dot","x":43.6,"y":1.2,"label":"D","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":0.6}]}},{"id":"m-geo-sanjiaoxing-q3","type":"choice","stem":"一个多边形的内角和是 1080^°，则这个多边形的边数是","answer":"C","explain":"由 (n-2)× 180^°=1080^° 得 n-2=6，所以 n=8。误选 6 是把 n-2 直接当成了边数。","options":["6","7","8","9"],"difficulty":1,"tags":["多边形内角和"]},{"id":"m-geo-sanjiaoxing-q4","type":"choice","stem":"在 △ ABC 中，D 是 BC 延长线上的一点，∠ ACD 是 △ ABC 的一个外角，则下列结论一定成立的是","answer":"A","explain":"三角形的一个外角等于与它不相邻的两个内角的和，∠ A、∠ B 都与 ∠ ACD 不相邻，所以 ∠ ACD=∠ A+∠ B，A 正确；∠ ACB 与 ∠ ACD 相邻，两者互补而不相等，B、D 错；C 把等号写成了大于号，只有「外角大于不相邻的某一个内角」才成立。","options":["∠ ACD=∠ A+∠ B","∠ ACD=∠ A+∠ ACB","∠ ACD>∠ A+∠ B","∠ ACD=∠ B+∠ ACB"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["外角性质","条件辨析"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sanjiaoxing-waijiao","title":"∠ ACD 是 △ ABC 在顶点 C 处的外角","caption":"延长 BC 到 D：∠ ACD 与 ∠ ACB 相邻且互补，而 ∠ ACB 又与 ∠ A、∠ B 的和互补，所以 ∠ ACD=∠ A+∠ B","view":"wide","alt":"三角形 ABC，把边 BC 延长到点 D；在顶点 C 处，角 ACD 是三角形的一个外角，它与角 ACB 相邻且互补。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[10,52],[90,52],[30,12]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":30,"y1":12,"x2":13.4,"y2":0.9,"dashed":true},{"t":"angle","x":30,"y":12,"from":-116.57,"to":-213.77,"r":9,"tone":"danger","label":"外角 ACD"},{"t":"dot","x":10,"y":52,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":90,"y":52,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":30,"y":12,"label":"C","labelDx":2.4,"labelDy":-3.2},{"t":"dot","x":13.4,"y":0.9,"label":"D","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":0.6}]}},{"id":"m-geo-sanjiaoxing-q5","type":"fill","stem":"一个等腰三角形的两边长分别是 4 和 9，则它的周长是 ____。（只填数字）","answer":"22","explain":"分两种情况：若腰长为 4，则三边为 4,4,9，因为 4+4=8<9，不能组成三角形，舍去；若腰长为 9，则三边为 9,9,4，因为 9+4>9，能组成三角形，此时周长是 9+9+4=22。","difficulty":2,"tags":["等腰三角形","三边关系","分类讨论"]},{"id":"m-geo-sanjiaoxing-q6","type":"short","stem":"用同一种正多边形铺满地面时，同一个顶点处各内角之和必须满足什么条件？请用这个条件说明正五边形为什么不能单独铺满地面。","answer":"用同一种正多边形铺满地面时，拼接在同一个顶点处的若干个内角之和必须恰好等于 $360^\\circ$（此时各边才能两两重合、无缝无重叠）。正五边形的每个内角是 $(5-2)\\times 180^\\circ\\div 5=108^\\circ$。若用 2 个正五边形拼在同一个顶点处，内角之和是 $216^\\circ$，还差 $144^\\circ$ 形成空隙；若用 3 个，内角之和是 $324^\\circ$，还差 $36^\\circ$；若用 4 个，内角之和已是 $432^\\circ>360^\\circ$，会重叠。也就是说 $360\\div 108$ 不是整数，无论取几个正五边形都无法让顶点处内角之和恰好等于 $360^\\circ$，所以正五边形不能单独铺满地面。同理，能单独镶嵌的正多边形只有正三角形、正四边形和正六边形。","explain":"本题考查平面镶嵌的条件与计算。评分要点：先答出同一顶点处各内角之和必须等于 360^°；再算出正五边形每个内角为 108^°；最后说清为什么凑不出 360^°（360÷ 108 不是整数，或列举 2 个、3 个内角之和不等于 360^°）。常见失分点：只写「不是整数」而不给出内角计算过程；把内角和公式误用为 (n-1)× 180^°；漏掉「各边相等、能无缝拼接」这一层条件。","difficulty":2,"tags":["平面镶嵌","多边形内角和"],"rubric":["写出顶点处各内角之和必须等于 360^°","正确算出正五边形的每个内角为 108^°","指出 360÷ 108 不是整数，或列举 2 个、3 个内角之和不等于 360^°","得出正五边形不能单独镶嵌的结论","（加分）指出能单独镶嵌的只有正三角形、正方形、正六边形"]},{"id":"m-geo-sanjiaoxing-z1","type":"choice","stem":"一个正多边形的每个外角都等于 40^°，则这个正多边形的边数是","answer":"C","explain":"任意多边形的外角和都等于 360^°，正多边形各外角相等，所以边数 n=360^°÷ 40^°=9，选 C。若误用内角和公式反推，容易把 n-2 当成 n 而错选 B。","options":["8","10","9","12"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["多边形内角和"]},{"id":"m-geo-sanjiaoxing-z2","type":"fill","stem":"在 △ ABC 中，∠ A=80^°，∠ B=60^°，则顶点 C 处外角的度数是 ____。（只填数字）","answer":"140","explain":"方法一：先由内角和得 ∠ C=180^°-80^°-60^°=40^°，顶点 C 处的外角与它互补，为 180^°-40^°=140^°。方法二：外角等于与它不相邻的两个内角之和，80^°+60^°=140^°。","difficulty":2,"tags":["内角和定理","外角性质"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sanjiaoxing-z2","title":"顶点 C 处的外角","caption":"按题目给的角度作图：∠ A=80^°、∠ B=60^°，由内角和得 ∠ C=40^°；顶点 C 处的外角为 180^°-40^°=∠ A+∠ B=140^°","view":"wide","alt":"三角形 ABC 中角 A 等于 80 度、角 B 等于 60 度；把边 BC 延长到点 D，顶点 C 处的外角 ACD 等于 140 度。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[30,54],[60,54],[37,14.2]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":37,"y1":14.2,"x2":31,"y2":3.8,"dashed":true},{"t":"angle","x":30,"y":54,"from":0,"to":80.02,"r":6,"tone":"ok","label":"80°"},{"t":"angle","x":60,"y":54,"from":-180,"to":-239.98,"r":6,"tone":"ok","label":"60°"},{"t":"angle","x":37,"y":14.2,"from":-99.98,"to":-240.02,"r":9,"tone":"danger","label":"140°"},{"t":"dot","x":30,"y":54,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":60,"y":54,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":37,"y":14.2,"label":"C","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":-3.2},{"t":"dot","x":31,"y":3.8,"label":"D","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":0.6}]}}]},{"id":"m-geo-quandeng","title":"全等三角形","subtitle":"人教版八上 · 第14章 全等三角形","grade":"8a","tags":["图形与几何","全等三角形"],"blocks":[{"type":"note","title":"教材章节","text":"人教版八上 · 第14章 全等三角形"},{"type":"note","title":"一句话概述","text":"掌握全等三角形的性质与五种判定方法，会用全等证明线段相等、角相等。"},{"type":"h","text":"先看什么：剪下来能完全重合"},{"type":"p","text":"把两个三角形剪下来能重合在一起，就说这两个三角形全等，重合的顶点叫对应顶点、重合的边叫对应边。所以判断全等看的永远是「对应元素」，而对应关系由字母的书写顺序规定：△ ABC≌△ DEF 中 A 对 D、B 对 E、C 对 F。注意图里右边的三角形是旋转过的，方向虽然变了，旋转后仍能重合，照样是全等。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-quandeng-s1","title":"旋转后能重合的两个三角形全等","caption":"方向不同不影响全等，重合的顶点就是对应顶点","view":"wide","alt":"左边一个实线三角形 ABC，右边一个与它全等的三角形用虚线画出，整体旋转了 180 度；两者之间有一段带箭头的短线，标注「旋转 180°」，说明旋转后两个三角形能完全重合，所以它们全等。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[12,14],[44,14],[24,46]],"closed":true,"fill":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"poly","points":[[60,46],[92,46],[80,14]],"closed":true,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"arrow","x1":40,"y1":32,"x2":62,"y2":32,"tone":"muted","label":"旋转 180°","labelDy":-3.5},{"t":"dot","x":12,"y":14,"label":"A","labelDx":-5,"labelDy":0},{"t":"dot","x":44,"y":14,"label":"B","labelDx":1,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"dot","x":24,"y":46,"label":"C","labelDx":-1,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":60,"y":46,"label":"D","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":3.5},{"t":"dot","x":92,"y":46,"label":"E","labelDx":2,"labelDy":3.5},{"t":"dot","x":80,"y":14,"label":"F","labelDx":0,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":58,"text":"剪下来能完全重合，就叫全等","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"书写顺序就是对应关系：把 △ ABC≌△ DEF 写成 △ ABC≌△ EDF，对应边、对应角就全错了。"},{"type":"h","text":"抓条件：三组元素就够定了"},{"type":"p","text":"判定全等不必把六个元素全给齐，只要给出能唯一确定三角形形状与大小的三组即可：三边分别相等（SSS）、两边和它们的夹角分别相等（SAS）、两角和它们的夹边分别相等（ASA）。为什么三组就够？按这三组条件作图时交点只有一个，画出的三角形被锁死，所以形状、大小都唯一。SAS 里的角必须夹在两条已知边中间，若不是夹角就成了不能判定的「边边角」。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-quandeng-s2","title":"三组判定各需要哪几组元素","caption":"SSS 看三条边、SAS 看两边与夹角、ASA 看两角与夹边","view":"wide","alt":"三个三角形并排：左边三角形三条边都画有等长记号，旁边标注 SSS；中间三角形把两条边标出等长记号、并在这两条边的夹角处画弧线，标注 SAS；右边三角形在两个角处画弧线、并把夹在这两个角之间的那条边标出等长记号，标注 ASA。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[4,18],[30,18],[17,50]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":17,"y1":16.6,"x2":17,"y2":19.4,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":22.2,"y1":33.47,"x2":24.8,"y2":34.53,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":9.2,"y1":33.47,"x2":11.8,"y2":34.53,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"text","x":17,"y":10,"text":"SSS","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"ok"},{"t":"poly","points":[[37,18],[63,18],[50,50]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":16.6,"x2":50,"y2":19.4,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":55.2,"y1":33.47,"x2":57.8,"y2":34.53,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"angle","x":63,"y":18,"from":180,"to":247.9,"r":6,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":10,"text":"SAS","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"ok"},{"t":"poly","points":[[70,18],[96,18],[83,50]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":83,"y1":16.6,"x2":83,"y2":19.4,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"angle","x":70,"y":18,"from":-67.9,"to":0,"r":6,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"angle","x":96,"y":18,"from":180,"to":247.9,"r":6,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"text","x":83,"y":10,"text":"ASA","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"ok"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":58,"text":"三组元素配齐，三角形的形状与大小就唯一确定","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"SAS 里的角必须夹在两条已知边中间，给的是其中一条边的对角就成了「边边角」，不能判定全等。"},{"type":"h","text":"看反例：为什么边边角不行"},{"type":"p","text":"已知两边和其中一边的对角（SSA）时，条件并没有把图形锁死。如图以 A 为圆心、AC 的长为半径画弧，弧与 ∠ B 的另一边交于 C₁、C₂ 两点，于是 △ ABC₁ 与 △ ABC₂ 都满足 AB、AC、∠ B 这三组条件，形状却明显不同。既然三组条件对应着两个不同的三角形，它就不能作为判定依据，必须把角换成夹角。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-quandeng-s3","title":"边边角不能判定：一种条件两种画法","caption":"AB=4、AC=3、∠B=30°，C 可以落在两个位置","view":"square","alt":"以点 B 为顶点画一个 30 度角，一条边水平、另一条边斜向上；在斜边上取 BA 长为 4，以 A 为圆心、3 为半径画圆，圆与水平边交于 C1、C2 两点，分别连接 AC1 与 AC2；三角形 ABC1 与 ABC2 都满足 AB 等于 4、AC 等于 3、角 B 等于 30 度，却形状不同，说明边边角不能判定全等。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":20,"y1":70,"x2":92,"y2":70,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":20,"y1":70,"x2":82.4,"y2":34,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":20,"y":70,"from":0,"to":30,"r":9,"tone":"ok","label":"30°"},{"t":"circle","cx":47.7,"cy":54,"r":24,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":47.7,"y1":54,"x2":29.8,"y2":70,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":47.7,"y1":54,"x2":65.6,"y2":70,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":20,"y":70,"label":"B","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":3},{"t":"dot","x":47.7,"y":54,"label":"A","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-2,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":29.8,"y":70,"label":"C1","labelDx":-2,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":65.6,"y":70,"label":"C2","labelDx":2,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"text","x":28,"y":60,"text":"AB=4","size":3.4,"anchor":"end","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":58,"y":46,"text":"AC=3","size":3.4,"anchor":"start","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":88,"text":"两种画法都满足条件，三角形却不同——SSA 不能判定全等","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"danger"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"凡是「两边加一对角」都先怀疑：只有直角三角形里斜边与一条直角边分别相等（HL）才可以判定。"},{"type":"h","text":"按格式写：从条件到结论一条链"},{"type":"p","text":"全等证明在卷面上有固定结构：先写明在「哪两个三角形中」，再按判定方法要求的顺序把三组条件逐一列出（公共边、公共角、对顶角这些隐含条件也必须写出），然后写判定依据，最后才写「全等三角形的对应边（角）相等」。这样写，阅卷人一眼能看出用的是哪条判定；若跳步或写成「由图可知」，推理链就断了，等于没有依据。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-quandeng-s4","title":"全等证明的书写结构","caption":"条件 → 判定 → 结论，四步一条链","view":"wide","alt":"全等证明的书写流程用四个方框与箭头自上而下连接：第一步写明在哪两个三角形中，第二步按顺序列出三组对应条件，第三步写出判定依据，第四步得到对应边、对应角相等。","prims":[{"t":"rect","x":14,"y":4,"w":72,"h":10,"rx":2,"tone":"main","label":""},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":10.5,"text":"① 在 △ABC 与 △DEF 中","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle"},{"t":"arrow","x1":50,"y1":14,"x2":50,"y2":18,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"rect","x":14,"y":18,"w":72,"h":10,"rx":2,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":24.5,"text":"② AB=DE，∠B=∠E，BC=EF（含公共边）","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle"},{"t":"arrow","x1":50,"y1":28,"x2":50,"y2":32,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"rect","x":14,"y":32,"w":72,"h":10,"rx":2,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":38.5,"text":"③ ∴ △ABC ≌ △DEF（SAS）","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle"},{"t":"arrow","x1":50,"y1":42,"x2":50,"y2":46,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"rect","x":14,"y":46,"w":72,"h":10,"rx":2,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":52.5,"text":"④ ∴ AC=DF（全等三角形对应边相等）","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"条件顺序要与判定方法对齐：用 SAS 就按「边、角、边」排，用 ASA 就按「角、边、角」排。"},{"type":"h","text":"核心概念"},{"type":"p","text":"全等形与全等三角形：能够完全重合的两个图形叫全等形，能够完全重合的两个三角形叫全等三角形。互相重合的顶点叫对应顶点，重合的边叫对应边，重合的角叫对应角。记作 △ ABC≌△ DEF 时，字母必须按对应顶点的顺序书写：A 对 D、B 对 E、C 对 F。\n把两个三角形剪下来能完全重合，就是全等——「完全重合」意味着三组对应边、三组对应角同时相等，六组元素一组都不能少。所以判断两个三角形是否全等，看的永远是「对应元素」：△ ABC≌△ DEF 里 A 对 D，那么 AC 只可能等于 DF，绝不会等于 EF。书写顺序一旦写错，后面找对应边、对应角会一路错到底，这是这一章最常见的隐性失分。"},{"type":"p","text":"全等三角形的性质：全等三角形的对应边相等、对应角相等。由此还能推出两个全等三角形的周长相等、面积相等，对应边上的高、中线、角平分线也分别相等。性质的作用是由「全等」得到线段或角相等，是证明线段相等、角相等的主要依据。\n性质只有一个方向：由「全等」推出「对应边、对应角相等」，它是证明题的出口——要证两条线段相等或两个角相等，最后一步几乎都是「全等三角形的对应边（角）相等」。由对应边、对应角相等还能顺带得到周长相等、面积相等，对应边上的高、中线、角平分线也分别相等；反过来，面积相等推不出全等，两个三角形的形状可以完全不同。"},{"type":"p","text":"判定方法 SSS 与 SAS：三边分别相等的两个三角形全等（SSS）；两边和它们的夹角分别相等的两个三角形全等（SAS）。SAS 中的角必须是两条对应边的夹角，若角是其中一边的对角，就变成了不能判定全等的「边边角」。\nSAS 里那个角不是随便哪个角，必须是两条已知边的夹角：先看已知哪两条边，再看题目给的角是不是夹在它们中间。若给的是其中一条边的对角（两边一对角，SSA），三组条件就确定不了三角形——以 A 为圆心、另一边为半径画弧，弧与第三条边可能交于两点，能作出一大一小两个都满足条件的三角形，所以不能判定全等。SSS 则相反，三组边一确定，三角形的形状与大小就唯一确定了。"},{"type":"p","text":"判定方法 ASA 与 AAS：两角和它们的夹边分别相等的两个三角形全等（ASA）；两角和其中一个角的对边分别相等的两个三角形全等（AAS）。由三角形内角和定理可知两角确定后第三个角也随之确定，所以 AAS 与 ASA 本质相通，只是已知边的位置不同。\n先数题目给了几个角：两角齐全时，那条已知边若是两角的夹边就是 ASA，若是其中一个角的对边就是 AAS。由三角形内角和定理，两角确定后第三个角随之确定，所以 AAS 与 ASA 本质是同一件事的两种写法——做题时不必纠结名称，把「两组角 + 任一条对应边」凑齐即可。"},{"type":"p","text":"直角三角形全等的判定 HL：斜边和一条直角边分别相等的两个直角三角形全等（HL）。它只适用于直角三角形，而且必须已知两条斜边相等；若已知的是两条直角边分别相等，应当用 SAS 判定。\nHL 的条件是「斜边 + 一条直角边」；如果已知的是两条直角边分别相等，那就该用 SAS——直角本来就是这两条边的夹角，条件反而是齐的。所以拿到直角三角形先数条件：斜边加一条直角边用 HL，两条直角边用 SAS，一条直角边加一个锐角用 ASA 或 AAS。HL 只对直角三角形有效；普通三角形里的「两边一对角」仍然是 SSA，不能判定。"},{"type":"p","text":"角的平分线的性质与判定：性质：角的平分线上的点到角两边的距离相等（要作出到两边的垂线段）。判定：在角的内部，到角两边距离相等的点在这个角的平分线上。两者条件与结论互换：由「平分」得「距离相等」是性质，由「距离相等」得「点在平分线上」是判定，用错方向就会写成没有依据的推理（还须强调点在角的内部）。\n两个方向的用途完全不同：性质（由「点在平分线上」推「到两边距离相等」）用来把角的条件换成线段条件，所以看到角平分线就往两边作垂线段；判定（由「到两边距离相等」推「点在平分线上」）用来证明某条射线是角平分线。用反方向就是循环论证。另外判定里「点在角的内部」这一条不能丢：角平分线所在的直线上，角的外部也有一点到两边距离相等。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"辨析五种判定方法，识别 SSA、AAA 等不能判定全等的情形\n选择题高频，常让补条件或选判定依据。踩分点：SAS 的角必须是夹角；HL 只限直角三角形且要斜边与一条直角边分别相等；面积或周长相等、三个角分别相等都不能判定全等。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"利用全等证明线段相等、角相等或直线垂直\n解答题主考题型。要先写清在「哪两个三角形中」，三组条件按判定方法顺序排列，公共边、公共角、对顶角必须显式写出，最后写「对应边（角）相等」，证明链一环扣一环，禁止用「由图可知」代替依据。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"角平分线的性质与判定，以及用二次全等、倍长中线完成证明\n见角平分线向两边作垂线段转化距离；一次全等条件不足时先证一组全等再证第二组；见中线常倍长中线构造「八字形」全等，把分散的边集中到同一三角形中求范围或相等。"},{"type":"table","title":"公式与定理","head":["公式/定理","表述","注意"],"rows":[["全等三角形的性质","△ ABC≌△ DEF⇒ AB=DE,\\ ∠ A=∠ D","对应关系由书写顺序决定；顺序写错会导致后面找对应边、对应角全错"],["判定定理 SSS","AB=DE,\\ BC=EF,\\ AC=DF⇒△ ABC≌△ DEF","三边分别相等即可，不需要任何角的条件"],["判定定理 SAS","AB=DE,\\ ∠ B=∠ E,\\ BC=EF⇒△ ABC≌△ DEF","角必须是两组对应边的夹角；若写成 AB=DE、AC=DF、∠ B=∠ E 就成了不能判定全等的边边角"],["判定定理 ASA","∠ B=∠ E,\\ BC=EF,\\ ∠ C=∠ F⇒△ ABC≌△ DEF","两个角必须夹住已知的这条边"],["判定定理 AAS","∠ A=∠ D,\\ ∠ B=∠ E,\\ BC=EF⇒△ ABC≌△ DEF","已知边是其中一个角的对边；由内角和可知第三个角也相等，故与 ASA 等价"],["直角三角形全等的判定 HL","AB=DE,\\ AC=DF△ ABC△ DEF","仅限直角三角形，AB、DE 是两条斜边，AC、DF 是直角边"]]},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"在四边形中，AB=AD，射线 AC 平分 ∠ BAD，求证 BC=DC。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-quandeng-e1","title":"已知两边与夹角，用 SAS 证全等","caption":"AB=AD、∠BAC=∠DAC、AC 公共，△ABC≌△ADC","view":"square","alt":"四边形 ABCD 中，A 在顶端、C 在底端，AC 是它的对角线；AB 与 AD 画有相同的等长记号，顶点 A 处被 AC 分成的两个角画有相同的弧线，说明 AC 平分角 BAD；由 SAS 得三角形 ABC 与三角形 ADC 全等，所以 BC 等于 DC。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[30,10],[12,40],[30,66],[48,40]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":30,"y1":10,"x2":30,"y2":66,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":30,"y":10,"from":-121,"to":-90,"r":8,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"angle","x":30,"y":10,"from":-90,"to":-59,"r":8,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":19.8,"y1":24.28,"x2":22.2,"y2":25.72,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":37.8,"y1":24.28,"x2":40.2,"y2":25.72,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"dot","x":30,"y":10,"label":"A","labelDx":-1,"labelDy":-4},{"t":"dot","x":12,"y":40,"label":"B","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":30,"y":66,"label":"C","labelDx":0.5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":48,"y":40,"label":"D","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":82,"text":"AB=AD，∠BAC=∠DAC，AC 公共，由 SAS 得两三角形全等","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["由 AC 平分 ∠ BAD（已知），得 ∠ BAC=∠ DAC（角平分线的定义）。","在 △ ABC 和 △ ADC 中：AB=AD（已知），∠ BAC=∠ DAC（已证），AC=AC（公共边），所以 △ ABC≌△ ADC（SAS）。","所以 BC=DC（全等三角形的对应边相等）。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：BC=DC。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"书写时把三组条件按「边、角、边」的顺序排列，公共边、公共角、对顶角这类隐含条件也要明确写出来。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"OP 平分 ∠ AOB，PC⊥ OA 于点 C，PD⊥ OB 于点 D，求证 PC=PD。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-quandeng-e2","title":"角平分线上的点到两边距离相等","caption":"PC⊥OA、PD⊥OB，直角与 OP 公共，由 AAS 得 PC=PD","view":"square","alt":"角 AOB 中，射线 OP 把角分成两个相等的角、两段弧线相同；点 P 在 OP 上，PC 垂直于 OA 于点 C、PD 垂直于 OB 于点 D，C 与 D 处都画有直角方框；三角形 POC 与 POD 中两组角与公共边 OP 分别相等，由 AAS 全等得 PC 等于 PD。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":14,"y1":64,"x2":88,"y2":20},{"t":"line","x1":14,"y1":64,"x2":90,"y2":64},{"t":"line","x1":14,"y1":64,"x2":58.4,"y2":51.8,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":58.4,"y1":51.8,"x2":52.1,"y2":41.4,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":58.4,"y1":51.8,"x2":58.4,"y2":64,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"angle","x":14,"y":64,"from":0,"to":15.35,"r":9,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"angle","x":14,"y":64,"from":15.35,"to":30.7,"r":9,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"angle","x":52.1,"y":41.4,"from":-149.3,"to":-58.8,"r":3.4,"right":true},{"t":"angle","x":58.4,"y":64,"from":90,"to":180,"r":3.4,"right":true},{"t":"line","x1":54.05,"y1":47.32,"x2":56.45,"y2":45.88,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":57.2,"y1":57.9,"x2":59.6,"y2":57.9,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"dot","x":14,"y":64,"label":"O","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":2},{"t":"dot","x":88,"y":20,"label":"A","labelDx":2,"labelDy":-1.5},{"t":"dot","x":90,"y":64,"label":"B","labelDx":2,"labelDy":3},{"t":"dot","x":58.4,"y":51.8,"label":"P","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-2,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":52.1,"y":41.4,"label":"C","labelDx":-1.5,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"dot","x":58.4,"y":64,"label":"D","labelDx":0.5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":86,"text":"两组角与公共边 OP 分别相等，由 AAS 得 PC = PD","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["由 OP 平分 ∠ AOB，得 ∠ COP=∠ DOP（角平分线的定义）。","由 PC⊥ OA、PD⊥ OB，得 ∠ PCO=∠ PDO=90^°（垂直的定义）。","在 △ POC 和 △ POD 中：∠ PCO=∠ PDO（已证），∠ COP=∠ DOP（已证），OP=OP（公共边），所以 △ POC≌△ POD（AAS）。","所以 PC=PD（全等三角形的对应边相等）。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：PC=PD。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"这正是角平分线的性质定理；结论以后可以直接引用，但第一次遇到时要会完整证明。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"已知 AB=AC，AD=AE，∠ BAC=∠ DAE，求证 BD=CE。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-quandeng-e3","title":"共顶点角模型：减去同一个角得夹角相等","caption":"∠BAC=∠DAE ⇒ ∠BAD=∠CAE，配 AB=AC、AD=AE 用 SAS","view":"wide","alt":"从公共顶点 A 引出四条射线 AB、AD、AC、AE，依次排列；AB 与 AC 画有相同的等长记号、AD 与 AE 画有相同的等长记号，角 BAD 与角 CAE 处画有相同的弧线；由 SAS 得三角形 ABD 与三角形 ACE 全等，所以 BD 等于 CE。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":14,"x2":33,"y2":43.4},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":14,"x2":60.5,"y2":46.3},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":14,"x2":46.7,"y2":37.8},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":14,"x2":65.4,"y2":32.4},{"t":"line","x1":33,"y1":43.4,"x2":46.7,"y2":37.8,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":60.5,"y1":46.3,"x2":65.4,"y2":32.4,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":14,"from":240,"to":262,"r":6,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":14,"from":288,"to":310,"r":6,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":40.3,"y1":28,"x2":42.7,"y2":29.4,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":54.1,"y1":30.52,"x2":56.4,"y2":29.78,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":47.15,"y1":25.73,"x2":49.55,"y2":26.07,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":46.98,"y1":26.92,"x2":49.38,"y2":27.26,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":56.78,"y1":23.97,"x2":58.62,"y2":22.43,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":57.55,"y1":24.89,"x2":59.39,"y2":23.35,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":14,"label":"A","labelDx":0,"labelDy":-4},{"t":"dot","x":33,"y":43.4,"label":"B","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":2},{"t":"dot","x":60.5,"y":46.3,"label":"C","labelDx":0.5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":46.7,"y":37.8,"label":"D","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":2},{"t":"dot","x":65.4,"y":32.4,"label":"E","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":58,"text":"∠BAC=∠DAE 减去公共角 ⇒ ∠BAD=∠CAE，配两组边用 SAS","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["由 ∠ BAC=∠ DAE，两边同时减去 ∠ CAD，得 ∠ BAD=∠ CAE（等式的性质）。","在 △ ABD 和 △ ACE 中：AB=AC（已知），∠ BAD=∠ CAE（已证），AD=AE（已知），所以 △ ABD≌△ ACE（SAS）。","所以 BD=CE（全等三角形的对应边相等）。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：BD=CE。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"两个大角相等时，往往要「同时加上或减去同一个角」才能得到能用的夹角，这类图形称为共顶点角模型。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"在 △ ABC 中，AD 是 BC 边上的中线，AB=5，AC=3，求中线 AD 长的取值范围。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-quandeng-beichang-1","title":"倍长中线构造全等","caption":"延长 AD 至 E 使 DE=AD，△BDE≌△CDA","view":"wide","alt":"三角形 ABC 中 AD 是中线，延长 AD 到点 E 使 DE 等于 AD，连接 BE；三角形 BDE 与三角形 CDA 全等，所以 BE 等于 AC 等于 3；在三角形 ABE 中 AB 等于 5，由三边关系得 AE 大于 2 且小于 8，即 AD 大于 1 且小于 4。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[37,33],[67,33],[67,10.5]],"closed":true},{"t":"poly","points":[[37,33],[52,33],[37,55.5]],"closed":true,"fill":true,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"poly","points":[[67,33],[52,33],[67,10.5]],"closed":true,"fill":true,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":67,"y1":10.5,"x2":52,"y2":33,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":52,"y1":33,"x2":37,"y2":55.5,"tone":"muted","dashed":true},{"t":"line","x1":37,"y1":33,"x2":37,"y2":55.5,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":60.9,"y1":22.7,"x2":58.1,"y2":20.8,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":45.9,"y1":45.2,"x2":43.1,"y2":43.3,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":44.5,"y1":31.4,"x2":44.5,"y2":34.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":59.5,"y1":31.4,"x2":59.5,"y2":34.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":67,"y":33,"from":90,"to":180,"r":3.5,"right":true},{"t":"dot","x":67,"y":10.5,"label":"A","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-2},{"t":"dot","x":37,"y":33,"label":"B","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":67,"y":33,"label":"C","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":52,"y":33,"label":"D","labelDx":-1.5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":37,"y":55.5,"label":"E","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":3},{"t":"text","x":49,"y":19.5,"text":"5","size":3.6,"anchor":"end","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":70,"y":22,"text":"3","size":3.6,"anchor":"start","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":33.5,"y":44.5,"text":"3","size":3.6,"anchor":"end","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["中线只给了 BD=DC，直接看 △ ABD 与 △ ADC 条件不够；延长 AD 到点 E，使 DE=AD，连接 BE（倍长中线的辅助线）。","在 △ BDE 和 △ CDA 中：BD=CD（中线定义），∠ BDE=∠ CDA（对顶角相等），DE=DA（作图），所以 △ BDE≌△ CDA（SAS），得 BE=AC=3。","在 △ ABE 中用三边关系：AB-BE<AE<AB+BE，即 5-3<AE<5+3，所以 2<AE<8。","由作图知 AE=2AD，故 2<2AD<8，即 1<AD<4。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：1<AD<4。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"中线问题条件分散时，倍长中线构造「八字形」全等是通法：它把 AC 等量搬到 BE，使 AB、AC 与两倍中线落在同一个三角形里，再用三边关系求范围。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"如图意：PB⊥ AB 于点 B，PC⊥ AC 于点 C，且 PB=PC，求证：射线 AP 平分 ∠ BAC。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-quandeng-hl-1","title":"斜边直角边（HL）判全等","caption":"PB⊥AB，PC⊥AC，PB=PC，AP 公共","view":"wide","alt":"从点 A 引出两条射线 AB 与 AC，点 P 在角内，PB 垂直 AB 于点 B，PC 垂直 AC 于点 C，图中 B、C 处画有直角标记，PB 与 PC 画有相同的等长标记，AP 是公共边；三角形 ABP 与三角形 ACP 全等，所以 AP 平分角 BAC。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":18,"y1":50,"x2":84.2,"y2":65.3},{"t":"line","x1":18,"y1":50,"x2":75.1,"y2":12.9},{"t":"line","x1":18,"y1":50,"x2":75.1,"y2":39.9},{"t":"line","x1":75.1,"y1":39.9,"x2":69.9,"y2":62,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":75.1,"y1":39.9,"x2":62.8,"y2":20.9,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":70.9,"y1":51.3,"x2":74.1,"y2":50.6,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":67.5,"y1":31.3,"x2":70.4,"y2":29.5,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":69.9,"y":62,"from":77,"to":167,"r":3.5,"right":true},{"t":"angle","x":62.8,"y":20.9,"from":213,"to":303,"r":3.5,"right":true},{"t":"dot","x":18,"y":50,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":69.9,"y":62,"label":"B","labelDx":2,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":62.8,"y":20.9,"label":"C","labelDx":1,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"dot","x":75.1,"y":39.9,"label":"P","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":1}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["由垂直的定义得 ∠ ABP=∠ ACP=90^°，所以 △ ABP、△ ACP 都是直角三角形。","在 Rt△ ABP 和 Rt△ ACP 中：AP=AP（公共斜边），PB=PC（已知），所以两三角形全等（HL）。","所以 ∠ BAP=∠ CAP（全等三角形的对应角相等）。","点 P 在 ∠ BAC 的内部，故射线 AP 平分 ∠ BAC；这也说明「到角两边距离相等的点在角的平分线上」。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：射线 AP 平分 ∠ BAC。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"由「距离相等」推「平分」用的是角平分线的判定，方向与性质相反；证明时先作垂线段、用全等过渡，最后必须点明点在角的内部，结论才严密。"},{"type":"list","title":"易错点","items":["边边角（SSA）不能判定全等：两边和其中一边的对角分别相等的两个三角形不一定全等，这是全等判定中最高频的错误。","角角角（AAA）只能说明两个三角形相似，不能判定它们全等。","用 SAS 时角必须是两条对应边的夹角，把「两边一对角」当成 SAS 会得出错误结论。","写全等式时字母顺序必须与对应顶点一致，$\\triangle ABC\\cong\\triangle DEF$ 表示 $A$ 对 $D$、$B$ 对 $E$、$C$ 对 $F$，顺序写错后续全部对应关系都会错。","公共边、公共角、对顶角是隐含条件，证明中必须写出来，不能用「由图可知」代替推理。","HL 只适用于直角三角形且需要斜边与一条直角边分别相等；只给出两条直角边相等时应改用 SAS。"]},{"type":"list","title":"解题方法","items":["要证线段相等或角相等，先找它们所在的两个三角形并尝试证明全等；找不到就作辅助线构造全等三角形。","一次全等条件不够时用「二次全等」：先证一组全等得到新的边或角，再用它去证目标三角形全等。","见角平分线就向角的两边作垂线段，用角平分线的性质把「角相等」转化为「线段相等」。","见中点或中线时倍长中线构造全等（延长中线到两倍，连成「8 字形」），把分散的边集中到一个三角形中。","找全等条件按 SSS、SAS、ASA、AAS、HL 的顺序逐条排查，缺角就去找公共角、对顶角或补角补齐。"]}],"questions":[{"id":"m-geo-quandeng-q1","type":"choice","stem":"下列条件中，不能判定两个三角形全等的是","answer":"C","explain":"A 是 SSS，B 是 SAS，D 是 ASA，都能判定全等。C 是「边边角」，已知两边和其中一边的对角时，另一条边的位置可能有两种情况，得到的三角形不一定全等，不能判定。","options":["三边分别相等","两边和它们的夹角分别相等","两边和其中一边的对角分别相等","两角和它们的夹边分别相等"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["全等判定","边边角不能判定"]},{"id":"m-geo-quandeng-q2","type":"choice","stem":"已知 AB=AD，∠ BAC=∠ DAC，则判定 △ ABC≌△ ADC 的依据是","answer":"B","explain":"AB=AD 与 ∠ BAC=∠ DAC 中的角正是 AB、AC 的夹角，再加上公共边 AC=AC，符合「两边和它们的夹角分别相等」，所以依据是 SAS。","options":["SSS","SAS","ASA","HL"],"difficulty":1,"tags":["全等判定","公共边"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-quandeng-q2","title":"已知两组条件，AC 是公共边","caption":"AB 与 AD 相等（单线记号）、∠BAC 与 ∠DAC 相等（绿弧），再加上公共边 AC，就凑齐「两边夹一角」","view":"square","alt":"点 A 引出两条相等的线段 AB 与 AD（画有相同的单线等长记号），线段 AC 把角 BAD 分成两个相等的角（两个角都画有绿色弧线）；三角形 ABC 与三角形 ADC 有公共边 AC。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[10,44],[38,16],[88,44]],"closed":true},{"t":"poly","points":[[10,44],[38,72],[88,44]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":10,"y1":44,"x2":88,"y2":44,"tone":"accent","width":0.9},{"t":"line","x1":22.94,"y1":28.94,"x2":25.06,"y2":31.06,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":25.06,"y1":56.94,"x2":22.94,"y2":59.06,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"angle","x":10,"y":44,"from":45,"to":0,"r":11,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"angle","x":10,"y":44,"from":-45,"to":0,"r":11,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"dot","x":10,"y":44,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":38,"y":16,"label":"B","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":88,"y":44,"label":"C","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":38,"y":72,"label":"D","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":2.4}]}},{"id":"m-geo-quandeng-q3","type":"choice","stem":"在 △ ABC 和 △ DEF 中，已知 ∠ A=∠ D，AB=DE，再添加下列一个条件，不能判定 △ ABC≌△ DEF 的是","answer":"D","explain":"A 中 AC=DF 与 AB=DE 及其夹角 ∠ A=∠ D 构成 SAS；B 中 ∠ B=∠ E 与 ∠ A=∠ D 及夹边 AB=DE 构成 ASA；C 中 ∠ C=∠ F 与 ∠ A=∠ D（以及由内角和得的 ∠ B=∠ E）和 AB=DE 构成 AAS，因为 AB、DE 分别是 ∠ C、∠ F 的对边。D 中 BC=EF 是 ∠ A、∠ D 的对边，与 AB=DE 组合成「边边角」，不能判定全等。","options":["AC=DF","∠ B=∠ E","∠ C=∠ F","BC=EF"],"difficulty":3,"tags":["全等判定","条件辨析"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-quandeng-q3","title":"题目已经给出的两组条件","caption":"AB 与 DE 相等（单线记号）、∠A 与 ∠D 相等（绿弧）；再补的一个条件要能凑成 SAS、ASA 或 AAS，补 BC=EF 就成了边边角","view":"wide","alt":"两个三角形 ABC 与 DEF：左边三角形把边 AB 加粗并标出角 A，右边三角形把边 DE 加粗并标出角 D，表示已知 AB=DE、角 A=角 D 两组条件。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[6,12],[46,12],[18,46]],"closed":true},{"t":"poly","points":[[54,12],[94,12],[66,46]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":26,"y1":10.5,"x2":26,"y2":13.5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":74,"y1":10.5,"x2":74,"y2":13.5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"angle","x":6,"y":12,"from":0,"to":-70.56,"r":6.5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"angle","x":54,"y":12,"from":0,"to":-70.56,"r":6.5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"dot","x":6,"y":12,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":46,"y":12,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":18,"y":46,"label":"C","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":54,"y":12,"label":"D","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":94,"y":12,"label":"E","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":66,"y":46,"label":"F","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":2.4}]}},{"id":"m-geo-quandeng-q4","type":"choice","stem":"已知 △ ABC≌△ DEF，∠ A=50^°，∠ B=70^°，则 ∠ F 的度数是","answer":"B","explain":"由三角形内角和定理得 ∠ C=180^°-50^°-70^°=60^°。由 △ ABC≌△ DEF 知 ∠ F 与 ∠ C 是对应角（C 对 F），所以 ∠ F=∠ C=60^°。","options":["50^°","60^°","70^°","80^°"],"difficulty":1,"tags":["全等性质","对应角"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-quandeng-q4","title":"C 对 F：对应角相等","caption":"由内角和得 ∠C=180°−50°−70°=60°；全等三角形对应角相等，∠F 与 ∠C 是对应角，所以 ∠F=60°","view":"wide","alt":"两个全等的三角形：左边 ABC 中标出角 A 等于 50 度、角 B 等于 70 度，右边 DEF 中标出角 F 等于 60 度；因为三角形全等，角 C 与角 F 是对应角。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[6,12],[46,12],[18,46]],"closed":true},{"t":"poly","points":[[54,12],[94,12],[66,46]],"closed":true},{"t":"angle","x":6,"y":12,"from":0,"to":-70.56,"r":6.5,"tone":"ok","label":"50°"},{"t":"angle","x":46,"y":12,"from":-180,"to":-129.47,"r":6.5,"tone":"ok","label":"70°"},{"t":"angle","x":18,"y":46,"from":109.44,"to":50.53,"r":6.5,"tone":"ok","label":"∠C"},{"t":"angle","x":66,"y":46,"from":109.44,"to":50.53,"r":6.5,"tone":"ok","label":"∠F"},{"t":"dot","x":6,"y":12,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":46,"y":12,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":18,"y":46,"label":"C","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":54,"y":12,"label":"D","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":94,"y":12,"label":"E","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":66,"y":46,"label":"F","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":2.4}]}},{"id":"m-geo-quandeng-q5","type":"fill","stem":"在 △ ABC 中，AD 平分 ∠ BAC 交 BC 于点 D，DE⊥ AB 于点 E，DF⊥ AC 于点 F，若 DE=3，则 DF= ____。（只填数字）","answer":"3","explain":"由 AD 平分 ∠ BAC 且 DE⊥ AB、DF⊥ AC 可知，点 D 在角平分线上，到角两边的距离相等（也就是 △ ADE≌△ ADF，用 AAS 可证），所以 DF=DE=3。","difficulty":1,"tags":["角平分线的性质","点到直线的距离"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-quandeng-q5","title":"角平分线上的点到角两边的距离","caption":"AD 平分 ∠BAC，DE⊥AB、DF⊥AC（E、F 处画直角方框）；DE 与 DF 是一组相等的距离","view":"square","alt":"三角形 ABC，AD 平分角 BAC 并与 BC 交于点 D；从 D 分别向 AB、AC 作垂线，垂足是 E 与 F，两处直角都画有方框，线段 DE 与 DF 画有相同的单线等长记号。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[46,10],[10,56],[90,50]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":46,"y1":10,"x2":49.7,"y2":53,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":49.7,"y1":53,"x2":26.6,"y2":34.8},{"t":"line","x1":49.7,"y1":53,"x2":69.4,"y2":31.3},{"t":"line","x1":28.76,"y1":32.04,"x2":31.51,"y2":34.21,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":31.51,"y1":34.21,"x2":29.35,"y2":36.97,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":66.81,"y1":28.94,"x2":64.46,"y2":31.54,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":64.46,"y1":31.54,"x2":67.05,"y2":33.89,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":39.08,"y1":42.72,"x2":37.22,"y2":45.08,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":60.66,"y1":43.16,"x2":58.44,"y2":41.14,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"dot","x":46,"y":10,"label":"A","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":10,"y":56,"label":"B","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":90,"y":50,"label":"C","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":49.7,"y":53,"label":"D","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":26.6,"y":34.8,"label":"E","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":69.4,"y":31.3,"label":"F","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"text","x":33,"y":45,"text":"3","anchor":"end","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":63,"y":45,"text":"?","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"danger"}]}},{"id":"m-geo-quandeng-q6","type":"short","stem":"说明边边角（SSA）为什么不能判定两个三角形全等，并举出一个反例。","answer":"判定全等要求三组条件能唯一确定三角形的形状和大小。在边边角的情形中，已知两边和其中一边的对角，当这个角是锐角时，另一条边的位置可以由两种方式确定，能画出两个形状不同的三角形，因此条件不能唯一确定图形，也就不能判定全等。反例：画 $\\angle B=30^\\circ$，在它的一边上取 $BA=4$；以 $A$ 为圆心、3 为半径画弧，与 $\\angle B$ 的另一边有两个交点 $C_1$、$C_2$（因为点 $A$ 到这条边的距离是 $4\\sin 30^\\circ=2$，小于半径 3）。这样 $\\triangle ABC_1$ 与 $\\triangle ABC_2$ 都满足 $AB=4$、$AC=3$、$\\angle B=30^\\circ$，即两边和其中一边的对角分别相等，但两个三角形显然不全等。因此判断全等必须用 SAS（夹角），不能用 SSA。","explain":"本题考查对全等判定条件的理解与反例构造能力。评分要点：说明边边角的条件不能唯一确定三角形的形状；给出具体数据并说明能作出两个满足条件但不全等的三角形；据此得出「两边及其中一边的对角分别相等不能判定全等」，并强调必须用夹角。常见失分点：只写「规定边边角不行」而说不出理由；反例数据自相矛盾（给出的三边根本构不成三角形）；把相似判定与全等判定的条件混为一谈。","difficulty":3,"tags":["边边角","反例","全等判定"],"rubric":["指出 SSA 不能唯一确定三角形的形状","举出具体数据（如 AB=4、AC=3、∠ B=30^°）","说明能作出两个满足条件的三角形","得出两面不全等的结论，或强调必须用夹角（SAS）"]},{"id":"m-geo-quandeng-z1","type":"choice","stem":"下列关于全等三角形的说法中，正确的是","answer":"B","explain":"A 错：全等三角形对应边上的高、中线、角平分线都相等。B 是 AAS，正确。C 错：面积相等只说明底与高的乘积相等，形状可以不同。D 错：两条直角边分别相等用 SAS 即可判定，HL 需要的是斜边与一条直角边分别相等。","options":["全等三角形对应边上的中线不一定相等","两角和其中一个角的对边分别相等的两个三角形全等","面积相等的两个三角形一定全等","两条直角边分别相等的两个直角三角形必须用 HL 判定全等"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["全等判定","条件辨析"]},{"id":"m-geo-quandeng-z2","type":"short","stem":"如图意：点 B、C、D 在同一直线上，AB⊥ BD，ED⊥ BD，垂足分别为 B、D，且 AC=CE，BC=DE。求证：AC⊥ CE。","answer":"因为 $AB\\perp BD$，$ED\\perp BD$，所以 $\\angle B=\\angle D=90^\\circ$，$\\triangle ABC$ 与 $\\triangle CDE$ 都是直角三角形。在 $\\mathrm{Rt}\\triangle ABC$ 和 $\\mathrm{Rt}\\triangle CDE$ 中：$AC=CE$（已知，斜边），$BC=DE$（已知，直角边），所以 $\\mathrm{Rt}\\triangle ABC\\cong\\mathrm{Rt}\\triangle CDE$（HL）。所以 $\\angle A=\\angle ECD$（全等三角形对应角相等）。在 $\\mathrm{Rt}\\triangle ABC$ 中两锐角互余，$\\angle A+\\angle ACB=90^\\circ$，等量代换得 $\\angle ECD+\\angle ACB=90^\\circ$。又因为 $B$、$C$、$D$ 共线，$\\angle ACB+\\angle ACE+\\angle ECD=180^\\circ$，所以 $\\angle ACE=180^\\circ-90^\\circ=90^\\circ$，即 $AC\\perp CE$。","explain":"本题考查 HL 判定与全等性质的综合运用。评分要点：先点明两个直角三角形；按 HL 列出斜边 AC=CE、直角边 BC=DE 两组条件；证全等后把对应角等量代换到直角三角形两锐角互余中；最后利用三点共线的平角算出 ∠ ACE=90^°。常见失分点：不说明是直角三角形就直接用 HL；把 BC=DE 当成斜边；得到角互余后忘记 B、C、D 共线这一条件，无法收出垂直结论。","difficulty":3,"tags":["全等判定","全等性质"],"rubric":["由垂直条件说明两个三角形都是直角三角形","用 HL 证明 Rt△ ABC△ CDE，并写明斜边与直角边两组条件","由全等得 ∠ A=∠ ECD，结合两锐角互余完成等量代换","利用 B、C、D 共线算出 ∠ ACE=90^°，写出垂直结论"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-quandeng-chuizhi-1","title":"HL 判全等证垂直","caption":"△ABC≌△CDE（HL），∠ACE=180°−90°","view":"square","alt":"点 B、C、D 在同一条水平直线上，AB 垂直于该直线于点 B，ED 垂直于该直线于点 D，图中 B、D 处有直角标记；斜边 AC 与 CE 画有相同标记、直角边 BC 与 DE 画有相同标记，由 HL 得三角形 ABC 全等于三角形 CDE，从而 AC 垂直于 CE。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":8,"y1":74,"x2":91,"y2":74},{"t":"line","x1":12,"y1":74,"x2":12,"y2":29},{"t":"line","x1":87,"y1":74,"x2":87,"y2":44},{"t":"line","x1":12,"y1":29,"x2":42,"y2":74},{"t":"line","x1":42,"y1":74,"x2":87,"y2":44},{"t":"line","x1":25,"y1":72.4,"x2":29,"y2":75.6,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":85,"y1":72.4,"x2":89,"y2":75.6,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":26.1,"y1":50.6,"x2":27.9,"y2":52.4,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":63.6,"y1":58.1,"x2":65.4,"y2":59.9,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"angle","x":12,"y":74,"from":0,"to":90,"r":3.5,"right":true},{"t":"angle","x":87,"y":74,"from":90,"to":180,"r":3.5,"right":true},{"t":"dot","x":12,"y":29,"label":"A","labelDx":-1,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"dot","x":12,"y":74,"label":"B","labelDx":-5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":42,"y":74,"label":"C","labelDx":0.5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":87,"y":74,"label":"D","labelDx":2,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":87,"y":44,"label":"E","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":0}]}}]},{"id":"m-geo-zhouduichen","title":"轴对称","subtitle":"人教版八上 · 第15章 轴对称","grade":"8a","tags":["图形与几何","轴对称"],"blocks":[{"type":"note","title":"教材章节","text":"人教版八上 · 第15章 轴对称"},{"type":"note","title":"一句话概述","text":"掌握轴对称的性质、线段垂直平分线与等腰三角形的判定和性质，以及坐标中的对称规律。"},{"type":"h","text":"先看什么：沿虚线折叠能重合"},{"type":"p","text":"把一个图形沿某条直线折叠，若直线两旁的部分能完全重合，这个图形就是轴对称图形，这条直线叫对称轴。判断的关键是「折叠后重合」：对称轴两侧的形状必须一模一样，只是方向相反。图里左右两个图形互相对称，中间的虚线就是它们的对称轴。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zhouduichen-s1","title":"沿对称轴折叠，两侧完全重合","caption":"虚线是对称轴，两侧图形关于它成轴对称","view":"square","alt":"一条竖直的虚线作为对称轴，左侧是一个五边形，右侧是它关于该虚线对称的镜像图形；右侧图形顶点的对应点 A′ 与左侧的 A 用水平虚线相连，连线与对称轴垂直。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":8,"x2":50,"y2":78,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"poly","points":[[18,62],[42,62],[42,40],[30,28],[18,40]],"closed":true,"fill":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"poly","points":[[82,62],[58,62],[58,40],[70,28],[82,40]],"closed":true,"fill":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":42,"y1":40,"x2":58,"y2":40,"dashed":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":40,"from":0,"to":90,"r":3.5,"right":true},{"t":"dot","x":42,"y":40,"label":"A","labelDx":-1.5,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"dot","x":58,"y":40,"label":"A′","labelDx":1.5,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":88,"text":"沿虚线折叠，两侧能完全重合","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"对称轴是一条可以无限延长的直线，作图时要画成直线并适当延长，不能画成线段。"},{"type":"h","text":"抓性质：连线被对称轴垂直平分"},{"type":"p","text":"轴对称最有用的一条性质是：对应点的连线一定被对称轴垂直平分。理由是折叠时两点恰好重合，说明它们到对称轴的距离相等、且分居两侧，连线自然与对称轴垂直，「被平分」正是「距离相等」的几何说法。所以给了对称轴，就等于给了「垂直」与「线段相等」两件事，很多证明由此展开。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zhouduichen-s2","title":"对应点连线被对称轴垂直平分","caption":"AM = MA′，且 AA′⊥l","view":"square","alt":"一条竖直的虚线 l 是对称轴，点 A 与它关于 l 的对应点 A′ 在两侧，AA′ 水平并垂直于对称轴，交点 M 处画有直角方框；线段 AM 与 MA′ 上画有相同的等长记号，说明对称轴垂直平分对应点的连线。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":10,"x2":50,"y2":90,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":22,"y1":34,"x2":78,"y2":34,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":34,"from":0,"to":90,"r":4,"right":true},{"t":"line","x1":37,"y1":32.6,"x2":37,"y2":35.4,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":63,"y1":32.6,"x2":63,"y2":35.4,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"dot","x":22,"y":34,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":78,"y":34,"label":"A′","labelDx":2,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":34,"r":0.9,"label":"M","labelDx":2,"labelDy":4},{"t":"text","x":54,"y":14,"text":"l","size":3.8,"anchor":"start","tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":86,"text":"AM = MA′，且 AA′ ⊥ l","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"「垂直平分」是两件事：垂直 + 平分，答题时缺一不可，只写「对称轴平分 AA′」是不完整的。"},{"type":"h","text":"怎么画：找点、作垂线、截等长、连线"},{"type":"p","text":"要作一个图形关于直线 l 的轴对称图形，只需抓住「对应点连线被 l 垂直平分」这一条：先找出图形的关键顶点，过每个顶点作 l 的垂线得到垂足，在垂线另一侧截取与垂足等长的线段定出对称点，最后按原图形的顺序把对称点依次连接即可。复杂的图形也因此化归为几个顶点的作图。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zhouduichen-s3","title":"画轴对称图形的四个步骤","caption":"每个顶点作垂线、截等长，再依次连线","view":"square","alt":"竖直虚线是对称轴，左侧是原三角形 ABC，右侧是它的轴对称图形 A′B′C′；三个顶点分别向对称轴作水平虚线并延长到另一侧，垂足处画有直角方框，对称轴两侧的对应线段上画有相同的等长记号，说明由垂线与等长定出对称点后连线得到轴对称图形。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":8,"x2":50,"y2":80,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":16,"y1":26,"x2":84,"y2":26,"dashed":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":16,"y1":58,"x2":84,"y2":58,"dashed":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":34,"y1":44,"x2":66,"y2":44,"dashed":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"poly","points":[[16,26],[16,58],[34,44]],"closed":true,"fill":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"poly","points":[[84,26],[84,58],[66,44]],"closed":true,"fill":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":26,"from":0,"to":90,"r":3.5,"right":true},{"t":"line","x1":33,"y1":24.6,"x2":33,"y2":27.4,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":67,"y1":24.6,"x2":67,"y2":27.4,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":42,"y1":24.6,"x2":42,"y2":27.4,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":58,"y1":24.6,"x2":58,"y2":27.4,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"dot","x":16,"y":26,"label":"A","labelDx":-5,"labelDy":-1},{"t":"dot","x":16,"y":58,"label":"B","labelDx":-5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":34,"y":44,"label":"C","labelDx":-1,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":84,"y":26,"label":"A′","labelDx":2,"labelDy":-1},{"t":"dot","x":84,"y":58,"label":"B′","labelDx":2,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":66,"y":44,"label":"C′","labelDx":1,"labelDy":4},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":88,"text":"作垂线 → 截等长 → 依次连线","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"连线要按原图形的顶点顺序连，不能随意乱连；对称轴本身不要画成图形的一条边。"},{"type":"h","text":"常见的轴对称图形各有几条轴"},{"type":"p","text":"常见图形里，等腰三角形有 1 条对称轴（底边上的高所在的直线），等边三角形有 3 条（三条中线所在的直线），矩形有 2 条（对边中点连线），正方形有 4 条（两条对边中点连线加两条对角线），圆有无数条（任意一条直径所在的直线）。数对称轴时要想清楚「还有没有漏掉的」，正 n 边形的对称轴恰好有 n 条。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zhouduichen-s4","title":"常见图形的对称轴条数","caption":"依次是 1、3、2、4 与无数条","view":"wide","alt":"从左到右依次是等腰三角形、等边三角形、矩形、正方形和圆，每个图形上都画出全部对称轴并用虚线表示：等腰三角形 1 条，等边三角形 3 条，矩形 2 条，正方形 4 条，圆有无数条；图形下方分别标注它们的名称。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[12,20],[5,46],[19,46]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":12,"y1":15,"x2":12,"y2":51,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"poly","points":[[31,30.4],[22,46],[40,46]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":31,"y1":30.4,"x2":31,"y2":46,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":40,"y1":46,"x2":26.5,"y2":38.2,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":22,"y1":46,"x2":35.5,"y2":38.2,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"rect","x":44,"y":26,"w":12,"h":20},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":21,"x2":50,"y2":51,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":39,"y1":36,"x2":61,"y2":36,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"rect","x":60,"y":24,"w":16,"h":20},{"t":"line","x1":68,"y1":19,"x2":68,"y2":49,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":55,"y1":34,"x2":81,"y2":34,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":60,"y1":24,"x2":76,"y2":44,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":76,"y1":24,"x2":60,"y2":44,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"circle","cx":88,"cy":34,"r":9},{"t":"line","x1":88,"y1":20,"x2":88,"y2":48,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":76,"y1":34,"x2":99,"y2":34,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":12,"y":10,"text":"1 条","size":3.2,"anchor":"middle","tone":"ok"},{"t":"text","x":31,"y":10,"text":"3 条","size":3.2,"anchor":"middle","tone":"ok"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":10,"text":"2 条","size":3.2,"anchor":"middle","tone":"ok"},{"t":"text","x":69,"y":10,"text":"4 条","size":3.2,"anchor":"middle","tone":"ok"},{"t":"text","x":88,"y":10,"text":"无数条","size":3.2,"anchor":"middle","tone":"ok"},{"t":"text","x":12,"y":56,"text":"等腰三角形","size":3.1,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":31,"y":56,"text":"等边三角形","size":3.1,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":56,"text":"矩形","size":3.1,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":69,"y":56,"text":"正方形","size":3.1,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":88,"y":56,"text":"圆","size":3.1,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"对称轴可能不止一条，判断时容易漏数，例如等边三角形有 3 条、圆有无数条。"},{"type":"h","text":"核心概念"},{"type":"p","text":"轴对称图形与两个图形成轴对称：一个图形沿一条直线折叠，直线两旁的部分能够互相重合，这个图形叫轴对称图形，这条直线是它的对称轴；两个图形沿一条直线折叠后能完全重合，就说这两个图形成轴对称。前者描述一个图形自身的对称性，后者描述两个图形之间的位置关系，但两者性质相同：对应点的连线被对称轴垂直平分。"},{"type":"p","text":"对称轴是一条直线：轴对称图形的对称轴是一条直线，可以无限延长，不能画成线段。等腰三角形有 1 条对称轴（底边上的高所在的直线），等边三角形有 3 条，正方形有 4 条，圆有无数条。"},{"type":"p","text":"线段的垂直平分线（判定与性质）：性质：线段垂直平分线上的点到这条线段两个端点的距离相等。判定：到线段两个端点距离相等的点，在这条线段的垂直平分线上。要证「点在垂直平分线上」必须用判定，要用「距离相等」则用性质，两者方向相反。"},{"type":"p","text":"等腰三角形的性质：等腰三角形的两个底角相等（等边对等角）；顶角平分线、底边上的中线、底边上的高互相重合（三线合一）。三线合一是等腰三角形特有的性质，使用时要指明是顶角平分线、底边上的中线、底边上的高。"},{"type":"p","text":"等腰三角形的判定：定义法：有两边相等的三角形是等腰三角形。定理法：有两个角相等的三角形是等腰三角形（等角对等边）。「等边对等角」与「等角对等边」互为逆命题，前者是性质，后者是判定，证题时不要用反。"},{"type":"p","text":"等边三角形：等边三角形三边相等，三个内角都等于 60^°，且有三条对称轴。判定方法：三边相等的三角形；三个角都相等的三角形；有一个角是 60^° 的等腰三角形。"},{"type":"p","text":"含 30° 角的直角三角形：在直角三角形中，如果一个锐角等于 30^°，那么它所对的直角边等于斜边的一半。它的逆命题也成立：直角三角形中，若一条直角边等于斜边的一半，则这条直角边所对的锐角是 30^°。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"等腰三角形的性质与判定，特别是分类讨论与「三线合一」\n已知等腰三角形一个角求其他角必须分顶角、底角两种情况；解答题常借三线合一把底边中点、高、角平分线互相转化。书写时要写清是「顶角平分线、底边上的中线、底边上的高」，判定等腰用等角对等边。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"线段垂直平分线的性质与判定，求线段长或证点在垂直平分线上\n选择、填空、证明都常见。见垂直平分线就连接端点把未知边替换成已知边；证「点在垂直平分线上」必须用判定（距离相等），方向用反会构成循环论证。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"等边三角形的判定、含 $30^\\circ$ 角直角三角形的结论与坐标对称规律\n有一个角为 60^° 的等腰三角形是等边三角形是高频判定；30^° 角所对直角边等于斜边一半常配合作图与计算；关于坐标轴对称的点注意哪个坐标变号，对称轴要画成直线。"},{"type":"table","title":"公式与定理","head":["公式/定理","表述","注意"],"rows":[["关于坐标轴对称的点的坐标","P(x,y)to P_x(x,-y), P_y(-x,y)","关于 x 轴对称时纵坐标变号，关于 y 轴对称时横坐标变号，对应轴的坐标保持不变"],["线段垂直平分线的性质","点 P 在线段 AB 的垂直平分线上，则 PA=PB。","这是性质（由垂直平分线得等线段）；反过来说「PA=PB 的点在垂直平分线上」是判定，两个方向的用途不同"],["等腰三角形的性质（等边对等角）","AB=AC⇒∠ B=∠ C","必须在同一个三角形中，且 AB、AC 是两腰，边与角的对应关系不能错"],["等腰三角形的判定（等角对等边）","∠ B=∠ C⇒ AB=AC","与上一条互为逆命题，用于由角相等证明边相等"],["含 30° 角的直角三角形","在 Rt△ ABC 中，∠ C=90^°，∠ A=30^°，则 ∠ A 所对的直角边 BC 等于斜边 AB 的一半。","前提是直角三角形，且必须是 30^° 角所对的那条直角边，不能张冠李戴"]]},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"已知等腰三角形的一个内角是 80^°，求另外两个内角的度数。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zhouduichen-e1","title":"两种情况：80° 是顶角或底角","caption":"左：80° 作顶角；右：80° 作底角","view":"wide","alt":"左边三角形顶角 A 为 80 度、两个底角各为 50 度；右边三角形顶角 A′ 为 20 度、两个底角各为 80 度；两个三角形都满足内角和 180 度，说明已知 80 度角时要分顶角与底角两种情况讨论。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[22,10],[5.3,29.9],[38.7,29.9]],"closed":true},{"t":"text","x":22,"y":16,"text":"80°","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":12,"y":26.5,"text":"50°","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":32,"y":26.5,"text":"50°","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":22,"y":10,"label":"A","labelDx":0,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":5.3,"y":29.9,"label":"B","labelDx":-2,"labelDy":5},{"t":"dot","x":38.7,"y":29.9,"label":"C","labelDx":2,"labelDy":5},{"t":"poly","points":[[74,10],[68.8,39.5],[79.2,39.5]],"closed":true},{"t":"text","x":74,"y":16.5,"text":"20°","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":70.5,"y":36,"text":"80°","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":77.5,"y":36,"text":"80°","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":74,"y":10,"label":"A′","labelDx":0,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":68.8,"y":39.5,"label":"B′","labelDx":-3,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":79.2,"y":39.5,"label":"C′","labelDx":3,"labelDy":4},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":52,"text":"80° 是顶角 或 80° 是底角","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["情况一：80^° 是顶角。则两个底角相等，各为 (180^°-80^°)÷ 2=50^°（三角形内角和定理与等腰三角形两底角相等）。","情况二：80^° 是底角。则另一个底角也是 80^°，顶角为 180^°-80^°-80^°=20^°。","两种情况都满足内角和定理与三边关系，因此都要保留。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：另外两个角是 50^°、50^°，或者 80^°、20^°。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"等腰三角形已知一个角求其他角必须分「已知角是顶角」和「已知角是底角」讨论；若已知角是直角或钝角，则它只能是顶角，只有一解。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"在 △ ABC 中，AB 的垂直平分线分别交 AB、AC 于点 D、E，已知 AC=8，BC=5，求 △ BEC 的周长。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zhouduichen-chuizhipingfen-1","title":"垂直平分线的等距性质","caption":"BE=AE，△BEC 周长 = AC+BC","view":"wide","alt":"三角形 ABC 中，AB 的垂直平分线交 AB 于点 D、交 AC 于点 E，D 处有直角标记；EA 与 EB 画有相同标记表示相等，AC 长为 8、BC 长为 5，三角形 BEC 的周长等于 AC 加 BC 为 13。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[15,45],[60,45],[61.9,7.6]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":37.5,"y1":52,"x2":37.5,"y2":22,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":37.5,"y":45,"from":90,"to":180,"r":3,"right":true},{"t":"line","x1":25.2,"y1":34.7,"x2":27.3,"y2":37.3,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":47.7,"y1":34.7,"x2":49.8,"y2":37.3,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"dot","x":15,"y":45,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":60,"y":45,"label":"B","labelDx":1,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":61.9,"y":7.6,"label":"C","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-1},{"t":"dot","x":37.5,"y":45,"label":"D","labelDx":-4.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":37.5,"y":27,"label":"E","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":0.5},{"t":"text","x":44,"y":24,"text":"8","size":3.6,"anchor":"start","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":65,"y":25,"text":"5","size":3.6,"anchor":"start","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["因为 DE 是 AB 的垂直平分线，所以 EA=EB（线段垂直平分线上的点到线段两个端点的距离相等）。","△ BEC 的周长 =BE+EC+BC=EA+EC+BC。","因为点 E 在线段 AC 上，所以 EA+EC=AC=8。","所以 △ BEC 的周长 =8+5=13。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：△ BEC 的周长是 13。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"见垂直平分线就连接线段的两个端点得到等腰三角形，把未知边替换成已知边，这是求周长的常规思路。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"在 Rt△ ABC 中，∠ C=90^°，∠ A=30^°，AB=10，求 BC 与 AC 的长。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zhouduichen-e3","title":"含 30° 角的直角三角形","caption":"BC:AC:AB = 1:√3:2","view":"wide","alt":"直角三角形 ABC 中角 C 为 90 度、角 A 为 30 度、角 B 为 60 度，斜边 AB 标为 10，30 度角所对的直角边 BC 标为 5，另一条直角边 AC 标为 5 倍根号 3，三边之比为 1 比根号 3 比 2。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[20,17.4],[20,52],[80,52]],"closed":true},{"t":"angle","x":20,"y":52,"from":0,"to":90,"r":4,"right":true},{"t":"angle","x":80,"y":52,"from":150,"to":180,"r":6,"label":"30°"},{"t":"angle","x":20,"y":17.4,"from":-90,"to":-30,"r":6,"label":"60°"},{"t":"dot","x":20,"y":17.4,"label":"B","labelDx":-2,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":20,"y":52,"label":"C","labelDx":-3,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":80,"y":52,"label":"A","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"text","x":14,"y":36,"text":"5","size":3.6,"anchor":"end","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":58,"text":"5√3","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":54,"y":31,"text":"10","size":3.6,"anchor":"start","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["因为 ∠ C=90^°、∠ A=30^°，所以 BC 是 30^° 角所对的直角边，于是 BC=(1)/(2)AB=(1)/(2)× 10=5。","在 Rt△ ABC 中，由勾股定理得 AC=√(AB²-BC²)=√(10²-5²)=√(75)=5√(3)。","检验：BC:AC:AB=5:5√(3):10=1:√(3):2，正好是含 30^° 角直角三角形的三边之比，结果正确。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：BC=5，AC=5√(3)。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"含 30^° 角的直角三角形三边之比是 1:√(3):2（依次是 30^° 角所对的直角边、另一条直角边、斜边），记比例比每次列勾股方程更快。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"如图意：在等边三角形 ABC 中，点 D、E 分别在边 BC、CA 上，且 BD=CE，AD 与 BE 相交于点 P，求 ∠ APE 的度数。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zhouduichen-dengbian-1","title":"等边三角形中的全等","caption":"BD=CE ⇒ △ABD≌△BCE，∠APE=60°","view":"square","alt":"等边三角形 ABC 中，D 在边 BC 上、E 在边 CA 上，BD 与 CE 画有相同标记表示相等；AD 与 BE 相交于点 P，由三角形 ABD 全等于三角形 BCE 得角 BAD 等于角 CBE，角 APE 等于角 BAP 加角 ABP 为 60 度。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[18,76],[82,76],[50,20.6]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":20.6,"x2":42,"y2":76},{"t":"line","x1":18,"y1":76,"x2":70,"y2":55.2},{"t":"line","x1":30,"y1":74.2,"x2":30,"y2":77.8,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":74.4,"y1":66.5,"x2":77.6,"y2":64.7,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":43.5,"y":65.8,"from":22,"to":82,"r":5,"label":"60°"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":20.6,"label":"A","labelDx":0,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"dot","x":18,"y":76,"label":"B","labelDx":-5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":82,"y":76,"label":"C","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":42,"y":76,"label":"D","labelDx":0,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":70,"y":55.2,"label":"E","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":0},{"t":"dot","x":43.5,"y":65.8,"label":"P","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":-1.5}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["等边三角形给出 AB=BC、∠ ABD=∠ BCE=60^°，加上 BD=CE，在 △ ABD 和 △ BCE 中构成 SAS，所以 △ ABD≌△ BCE。","由全等得对应角相等：∠ BAD=∠ CBE。","∠ APE 是 △ ABP 的外角，所以 ∠ APE=∠ BAP+∠ ABP（外角等于不相邻两内角之和）。","把 ∠ BAP 等量代换成 ∠ CBE，则 ∠ APE=∠ CBE+∠ ABP=∠ ABC=60^°。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：∠ APE=60^°。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"等边三角形中夹 60^° 角的两组对应边常凑成 SAS 全等；所求角若在两条连线的交点处，优先用外角把它拆成两个角之和，再借全等做等量代换。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"用构造全等的方法证明等腰三角形的判定定理：如果一个三角形有两个角相等，那么这两个角所对的边也相等。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zhouduichen-e5","title":"作底边上的高证等角对等边","caption":"作 AD⊥BC，证 △ABD≌△ACD","view":"square","alt":"三角形 ABC 中角 B 与角 C 画有相同弧线标记表示相等，作 AD 垂直于底边 BC，D 处有直角标记；三角形 ABD 与三角形 ACD 有一组等角、公共边 AD 和两个直角，由角角边判定全等，从而 AB 与 AC 画有相同标记表示相等。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[50,22],[22,72],[78,72]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":22,"x2":50,"y2":72,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":72,"from":0,"to":90,"r":3.5,"right":true},{"t":"angle","x":22,"y":72,"from":0,"to":60.7,"r":8,"label":"∠B"},{"t":"angle","x":78,"y":72,"from":119.3,"to":180,"r":8,"label":"∠C"},{"t":"line","x1":33.4,"y1":45.5,"x2":38.6,"y2":48.5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":61.4,"y1":48.5,"x2":66.6,"y2":45.5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":22,"label":"A","labelDx":0,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":22,"y":72,"label":"B","labelDx":-2,"labelDy":5},{"t":"dot","x":78,"y":72,"label":"C","labelDx":2,"labelDy":5},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":72,"label":"D","labelDx":-4.5,"labelDy":5},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":90,"text":"∠B = ∠C ⇒ AB = AC","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["已知 △ ABC 中 ∠ B=∠ C，要证 AB=AC。辅助线的想法是把 △ ABC 分成两个三角形：作 AD⊥ BC，垂足为 D。","由垂直的定义得 ∠ ADB=∠ ADC=90^°。","在 △ ABD 和 △ ACD 中：∠ B=∠ C（已知），∠ ADB=∠ ADC（已证），AD=AD（公共边），所以 △ ABD≌△ ACD（AAS）。","所以 AB=AC（全等三角形的对应边相等），即等角对等边。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：AB=AC，等角对等边得证。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"证明判定定理时不能用定理自身作依据；作底边上的高（或顶角平分线）把一个三角形拆成两个全等三角形，是沟通角相等与边相等的标准辅助线。"},{"type":"list","title":"易错点","items":["等腰三角形已知一个角求其他角时漏掉分类讨论，只算「已知角是顶角」一种情况是最常见的漏解。","「三线合一」只对等腰三角形成立，而且指的是顶角平分线、底边上的中线、底边上的高互相重合，不是任意三角形中的任意三条线。","「$30^\\circ$ 角所对的直角边等于斜边的一半」前提是直角三角形，且必须是 $30^\\circ$ 角所对的那条直角边，用错边的位置结论就不成立。","对称轴是直线不是线段，画对称轴时应当画成直线并适当延长。","轴对称图形的对称轴可能不止一条，判断时容易遗漏，例如等边三角形有 3 条、圆有无数条。","垂直平分线的性质与判定方向相反：题目要求「证明某点在垂直平分线上」时必须用判定，用性质就是循环论证。"]},{"type":"list","title":"解题方法","items":["等腰三角形求角用「分类讨论加内角和」，求边则要用「三边关系」检验结果是否合法。","见垂直平分线就连接线段两个端点得到等腰三角形；见角平分线加平行线同样能得到等腰三角形。","见 30^°、60^° 角就构造直角三角形，用「30^° 角所对直角边等于斜边一半」与三边比 1:√(3):2。","折叠问题把折叠前后的等量关系都标在图上，设未知数后用勾股定理列方程求解。","证明线段相等或角相等，优先考虑等腰三角形与垂直平分线的性质，往往比证全等更简捷。"]}],"questions":[{"id":"m-geo-zhouduichen-q1","type":"choice","stem":"等腰三角形的一个内角是 100^°，则它的底角是","answer":"A","explain":"100^° 是钝角，不可能作底角（否则两个底角之和已超过 180^°，与内角和定理矛盾），所以 100^° 只能是顶角，两个底角各为 (180^°-100^°)÷ 2=40^°。","options":["40^°","50^°","40^° 或 100^°","80^°"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["等腰三角形","分类讨论"]},{"id":"m-geo-zhouduichen-q2","type":"choice","stem":"在 △ ABC 中，AB=AC，AD 是 △ ABC 的角平分线，则下列结论不一定成立的是","answer":"D","explain":"等腰三角形顶角的平分线、底边上的中线、底边上的高互相重合，所以 AD 既是中线又是高，BD=CD、AD⊥ BC 都成立；由等腰三角形两底角相等得 ∠ B=∠ C。而 AD 与 BD 之间没有必然的相等关系（只有当顶角为 90^° 时才相等），所以 D 不一定成立。","options":["BD=CD","AD⊥ BC","∠ B=∠ C","AD=BD"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["三线合一","等腰三角形"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zhouduichen-q2","title":"等腰三角形中的三线合一","caption":"AB 与 AC 相等（单线记号），AD 平分顶角（A 处两段相等的角弧）；这条角平分线同时是底边上的中线与高","view":"square","alt":"等腰三角形 ABC，AB 与 AC 上画有相同的单线等长记号；AD 是顶角 A 的平分线并与底边 BC 交于点 D，顶点 A 处的两个角画有相同的弧线，D 处画有直角方框。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[50,12],[14,54],[86,54]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":12,"x2":50,"y2":54,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":33.14,"y1":33.98,"x2":30.86,"y2":32.02,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":69.14,"y1":32.02,"x2":66.86,"y2":33.98,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":12,"from":-130.6,"to":-90,"r":10,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":12,"from":-90,"to":-49.4,"r":10,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":50.5,"x2":46.5,"y2":50.5,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":46.5,"y1":50.5,"x2":46.5,"y2":54,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":12,"label":"A","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":14,"y":54,"label":"B","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":86,"y":54,"label":"C","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":54,"label":"D","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":2.4}]}},{"id":"m-geo-zhouduichen-q3","type":"choice","stem":"点 P(-2,3) 关于 x 轴对称的点的坐标是","answer":"B","explain":"关于 x 轴对称的两点，横坐标相同、纵坐标互为相反数，所以对称点的坐标是 (-2,-3)。选 (2,3) 是错用了关于 y 轴对称的规律，选 (2,-3) 则是关于原点对称。","options":["(2,3)","(-2,-3)","(2,-3)","(3,-2)"],"difficulty":1,"tags":["坐标与轴对称"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zhouduichen-q3","title":"关于 x 轴对称的两点","caption":"关于 x 轴对称：横坐标相同、纵坐标互为相反数；PP1 与 x 轴垂直，且被 x 轴平分","view":"square","alt":"平面直角坐标系中，点 P 在第二象限、坐标是 (-2,3)；从 P 向下作垂线交 x 轴，并在另一侧取对称点 P1，坐标是 (-2,-3)，两点连线与 x 轴垂直。","prims":[{"t":"plane","x":50,"y":44,"right":36,"left":28,"up":32,"down":32,"xLabel":"x","yLabel":"y","xTicks":[{"at":-16,"label":"-2"},{"at":-8,"label":"-1"},{"at":8,"label":"1"}],"yTicks":[{"at":24,"label":"3"},{"at":8,"label":"1"},{"at":-8,"label":"-1"},{"at":-24,"label":"-3"}]},{"t":"line","x1":34,"y1":20,"x2":34,"y2":68,"tone":"accent","dashed":true},{"t":"line","x1":34,"y1":40.5,"x2":37.5,"y2":40.5,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":37.5,"y1":40.5,"x2":37.5,"y2":44,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":34,"y":20,"label":"P","labelDx":-4.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":34,"y":68,"label":"P1","labelDx":-6.6,"labelDy":2.6},{"t":"text","x":20,"y":26,"text":"P(-2,3)","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":20,"y":74,"text":"P1(-2,-3)","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"}]}},{"id":"m-geo-zhouduichen-q4","type":"fill","stem":"在 Rt△ ABC 中，∠ C=90^°，∠ A=30^°，BC=4，则 AB= ____。（只填数字）","answer":"8","explain":"∠ A=30^°，它所对的直角边是 BC，由「30^° 角所对的直角边等于斜边的一半」得 BC=(1)/(2)AB，所以 AB=2BC=8。","difficulty":1,"tags":["含 30° 角的直角三角形","斜边"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zhouduichen-q4","title":"30° 角所对的直角边与斜边","caption":"角 A 是 30°，它所对的直角边是 BC（已知 4）；由 BC 等于 AB 的一半得 AB=2BC=8","view":"wide","alt":"直角三角形 ABC：顶点 C 处画有直角方框，顶点 A 处标出 30 度；与角 A 相对的直角边 BC 长 4，斜边 AB 待求。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[20,54],[80,54],[65,28]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":61.54,"y1":30,"x2":63.54,"y2":33.47,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":63.54,"y1":33.47,"x2":67,"y2":31.46,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":20,"y":54,"from":0,"to":30.02,"r":8,"tone":"ok","label":"30°"},{"t":"text","x":77,"y":43,"text":"BC = 4","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":59,"text":"AB = ?","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"dot","x":20,"y":54,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":80,"y":54,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":65,"y":28,"label":"C","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.8}]}},{"id":"m-geo-zhouduichen-q5","type":"fill","stem":"在 △ ABC 中，AB=AC=10，BC=16，则 BC 边上的高是 ____。（只填数字）","answer":"6","explain":"等腰三角形底边上的高也是底边上的中线（三线合一），所以高把 BC 分成相等的两段，每段长 16÷ 2=8。在所得直角三角形中，由勾股定理得高 =√(10²-8²)=√(36)=6。","difficulty":2,"tags":["三线合一","勾股定理"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zhouduichen-q5","title":"等腰三角形底边上的高（三线合一）","caption":"AB 与 AC 都等于 10（单线记号），高 AD 同时是中线：BD 与 DC 相等（双线记号），各为 8","view":"square","alt":"等腰三角形 ABC，两腰 AB 与 AC 都标注为 10，底边 BC 长 16；从顶点 A 向 BC 作高 AD，D 处画有直角方框，BD 与 DC 画有相同的双线等长记号。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[50,12],[22,54],[78,54]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":12,"x2":50,"y2":54,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":50.5,"x2":46.5,"y2":50.5,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":46.5,"y1":50.5,"x2":46.5,"y2":54,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":37.25,"y1":33.83,"x2":34.75,"y2":32.17,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":65.25,"y1":32.17,"x2":62.75,"y2":33.83,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":34.8,"y1":52.5,"x2":34.8,"y2":55.5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":37.2,"y1":52.5,"x2":37.2,"y2":55.5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":62.8,"y1":52.5,"x2":62.8,"y2":55.5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":65.2,"y1":52.5,"x2":65.2,"y2":55.5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"text","x":32,"y":32,"text":"10","anchor":"end","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":68,"y":32,"text":"10","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":36,"y":48,"text":"8","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":64,"y":48,"text":"8","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":53,"y":34,"text":"AD = ?","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":12,"label":"A","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":22,"y":54,"label":"B","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":78,"y":54,"label":"C","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":54,"label":"D","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":2.4}]}},{"id":"m-geo-zhouduichen-q6","type":"short","stem":"说明「线段的垂直平分线上的点到线段两端点的距离相等」与「到线段两端点距离相等的点在垂直平分线上」的区别，并各举一个用法。","answer":"第一句是线段垂直平分线的性质定理：前提是「点在垂直平分线上」，结论是「点到两端点的距离相等」，作用是已知垂直平分线时直接得到相等线段，常用于求周长、求线段长。第二句是它的判定定理：前提是「点到线段两端点的距离相等」，结论是「点在这条线段的垂直平分线上」，作用是证明某点在垂直平分线上（进而得到垂直平分关系或等腰三角形的对称性）。两句话的条件与结论恰好互换，互为逆命题。用法示例：题中给出「$DE$ 垂直平分 $AB$」时，直接写 $EA=EB$ 用的是性质；题中已知 $PA=PB$，要证明点 $P$ 在 $AB$ 的垂直平分线上，必须用判定。","explain":"本题考查两条互逆定理的用途辨析。评分要点：分别说明性质定理（由垂直平分线得线段相等）与判定定理（由线段相等得点在垂直平分线上）的条件与结论；各举一个具体用法说明适用场景。常见失分点：只说「两条互为逆定理」而不说明各自用途；在「证明某点在垂直平分线上」的题目里误用性质，形成循环论证；举例时把两个方向说反。","difficulty":2,"tags":["垂直平分线","判定与性质"],"rubric":["指出第一句是性质：由垂直平分线得距离相等","指出第二句是判定：由距离相等得在垂直平分线上","说明两者互为逆命题、条件与结论互换","分别给出一个正确用法（求线段长 / 证点在垂直平分线上）"]},{"id":"m-geo-zhouduichen-z1","type":"choice","stem":"下列关于轴对称与等腰三角形的说法中，正确的是","answer":"D","explain":"A 错：只有顶角平分线、底边上的中线、底边上的高才互相重合。B 错：40^° 可能是顶角（底角各 70^°），也可能是底角（顶角 100^°）。C 错：应为 PA=PB。D 是等边三角形的判定定理，正确。","options":["等腰三角形的高、中线、角平分线互相重合","等腰三角形中有一个角是 40^°，则它的顶角一定是 40^°","点 P 在线段 AB 的垂直平分线上，则 PA=AB","有一个角是 60^° 的等腰三角形是等边三角形"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["三线合一","等腰三角形"]},{"id":"m-geo-zhouduichen-z2","type":"fill","stem":"点 P 在线段 AB 的垂直平分线上，且 PA=2x-1，PB=x+3，则 x= ____。（只填数字）","answer":"4","explain":"线段垂直平分线上的点到线段两个端点的距离相等，所以 PA=PB，即 2x-1=x+3，解得 x=4。回代得 PA=PB=7，距离相等，结果合理。","difficulty":2,"tags":["垂直平分线","判定与性质"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zhouduichen-z2","title":"垂直平分线上的点到两端点距离相等","caption":"直线 l 垂直平分 AB 于点 M，P 在 l 上：PA 与 PB 画有相同的等长记号，所以 PA=PB","view":"square","alt":"线段 AB，中点 M 处有垂直 AB 的直线 l；点 P 在 l 上，从 P 分别连到 A、B，M 处画有直角方框，PA 与 PB 画有相同的单线等长记号。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":14,"y1":50,"x2":86,"y2":50,"width":0.8},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":10,"x2":50,"y2":90,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":20,"x2":14,"y2":50},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":20,"x2":86,"y2":50},{"t":"line","x1":46,"y1":50,"x2":46,"y2":46,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":46,"y1":46,"x2":50,"y2":46,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":32.96,"y1":36.15,"x2":31.04,"y2":33.85,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":68.96,"y1":33.85,"x2":67.04,"y2":36.15,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":20,"label":"P","labelDx":-1.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":50,"label":"M","labelDx":-8,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":14,"y":50,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":86,"y":50,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"text","x":52.6,"y":14,"text":"l","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":30,"y":38,"text":"2x-1","anchor":"end","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":70,"y":38,"text":"x+3","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"}]}}]},{"id":"m-geo-gougu","title":"勾股定理","subtitle":"人教版八下 · 第20章 勾股定理","grade":"8b","tags":["图形与几何","勾股定理"],"blocks":[{"type":"note","title":"教材章节","text":"人教版八下 · 第20章 勾股定理"},{"type":"note","title":"一句话概述","text":"掌握勾股定理及其逆定理，会用它们求线段长、判定直角三角形并解决最短路径问题。"},{"type":"h","text":"先看什么：直角三角形的三边关系"},{"type":"p","text":"直角三角形里，两条直角边与斜边不是随意的三条线段，它们之间存在固定的平方关系：两条直角边的平方和恰好等于斜边的平方。为什么是「平方」而不是边长本身相加？因为面积是按边长的平方增长的，这个关系本质上是三块正方形面积之间的关系。图里三条边分别记作 a、b、c（c 是斜边），对应的三块正方形面积就是 a²、b²、c²，a²+b²=c²。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-gougu-s1","title":"直角三角形的三边与三块正方形","caption":"两条直角边上正方形的面积之和，等于斜边上正方形的面积","view":"square","alt":"直角三角形 ABC 中角 C 为直角，两条直角边 AC 标为 a、BC 标为 b，斜边 AB 标为 c；三条边上各画一个正方形，面积分别是 a 的平方、b 的平方、c 的平方，表示两条直角边的平方和等于斜边的平方。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[35,32],[35,62],[65,62]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"rect","x":35,"y":62,"w":30,"h":30,"tone":"muted","dashed":true},{"t":"rect","x":5,"y":32,"w":30,"h":30,"tone":"muted","dashed":true},{"t":"poly","points":[[35,32],[65,62],[95,32],[65,2]],"closed":true,"tone":"muted","dashed":true},{"t":"angle","x":35,"y":62,"from":0,"to":90,"r":3.5,"right":true},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":58,"text":"a","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":39,"y":47,"text":"b","size":3.4,"anchor":"start","tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":48,"y":38,"text":"c","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":80,"text":"a²","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":20,"y":47,"text":"b²","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":71,"y":17,"text":"c²","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":35,"y":32,"label":"B","labelDx":-3,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":65,"y":62,"label":"A","labelDx":2,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":35,"y":62,"label":"C","labelDx":-3.5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":97,"text":"a² + b² = c²","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"使用前必须先确认是直角三角形，并找准哪条边是斜边（最长边），否则 a²+b²=c² 会套错边。"},{"type":"h","text":"换个看法：用面积拼图证明"},{"type":"p","text":"把四个全等的直角三角形（直角边为 a、b，斜边为 c）拼成一个边长为 a+b 的大正方形，中间正好空出一个边长为 c 的小正方形，这就是赵爽弦图。大正方形的面积 (a+b)² 等于四个三角形的面积 4×(1)/(2)ab 加小正方形的面积 c²，两边展开化简，与 a²+b² 无关的项恰好抵消，得到 a²+b²=c²。所以勾股定理不是背下来的结论，而是可以用面积算出来的。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-gougu-s2","title":"赵爽弦图：面积拼出勾股定理","caption":"大正方形 = 四个直角三角形 + 中间小正方形","view":"square","alt":"边长为 a 加 b 的大正方形里摆着四个全等的直角三角形，直角边分别是 a 与 b、斜边是 c；四个三角形的斜边围成中间一个边长为 c 的小正方形，大正方形面积等于四个三角形面积加小正方形面积，化简后得到 a 的平方加 b 的平方等于 c 的平方。","prims":[{"t":"rect","x":22,"y":22,"w":56,"h":56,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"poly","points":[[78,22],[54,22],[78,54]],"closed":true,"fill":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"poly","points":[[78,78],[78,54],[46,78]],"closed":true,"fill":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"poly","points":[[22,78],[46,78],[22,46]],"closed":true,"fill":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"poly","points":[[22,22],[22,46],[54,22]],"closed":true,"fill":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"poly","points":[[54,22],[78,54],[46,78],[22,46]],"closed":true,"fill":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":38,"y":18,"text":"b","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":66,"y":18,"text":"a","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":51,"text":"c²","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"main"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":88,"text":"4×(½ab) + c² = (a+b)² ⇒ a²+b²=c²","size":2.7,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"拼图时必须保证四个三角形全等、斜边围成中间的小正方形；a、b 的位置标反，化简时就凑不出结果。"},{"type":"h","text":"反过来用：由边的关系判定直角"},{"type":"p","text":"逆定理把关系反过来用：如果一个三角形的三边满足 a²+b²=c²（c 为最长边），那么它一定是直角三角形，且边 c 所对的角是直角。判定的关键在「先找最长边、再验证平方和」——最长边不一定是题目里最后给出的那条。图里三边是 5、12、13，因为 5²+12²=25+144=169=13²，所以最长边所对的角是直角。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-gougu-s3","title":"由 5、12、13 判定直角三角形","caption":"5² + 12² = 13²，最长边所对的角是直角","view":"square","alt":"三角形 ABC 的三边长分别是 5、12、13，角 C 处有直角标记；因为两条较短边的平方和 25 加 144 等于最长边的平方 169，由勾股定理的逆定理判定这个三角形是直角三角形，最长边 13 所对的角 C 是直角。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[10,50],[10,80],[82,80]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"angle","x":10,"y":80,"from":0,"to":90,"r":3.5,"right":true},{"t":"text","x":6,"y":65,"text":"5","size":3.6,"anchor":"end","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":46,"y":85,"text":"12","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":45,"y":70,"text":"13","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":10,"y":50,"label":"B","labelDx":-3,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":82,"y":80,"label":"A","labelDx":2,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":10,"y":80,"label":"C","labelDx":-3.5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"text","x":46,"y":94,"text":"5² + 12² = 169 = 13² ⇒ ∠C = 90°","size":2.9,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"验证时要算「两条较短边的平方和」是否等于「最长边的平方」，把最长边当成直角边去算就会判错。"},{"type":"h","text":"用起来：最短路径先展开"},{"type":"p","text":"求立体图形表面上两点间的最短路线，不能直接在空间里连线段，因为那条线段不在表面上。正确做法是沿一条棱或接缝把曲面剪开、展开成平面图形，让起点与终点落在同一个平面内，再用「两点之间线段最短」连一条线段，最后用勾股定理算长度。圆柱的侧面展开后是一个矩形：宽等于底面周长，高等于圆柱的高，最短路线就是矩形的对角线。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-gougu-s4","title":"圆柱侧面展开求最短路径","caption":"展开成矩形，最短路线是它的对角线","view":"square","alt":"圆柱侧面展开后的矩形，宽等于底面周长、高等于圆柱的高，中间有一条竖直虚线表示接缝；从矩形左下角顶点 S 沿虚线对角线爬到右上角顶点 T，由勾股定理最短路程等于根号下底面周长的平方加高的平方。","prims":[{"t":"rect","x":20,"y":18,"w":60,"h":30,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":18,"x2":50,"y2":48,"dashed":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":20,"y1":48,"x2":80,"y2":18,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":20,"y":48,"from":0,"to":90,"r":3,"right":true},{"t":"dot","x":20,"y":48,"label":"S","labelDx":-5,"labelDy":0},{"t":"dot","x":80,"y":18,"label":"T","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-1},{"t":"text","x":16,"y":33,"text":"高","size":3.4,"anchor":"end","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":55,"text":"底面周长","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":72,"text":"路程 = √(底面周长² + 高²)","size":2.9,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"展开方式可能不止一种（长方体就有几种剪法），要把每种都算出来再比较，漏掉一种可能取不到最小值。"},{"type":"h","text":"核心概念"},{"type":"p","text":"勾股定理：直角三角形两条直角边的平方和等于斜边的平方。它反映由「形」到「数」的关系：已知直角三角形和两条边就能求第三条边。使用前必须确认三角形是直角三角形，并明确哪条边是斜边（直角所对的边，也是最长边）。"},{"type":"p","text":"勾股定理的逆定理：如果三角形的三边长 a、b、c 满足 a²+b²=c²，那么这个三角形是直角三角形，且边 c 所对的角是直角。它反映由「数」到「形」的判定，用来判断一个三角形是否为直角三角形。"},{"type":"p","text":"勾股数：能构成直角三角形三边的三个正整数叫勾股数，常用的有 3,4,5；5,12,13；6,8,10；7,24,25；8,15,17；9,12,15。每一组勾股数同乘一个正整数后仍是勾股数，所以完整说法是「三边为 3k,4k,5k（k 为正整数）」。"},{"type":"p","text":"勾股定理与逆定理的区别：勾股定理的前提是「已知直角三角形」，结论是「三边满足平方和关系」，用来求边长；逆定理的前提是「三边满足平方和关系」，结论是「这个三角形是直角三角形」，用来判定直角。两者的前提与结论互换，不能互相替代。"},{"type":"p","text":"勾股定理的面积法证明（赵爽弦图）：把四个全等的直角三角形（直角边为 a、b，斜边为 c）拼成一个边长为 a+b 的大正方形，中间留下边长为 c 的小正方形。大正方形面积 (a+b)² 与四个三角形面积加小正方形面积 4×(1)/(2)ab+c² 相等，化简即得 a²+b²=c²。"},{"type":"p","text":"立体图形表面上的最短路径：求曲面或立体图形表面上两点间的最短路线，要把表面展开成平面图形，依据「两点之间线段最短」连接两点，再用勾股定理计算长度。展开方式可能不止一种，需要分别计算并比较，才能确定最小值。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"在直角三角形中已知两边求第三边，或利用方程求线段长\n选择、填空高频。先确认直角三角形并找准斜边，再列平方关系；折叠、旗杆断裂等问题中设未知线段为 x，把折叠前后相等的边标在图上，用勾股定理列方程求解，解后检验为正且合三边关系。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"用逆定理判定直角三角形或说明垂直\n给三边长度时先算平方，按「找最长边、验平方和、下直角结论」三步书写；常与中线、面积结合：先逆定理得垂直，再用垂直平分线或面积公式收尾，依据必须写明是逆定理。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"立体表面最短路径与实际测量问题\n蚂蚁爬行必须把立体表面展开成平面后连线，各种展开方式分别计算取最小；梯子靠墙、航行方位等应用题先画示意图，把实际量标成直角三角形的边，再用勾股定理作答并写单位。"},{"type":"table","title":"公式与定理","head":["公式/定理","表述","注意"],"rows":[["勾股定理","a²+b²=c²","∠ C=90^°，a、b 是两条直角边，c 是斜边（最长边）"],["勾股定理的逆定理","a²+b²=c²⇒∠ C=90^°","必须先确定最长边，再检验「两条较短边的平方和」是否等于最长边的平方"],["由两边求第三边","c=√(a²+b²), a=√(c²-b²)","开方结果要化成最简二次根式；边长必须是正数"],["等腰直角三角形的三边之比","1:1:√(2)","两条直角边相等，斜边是直角边的 √(2) 倍；反过来直角边是斜边的 √(2)2 倍"],["含 30° 角的直角三角形的三边之比","1:√(3):2","依次是 30^° 角所对的直角边、另一条直角边、斜边"]]},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"在 Rt△ ABC 中，∠ C=90^°，AC=6，BC=8，求 AB 的长。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-gougu-e1","title":"已知两条直角边求斜边","caption":"6² + 8² = 100，所以 AB = 10","view":"square","alt":"直角三角形 ABC 中角 C 是直角，直角边 AC 等于 6、BC 等于 8，斜边 AB 等于 10；由勾股定理 6 的平方加 8 的平方等于 100，开方即得斜边 AB 为 10。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[30,22],[30,70],[94,70]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"angle","x":30,"y":70,"from":0,"to":90,"r":3.5,"right":true},{"t":"text","x":26,"y":46,"text":"6","size":3.6,"anchor":"end","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":62,"y":76,"text":"8","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":58,"y":56,"text":"10","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":30,"y":22,"label":"A","labelDx":-3,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":94,"y":70,"label":"B","labelDx":2,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":30,"y":70,"label":"C","labelDx":-3.5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"text","x":62,"y":88,"text":"6² + 8² = 10²","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["因为 ∠ C=90^°，所以 AB 是斜边，AC、BC 是两条直角边（勾股定理的适用条件）。","由勾股定理得 AB²=AC²+BC²=6²+8²=36+64=100。","因为边长是正数，所以 AB=√(100)=10。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：AB=10。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"6,8,10 是勾股数 3,4,5 的 2 倍，记住常用勾股数可以快速验算结果。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"在 △ ABC 中，AB=13，BC=10，BC 边上的中线 AD=12，求证 AB=AC。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-gougu-e2","title":"中线与三边：先用逆定理得垂直","caption":"5² + 12² = 13² ⇒ ∠ADB = 90°，再得 AB = AC","view":"square","alt":"三角形 ABC 中 D 是底边 BC 的中点，中线 AD 把三角形分成两个直角三角形，D 处有直角标记；BD 与 DC 都等于 5，AD 等于 12，AB 与 AC 都等于 13，由 5 的平方加 12 的平方等于 13 的平方判定 AD 垂直于 BC，再由垂直平分线得 AB 等于 AC。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[20,78],[70,78],[45,18]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":45,"y1":18,"x2":45,"y2":78,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":45,"y":78,"from":0,"to":90,"r":3,"right":true},{"t":"text","x":32,"y":83,"text":"5","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":58,"y":83,"text":"5","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":48,"y":48,"text":"12","size":3.4,"anchor":"start","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":27,"y":46,"text":"13","size":3.4,"anchor":"end","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":63,"y":46,"text":"13","size":3.4,"anchor":"start","tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":45,"y":18,"label":"A","labelDx":0,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":20,"y":78,"label":"B","labelDx":-2,"labelDy":5},{"t":"dot","x":70,"y":78,"label":"C","labelDx":2,"labelDy":5},{"t":"dot","x":45,"y":78,"label":"D","labelDx":0,"labelDy":5},{"t":"text","x":45,"y":93,"text":"BD² + AD² = AB² ⇒ ∠ADB = 90°","size":2.7,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["因为 AD 是 BC 边上的中线，所以 BD=CD=(1)/(2)BC=5（中线的定义）。","在 △ ABD 中，BD²+AD²=5²+12²=25+144=169，而 AB²=13²=169，所以 BD²+AD²=AB²。","由勾股定理的逆定理得 ∠ ADB=90^°，即 AD⊥ BC。","因为 AD⊥ BC 且 BD=CD，所以直线 AD 是线段 BC 的垂直平分线，于是 AB=AC（线段垂直平分线上的点到线段两端点的距离相等）。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：AB=AC。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"已知三边长度时先算平方，常常能发现垂直关系；本题就是「中线加三边，先得垂直，再得等腰」的典型链条。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"一个长方体盒子的长、宽、高分别是 5、4、3（单位：cm），一只蚂蚁要从盒子的一个顶点沿表面爬到与它相对的顶点，求最短路程。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-gougu-zhankai-1","title":"长方体表面最短路径（展开图）","caption":"宽与高所在面展开：√(5²+7²)=√74","view":"square","alt":"把长方体宽与高所在的两个面沿公共棱展开成一个矩形：一边是长 5，另一边是宽加高等于 7，公共棱是中间的横线；蚂蚁从左上角顶点 S 沿虚线对角线爬到右下角的对角顶点 T，由勾股定理最短路程为根号 74，约 8.6 厘米。","prims":[{"t":"rect","x":28,"y":18,"w":35,"h":49},{"t":"line","x1":28,"y1":46,"x2":63,"y2":46,"tone":"muted","dashed":true},{"t":"line","x1":28,"y1":18,"x2":63,"y2":67,"tone":"accent","dashed":true},{"t":"angle","x":63,"y":67,"from":90,"to":180,"r":3,"right":true},{"t":"dot","x":28,"y":18,"label":"S","labelDx":-5,"labelDy":-1},{"t":"dot","x":63,"y":67,"label":"T","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":2},{"t":"text","x":52,"y":40,"text":"√74","size":3.6,"anchor":"start","tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":45.5,"y":71.5,"text":"长 5","size":3.4},{"t":"text","x":24.5,"y":32,"text":"宽 4","size":3.4,"anchor":"end"},{"t":"text","x":24.5,"y":56.5,"text":"高 3","size":3.4,"anchor":"end"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["蚂蚁必须经过盒子的表面，把经过的两个面沿它们公共的棱展开成平面图形，最短路程就是展开图中两点之间的线段长（两点之间线段最短）。","长与宽所在的面展开：路程为 √((5+4)²+3²)=√(81+9)=√(90)。","长与高所在的面展开：路程为 √((5+3)²+4²)=√(64+16)=√(80)。","宽与高所在的面展开：路程为 √((4+3)²+5²)=√(49+25)=√(74)。","比较得 √(74)<√(80)<√(90)，所以最短路程是 √(74) cm（约 8.6 cm）。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：最短路程是 √(74) cm。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"立体表面的最短路径必须先展开成平面再连线，而且要把所有展开方式都算出来比较，漏掉一种可能取不到最小值。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"如图意：矩形纸片 ABCD 中，AB=CD=8，AD=BC=10。把纸片折叠，使点 D 落在 BC 边上的点 F 处，折痕为 AE（点 E 在 CD 边上），求 EC 的长。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-gougu-zhedie-1","title":"矩形折叠求 EC","caption":"AF=AD=10，EF=ED，在 Rt△EFC 中列方程","view":"square","alt":"矩形 ABCD 中 AB 等于 8、AD 等于 10，折叠使点 D 落在 BC 边上的点 F 处，折痕 AE 画成虚线；AF 等于 AD 等于 10，BF 等于 6、FC 等于 4，DE 折过去成为 EF，设 EC 为 x，在直角三角形 EFC 中用勾股定理解得 EC 等于 3。","prims":[{"t":"rect","x":30,"y":15,"w":60,"h":48},{"t":"line","x1":30,"y1":15,"x2":90,"y2":45,"tone":"accent","dashed":true},{"t":"line","x1":30,"y1":15,"x2":66,"y2":63},{"t":"line","x1":90,"y1":45,"x2":66,"y2":63},{"t":"angle","x":30,"y":63,"from":0,"to":90,"r":3,"right":true},{"t":"text","x":63,"y":27,"text":"折痕 AE","size":3.2,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":30,"y":15,"label":"A","labelDx":-5,"labelDy":-2},{"t":"dot","x":30,"y":63,"label":"B","labelDx":-5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":90,"y":63,"label":"C","labelDx":2,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":90,"y":15,"label":"D","labelDx":2,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":66,"y":63,"label":"F","labelDx":0,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":90,"y":45,"label":"E","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":0},{"t":"text","x":26.5,"y":39,"text":"8","size":3.6,"anchor":"end","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":60,"y":69.5,"text":"10","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":48,"y":69.5,"text":"6","size":3.2,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":78,"y":69.5,"text":"4","size":3.2,"tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["折叠前后重合的边相等：AF=AD=10，EF=DE（这是列方程的等量来源）。","在 Rt△ ABF 中用勾股定理：BF=√(AF²-AB²)=√(10²-8²)=6，所以 FC=BC-BF=10-6=4。","设 EC=x，则 DE=8-x，于是 EF=DE=8-x。","在 Rt△ EFC 中：x²+4²=(8-x)²，展开得 x²+16=64-16x+x²，解得 x=3。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：EC=3。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"折叠问题的思路是「折痕即对称轴」：重合边、重合角全部相等，先在一个直角三角形里求出过渡线段，再设未知数到另一个直角三角形中列勾股方程。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"在 △ ABC 中，AB=13，AC=15，BC=14，求 BC 边上的高 AD 与 △ ABC 的面积。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-gougu-shuanggougu-1","title":"双勾股求斜三角形的高","caption":"设 BD=x，同一条高两次用勾股定理","view":"square","alt":"三角形 ABC 中 AB 等于 13、AC 等于 15、BC 等于 14，AD 是 BC 边上的高，D 处有直角标记；BD 等于 5、DC 等于 9、AD 等于 12，由两个直角三角形的勾股定理联立求得，三角形面积等于 84。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[16,78],[86,78],[41,18]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":41,"y1":18,"x2":41,"y2":78,"tone":"muted","dashed":true},{"t":"angle","x":41,"y":78,"from":0,"to":90,"r":3,"right":true},{"t":"dot","x":41,"y":18,"label":"A","labelDx":0,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"dot","x":16,"y":78,"label":"B","labelDx":-5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":86,"y":78,"label":"C","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":41,"y":78,"label":"D","labelDx":0,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"text","x":25,"y":46,"text":"13","size":3.6,"anchor":"end","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":66,"y":46,"text":"15","size":3.6,"anchor":"start","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":28.5,"y":83.5,"text":"5","size":3.2,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":63.5,"y":83.5,"text":"9","size":3.2,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":51,"y":89.5,"text":"14","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":44,"y":48,"text":"12","size":3.6,"anchor":"start","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["高 AD 把 △ ABC 分成两个直角三角形，但两段底边都未知。设 BD=x，则 DC=14-x（高在三角形内部，由三边可预判为锐角三角形）。","同一条高在两个直角三角形中分别用勾股定理：AD²=AB²-BD²=13²-x²，AD²=AC²-DC²=15²-(14-x)²。","两式相等：169-x²=225-(14-x)²，化简得 169=29+28x，解得 x=5。","所以 AD=√(13²-5²)=√(144)=12，面积 S=(1)/(2)× 14× 12=84。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：AD=12，△ ABC 的面积是 84。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"斜三角形求高的通法是「设底边一段为 x，同一条高两次列勾股，等高等量联立」；13,14,15 三角形面积恰为整数 84，是非常经典的模型。"},{"type":"list","title":"易错点","items":["勾股定理只适用于直角三角形，在非直角三角形中直接套用会得到错误结果。","用逆定理判定直角三角形时，要检验「两条较短边的平方和」是否等于「最长边的平方」，最长边不一定是题目中最后给出的那条边。","$3,4,5$ 是基本勾股数，但结论应写成「三边为 $3k,4k,5k$（$k$ 为正整数）」，只记一组数字容易在比例问题中漏掉系数。","立体图形表面上的最短路径必须先展开成平面图形再连线，直接在空间中连接两点是错的（那条线段不在表面上）。","用勾股定理列方程时把斜边与直角边设错，会让方程变复杂甚至解出矛盾结果。","求出第三边后要用三角形三边关系检验，避免出现不能构成三角形的答案。"]},{"type":"list","title":"解题方法","items":["求线段长优先考虑勾股定理：先找出或构造直角三角形，再分清斜边与直角边。","判定直角用逆定理，按「找最长边、算平方和、下结论」三步走，并写明依据。","题目给出三边长度时先算平方，往往能发现垂直关系，进而得到等腰三角形或垂直平分线等结论。","遇到「蚂蚁爬行」「最短路径」就把立体或曲面展开成平面，用「两点之间线段最短」加勾股定理计算。","实际应用题（梯子滑动、航行、方位角）先画图，标出不变的量，再用勾股定理列方程。"]}],"questions":[{"id":"m-geo-gougu-q1","type":"choice","stem":"下列各组数中，能作为直角三角形三边长的是","answer":"C","explain":"5²+12²=25+144=169=13²，满足勾股定理的逆定理，能构成直角三角形。2²+3²=13≠ 4²，A 不能；3²+4²=25≠ 6²，B 不能；6²+7²=85≠ 8²，D 不能。","options":["2,3,4","3,4,6","5,12,13","6,7,8"],"difficulty":1,"tags":["勾股定理的逆定理","勾股数"]},{"id":"m-geo-gougu-q2","type":"choice","stem":"在 Rt△ ABC 中，∠ C=90^°，a=5，c=13，则 b 的值是","answer":"B","explain":"由勾股定理得 b²=c²-a²=169-25=144，因为 b>0，所以 b=12。选 √(194) 是把 a 与 c 都当成了直角边去相加，属于斜边、直角边混淆。","options":["8","12","√(194)","18"],"difficulty":1,"tags":["勾股定理","求直角边"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-gougu-q2","title":"已知斜边与一条直角边，求另一条直角边","caption":"∠C=90°，斜边 c=13、直角边 a=5，要求的 b 是另一条直角边","view":"wide","alt":"直角三角形 ABC，顶点 C 处画有直角方框；直角边 BC 记为 a（等于 5），斜边 AB 记为 c（等于 13），另一条直角边 AC 记为 b 待求。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[80,54],[20,16],[20,54]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":24,"y1":54,"x2":24,"y2":50,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":24,"y1":50,"x2":20,"y2":50,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":16,"y":35,"text":"a = 5","anchor":"end","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":49,"text":"b = ?","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"text","x":54,"y":31,"text":"c = 13","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":80,"y":54,"label":"A","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":20,"y":16,"label":"B","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":20,"y":54,"label":"C","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4}]}},{"id":"m-geo-gougu-q3","type":"choice","stem":"在 △ ABC 中，∠ A、∠ B、∠ C 的对边分别是 a、b、c，且满足 a²+b²=c²，则下列说法正确的是","answer":"C","explain":"由勾股定理的逆定理，满足平方和关系时，最长边所对的角是直角。这里 c 是最长边，它对的角是 ∠ C，所以 ∠ C=90^°。","options":["∠ A=90^°","∠ B=90^°","∠ C=90^°","这个三角形是锐角三角形"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["勾股定理的逆定理","直角的位置"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-gougu-q3","title":"三边满足平方和关系时，最长边所对的角是直角","caption":"a、b、c 分别是 ∠A、∠B、∠C 的对边；这里 c 是最长边，所以直角在顶点 C 处","view":"wide","alt":"一个三角形 ABC，三条边分别标注为 a、b、c：a 是角 A 的对边 BC，b 是角 B 的对边 AC，c 是角 C 的对边 AB，其中 c 最长。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[16,54],[84,54],[40,14]],"closed":true},{"t":"text","x":67,"y":32,"text":"a","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":23,"y":32,"text":"b","anchor":"end","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":51,"y":60,"text":"c（最长边）","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":16,"y":54,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":84,"y":54,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":40,"y":14,"label":"C","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":-2.8}]}},{"id":"m-geo-gougu-q4","type":"choice","stem":"一直角三角形的两条直角边长分别是 9 和 12，则斜边长是","answer":"A","explain":"c=√(9²+12²)=√(81+144)=√(225)=15，这正是勾股数 3,4,5 的 3 倍。选 √(63) 是把平方和当成了平方差，选 21 是漏了开方。","options":["15","16","√(63)","21"],"difficulty":1,"tags":["勾股定理","求斜边"]},{"id":"m-geo-gougu-q5","type":"fill","stem":"在 △ ABC 中，AB=10，AC=24，BC=26，则 △ ABC 的面积是 ____。（只填数字）","answer":"120","explain":"因为 10²+24²=100+576=676=26²，所以由勾股定理的逆定理得 ∠ A=90^°，即 AB⊥ AC。于是面积 =(1)/(2)× 10× 24=120。","difficulty":2,"tags":["勾股定理的逆定理","三角形面积"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-gougu-q5","title":"10、24、26 是一组勾股数","caption":"因为 10²+24²=26²，由逆定理得 ∠A=90°，即 AB⊥AC，于是面积等于两直角边乘积的一半","view":"wide","alt":"三角形 ABC：边 AB 长 10、边 AC 长 24、边 BC 长 26，顶点 A 处画有直角方框，表示 AB 与 AC 互相垂直。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[14,54],[14,24],[86,54]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":14,"y1":49,"x2":19,"y2":49,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":19,"y1":49,"x2":19,"y2":54,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":10,"y":39,"text":"AB = 10","anchor":"end","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":49,"text":"AC = 24","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":56,"y":36,"text":"BC = 26","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":14,"y":54,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":14,"y":24,"label":"B","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":86,"y":54,"label":"C","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2.4}]}},{"id":"m-geo-gougu-q6","type":"short","stem":"说明勾股定理与它的逆定理的区别，并说明逆定理为什么可以用来判定一个三角形是直角三角形。","answer":"勾股定理的内容是：如果三角形是直角三角形，那么两条直角边的平方和等于斜边的平方。它的前提是「已知直角三角形」，结论是「三边满足平方和关系」，用途是由两条边求第三条边。逆定理的内容是：如果三角形的三边长 $a$、$b$、$c$ 满足 $a^2+b^2=c^2$，那么这个三角形是直角三角形，且边 $c$ 所对的角是直角。它的前提是「三边满足平方和关系」，结论是「这个三角形是直角三角形」，用途是判定直角。逆定理能用来判定直角，是因为给定三边长后三角形的形状就被唯一确定：三边满足平方和关系的那个三角形，与一个直角边为 $a$、$b$ 的直角三角形三边对应相等，由 SSS 可知两者全等，所以它一定是直角三角形。使用时要先确定最长边，再检验另外两边的平方和是否等于最长边的平方。","explain":"本题考查勾股定理与逆定理的区别及其成立依据。评分要点：分别说明定理（由直角得平方和关系，用于求边长）与逆定理（由平方和关系得直角，用于判定）；解释逆定理成立的理由（与对应的直角三角形三边相等，由 SSS 得全等）；指出使用逆定理时要先确定最长边。常见失分点：把两者的前提与结论说反；答不出「为什么三边满足平方和关系就一定是直角三角形」；忽略「先找最长边」，导致平方和比较错位。","difficulty":3,"tags":["勾股定理","逆定理","辨析"],"rubric":["正确说出勾股定理的内容与用途（已知直角求边长）","正确说出逆定理的内容与用途（由三边判定直角）","指出两者的前提与结论互换（互逆）","说明逆定理成立的理由（与对应直角三角形三边相等，用 SSS 得全等）","指出使用时先确定最长边"]},{"id":"m-geo-gougu-z1","type":"choice","stem":"一架长 2.5 m 的梯子斜靠在竖直的墙上，梯子底端离墙脚 0.7 m，则梯子顶端离地面的高度是","answer":"C","explain":"墙与地面垂直，梯子是斜边。由勾股定理得高度 h=√(2.5²-0.7²)=√(6.25-0.49)=√(5.76)=2.4 m，选 C。选 D 是把两条边直接相加，选 A、B 是平方或开方计算出错。","options":["1.8 m","2.0 m","2.4 m","3.2 m"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["勾股定理","求直角边"]},{"id":"m-geo-gougu-z2","type":"fill","stem":"一个长方体的长、宽、高分别是 3、2、12，一只蚂蚁从一个顶点沿表面爬到与它相对的顶点，最短路程是 ____。（只填数字）","answer":"13","explain":"把表面展开后比较三种走法：√((3+2)²+12²)=√(169)=13；√((3+12)²+2²)=√(229)；√((2+12)²+3²)=√(205)。三者中最小的是 13，所以最短路程为 13。","difficulty":3,"tags":["勾股定理"]}]},{"id":"m-geo-pingxing-sibianxing","title":"平行四边形","subtitle":"人教版八下 · 第21章 四边形","grade":"8b","tags":["图形与几何","四边形"],"blocks":[{"type":"note","title":"教材章节","text":"人教版八下 · 第21章 四边形"},{"type":"note","title":"一句话概述","text":"掌握平行四边形的性质与判定，理解三角形中位线定理及矩形、菱形、正方形的特殊性质。"},{"type":"h","text":"先看什么：两组对边分别平行"},{"type":"p","text":"平行四边形的定义是「两组对边分别平行」，这里的「平行」不是看上去差不多，而要由题目条件或推理确认。从定义出发可以推出它的全部性质：两组对边分别相等、两组对角分别相等、邻角互补、对角线互相平分。为什么会有这些结论？因为一组对边平行就能得到内错角相等，再连一条对角线，平行四边形就被拆成两个全等三角形，边与角的相等关系随之而来。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sibianxing-s1","title":"平行四边形的对边平行且相等","caption":"两组对边分别平行、分别相等","view":"square","alt":"平行四边形 ABCD 中，AB 与 CD 画有相同的箭头标记表示它们平行，AD 与 BC 同样画有箭头标记表示平行；AB 与 CD 画有相同短横线表示相等、AD 与 BC 也画有相同短横线表示相等，说明平行四边形两组对边分别平行且分别相等。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[20,25],[70,25],[85,70],[35,70]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":45,"y1":22,"x2":45,"y2":28,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":60,"y1":67,"x2":60,"y2":73,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":24.65,"y1":46.55,"x2":30.35,"y2":48.45,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":74.65,"y1":46.55,"x2":80.35,"y2":48.45,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":53,"y1":22.5,"x2":55,"y2":25,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":53,"y1":27.5,"x2":55,"y2":25,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":63,"y1":67.5,"x2":65,"y2":70,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":63,"y1":72.5,"x2":65,"y2":70,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":20,"y":25,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":-2},{"t":"dot","x":70,"y":25,"label":"B","labelDx":2,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":85,"y":70,"label":"C","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":35,"y":70,"label":"D","labelDx":-5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"text","x":52.5,"y":86,"text":"对边平行且相等","size":3.2,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"判断是不是平行四边形不能只凭「看起来平行」，必须依据定义或判定定理推理。"},{"type":"h","text":"连对角线：发现互相平分"},{"type":"p","text":"把平行四边形的两条对角线都连起来，它们交于一点 O，则 AO=CO、BO=DO，也就是对角线互相平分。这条性质来自两次全等：由对边平行得到内错角相等，再加上对边相等，就能证明 △ AOB≌△ COD，对应边自然相等。对角线互相平分既是性质，反过来又能当判定用，是处理平行四边形问题最常用的一条。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sibianxing-s2","title":"平行四边形的对角线互相平分","caption":"交点 O 把两条对角线都分成相等的两段","view":"square","alt":"平行四边形 ABCD 的两条对角线 AC 与 BD 相交于点 O；AO 与 OC 画有相同标记表示相等、BO 与 OD 画有相同标记表示相等，说明平行四边形的两条对角线互相平分。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[20,25],[70,25],[85,70],[35,70]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":20,"y1":25,"x2":85,"y2":70,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":70,"y1":25,"x2":35,"y2":70,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":34.54,"y1":33.78,"x2":37.96,"y2":38.72,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":67.04,"y1":56.28,"x2":70.46,"y2":61.22,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":58.88,"y1":34.41,"x2":63.62,"y2":38.09,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":41.38,"y1":56.91,"x2":46.12,"y2":60.59,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"dot","x":20,"y":25,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":-2},{"t":"dot","x":70,"y":25,"label":"B","labelDx":2,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":85,"y":70,"label":"C","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":35,"y":70,"label":"D","labelDx":-5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":52.5,"y":47.5,"r":0.9,"label":"O","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":3.5},{"t":"text","x":52.5,"y":86,"text":"AO = CO，BO = DO","size":3.2,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"「对角线互相平分」指两条对角线都被交点分成相等的两段，不是两条对角线本身相等（那是矩形的性质）。"},{"type":"h","text":"怎么判定：一组对边平行且相等"},{"type":"p","text":"判定平行四边形有五条，最常用的是「一组对边平行且相等」：只要一条对边同时满足平行与相等，就能断定它是平行四边形。证明的思路是连一条对角线，用平行得到的内错角与这组相等的对边凑成 SAS 全等，从而得到另一组对边也平行，回到定义。所以判定与性质是互逆的两套推理，书写时方向不能弄反。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sibianxing-s3","title":"一组对边平行且相等即平行四边形","caption":"连对角线 AC，用 SAS 证另一组对边平行","view":"square","alt":"四边形 ABCD 中 AB 与 CD 画有箭头标记表示平行、画有相同短横线表示相等，对角线 AC 画成虚线；连接 AC 后由内错角相等与 AB 等于 CD 得到两个三角形全等，进而推出 AD 平行于 BC，判定四边形 ABCD 是平行四边形。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[20,25],[65,25],[85,70],[40,70]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":20,"y1":25,"x2":85,"y2":70,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":42.5,"y1":22,"x2":42.5,"y2":28,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":62.5,"y1":67,"x2":62.5,"y2":73,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":53,"y1":22.5,"x2":55,"y2":25,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":53,"y1":27.5,"x2":55,"y2":25,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":46,"y1":67.5,"x2":48,"y2":70,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":46,"y1":72.5,"x2":48,"y2":70,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":20,"y":25,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":-2},{"t":"dot","x":65,"y":25,"label":"B","labelDx":2,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":85,"y":70,"label":"C","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":40,"y":70,"label":"D","labelDx":-5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"text","x":52,"y":86,"text":"AB∥CD 且 AB = CD","size":3.2,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"「一组对边平行、另一组对边相等」不能判定平行四边形，满足这个条件的四边形可能是等腰梯形。"},{"type":"h","text":"换个形状：三种特殊四边形的对角线"},{"type":"p","text":"在平行四边形的基础上再加条件，就得到矩形、菱形、正方形，它们的差别集中体现在对角线上：矩形的对角线相等，菱形的对角线互相垂直并且每一条平分一组对角，正方形两者兼有。为什么盯住对角线最有用？因为题目里出现 60^° 角或垂直关系时，往往要把对角线分出的三角形当作等腰三角形或直角三角形来处理，再用勾股定理求边长。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sibianxing-s4","title":"矩形、菱形、正方形的对角线对照","caption":"矩形对角线相等，菱形对角线垂直，正方形二者兼具","view":"square","alt":"三个图形并排对照：矩形画出两条相等的对角线；菱形画出两条互相垂直的对角线，交点处有直角标记；正方形画出既相等又互相垂直的对角线，交点处也有直角标记。","prims":[{"t":"rect","x":5,"y":12,"w":24,"h":18,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":5,"y1":12,"x2":29,"y2":30,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":5,"y1":30,"x2":29,"y2":12,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":17,"y":40,"text":"矩形","size":3.2,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":17,"y":46,"text":"对角线相等","size":2.7,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"poly","points":[[62,8],[50,20],[62,32],[74,20]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":62,"y1":8,"x2":62,"y2":32,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":20,"x2":74,"y2":20,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":62,"y":20,"from":0,"to":90,"r":2.5,"right":true},{"t":"text","x":62,"y":42,"text":"菱形","size":3.2,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":62,"y":48,"text":"对角线垂直","size":2.7,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"rect","x":78,"y":14,"w":18,"h":18,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":78,"y1":14,"x2":96,"y2":32,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":78,"y1":32,"x2":96,"y2":14,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":87,"y":23,"from":0,"to":90,"r":2.5,"right":true},{"t":"text","x":87,"y":42,"text":"正方形","size":3.2,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":87,"y":48,"text":"相等且垂直","size":2.7,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"「对角线相等」是矩形特有的，「对角线互相垂直」是菱形特有的，套到一般平行四边形上都不成立。"},{"type":"h","text":"核心概念"},{"type":"p","text":"平行四边形的定义与性质：两组对边分别平行的四边形叫平行四边形。性质：两组对边分别相等，两组对角分别相等，邻角互补，对角线互相平分。性质是由「已知是平行四边形」推出边、角、对角线的相等或互补关系。"},{"type":"p","text":"平行四边形的判定：五个判定：两组对边分别平行的四边形；两组对边分别相等的四边形；一组对边平行且相等的四边形；两组对角分别相等的四边形；对角线互相平分的四边形。判定是由条件推出「是平行四边形」，与性质的推理方向相反。"},{"type":"p","text":"三角形中位线定理：连接三角形两边中点的线段叫三角形的中位线，它平行于第三边，并且等于第三边的一半。这个定理同时给出位置关系与数量关系，是处理中点问题的核心工具；注意它说的是「两边中点的连线」，不是任意两点连线。"},{"type":"p","text":"直角三角形斜边上的中线：直角三角形斜边上的中线等于斜边的一半。它的逆命题也成立：如果三角形一边上的中线等于这条边的一半，那么这个三角形是直角三角形，且这条边是斜边。"},{"type":"p","text":"矩形（性质与判定）：有一个角是直角的平行四边形叫矩形。性质：四个角都是直角，对角线相等且互相平分。判定：有一个角是直角的平行四边形；对角线相等的平行四边形；有三个角是直角的四边形。注意「对角线相等」必须与「平行四边形」这个前提配齐，否则等腰梯形也满足。"},{"type":"p","text":"菱形（性质与判定）：有一组邻边相等的平行四边形叫菱形。性质：四条边都相等，两条对角线互相垂直，并且每一条对角线平分一组对角。判定：有一组邻边相等的平行四边形；对角线互相垂直的平行四边形；四条边都相等的四边形。"},{"type":"p","text":"正方形：有一组邻边相等并且有一个角是直角的平行四边形叫正方形。它既是矩形又是菱形，因此同时具有两者的全部性质：四个角都是直角，四条边都相等，对角线相等且互相垂直平分，每条对角线平分一组对角。"},{"type":"p","text":"中点四边形：顺次连接任意四边形各边中点所得的四边形叫中点四边形，它一定是平行四边形（用两次中位线定理可证）。进一步：若原四边形的对角线相等，则中点四边形是菱形；若原四边形的对角线互相垂直，则中点四边形是矩形；若对角线既相等又互相垂直，则中点四边形是正方形。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"平行四边形性质与判定的综合运用\n选择题考条件辨析（注意「一组对边平行另一组相等」可能是等腰梯形）；解答题常需连对角线证全等，或由对角线互相平分判定。书写要先写平行（或相等）依据，再下「是平行四边形」结论，性质与判定方向不能混。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"矩形、菱形、正方形的特殊性质与判定，以及相关计算\n矩形对角线相等、菱形对角线垂直且四边相等，考边长、面积时常在对角线分出的直角三角形中用勾股定理；菱形面积用 (1)/(2)d₁d₂。判定时「对角线相等（垂直）」必须配齐「平行四边形」前提，正方形要双重条件。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"三角形中位线定理、斜边中线与中点四边形\n见两个中点连中位线，平行与一半两层结论按问题取舍；中点四边形题连一条对角线用两次中位线，再根据原四边形对角线相等或垂直判断是菱形还是矩形，证明链要写出「四边相等」等中间步骤。"},{"type":"table","title":"公式与定理","head":["公式/定理","表述","注意"],"rows":[["平行四边形的对角线互相平分","AO=CO=(1)/(2)AC, BO=DO=(1)/(2)BD","两条对角线相交于点 O。这既是性质，反过来「对角线互相平分的四边形」也是判定平行四边形的依据"],["三角形中位线定理","DE∥ BC, DE=(1)/(2)BC","D、E 分别是 AB、AC 的中点；「平行」与「等于一半」两个结论都要写全"],["平行四边形的面积","S=ah","a 为一条边长，h 为这条边上的高，底与高必须互相垂直"],["菱形的面积","S=(1)/(2)d₁d₂","d₁、d₂ 是两条对角线的长；此式只在两条对角线互相垂直时成立，一般平行四边形不能用"],["矩形的对角线","AC=BD","矩形的对角线相等且互相平分；单独「对角线相等」不能判定矩形，必须先有「平行四边形」这一前提"],["直角三角形斜边上的中线","CD=(1)/(2)AB","∠ C=90^°，D 是斜边 AB 的中点；逆命题也成立"]]},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"在 △ ABC 中，D、E 分别是 AB、AC 的中点，DE=4，BC 边上的高为 6，求 △ ABC 的面积。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sibianxing-e1","title":"中位线求三角形的底","caption":"DE=4 ⇒ BC=8，面积 = ½×8×6 = 24","view":"square","alt":"三角形 ABC 中 D、E 分别是 AB、AC 的中点，中位线 DE 长 4，与 BC 平行；从顶点 A 向 BC 作高，高长 6，垂足处有直角标记，由中位线是第三边的一半得 BC 等于 8，三角形面积等于二分之一乘 8 乘 6 为 24。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[50,20],[15,72],[85,72]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":32.5,"y1":46,"x2":67.5,"y2":46,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":20,"x2":50,"y2":72,"dashed":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":72,"from":0,"to":90,"r":3,"right":true},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":41.5,"text":"4","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":46,"y":40,"text":"6","size":3.4,"anchor":"end","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":78,"text":"8","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":20,"label":"A","labelDx":0,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"dot","x":15,"y":72,"label":"B","labelDx":-5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":85,"y":72,"label":"C","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":32.5,"y":46,"label":"D","labelDx":-5,"labelDy":0.5},{"t":"dot","x":67.5,"y":46,"label":"E","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":0.5},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":88,"text":"DE = ½BC ⇒ BC = 8","size":3,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["因为 D、E 分别是 AB、AC 的中点，所以 DE 是 △ ABC 的中位线，DE∥ BC 且 DE=(1)/(2)BC（三角形中位线定理）。","由 DE=4 得 BC=2DE=8。","所以 S_(△ ABC)=(1)/(2)× BC× h=(1)/(2)× 8× 6=24。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：△ ABC 的面积是 24。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"中位线定理有两层结论：求长度用「等于第三边的一半」，证平行用「平行于第三边」，用哪一层要看题目问什么。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"在四边形 ABCD 中，AB∥ CD 且 AB=CD，求证四边形 ABCD 是平行四边形。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sibianxing-e2","title":"连对角线证一组对边平行且相等","caption":"AB∥CD、AB=CD，连 AC 后证 △ABC≌△CDA","view":"square","alt":"四边形 ABCD 中 AB 与 CD 画有相同箭头标记表示平行、画有相同短横线表示相等，对角线 AC 画成虚线；∠BAC 与 ∠DCA 画有相同弧线标记表示内错角相等，连接 AC 后由边角边证得两个三角形全等，从而 AD 平行于 BC，四边形 ABCD 是平行四边形。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[20,25],[65,25],[85,70],[40,70]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":20,"y1":25,"x2":85,"y2":70,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":42.5,"y1":22,"x2":42.5,"y2":28,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":62.5,"y1":67,"x2":62.5,"y2":73,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":53,"y1":22.5,"x2":55,"y2":25,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":53,"y1":27.5,"x2":55,"y2":25,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":46,"y1":67.5,"x2":48,"y2":70,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":46,"y1":72.5,"x2":48,"y2":70,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":20,"y":25,"from":-34.7,"to":0,"r":9,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":85,"y":70,"from":145.3,"to":180,"r":9,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":20,"y":25,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":-2},{"t":"dot","x":65,"y":25,"label":"B","labelDx":2,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":85,"y":70,"label":"C","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":40,"y":70,"label":"D","labelDx":-5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"text","x":52,"y":86,"text":"AB∥CD 且 AB = CD ⇒ 平行四边形","size":2.8,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["连接 AC。因为 AB∥ CD，所以 ∠ BAC=∠ DCA（两直线平行，内错角相等）。","在 △ ABC 和 △ CDA 中：AB=CD（已知），∠ BAC=∠ DCA（已证），AC=CA（公共边），所以 △ ABC≌△ CDA（SAS）。","所以 ∠ BCA=∠ DAC（全等三角形的对应角相等），从而 AD∥ BC（内错角相等，两直线平行）。","所以四边形 ABCD 是平行四边形（两组对边分别平行的四边形是平行四边形）。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：四边形 ABCD 是平行四边形。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"本题也可以直接引用「一组对边平行且相等的四边形是平行四边形」，但用全等推一遍能看清这条判定的来由。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"菱形 ABCD 的两条对角线 AC、BD 相交于点 O，AC=8，BD=6，求菱形的边长和面积。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sibianxing-lingxing-1","title":"菱形的对角线互相垂直平分","caption":"对角线分菱形为四个直角三角形","view":"square","alt":"菱形 ABCD 的对角线 AC 等于 8、BD 等于 6，交于点 O，O 处有直角标记表示对角线互相垂直；对角线把菱形分成四个直角三角形，边长等于根号下 4 的平方加 3 的平方为 5，面积等于 8 乘 6 除以 2 为 24。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[50,25],[35,45],[50,65],[65,45]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":25,"x2":50,"y2":65},{"t":"line","x1":35,"y1":45,"x2":65,"y2":45},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":45,"from":90,"to":180,"r":3,"right":true},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":25,"label":"A","labelDx":0,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"dot","x":35,"y":45,"label":"B","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":0.5},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":65,"label":"C","labelDx":0,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":65,"y":45,"label":"D","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":0.5},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":45,"r":0.9,"label":"O","labelDx":2,"labelDy":3.5},{"t":"text","x":52.5,"y":34,"text":"8","size":3.6,"anchor":"start","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":41,"y":41.5,"text":"6","size":3.6,"anchor":"end","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["因为 ABCD 是菱形，所以两条对角线互相垂直且互相平分（菱形的性质），于是 AC⊥ BD，AO=(1)/(2)AC=4，BO=(1)/(2)BD=3。","在 Rt△ AOB 中，由勾股定理得 AB=√(AO²+BO²)=√(4²+3²)=5，所以菱形的边长是 5。","菱形的面积 S=(1)/(2)× AC× BD=(1)/(2)× 8× 6=24。","检验：用底乘高计算，边长为 5 时高 =24÷ 5=4.8，结果自洽。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：菱形的边长是 5，面积是 24。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"菱形的对角线把它分成四个全等的直角三角形：边长用勾股定理求，面积用对角线乘积的一半，一次解决两个问题。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"如图意：矩形 ABCD 的两条对角线相交于点 O，∠ AOB=60^°，AB=4，求对角线 AC 的长。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sibianxing-juxing-1","title":"矩形的对角线相等且互相平分","caption":"OA=OB=AB=4，所以 AC=8","view":"wide","alt":"矩形 ABCD 的对角线相交于点 O，角 AOB 等于 60 度，AB 等于 4，A 处有直角标记；矩形对角线相等且互相平分，所以 OA 等于 OB，三角形 AOB 是等边三角形，OA 等于 4，对角线 AC 等于 8。","prims":[{"t":"rect","x":29,"y":32,"w":45,"h":26},{"t":"line","x1":29,"y1":32,"x2":74,"y2":58},{"t":"line","x1":29,"y1":58,"x2":74,"y2":32},{"t":"angle","x":51.5,"y":45,"from":150,"to":210,"r":5,"label":"60°"},{"t":"angle","x":29,"y":32,"from":-90,"to":0,"r":3,"right":true},{"t":"dot","x":29,"y":32,"label":"A","labelDx":-4.5,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":29,"y":58,"label":"B","labelDx":-4.5,"labelDy":3.5},{"t":"dot","x":74,"y":58,"label":"C","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":3.5},{"t":"dot","x":74,"y":32,"label":"D","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":51.5,"y":45,"r":0.9,"label":"O","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":0.5},{"t":"text","x":25.5,"y":45,"text":"4","size":3.6,"anchor":"end","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["矩形的对角线相等且互相平分，所以 AC=BD，AO=(1)/(2)AC，BO=(1)/(2)BD，于是 AO=BO，△ AOB 是等腰三角形。","又因为 ∠ AOB=60^°，有一个角是 60^° 的等腰三角形是等边三角形，所以 △ AOB 是等边三角形。","因此 AO=AB=4。","所以 AC=2AO=8。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：AC=8。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"矩形两条对角线交成 60^°（或 120^°）时，必出等边三角形：先由「对角线互相平分且相等」得等腰，再加 60^° 升级为等边，对角线就是短边的两倍。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"如图意：在平行四边形 ABCD 中，对角线 AC、BD 相交于点 O，点 E、F 在 AC 上，且 AE=CF。求证：四边形 BEDF 是平行四边形。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sibianxing-pingxing-1","title":"对角线互相平分的四边形","caption":"OE=OF，OB=OD ⇒ 四边形 BEDF 是平行四边形","view":"square","alt":"平行四边形 ABCD 的对角线 AC 与 BD 相交于点 O，E、F 在 AC 上且 AE 等于 CF；OE 与 OF 画有相同标记、OB 与 OD 画有相同标记，对角线 EF 与 BD 互相平分，所以四边形 BEDF 是平行四边形。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[20,25],[70,25],[85,70],[35,70]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":20,"y1":25,"x2":85,"y2":70},{"t":"line","x1":70,"y1":25,"x2":35,"y2":70},{"t":"line","x1":70,"y1":25,"x2":39.5,"y2":38.5,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":35,"y1":70,"x2":65.5,"y2":56.5,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":45,"y1":44.4,"x2":47,"y2":41.6,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":58,"y1":53.4,"x2":60,"y2":50.6,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":60,"y1":35.3,"x2":62.5,"y2":37.2,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":42.5,"y1":57.8,"x2":45,"y2":59.7,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":20,"y":25,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":-2},{"t":"dot","x":70,"y":25,"label":"B","labelDx":2,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":85,"y":70,"label":"C","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":35,"y":70,"label":"D","labelDx":-5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":52.5,"y":47.5,"r":0.9,"label":"O","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":3.5},{"t":"dot","x":39.5,"y":38.5,"label":"E","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":-0.5},{"t":"dot","x":65.5,"y":56.5,"label":"F","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":0.5}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["已有平行四边形的对角线条件可直接用：因为 ABCD 是平行四边形，所以 OB=OD，OA=OC（平行四边形的对角线互相平分）。","又已知 AE=CF，两式分别相减得 OA-AE=OC-CF，即 OE=OF。","在四边形 BEDF 中，对角线 BD、EF 相交于 O，且 OB=OD、OE=OF，即两条对角线互相平分。","所以四边形 BEDF 是平行四边形（对角线互相平分的四边形是平行四边形）。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：四边形 BEDF 是平行四边形。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"证平行四边形优先利用原图形的对角线交点：一个「互相平分」直接给出两组等量，再处理 E、F 的条件，比连新辅助线证全等简捷得多。"},{"type":"list","title":"易错点","items":["「一组对边平行，另一组对边相等」不能判定平行四边形，满足这个条件的四边形可能是等腰梯形。","「对角线相等」是矩形的性质，一般平行四边形的对角线不一定相等；「对角线互相垂直」是菱形的性质，两者不能张冠李戴。","正方形既是矩形又是菱形，判定时要同时满足相应条件（如一组邻边相等且有直角），缺一不可。","三角形中位线是「两边中点之间的连线」，不是任意两点的连线；应用时容易只写「等于第三边的一半」而漏掉「平行于第三边」。","菱形面积公式 $S=\\frac{1}{2}d_1d_2$ 只适用于对角线互相垂直的四边形，一般平行四边形不能用。","判定平行四边形前必须先确认图形是四边形（同一平面内），不能把三角形或空间四边形套进这些判定。"]},{"type":"list","title":"解题方法","items":["图形中出现两个或更多中点时先想中位线，连出中位线可同时得到平行关系与长度关系。","证平行四边形先看「对边」再看「对角线」，选择条件最少的那条判定路径。","矩形问题连对角线，用「对角线相等且互相平分」配合勾股定理；菱形问题用「对角线互相垂直且平分」。","中点四边形问题用两次中位线定理，得到对边平行且相等，再按原四边形对角线的特征判断形状。","求线段长先证特殊三角形（直角、等腰），再用勾股定理或中位线的一半关系计算。"]}],"questions":[{"id":"m-geo-pingxing-sibianxing-q1","type":"choice","stem":"下列条件中，不能判定四边形 ABCD 是平行四边形的是","answer":"C","explain":"A 是两组对边分别平行，B 是两组对边分别相等，D 是一组对边平行且相等，都能判定平行四边形。C 是「一组对边平行、另一组对边相等」，不能判定，例如等腰梯形的上、下底平行且两腰相等，但它不是平行四边形。","options":["AB∥ CD，AD∥ BC","AB=CD，AD=BC","AB∥ CD，AD=BC","AB∥ CD，AB=CD"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["平行四边形的判定","条件辨析"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sibianxing-q1","title":"反例：等腰梯形不是平行四边形","caption":"等腰梯形中 AB∥DC（画有平行箭头）、两腰 AD=BC（画有等长记号），但它不是平行四边形——所以「一组对边平行、另一组对边相等」不能判定","view":"wide","alt":"一个等腰梯形 ABCD：上底 AB 与下底 DC 互相平行（都画有平行箭头），两腰 AD 与 BC 相等（画有相同的等长记号），但它两组对边并不分别平行。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[30,16],[70,16],[90,52],[10,52]],"closed":true},{"t":"poly","points":[[48.1,17.5],[50.5,16],[48.1,14.5]],"tone":"accent"},{"t":"poly","points":[[48.1,53.5],[50.5,52],[48.1,50.5]],"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":21.31,"y1":34.73,"x2":18.69,"y2":33.27,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":81.31,"y1":33.27,"x2":78.69,"y2":34.73,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"dot","x":30,"y":16,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":70,"y":16,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":90,"y":52,"label":"C","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":10,"y":52,"label":"D","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4}]}},{"id":"m-geo-pingxing-sibianxing-q2","type":"choice","stem":"在平行四边形 ABCD 中，∠ A=70^°，则 ∠ C 的度数是","answer":"A","explain":"平行四边形的两组对角分别相等，∠ C 与 ∠ A 是对角，所以 ∠ C=∠ A=70^°。与 ∠ A 互补的是邻角 ∠ B、∠ D，它们各为 110^°。","options":["70^°","110^°","20^°","140^°"],"difficulty":1,"tags":["平行四边形的性质","对角相等"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sibianxing-q2","title":"平行四边形的对角相等","caption":"∠A 与 ∠C 是一组对角（画有相同的角弧），所以 ∠C=∠A=70°；邻角 ∠B、∠D 与 ∠A 互补，各为 110°","view":"wide","alt":"平行四边形 ABCD：顶点 A 与顶点 C 处画有相同的角弧，表示这两个对角相等；A 处标出 70 度。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[18,52],[82,52],[70,16],[6,16]],"closed":true},{"t":"angle","x":18,"y":52,"from":0,"to":108.43,"r":8,"tone":"ok","label":"70°"},{"t":"angle","x":70,"y":16,"from":-71.57,"to":-180,"r":8,"tone":"ok","label":"∠C=?"},{"t":"dot","x":18,"y":52,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":82,"y":52,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":70,"y":16,"label":"C","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":6,"y":16,"label":"D","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8}]}},{"id":"m-geo-pingxing-sibianxing-q3","type":"choice","stem":"四边形 ABCD 的两条对角线 AC、BD 相交于点 O，下列条件中能判定四边形 ABCD 是矩形的是","answer":"C","explain":"「对角线相等的平行四边形是矩形」，C 同时给出平行四边形与对角线相等，可以判定矩形。只知道 AC=BD 而没有平行四边形的前提不能判定（等腰梯形也满足）；AC⊥ BD 是菱形的特征；AB=CD、AB=BC 与矩形无关。","options":["AB=CD","AC⊥ BD","AC=BD，且四边形 ABCD 是平行四边形","AB=BC"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["矩形的判定","条件前提"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sibianxing-q3","title":"四边形的两条对角线相交于点 O","caption":"要判定矩形，两个前提缺一不可：先有平行四边形（对角线互相平分），再加「对角线相等」","view":"square","alt":"四边形 ABCD，两条对角线 AC 与 BD 相交于点 O；图中画出并标注了两条对角线 AC、BD 与交点 O。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[16,62],[86,62],[72,18],[8,18]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":16,"y1":62,"x2":72,"y2":18,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":86,"y1":62,"x2":8,"y2":18,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":44,"y":40,"label":"O","labelDx":-6.6,"labelDy":2.2},{"t":"dot","x":16,"y":62,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":86,"y":62,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":72,"y":18,"label":"C","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":8,"y":18,"label":"D","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"text","x":55,"y":44,"text":"AC","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":26,"text":"BD","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"accent"}]}},{"id":"m-geo-pingxing-sibianxing-q4","type":"fill","stem":"在 △ ABC 中，D、E 分别是 AB、AC 的中点，BC=12，则 DE= ____。（只填数字）","answer":"6","explain":"DE 是 △ ABC 的中位线，由中位线定理得 DE=(1)/(2)BC=(1)/(2)× 12=6。","difficulty":1,"tags":["三角形中位线"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sibianxing-q4","title":"中位线 DE 与底边 BC","caption":"D、E 分别是 AB、AC 的中点（等长记号），所以 DE∥BC 且 DE 等于 BC 的一半","view":"wide","alt":"三角形 ABC，D 是 AB 的中点、E 是 AC 的中点，连接 DE；DE 与 BC 上画有表示平行的箭头，BC 标注为 12，DE 待求。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[10,52],[90,52],[30,12]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":52,"x2":20,"y2":32,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":30,"y1":50.5,"x2":30,"y2":53.5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":70,"y1":50.5,"x2":70,"y2":53.5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":13.12,"y1":42.4,"x2":15.8,"y2":43.74,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":14.2,"y1":40.26,"x2":16.88,"y2":41.6,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":23.12,"y1":22.4,"x2":25.8,"y2":23.74,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":24.2,"y1":20.26,"x2":26.88,"y2":21.6,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"poly","points":[[37.41,41.81],[34.58,41.72],[35.75,44.3]],"tone":"accent"},{"t":"poly","points":[[62.41,31.81],[59.58,31.72],[60.75,34.3]],"tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":65,"y":30,"text":"BC = 12","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":27,"y":45,"text":"DE = ?","anchor":"end","size":3.6,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"dot","x":10,"y":52,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":90,"y":52,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":30,"y":12,"label":"C","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":52,"label":"D","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":20,"y":32,"label":"E","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8}]}},{"id":"m-geo-pingxing-sibianxing-q5","type":"fill","stem":"菱形 ABCD 的两条对角线 AC=10，BD=24，则菱形的边长是 ____。（只填数字）","answer":"13","explain":"菱形的对角线互相垂直且互相平分，所以 AO=(1)/(2)× 10=5，BO=(1)/(2)× 24=12，且 AC⊥ BD。在 Rt△ AOB 中由勾股定理得 AB=√(5²+12²)=13，即边长是 13。","difficulty":2,"tags":["菱形的性质","勾股定理"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sibianxing-q5","title":"菱形的对角线互相垂直且平分","caption":"AO=CO=5（单线记号）、BO=DO=12（双线记号），AC⊥BD（O 处直角方框）；在直角三角形 AOB 中求边长","view":"square","alt":"菱形 ABCD，两条对角线 AC 与 BD 相交于点 O 并互相垂直（O 处画有直角方框）；AO 与 CO、BO 与 DO 分别画有相同的等长记号，AC 标注为 10、BD 标注为 24。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[37.5,32],[50,2],[62.5,32],[50,62]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":37.5,"y1":32,"x2":62.5,"y2":32,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":2,"x2":50,"y2":62,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":54,"y1":32,"x2":54,"y2":28,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":54,"y1":28,"x2":50,"y2":28,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":43.75,"y1":30.5,"x2":43.75,"y2":33.5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":56.25,"y1":30.5,"x2":56.25,"y2":33.5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":51.5,"y1":15.8,"x2":48.5,"y2":15.8,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":51.5,"y1":18.2,"x2":48.5,"y2":18.2,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":51.5,"y1":45.8,"x2":48.5,"y2":45.8,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":51.5,"y1":48.2,"x2":48.5,"y2":48.2,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"text","x":56,"y":28,"text":"AC = 10","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":45,"y":20,"text":"BD = 24","anchor":"end","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":32,"label":"O","labelDx":3.4,"labelDy":3.2},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":2,"label":"B","labelDx":-8,"labelDy":0.6},{"t":"dot","x":37.5,"y":32,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":62.5,"y":32,"label":"C","labelDx":2.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":62,"label":"D","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":2.6}]}},{"id":"m-geo-pingxing-sibianxing-q6","type":"short","stem":"说明「顺次连接任意四边形各边中点所得的四边形一定是平行四边形」的理由，并指出原四边形满足什么条件时中点四边形是菱形。","answer":"设四边形 $ABCD$ 中，$E$、$F$、$G$、$H$ 分别是 $AB$、$BC$、$CD$、$DA$ 的中点，连接对角线 $AC$。在 $\\triangle ABC$ 中，$E$、$F$ 是两边的中点，所以 $EF$ 是中位线，$EF\\parallel AC$ 且 $EF=\\frac{1}{2}AC$；在 $\\triangle ADC$ 中同理，$HG\\parallel AC$ 且 $HG=\\frac{1}{2}AC$。于是 $EF\\parallel HG$ 且 $EF=HG$，由「一组对边平行且相等的四边形是平行四边形」得四边形 $EFGH$ 是平行四边形。若原四边形的两条对角线相等（即 $AC=BD$），则由中位线定理得 $EF=HG=\\frac{1}{2}AC$、$EH=FG=\\frac{1}{2}BD$，四条边都相等，而「四边相等的平行四边形是菱形」，所以此时中点四边形是菱形。","explain":"本题考查中位线定理的综合运用与「条件—结论」的对应。评分要点：说明连对角线后用两次中位线定理，得到一组对边平行且相等，从而判定平行四边形；说明原四边形对角线相等时四条边都等于同一条对角线的一半，由「四边相等的平行四边形是菱形」得证。常见失分点：连了中位线却不写依据；把「对角线相等」与「对角线互相垂直」对应的图形特征弄反；证完平行四边形就直接断定是菱形，缺少「四条边相等」的中间步骤。","difficulty":3,"tags":["中点四边形","中位线定理"],"rubric":["正确连接对角线 AC，说明用两次中位线定理","写出中位线的两个结论（平行且等于第三边的一半）","依据「一组对边平行且相等 ⇒ 平行四边形」得出结论","指出原四边形对角线相等时中点四边形是菱形，并说明理由","（加分）指出对角线互相垂直时中点四边形是矩形"]},{"id":"m-geo-pingxing-sibianxing-z1","type":"choice","stem":"菱形具有而一般平行四边形不一定具有的性质是","answer":"B","explain":"对角相等、对角线互相平分、对边平行且相等都是平行四边形的一般性质，菱形自然也有；只有「对角线互相垂直」是菱形（及正方形）特有的性质，一般平行四边形的对角线只互相平分，不一定垂直。","options":["两组对角分别相等","两条对角线互相垂直","两条对角线互相平分","两组对边分别平行且相等"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["平行四边形的性质","菱形的性质"]},{"id":"m-geo-pingxing-sibianxing-z2","type":"fill","stem":"在平行四边形 ABCD 中，∠ A:∠ B=2:3，则 ∠ A= ____ 度。（只填数字）","answer":"72","explain":"平行四边形的邻角互补，∠ A 与 ∠ B 是邻角。设 ∠ A=2x^°，∠ B=3x^°，则 2x+3x=180，解得 x=36，所以 ∠ A=2× 36^°=72^°。","difficulty":2,"tags":["平行四边形的性质"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-sibianxing-z2","title":"平行四边形的邻角互补","caption":"∠A 与 ∠B 是邻角，和为 180°：设 ∠A=2x°、∠B=3x°，得 2x+3x=180，x=36，所以 ∠A=72°","view":"wide","alt":"平行四边形 ABCD：顶点 A 处的角标注为 2x 度，它旁边的顶点 B 处的角标注为 3x 度，两个角是同一条边 AB 上的邻角。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[18,52],[82,52],[70,16],[6,16]],"closed":true},{"t":"angle","x":18,"y":52,"from":0,"to":108.43,"r":8,"tone":"ok","label":"2x°"},{"t":"angle","x":82,"y":52,"from":-180,"to":-251.57,"r":8,"tone":"ok","label":"3x°"},{"t":"dot","x":18,"y":52,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":82,"y":52,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":70,"y":16,"label":"C","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":6,"y":16,"label":"D","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":60,"text":"邻角互补：2x + 3x = 180","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"}]}}]},{"id":"m-geo-xuanzhuan","title":"旋转与中心对称","subtitle":"人教版九上 · 第28章 旋转","grade":"9a","tags":["图形与几何","旋转"],"blocks":[{"type":"note","title":"教材章节","text":"人教版九上 · 第28章 旋转"},{"type":"note","title":"一句话概述","text":"理解旋转的三要素与性质，认识中心对称和中心对称图形，会作旋转后的图形。"},{"type":"h","text":"先看三要素：中心、角度、方向"},{"type":"p","text":"旋转必须同时说清三件事：绕哪一点转（旋转中心）、转多少度（旋转角）、朝哪个方向转（顺时针或逆时针）。图中线段 OA 绕点 O 逆时针转过 α 得到 OA₁，O 就是旋转中心，α 就是旋转角。少说任何一个要素，图形都不唯一。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xuanzhuan-s1","title":"旋转的三要素：中心、角度、方向","caption":"线段 OA 绕点 O 逆时针旋转角 α 得到 OA₁","view":"square","alt":"以 O 为旋转中心，线段 OA 沿逆时针方向旋转角 α 得到线段 OA₁，图中用带箭头的弧线标出旋转角 α，A 与 A₁ 是一对对应点，底部注明三个要素是旋转中心、旋转角与旋转方向。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":22,"y1":80,"x2":86,"y2":80},{"t":"line","x1":22,"y1":80,"x2":58.7,"y2":27.6,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"arc","cx":22,"cy":80,"r":24,"from":0,"to":55,"tone":"accent","arrow":true},{"t":"text","x":41,"y":63,"text":"α","size":3.8,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":22,"y":80,"label":"O","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":86,"y":80,"label":"A","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":58.7,"y":27.6,"label":"A₁","labelDx":2,"labelDy":-2},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":93,"text":"旋转中心 O、旋转角 α、逆时针方向","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"只说「旋转某个角度」而不说明方向，图形并不唯一，这是作图题最常见的漏条件。"},{"type":"h","text":"抓关键点：对应点到中心的距离相等"},{"type":"p","text":"点 A 绕中心 O 旋转时，是沿着以 O 为圆心、OA 为半径的圆运动，所以对应点 A₁ 一定满足 OA₁=OA。这正是旋转作图的依据：先连旋转中心与关键点，再在所求方向上截取与原来一样长的线段。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xuanzhuan-s2","title":"对应点到旋转中心的距离相等","caption":"OA=OA₁，对应点都落在以 O 为圆心的圆上","view":"square","alt":"以 O 为旋转中心，点 A 绕 O 旋转 90 度到对应点 A₁，图中以 O 为圆心画出虚线圈，并画出半径 OA 与 OA₁，标注 OA 等于 OA₁。","prims":[{"t":"circle","cx":50,"cy":50,"r":34,"dashed":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":50,"x2":20.6,"y2":67,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":50,"x2":67,"y2":79.4,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"arc","cx":50,"cy":50,"r":13,"from":210,"to":300,"tone":"accent","arrow":true},{"t":"text","x":40,"y":76,"text":"90°","size":3.4,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":50,"label":"O","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":20.6,"y":67,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":67,"y":79.4,"label":"A₁","labelDx":2,"labelDy":4},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":20,"text":"OA=OA₁","size":3.8,"anchor":"middle"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"对应点是「同一个点旋转后的位置」，不要与图形中的其它点混淆。"},{"type":"h","text":"建立关系：旋转前后两个图形全等"},{"type":"p","text":"每个点都绕中心转过同一个角，线段的长短与角的大小都不会改变，所以旋转前后的图形全等：对应线段相等、对应角相等。因此可以把旋转当作「把一个三角形搬到新位置」的工具，用全等去证线段相等或角相等。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xuanzhuan-s3","title":"旋转前后两个三角形全等","caption":"△ABC 绕点 O 逆时针旋转 90° 得 △A₁B₁C₁","view":"square","alt":"三角形 ABC 绕点 O 逆时针旋转 90 度后得到三角形 A₁B₁C₁，原三角形画成虚线、旋转后的三角形画成实线，二者形状大小完全相同，图中用弧线标出 90 度的旋转角。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[78,55],[85,68],[72,72]],"closed":true,"tone":"main","dashed":true},{"t":"poly","points":[[45,22],[58,15],[62,28]],"closed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"arc","cx":45,"cy":55,"r":14,"from":0,"to":90,"tone":"accent","arrow":true},{"t":"text","x":62,"y":62,"text":"90°","size":3.4,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":45,"y":55,"label":"O","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":78,"y":55,"label":"A","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":85,"y":68,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":72,"y":72,"label":"C","labelDx":-1,"labelDy":5},{"t":"dot","x":45,"y":22,"label":"A₁","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":-1},{"t":"dot","x":58,"y":15,"label":"B₁","labelDx":1,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":62,"y":28,"label":"C₁","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":92,"text":"△ABC≌△A₁B₁C₁","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"旋转后对应线段相等，但不一定平行；只有旋转角是 180^° 时才一定平行。"},{"type":"h","text":"换情境看：旋转 180° 就是中心对称"},{"type":"p","text":"当旋转角取 180^° 时，对应点与旋转中心三点共线，且中心恰是对应点连线的中点，这就是中心对称。所以绕原点旋转 180^° 与关于原点对称是同一件事，坐标都由 (x,y) 变成 (-x,-y)。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xuanzhuan-s4","title":"中心对称就是旋转 180°","caption":"AO=OA₁，BO=OB₁，A、O、A₁ 三点共线","view":"square","alt":"线段 AB 与线段 A₁B₁ 关于点 O 中心对称，A 与 A₁、B 与 B₁ 的连线都经过点 O 并被 O 平分，图中 A、O、A₁ 三点共线，AB 与 A₁B₁ 平行且相等。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":18,"y1":22,"x2":82,"y2":78,"dashed":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":84,"y1":24,"x2":16,"y2":76,"dashed":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":18,"y1":22,"x2":84,"y2":24,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":82,"y1":78,"x2":16,"y2":76,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":50,"label":"O","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":18,"y":22,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":-1},{"t":"dot","x":82,"y":78,"label":"A₁","labelDx":2,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":84,"y":24,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-1},{"t":"dot","x":16,"y":76,"label":"B₁","labelDx":-7,"labelDy":4},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":92,"text":"AB 与 A₁B₁ 关于点 O 中心对称","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"「中心对称」描述两个图形之间的关系，「中心对称图形」描述一个图形自身的性质，两者不能混用。"},{"type":"h","text":"核心概念"},{"type":"p","text":"旋转的三要素：把一个平面图形绕着平面内某一点转动一个角度，叫做图形的旋转。这一点叫旋转中心，转动的角叫旋转角，转动方向（顺时针或逆时针）也必须明确。旋转中心、旋转方向、旋转角称为旋转的三要素，缺一不可。"},{"type":"p","text":"旋转的性质：对应点到旋转中心的距离相等；对应点与旋转中心连线所成的角都等于旋转角；旋转前后的图形全等，即对应线段相等、对应角相等。这三条性质是旋转作图和用旋转证题的主要依据。"},{"type":"p","text":"中心对称：把一个图形绕着某一点旋转 180^°，如果它能与另一个图形重合，就说这两个图形成中心对称，这个点叫对称中心。性质：对称点的连线都经过对称中心，并且被对称中心平分；成中心对称的两个图形全等。"},{"type":"p","text":"中心对称图形：把一个图形绕着某一点旋转 180^°，如果旋转后的图形能与原来的图形重合，这个图形叫中心对称图形。平行四边形、矩形、菱形、正方形、线段、圆都是中心对称图形；等边三角形、正五边形是轴对称图形但不是中心对称图形。"},{"type":"p","text":"坐标与中心对称：在平面直角坐标系中，关于原点对称的两个点，横坐标与纵坐标都互为相反数：点 P(x,y) 关于原点的对称点是 (-x,-y)。把点绕原点旋转 180^° 与关于原点对称是同一件事，但与关于 x 轴、y 轴对称不同。"},{"type":"p","text":"用旋转构造全等：图形中有等腰直角三角形（旋转角 90^°）、等边三角形（旋转角 60^°）、正方形（旋转角 90^°）等特殊图形时，常把某个三角形绕公共顶点旋转，使分散的线段与角集中到一个新的位置，从而构造全等三角形，得到相等的线段、角或共线关系。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"利用旋转的性质求旋转角、证明线段或角相等\n常与等腰三角形综合：连接旋转中心与一对对应点，由「对应点到旋转中心的距离相等」构造等腰三角形，用顶角或底角求旋转角；证线段相等直接引用「旋转前后的图形全等」，旋转角必须用对应点与中心的连线去找。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"方格纸中的旋转作图与坐标中的旋转\n作图题高频：按「连、转、取」三步在网格中旋转图形，先定方向再定角度；坐标系中绕原点旋转 90^° 可借全等推对应点坐标，旋转 180^° 即关于原点对称。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"中心对称与中心对称图形的识别\n常与轴对称混合考查：给出平行四边形、圆、正多边形、字母图案等，先看绕某点旋转 180^° 能否重合，再看有无对称轴；注意分清「两个图形的关系」与「一个图形自身的性质」。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"用旋转构造全等证明线段和差或相等\n压轴常考：见等边三角形想 60^° 旋转、见正方形想 90^° 旋转，把三角形绕公共顶点「搬家」，用 SAS 证全等，把分散线段集中到一个三角形中，再结合勾股或等腰三角形收尾。"},{"type":"table","title":"公式与定理","head":["公式/定理","表述","注意"],"rows":[["旋转的对应线段相等（旋转前后图形全等）","AB=A₁B₁","记 A₁、B₁ 分别是 A、B 绕旋转中心旋转后的对应点；旋转不改变图形的形状和大小"],["对应点到旋转中心的距离相等","OA=OA₁, OB=OB₁","这是旋转作图时「在射线上截取与原来相等的长度」的依据"],["旋转角等于对应点连线的夹角","∠ AOA₁=∠ BOB₁=α","α 是旋转角；说明「对应点与旋转中心连线所成的角都等于旋转角」，找旋转角时必须用对应点去连中心"],["关于原点对称的点的坐标","(x,y)to(-x,-y)","横、纵坐标都变号；与绕原点旋转 180^° 的结果相同，不要与只变一个坐标的轴对称混淆"],["中心对称的对称点连线","成中心对称的两个图形中，对称点的连线都经过对称中心，并且被对称中心平分。","对称中心是每一对对称点所连线段的公共中点，由此可推出成中心对称的两个图形全等"]]},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"点 A(3,-2) 绕原点旋转 180^° 后得到点 B，求点 B 的坐标；并求点 A 关于 y 轴对称的点 C 的坐标。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xuanzhuan-e1","title":"绕原点旋转 180° 与关于 y 轴对称","caption":"A(3,−2) 绕原点转 180° 得 B(−3,2)，关于 y 轴对称得 C(−3,−2)","view":"square","alt":"平面直角坐标系中，点 A 位于第四象限的 (3,−2)，绕原点旋转 180 度后得到点 B(−3,2)，它在第二象限；点 A 关于 y 轴对称的点 C(−3,−2) 在第三象限。图中用虚线画出原点与各点的连线以及经过原点的 A、B 连线，说明绕原点旋转 180 度与关于原点对称是同一件事，与关于 y 轴对称不同。","prims":[{"t":"plane","x":50,"y":50,"right":45,"left":40,"up":38,"down":38,"xTicks":[{"at":-36,"label":"−3"},{"at":36,"label":"3"}],"yTicks":[{"at":-24,"label":"−2"},{"at":24,"label":"2"}]},{"t":"line","x1":86,"y1":74,"x2":14,"y2":26,"dashed":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":86,"y1":74,"x2":50,"y2":50,"dashed":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":50,"x2":14,"y2":26,"dashed":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":50,"x2":14,"y2":74,"dashed":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":86,"y":74,"label":"A","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":14,"y":26,"label":"B","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":-1},{"t":"dot","x":14,"y":74,"label":"C","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":94,"text":"B 与 A 关于原点对称，C 与 A 关于 y 轴对称","size":3.2,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["绕原点旋转 180^° 等于关于原点对称，横坐标、纵坐标都变为相反数，所以 B(-3,2)。","关于 y 轴对称的点纵坐标不变、横坐标变为相反数，所以 C(-3,-2)。","比较可知 B 与 C 一般不相同（只有点在坐标轴上时才重合），说明「绕原点旋转 180^°」与「关于 y 轴对称」是两种不同的变换。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：B(-3,2)，C(-3,-2)。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"坐标变换口诀：关于 x 轴横不变，关于 y 轴纵不变，关于原点（或绕原点旋转 180^°）两个都变号。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"在正方形 ABCD 中，E 是 BC 边上一点，把 △ ABE 绕点 A 顺时针旋转 90^° 得到 △ ADF。求证 AE=AF 且 AE⊥ AF。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xuanzhuan-e2","title":"正方形中绕顶点旋转 90°","caption":"△ABE 绕 A 顺时针旋转 90° 得 △ADF，F、D、C 三点共线","view":"square","alt":"正方形 ABCD 中，点 E 在 BC 边上，三角形 ABE 绕顶点 A 顺时针旋转 90 度得到三角形 ADF：旋转后点 B 与点 D 重合、点 E 落在 F 处，F、D、C 三点共线。图中 AE 与 AF 相等且互相垂直，在顶点 A 处标出 90 度的旋转角，D 处与 B 处标出直角标记。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[38,22],[88,22],[88,72],[38,72]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"poly","points":[[38,22],[88,22],[88,47]],"closed":true,"tone":"accent","fill":true},{"t":"poly","points":[[38,22],[38,72],[13,72]],"closed":true,"tone":"danger","dashed":true},{"t":"angle","x":38,"y":22,"from":-117,"to":-27,"r":13,"label":"90°","tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":38,"y":72,"from":90,"to":180,"r":6,"right":true,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"angle","x":88,"y":22,"from":-180,"to":-90,"r":6,"right":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"dot","x":38,"y":22,"label":"A","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":-1.5},{"t":"dot","x":88,"y":22,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-1},{"t":"dot","x":88,"y":72,"label":"C","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":38,"y":72,"label":"D","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":88,"y":47,"label":"E","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":13,"y":72,"label":"F","labelDx":-7,"labelDy":4},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":92,"text":"AE=AF 且 AE⊥AF","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["因为旋转不改变图形的形状和大小，所以 △ ABE≌△ ADF（旋转的性质），于是 AE=AF。","旋转角是 90^°，点 A 的对应点是它本身，点 E 的对应点是 F，所以 ∠ EAF 就是旋转角，即 ∠ EAF=90^°，也就是 AE⊥ AF。","由 △ ABE≌△ ADF 还得到 DF=BE，∠ ADF=∠ ABE=90^°。因为 ∠ ADC=90^°，所以 ∠ ADF+∠ ADC=180^°，即 F、D、C 三点共线。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：AE=AF 且 AE⊥ AF（同时得到 F、D、C 三点共线）。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"正方形中的 90^° 旋转能把一个三角形「搬到」相邻的位置，是证明线段相等、垂直以及三点共线的常用手法。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"判断下列图形哪些是中心对称图形：平行四边形、等边三角形、正五边形、圆、线段。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xuanzhuan-e3","title":"五个图形是不是中心对称图形","caption":"绕各自标出的点旋转 180°，能与自身重合的才是中心对称图形","view":"square","alt":"上排从左到右是平行四边形、等边三角形和正五边形，下排是圆与线段。平行四边形、圆、线段上各标出一个圆点作为旋转中心，绕它旋转 180 度后能与自身重合；等边三角形与正五边形无论绕哪一点旋转 180 度都不能与自身重合。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[8,12],[42,12],[36,36],[2,36]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"dot","x":22,"y":24,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"poly","points":[[50,10],[34,36],[66,36]],"closed":true,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"poly","points":[[80,11],[65.7,21.4],[71.2,38.1],[88.8,38.1],[94.3,21.4]],"closed":true,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"circle","cx":22,"cy":72,"r":15,"tone":"main"},{"t":"dot","x":22,"y":72,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":56,"y1":72,"x2":94,"y2":72,"width":0.7},{"t":"dot","x":75,"y":72,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":22,"y":45,"text":"平行四边形","size":3.2,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":45,"text":"等边三角形","size":3.2,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":80,"y":45,"text":"正五边形","size":3.2,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":22,"y":94,"text":"圆","size":3.2,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":75,"y":90,"text":"线段","size":3.2,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["平行四边形绕两条对角线的交点旋转 180^° 后与自身重合，是中心对称图形。","等边三角形、正五边形绕各自的中心旋转 180^° 后顶点位置改变，不能与自身重合，所以不是中心对称图形（它们是轴对称图形）。","圆绕圆心旋转 180^° 后与自身重合；线段绕它的中点旋转 180^° 后也与自身重合，所以两者都是中心对称图形。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：平行四边形、圆、线段是中心对称图形；等边三角形、正五边形不是。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"正 n 边形只有 n 为偶数时才是中心对称图形；判断的关键是「是否存在一个点，使图形绕它旋转 180^° 后与自身重合」。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"点 P 是等边 △ ABC 内一点，PA=3，PB=4，PC=5，求 ∠ APB 的度数。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xuanzhuan-e4","title":"等边三角形内一点的距离问题","caption":"△ABP 绕 A 逆时针旋转 60° 得 △ACP₁，∠APB=150°","view":"square","alt":"等边三角形 ABC 内有一点 P，PA 等于 3、PB 等于 4、PC 等于 5。把三角形 ABP 绕点 A 逆时针旋转 60 度得到三角形 ACP₁，旋转后 CP₁ 等于 4；连接 PP₁ 后 PP₁ 等于 3，三角形 PP₁C 的三边长为 3、4、5，所以 ∠PP₁C 是 90 度，∠APP₁ 是 60 度，由此得到 ∠APB 等于 150 度。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[50,14],[15,74.6],[85,74.6]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":43.1,"y1":44.3,"x2":50,"y2":14},{"t":"line","x1":43.1,"y1":44.3,"x2":15,"y2":74.6},{"t":"line","x1":43.1,"y1":44.3,"x2":85,"y2":74.6},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":14,"x2":72.8,"y2":35.1,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":85,"y1":74.6,"x2":72.8,"y2":35.1,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":43.1,"y1":44.3,"x2":72.8,"y2":35.1,"dashed":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":14,"from":-103,"to":-43,"r":10,"label":"60°","tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":72.8,"y":35.1,"from":-163,"to":-73,"r":7,"right":true,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":14,"label":"A","labelDx":2,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":15,"y":74.6,"label":"B","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":85,"y":74.6,"label":"C","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":43.1,"y":44.3,"label":"P","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":2},{"t":"dot","x":72.8,"y":35.1,"label":"P₁","labelDx":2,"labelDy":-2},{"t":"text","x":42,"y":27,"text":"3","size":3.4,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":25,"y":58,"text":"4","size":3.4,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":68,"y":58,"text":"5","size":3.4,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":92,"text":"PA=3，PB=4，PC=5，∠APB=150°","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["见等边三角形想 60^° 旋转：把 △ ABP 绕点 A 逆时针旋转 60^°，使 AB 与 AC 重合，点 P 的对应点记为 P₁，则 △ ABP≌△ ACP₁（旋转前后图形全等）。","由旋转性质得 AP₁=AP=3，CP₁=BP=4；旋转角为 60^°，即 ∠ PAP₁=60^°，所以 △ APP₁ 是等边三角形，PP₁=AP=3。","在 △ PP₁C 中，三边长分别为 PP₁=3，P₁C=4，PC=5，因为 3²+4²=5²，由勾股定理的逆定理得 ∠ PP₁C=90^°。","由旋转全等得 ∠ APB=∠ AP₁C。结合图形，射线 P₁P 落在 ∠ AP₁C 的内部，所以 ∠ AP₁C=∠ AP₁P+∠ PP₁C=60^°+90^°=150^°，即 ∠ APB=150^°。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：∠ APB=150^°。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"等边三角形内一点到三个顶点的距离问题，几乎都绕顶点旋转 60^°：把三段距离集中到一个三角形中，再用勾股定理的逆定理发现直角，最后还原旋转角收尾。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"在平面直角坐标系中，把点 P(3,1) 绕原点 O 顺时针旋转 90^° 得到点 P₁。求点 P₁ 的坐标、线段 PP₁ 的长，以及点 P 在旋转过程中经过的路径长。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xuanzhuan-e5","title":"坐标中的旋转 90° 与旋转路径","caption":"P(3,1) 绕原点顺时针旋转 90° 得 P₁(1,−3)","view":"square","alt":"平面直角坐标系中，点 P 的坐标是 (3,1)，绕原点顺时针旋转 90 度后得到点 P₁(1,−3)。图中画出 OP 与 OP₁ 两条线段且长度相等，它们之间的夹角是 90 度，用带箭头的弧线标出点 P 旋转到点 P₁ 的路径，并用虚线连接 P 与 P₁。","prims":[{"t":"plane","x":50,"y":50,"right":45,"left":42,"up":42,"down":42,"xTicks":[{"at":10,"label":"1"},{"at":30,"label":"3"}],"yTicks":[{"at":10,"label":"1"},{"at":-30,"label":"−3"}]},{"t":"arc","cx":50,"cy":50,"r":31.6,"from":18.4,"to":-71.6,"tone":"accent","arrow":true},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":50,"x2":80,"y2":40},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":50,"x2":60,"y2":80},{"t":"line","x1":80,"y1":40,"x2":60,"y2":80,"dashed":true,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":50,"from":18.4,"to":-71.6,"r":10,"right":true,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"dot","x":80,"y":40,"label":"P","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-2},{"t":"dot","x":60,"y":80,"label":"P₁","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":96,"text":"OP=OP₁，∠POP₁=90°，PP₁=2√5","size":3.3,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["顺时针旋转 90^° 时，点 (x,y) 的对应点是 (y,-x)（可以取点 (1,0) 检验：它顺时针转 90^° 后落在 (0,-1)）。所以 P₁(1,-3)。","旋转不改变与中心的距离，所以 OP₁=OP=√(3²+1²)=√(10)，且 ∠ P₁OP=90^°（旋转角），△ POP₁ 是等腰直角三角形。","PP₁ 是这个等腰直角三角形的斜边，PP₁=√(2)×√(10)=√(20)=2√(5)（也可以用两点间距离公式 √((3-1)²+(1+3)²)=√(20) 验证）。","点 P 的路径是以 O 为圆心、OP 为半径、圆心角 90^° 的一段弧，由弧长公式得 l=90π×√(10)180=√(10)π2。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：P₁(1,-3)，PP₁=2√(5)，路径长为 √(10)π2。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"坐标旋转 90^° 的对应关系可以借特殊点记忆；旋转路径长要想到弧长公式，圆心角、半径、弧长知道其中两个就能求第三个。"},{"type":"list","title":"易错点","items":["旋转角是「对应点与旋转中心连线」所成的角，不是图形中任意两点连线所成的角，找错角会使整个推理失去依据。","「中心对称」描述两个图形之间的关系，「中心对称图形」描述一个图形自身的性质，两个概念不能混用。","等边三角形、正五边形是轴对称图形但不是中心对称图形；正 $n$ 边形只有 $n$ 为偶数时才是中心对称图形。","旋转作图必须同时确定旋转中心、旋转方向和旋转角三个要素，只知中心与角度而不知方向会作出两种不同的图形。","关于原点对称与关于 $x$ 轴、$y$ 轴对称的坐标变化不同：绕原点旋转 $180^\\circ$ 是两个坐标都变号，只变一个坐标的是轴对称。","旋转后对应线段相等，但一般不能说「对应线段平行」——只有旋转角为 $180^\\circ$ 时对应线段才一定平行。"]},{"type":"list","title":"解题方法","items":["见等边三角形（60^°）或正方形（90^°）就想用旋转构造全等，把分散的线段集中到一个三角形中。","旋转作图按三步走：连（连接旋转中心与关键点）、转（按要求的方向作等于旋转角的角）、取（在所作射线上截取与原来相等的长度）。","求旋转角就找一对对应点，用它们与旋转中心构成等腰三角形，再由顶角或底角求旋转角。","判断中心对称图形，就看是否存在一点，使图形绕它旋转 180^° 后与自身重合。","坐标变换用口诀记：关于 x 轴横不变，关于 y 轴纵不变，关于原点两个都变号。"]}],"questions":[{"id":"m-geo-xuanzhuan-q1","type":"choice","stem":"下列图形中，既是轴对称图形又是中心对称图形的是","answer":"D","explain":"圆有无数条对称轴，且绕圆心旋转 180^° 后与自身重合，两种对称性都具备。等边三角形、正五边形是轴对称图形但不是中心对称图形；一般的平行四边形是中心对称图形但不是轴对称图形。","options":["等边三角形","平行四边形","正五边形","圆"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["轴对称图形","中心对称图形"]},{"id":"m-geo-xuanzhuan-q2","type":"choice","stem":"点 A(-3,2) 关于原点对称的点的坐标是","answer":"C","explain":"关于原点对称的两点，横坐标、纵坐标都互为相反数，所以对称点是 (3,-2)。选 (3,2) 是错用了关于 y 轴对称的规律，选 (-3,-2) 是错用了关于 x 轴对称的规律。","options":["(3,2)","(-3,-2)","(3,-2)","(2,-3)"],"difficulty":1,"tags":["中心对称","坐标变化"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xuanzhuan-q2","title":"关于原点对称的两点","caption":"关于原点对称：横、纵坐标都互为相反数，所以 A(-3,2) 的对称点是 A1(3,-2)","view":"square","alt":"平面直角坐标系中，点 A 在第二象限、坐标是 (-3,2)；点 A1 在第四象限与它关于原点对称，坐标是 (3,-2)，两点连线经过原点。","prims":[{"t":"plane","x":50,"y":44,"right":34,"left":34,"up":26,"down":26,"xLabel":"x","yLabel":"y","xTicks":[{"at":-24,"label":"-3"},{"at":24,"label":"3"}],"yTicks":[{"at":16,"label":"2"},{"at":-16,"label":"-2"}]},{"t":"line","x1":26,"y1":28,"x2":74,"y2":60,"tone":"accent","dashed":true},{"t":"dot","x":26,"y":28,"label":"A","labelDx":-4.6,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":74,"y":60,"label":"A1","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":2.6},{"t":"text","x":20,"y":24,"text":"A(-3,2)","anchor":"end","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":78,"y":66,"text":"A1(3,-2)","anchor":"end","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"}]}},{"id":"m-geo-xuanzhuan-q3","type":"choice","stem":"把一个图形绕点 O 顺时针旋转 90^°，下列说法错误的是","answer":"D","explain":"A、B 是旋转的基本性质，C 也成立（旋转不改变图形的形状和大小）。旋转后对应线段相等，但只有当旋转角是 180^° 时对应线段才一定平行；旋转 90^° 时对应线段一般互相垂直，所以 D 错误。","options":["对应点到点 O 的距离相等","对应点与点 O 连线所成的角都等于 90^°","旋转前后的两个图形全等","对应线段一定互相平行"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["旋转的性质","辨析"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xuanzhuan-q3","title":"把图形绕点 O 顺时针旋转 90 度","caption":"旋转角 ∠POP1=90°；对应点到 O 的距离相等，旋转前后的两个三角形全等","view":"square","alt":"两个三角形 OPQ 与 OP1Q1 有公共顶点 O，后者是前者绕点 O 顺时针旋转 90 度得到的；O 处标出旋转角 90 度。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[50,50],[20,50],[26,26]],"closed":true},{"t":"poly","points":[[50,50],[50,20],[74,26]],"closed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":50,"from":-180,"to":-270,"r":12,"tone":"ok","label":"90°"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":50,"label":"O","labelDx":3,"labelDy":3},{"t":"dot","x":20,"y":50,"label":"P","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":26,"y":26,"label":"Q","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":20,"label":"P1","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":74,"y":26,"label":"Q1","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":-2.8}]}},{"id":"m-geo-xuanzhuan-q4","type":"fill","stem":"一个正 n 边形是中心对称图形，则 n 的最小值是 ____。（只填数字）","answer":"4","explain":"正 n 边形只有 n 为偶数时才是中心对称图形，所以 n 的最小值是 4，即正方形。正三角形（n=3）是轴对称图形，但绕中心旋转 180^° 不能与自身重合。","difficulty":2,"tags":["中心对称图形","正多边形"]},{"id":"m-geo-xuanzhuan-q5","type":"fill","stem":"把点 P(3,1) 绕原点旋转 180^° 得到点 Q，则点 Q 到 x 轴的距离是 ____。（只填数字）","answer":"1","explain":"绕原点旋转 180^° 等于关于原点对称，横、纵坐标都变号，所以 Q(-3,-1)。点到 x 轴的距离等于纵坐标的绝对值，即 |-1|=1。","difficulty":2,"tags":["旋转与坐标","点到坐标轴的距离"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xuanzhuan-q5","title":"绕原点旋转 180 度","caption":"绕原点旋转 180° 就是关于原点中心对称：P(3,1) 的对应点是 Q(-3,-1)","view":"square","alt":"平面直角坐标系中，点 P 在第一象限、坐标是 (3,1)；点 Q 在第三象限与它关于原点对称，坐标是 (-3,-1)，两点连线经过原点。","prims":[{"t":"plane","x":50,"y":40,"right":34,"left":34,"up":26,"down":22,"xLabel":"x","yLabel":"y","xTicks":[{"at":-30,"label":"-3"},{"at":30,"label":"3"}],"yTicks":[{"at":10,"label":"1"},{"at":-10,"label":"-1"}]},{"t":"line","x1":80,"y1":30,"x2":20,"y2":50,"tone":"accent","dashed":true},{"t":"dot","x":80,"y":30,"label":"P","labelDx":2.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":20,"y":50,"label":"Q","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"text","x":82,"y":24,"text":"P(3,1)","anchor":"end","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":16,"y":56,"text":"Q(-3,-1)","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"}]}},{"id":"m-geo-xuanzhuan-q6","type":"short","stem":"说明「中心对称」与「中心对称图形」的区别，并各举两个例子。","answer":"「中心对称」描述的是两个图形之间的关系：把一个图形绕某一点旋转 $180^\\circ$，如果它能与另一个图形重合，就说这两个图形成中心对称，这个点叫对称中心；性质是对称点的连线都经过对称中心，并且被对称中心平分，两个图形全等。「中心对称图形」描述的是一个图形自身的性质：把一个图形绕某一点旋转 $180^\\circ$，如果旋转后的图形能与原来的图形重合，这个图形就叫中心对称图形。区别在于：前者涉及两个图形，说的是它们之间的位置关系；后者只涉及一个图形，说的是它自身的对称性。成中心对称的例子：如图形 $F$ 与它关于点 $O$ 对称的图形 $F_1$，或两条关于某点中心对称的线段；中心对称图形的例子：平行四边形、圆（矩形、菱形、正方形也都是中心对称图形）。","explain":"本题考查两个易混概念的区分与举例能力。评分要点：说明中心对称描述两个图形之间的关系、中心对称图形描述一个图形自身的性质；点明判断方法（绕某点旋转 180^° 后与另一个图形或自身重合）；各举两个例子。常见失分点：两个概念混用，把「平行四边形是中心对称图形」说成「平行四边形与某图形成中心对称」；举例时把等边三角形、正五边形误当成中心对称图形；只举一个例子，区分说明不充分。","difficulty":2,"tags":["中心对称","概念辨析"],"rubric":["准确说出「中心对称」是两个图形之间的关系","准确说出「中心对称图形」是一个图形自身的性质","指出两者的核心区别（涉及两个图形 / 只涉及一个图形）","成中心对称的例子举出两个","中心对称图形的例子举出两个"]},{"id":"m-geo-xuanzhuan-z1","type":"choice","stem":"在 △ ABC 中，AB=8、AC=12，∠ BAC=40^°。把 △ ABC 绕点 A 旋转，使点 B 恰好落在原三角形的 AC 边上的点 D 处（点 D 异于 A、C），则 ∠ ABD 的度数是","answer":"D","explain":"点 B 的对应点是 D，旋转角为 ∠ BAD。因为 D 在 AC 上，所以 ∠ BAD=∠ BAC=40^°。由旋转性质得 AD=AB，所以 △ ABD 是等腰三角形，顶角 ∠ BAD=40^°，底角 ∠ ABD=(180^°-40^°)/(2)=70^°。选 B 是把 40^° 直接平分，误当成角平分线问题。","options":["40^°","55^°","80^°","70^°"],"difficulty":3,"tags":["旋转的性质","等腰三角形"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xuanzhuan-z1","title":"把点 B 绕点 A 旋转到 AC 上的点 D","caption":"AB=8、AC=12、∠BAC=40°；旋转后 AD=AB=8，∠BAD=40°，于是 △ABD 是等腰三角形，底角 ∠ABD=70°","view":"wide","alt":"三角形 ABC：AB 长 8、AC 长 12、∠A 等于 40 度；点 D 在边 AC 上且 AD 等于 AB，连接 BD，∠ABD 标为 70 度。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[20,54],[56.8,23.1],[92,54]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":56.8,"y1":23.1,"x2":68,"y2":54,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":20,"y":54,"from":40.02,"to":0,"r":9,"tone":"ok","label":"40°"},{"t":"angle","x":56.8,"y":23.1,"from":-139.98,"to":-70.08,"r":9,"tone":"ok","label":"70°"},{"t":"text","x":33,"y":37,"text":"AB = 8","anchor":"end","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":44,"y":60,"text":"AD = 8","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":90,"y":49,"text":"AC = 12","anchor":"end","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":20,"y":54,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":56.8,"y":23.1,"label":"B","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":92,"y":54,"label":"C","labelDx":2.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":68,"y":54,"label":"D","labelDx":2.4,"labelDy":2.4}]}},{"id":"m-geo-xuanzhuan-z2","type":"short","stem":"已知：在正方形 ABCD 中，点 E 在边 BC 上，点 F 在边 CD 上，且 ∠ EAF=45^°。求证：EF=BE+DF。","answer":"延长 $CB$ 到 $F_1$，使 $BF_1=DF$，连接 $AF_1$（相当于把 $\\triangle ADF$ 绕点 $A$ 顺时针旋转 $90^\\circ$ 到 $\\triangle ABF_1$ 的位置）。因为 $AB=AD$，$\\angle ABF_1=\\angle ADF=90^\\circ$，$BF_1=DF$，所以 $\\triangle ABF_1\\cong\\triangle ADF$（SAS），得 $AF_1=AF$，$\\angle F_1AB=\\angle FAD$。因为 $\\angle BAD=90^\\circ$，$\\angle EAF=45^\\circ$，所以 $\\angle FAD+\\angle BAE=90^\\circ-45^\\circ=45^\\circ$，于是 $\\angle F_1AE=\\angle F_1AB+\\angle BAE=\\angle FAD+\\angle BAE=45^\\circ=\\angle FAE$。又 $AE=AE$，$AF_1=AF$，所以 $\\triangle AF_1E\\cong\\triangle AFE$（SAS），得 $EF=EF_1$。因为 $F_1$ 在 $CB$ 的延长线上，所以 $E$、$B$、$F_1$ 共线，$EF_1=EB+BF_1=BE+DF$，即 $EF=BE+DF$。","explain":"本题考查正方形半角模型中用旋转构造全等。评分要点：写出旋转（截长）辅助线并证 △ ABF₁≌△ ADF，得到 AF₁=AF 与 ∠ F₁AB=∠ FAD；由角的和差推出 ∠ F₁AE=∠ FAE=45^°；用 SAS 证 △ AF₁E≌△ AFE 得 EF=EF₁；最后由 F₁、B、E 共线换算出 EF=BE+DF。常见失分点：辅助线只写「作辅助线」不写作法；跳过 ∠ F₁AE=45^° 的推导直接用 SAS；最后一步不说明 E、B、F₁ 共线，导致 EF₁=EB+BF₁ 缺少依据。","difficulty":3,"tags":["旋转的性质","辅助线"],"rubric":["写出辅助线：延长 CB 到 F1 使 BF1=DF（或把 △ADF 绕 A 顺时针旋转 90°），连接 AF1","证 △ABF1≌△ADF（SAS），得 AF1=AF 与 ∠F1AB=∠FAD","由 ∠BAD=90° 与 ∠EAF=45° 推出 ∠F1AE=∠FAE=45°","证 △AF1E≌△AFE（SAS），得 EF=EF1=EB+BF1=BE+DF"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xuanzhuan-z2","title":"正方形中的半角模型（旋转 90 度）","caption":"正方形 ABCD 中 ∠EAF=45°；把 △ADF 绕点 A 旋转 90° 到 △ABF1 的位置，则 EF=EF1=BE+DF","view":"square","alt":"正方形 ABCD，点 E 在边 BC 上、点 F 在边 CD 上，且 ∠EAF 等于 45 度；把 △ADF 绕点 A 旋转到 △ABF1，点 F1 落在 CB 的延长线上，于是 EF 与 EF1 相等。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[28,55],[72,55],[72,11],[28,11]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":28,"y1":55,"x2":72,"y2":39,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":28,"y1":55,"x2":48.6,"y2":11,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":72,"y1":39,"x2":48.6,"y2":11,"width":0.9},{"t":"line","x1":28,"y1":55,"x2":72,"y2":75.6,"tone":"accent","dashed":true},{"t":"line","x1":72,"y1":55,"x2":72,"y2":75.6,"dashed":true},{"t":"line","x1":72,"y1":39,"x2":72,"y2":75.6,"tone":"ok","width":0.9},{"t":"angle","x":28,"y":55,"from":19.98,"to":64.91,"r":13,"tone":"ok","label":"45°"},{"t":"dot","x":28,"y":55,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":72,"y":55,"label":"B","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":72,"y":11,"label":"C","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":28,"y":11,"label":"D","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":72,"y":39,"label":"E","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":48.6,"y":11,"label":"F","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":72,"y":75.6,"label":"F1","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":2.4}]}}]},{"id":"m-geo-yuan","title":"圆","subtitle":"人教版九上 · 第29章 圆、第30章 直线与圆的位置关系","grade":"9a","tags":["图形与几何","圆、直线与圆的位置关系"],"blocks":[{"type":"note","title":"教材章节","text":"人教版九上 · 第29章 圆、第30章 直线与圆的位置关系"},{"type":"note","title":"一句话概述","text":"掌握垂径定理、圆周角定理与切线的判定性质，会计算弧长与扇形面积。"},{"type":"h","text":"先认清圆里的元素"},{"type":"p","text":"圆里最要紧的是三条线：连接圆心与圆上任意一点的线段是半径，同圆的半径都相等；经过圆心的弦是直径，它是圆中最长的弦；不经过圆心的弦都比直径短。圆上两点之间的部分叫弧，图中的弧 DE 就是弦 DE 所对的弧。把这些元素认清了，题目里的条件才能翻译成「哪条线段等于哪条」。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-yuan-s1","title":"圆的半径、直径、弦与弧","caption":"半径 OA、直径 BC、弦 DE 与它所对的弧 DE","view":"square","alt":"一个圆，圆心 O 用圆点标出，半径 OA 连到圆上；BC 是经过圆心的直径，DE 是不经过圆心的弦，弦 DE 所对的弧用同色弧线标出，说明半径、直径、弦与弧的区别，其中直径是最长的弦。","prims":[{"t":"circle","cx":50,"cy":50,"r":32,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":72.6,"y1":27.4,"x2":27.4,"y2":72.6,"width":0.7},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":50,"x2":22.3,"y2":34,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":21.2,"y1":64,"x2":78.8,"y2":64,"width":0.7},{"t":"arc","cx":50,"cy":50,"r":32,"from":205.9,"to":334.1,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":50,"label":"O","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":22.3,"y":34,"label":"A","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":-1},{"t":"dot","x":72.6,"y":27.4,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-2},{"t":"dot","x":27.4,"y":72.6,"label":"C","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":21.2,"y":64,"label":"D","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":78.8,"y":64,"label":"E","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":78,"text":"弧 DE","size":3.2,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":95,"text":"半径 OA、直径 BC（过圆心）、弦 DE、弧 DE","size":3.1,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"直径是弦，但弦不一定是直径；说「弦 AB」时不要默认它经过圆心。"},{"type":"h","text":"见弦就作弦心距"},{"type":"p","text":"遇到弦先作弦心距：过圆心 O 作 OC⊥ AB 于 C。这样做的道理是，垂直一旦作出，直角三角形就出现了——由垂径定理得 AC=CB=(1)/(2)AB，于是 OA²=OC²+AC²。半径 OA、弦心距 OC、半弦 AC 三个量知道两个就能求第三个，这是圆里算弦长、算半径、算距离的通用套路。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-yuan-s2","title":"垂径定理：垂直于弦的直径平分弦","caption":"OC⊥AB 于 C，则 AC=CB","view":"square","alt":"圆 O 中，弦 AB 与过圆心 O 的半径 OC 垂直，垂足为 C，图中在 C 处标出直角，并用短竖线标出 AC 与 CB 相等；连接 OA 得到直角三角形，半径的平方等于弦心距的平方加半弦的平方。","prims":[{"t":"circle","cx":50,"cy":48,"r":30,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":27.6,"y1":68,"x2":72.4,"y2":68,"width":0.7},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":48,"x2":50,"y2":68,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":48,"x2":72.4,"y2":68,"dashed":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":68,"from":0,"to":90,"r":6,"right":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":39,"y1":66.4,"x2":39,"y2":69.6,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":61,"y1":66.4,"x2":61,"y2":69.6,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":48,"label":"O","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":-2},{"t":"dot","x":27.6,"y":68,"label":"A","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":72.4,"y":68,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":68,"label":"C","labelDx":-1,"labelDy":5},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":93,"text":"OC⊥AB 且 AC=CB（垂径定理）","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"推论「平分弦的直径垂直于弦」中，被平分的弦不能是直径——两条直径互相平分，却不一定垂直。"},{"type":"h","text":"抓住圆心角与圆周角的关系"},{"type":"p","text":"同一条弧，从圆心看是圆心角，从圆上看是圆周角：∠ BAC=(1)/(2)∠ BOC，圆周角永远是圆心角的一半，这个「一半」由等腰三角形的外角关系推出。两条推论最常考：同弧（或等弧）所对的圆周角相等；半圆所对的圆周角是直角，反过来 90^° 的圆周角所对的弦是直径。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-yuan-s3","title":"同弧所对的圆周角是圆心角的一半","caption":"∠BAC 与 ∠BOC 对着同一条弧 BC","view":"square","alt":"圆 O 中，B、C 两点在圆上，圆心角 ∠BOC 等于 120 度；点 A 在优弧上，圆周角 ∠BAC 的两边分别经过 B 和 C，等于 60 度，说明同弧所对的圆周角是圆心角的一半。","prims":[{"t":"circle","cx":50,"cy":50,"r":30,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":20,"x2":24,"y2":65},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":20,"x2":76,"y2":65},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":50,"x2":24,"y2":65,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":50,"x2":76,"y2":65,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"arc","cx":50,"cy":50,"r":9,"from":210,"to":330,"tone":"accent","arrow":true},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":63,"text":"120°","size":3.4,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":20,"from":-120,"to":-60,"r":12,"label":"60°","tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":50,"label":"O","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":4.5},{"t":"dot","x":24,"y":65,"label":"B","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":76,"y":65,"label":"C","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":20,"label":"A","labelDx":2,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":94,"text":"同弧所对的圆周角等于圆心角的一半","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"用这条定理的前提是角的顶点在圆上、两边都与圆相交；顶点在圆内或圆外的角不是圆周角。"},{"type":"h","text":"切线靠「连半径」打开"},{"type":"p","text":"直线与圆相切，本质是「圆心到直线的距离等于半径」，而圆里最好用的写法是连半径：连接 OT，只要证出 OT⊥ l，且 T 是半径 OT 的外端，l 就是圆的切线（判定）；反过来已知 l 是切线，也能立刻得到 OT⊥ l（性质）。所以切线问题几乎都从「连半径」这一步开始，要么连出垂直去证，要么连出垂直去算。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-yuan-s4","title":"连半径，证垂直，得切线","caption":"OT 是半径，l 过 T 且垂直于 OT，所以 l 是切线","view":"square","alt":"圆 O 中 OT 是半径，直线 l 经过半径的外端点 T 并且与 OT 垂直，图中在 T 处标出直角，直线 l 与圆只相交于 T 一点，所以 l 是圆 O 的切线；反过来已知 l 是切线也可以得到 OT 垂直于 l。","prims":[{"t":"circle","cx":46,"cy":50,"r":26,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":72,"y1":82,"x2":72,"y2":18,"width":0.7,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":46,"y1":50,"x2":72,"y2":50,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":72,"y":50,"from":90,"to":180,"r":6,"right":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":46,"y":50,"label":"O","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":-2},{"t":"dot","x":72,"y":50,"label":"T","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":93,"text":"l 经过半径外端 T 且 l⊥OT → l 是切线","size":3.1,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"「经过半径的外端」与「垂直于这条半径」缺一不可：只垂直于半径的直线可能与圆相离。"},{"type":"h","text":"核心概念"},{"type":"p","text":"圆的基本概念：在平面内，线段 OA 绕它固定的一个端点 O 旋转一周，另一个端点 A 所形成的图形叫圆，点 O 是圆心，线段 OA 是半径。圆上任意两点间的部分叫弧，连接圆上任意两点的线段叫弦，经过圆心的弦叫直径（圆中最长的弦）。在同圆或等圆中能够互相重合的弧叫等弧。"},{"type":"p","text":"垂径定理（性质）：垂直于弦的直径平分这条弦，并且平分弦所对的两条弧。推论：平分弦（不是直径）的直径垂直于这条弦，并且平分弦所对的两条弧。推论必须先排除「这条弦是直径」的情形，否则结论不成立。垂径定理用于由「垂直」推「平分」。"},{"type":"p","text":"圆心角、弧、弦的关系：在同圆或等圆中，相等的圆心角所对的弧相等、所对的弦相等；反过来，两条弧相等或两条弦相等，则它们所对的圆心角也相等。这条定理的前提「在同圆或等圆中」不能丢，半径不同的圆中弧相等与圆心角相等没有必然联系。"},{"type":"p","text":"圆周角定理及其推论：一条弧所对的圆周角等于它所对的圆心角的一半。推论：同弧或等弧所对的圆周角相等；半圆（或直径）所对的圆周角是直角；90^° 的圆周角所对的弦是直径。使用的前提是角的顶点在圆上，且角的两边都与圆相交。"},{"type":"p","text":"圆内接四边形：四个顶点都在同一个圆上的四边形叫圆内接四边形。性质：圆内接四边形的对角互补，并且任何一个外角都等于与它不相邻的内角。前提是四边形的四个顶点都在圆上，否则不能使用。"},{"type":"p","text":"切线的判定与性质：判定：经过半径的外端并且垂直于这条半径的直线是圆的切线，「经过半径外端」与「垂直于半径」两个条件缺一不可。性质：圆的切线垂直于过切点的半径。证明切线通常写作「连半径，证垂直」；已知切线时「连半径，得垂直」。"},{"type":"p","text":"切线长定理：从圆外一点引圆的两条切线，它们的切线长相等，并且这一点与圆心的连线平分两条切线的夹角。这是由两个全等的直角三角形（共用斜边、一条直角边相等，用 HL 判定）得到的结论。"},{"type":"p","text":"三角形与圆、正多边形与圆：不在同一条直线上的三个点确定一个圆，这个圆叫三角形的外接圆，圆心（外心）是三边垂直平分线的交点；与三角形三边都相切的圆叫内切圆，圆心（内心）是三条角平分线的交点。正多边形的外接圆与内切圆同心，半径、边心距与半条边构成直角三角形，可用勾股定理计算。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"垂径定理及其推论的计算\n高频填空与解答：见弦作弦心距，用 r²=d²+((a)/(2))² 与勾股定理知二求一；注意弦所对的弧有劣弧、优弧两类，求弓形高要分类讨论，防止漏解。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"圆周角定理与圆内接四边形综合求角\n常与等腰三角形结合：连半径得等腰，用「同弧所对圆周角相等」「直径所对圆周角是直角」搭桥；圆内接四边形对角互补也是求角的重要依据，书写时注明所用定理。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"切线的判定与性质\n解答必考：证切线「连半径，证垂直」，垂直常由等腰三角形顶角、平行线转移或已知直角得到；已知切线则「连半径，得垂直」，再结合勾股、相似或三角函数求线段。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"弧长、扇形面积与圆锥侧面展开\n先找圆心角与半径：不规则阴影用「整体减部分」或割补转化；圆锥问题抓住「底面周长等于展开扇形弧长」，用勾股定理联系半径、高与母线，再套 π rl 求侧面积。"},{"type":"table","title":"公式与定理","head":["公式/定理","表述","注意"],"rows":[["垂径定理中的数量关系","r²=d²+((a)/(2))²","r 是半径，d 是圆心到弦的距离（弦心距），a 是弦长；三个量知二求一"],["圆周角定理","∠ BAC=(1)/(2)∠ BOC","∠ BAC 与 ∠ BOC 所对的弧都是弧 BC；圆周角的顶点必须在圆上，且两边都与圆相交。推论：同弧或等弧所对的圆周角相等"],["直径所对的圆周角是直角","若 AB 是 O 的直径，点 C 在 O 上，则 ∠ ACB=90^°。","逆命题也成立：90^° 的圆周角所对的弦是直径"],["圆内接四边形的对角互补","∠ A+∠ C=180^°","前提是四边形的四个顶点都在同一个圆上；还可得到「外角等于与它不相邻的内角」"],["弧长公式","l=(nπ r)/(180)","n 是圆心角的度数（不带单位），r 是半径；结果单位与半径的单位相同"],["扇形面积公式","S=(nπ r²)/(360)=(1)/(2)lr","n 是圆心角的度数，l 是弧长；两个公式等价，已知弧长时用第二个更省事。拓展：圆锥的侧面积 S=π rl，其中 l 为母线长"]]},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"O 的半径是 13，弦 AB=24，求圆心 O 到弦 AB 的距离，并求该弦所对的劣弧一侧的弓形高。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-yuan-e1","title":"半径、弦心距与弓形高","caption":"弦 AB=24，半径 OA=13，则弦心距 OC=5，弓形高 CD=8","view":"square","alt":"圆 O 中弦 AB 长 24，过圆心 O 作 OC 垂直于 AB 于 C，连接 OA 得直角三角形，图中在 C 处标出直角；由垂径定理得 AC 等于 12，于是 OC 等于 5，也就是弦心距；再延长 OC 交劣弧于 D，CD 就是弓形高，等于半径 13 减去 5 得 8。","prims":[{"t":"circle","cx":50,"cy":46,"r":26,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":26,"y1":56,"x2":74,"y2":56,"width":0.7},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":46,"x2":50,"y2":56,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":56,"x2":50,"y2":72,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":46,"x2":26,"y2":56,"dashed":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":56,"from":0,"to":90,"r":6,"right":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":46,"label":"O","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":-3.5},{"t":"dot","x":26,"y":56,"label":"A","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":74,"y":56,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":56,"label":"C","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":4.6},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":72,"label":"D","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":2.5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":93,"text":"OA=13，AC=12，OC=5，弓形高 CD=8","size":3.3,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["过点 O 作 OC⊥ AB 于点 C，连接 OA。由垂径定理，OC 平分弦 AB，所以 AC=(1)/(2)AB=(1)/(2)× 24=12（垂直于弦的直径平分弦）。","在 Rt△ OAC 中，OA=13，由勾股定理得 OC=√(OA²-AC²)=√(13²-12²)=√(25)=5，即圆心到弦的距离是 5。","弓形的高是半径减去圆心到弦的距离：13-5=8。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：圆心到弦 AB 的距离是 5，弓形的高是 8。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"见弦作弦心距是通用方法：作垂线后由垂径定理得到「弦的一半」，再在直角三角形中用勾股定理求半径、弦心距或弦长。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"AB 是 O 的直径，点 C 在 O 上，∠ BAC=30^°，AB=10，求 BC 与 AC 的长。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-yuan-e2","title":"直径所对的圆周角是直角","caption":"AB 为直径，∠ACB=90°，∠A=30°，则 BC=5、AC=5√3","view":"square","alt":"圆 O 中以 AB 为直径，点 C 在圆上，图中在 C 处用方框标出直角，在 A 处标出 30 度角；因为直径所对的圆周角是直角，所以三角形 ABC 是直角三角形，斜边 AB 等于 10，30 度角所对的直角边 BC 等于 5，另一条直角边 AC 等于 5 倍根号 3。","prims":[{"t":"circle","cx":50,"cy":50,"r":25,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":25,"y1":50,"x2":75,"y2":50,"width":0.7},{"t":"line","x1":25,"y1":50,"x2":62.5,"y2":28.4},{"t":"line","x1":75,"y1":50,"x2":62.5,"y2":28.4},{"t":"angle","x":25,"y":50,"from":0,"to":30,"r":9,"label":"30°","tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":62.5,"y":28.4,"from":-150,"to":-60,"r":7,"right":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":50,"label":"O","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"dot","x":25,"y":50,"label":"A","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":75,"y":50,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":62.5,"y":28.4,"label":"C","labelDx":2,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"text","x":54,"y":48,"text":"AC=5√3","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":85,"y":54,"text":"BC=5","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":93,"text":"AB 是直径，所以 ∠ACB=90°","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["因为 AB 是直径，点 C 在圆上，所以 ∠ ACB=90^°（直径所对的圆周角是直角）。","在 Rt△ ABC 中，∠ A=30^°，AB=10 是斜边，所以 BC=(1)/(2)AB=5（30^° 角所对的直角边等于斜边的一半）。","由勾股定理得 AC=√(AB²-BC²)=√(10²-5²)=√(75)=5√(3)。","用圆周角定理检验：∠ BOC=2∠ BAC=60^°，而 OB=OC，所以 △ OBC 是等边三角形，BC=OB=5，与上面结果一致。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：BC=5，AC=5√(3)。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"见直径想直角，是圆与三角形结合的通用入口；再由圆周角定理可得圆心角是圆周角的 2 倍，常用于发现等边三角形。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"AB 是 O 的直径，点 C 在 O 上，过点 C 的直线 CD 满足 ∠ DCA=∠ CBA，求证 CD 是 O 的切线。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-yuan-e3","title":"连半径证切线","caption":"∠DCA=∠CBA=45°，连 OC 得 OC⊥CD，故 CD 是切线","view":"square","alt":"圆 O 中 AB 是直径，点 C 在圆上，过 C 的直线 CD 与圆相切；连接半径 OC 后在 C 处标出直角，说明 CD 垂直于半径 OC，且 C 是半径的外端；图中还分别标出 ∠DCA 与 ∠CBA 都等于 45 度，它们是等量代换得到这一直角的关键。","prims":[{"t":"circle","cx":50,"cy":50,"r":25,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":25,"y1":50,"x2":75,"y2":50,"width":0.7},{"t":"line","x1":25,"y1":50,"x2":50,"y2":25},{"t":"line","x1":75,"y1":50,"x2":50,"y2":25},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":50,"x2":50,"y2":25,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":14,"y1":25,"x2":88,"y2":25,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":25,"from":180,"to":270,"r":8,"right":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":25,"from":180,"to":225,"r":11,"label":"45°","tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":75,"y":50,"from":135,"to":180,"r":11,"label":"45°","tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":50,"label":"O","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"dot","x":25,"y":50,"label":"A","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":75,"y":50,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":25,"label":"C","labelDx":2,"labelDy":-2.5,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":16,"y":25,"label":"D","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":-2},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":92,"text":"连 OC：∠DCA=∠OCB=45°，得 OC⊥CD","size":3.3,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["连接 OC。因为 AB 是直径，所以 ∠ ACB=90^°（直径所对的圆周角是直角），于是 ∠ ACO+∠ OCB=90^°。","因为 OB=OC（同圆的半径相等），所以 ∠ OCB=∠ CBA（等边对等角）。","由已知 ∠ DCA=∠ CBA，得 ∠ DCA=∠ OCB（等量代换）。","所以 ∠ DCO=∠ DCA+∠ ACO=∠ OCB+∠ ACO=90^°，即 OC⊥ CD。又 C 是半径 OC 的外端，所以 CD 是 O 的切线（经过半径的外端并且垂直于这条半径的直线是圆的切线）。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：CD 是 O 的切线。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"证切线的标准三步：连半径、证垂直、下结论；垂直关系常靠「同圆半径相等得等腰」与「直径所对的圆周角是直角」来搭桥。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"如图意，PA、PB 是 O 的两条切线，A、B 为切点，且 ∠ APB=50^°。求 ∠ AOB 的度数，并求弦 AB 所对的圆周角的度数。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-yuan-e4","title":"两条切线与圆心角","caption":"PA、PB 切于 A、B，∠APB=50°，则 ∠AOB=130°","view":"square","alt":"圆 O 外一点 P 向圆引两条切线 PA、PB，切点分别是 A、B；图中在 A、B 处各用方框标出直角，说明半径垂直于切线，在 P 处标出 ∠APB 等于 50 度，在圆心 O 处标出 ∠AOB 等于 130 度，并用虚线画出弦 AB。","prims":[{"t":"circle","cx":50,"cy":34,"r":18,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":76.6,"x2":66.3,"y2":41.6},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":76.6,"x2":33.7,"y2":41.6},{"t":"line","x1":66.3,"y1":41.6,"x2":33.7,"y2":41.6,"dashed":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":66.3,"y":41.6,"from":155,"to":245,"r":5.5,"right":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":33.7,"y":41.6,"from":-65,"to":25,"r":5.5,"right":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":76.6,"from":65,"to":115,"r":14,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":59.2,"text":"50°","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":34,"from":-155,"to":-25,"r":7.5,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":38,"text":"130°","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":34,"label":"O","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"dot","x":66.3,"y":41.6,"label":"A","labelDx":3,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":33.7,"y":41.6,"label":"B","labelDx":-7.5,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":76.6,"label":"P","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":3},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":92,"text":"∠AOB=130°，弦 AB 所对圆周角 65° 或 115°","size":3.2,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["连接 OA、OB。因为 PA、PB 是切线，所以 OA⊥ PA，OB⊥ PB（切线的性质：圆的切线垂直于过切点的半径），即 ∠ OAP=∠ OBP=90^°。","在四边形 AOBP 中，内角和为 360^°，所以 ∠ AOB=360^°-90^°-90^°-50^°=130^°。","弦 AB 把圆分成两段弧，所对的圆周角要分类：顶点在优弧上的圆周角所对的是劣弧 AB，劣弧度数等于圆心角 130^°，所以这个圆周角为 (1)/(2)× 130^°=65^°。","顶点在劣弧上的圆周角所对的是优弧，优弧度数为 360^°-130^°=230^°，所对圆周角为 115^°；也可以由「圆内接四边形对角互补」直接得 180^°-65^°=115^°。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：∠ AOB=130^°；弦 AB 所对的圆周角为 65^° 或 115^°。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"切线问题先连过切点的半径；「一条弦所对的圆周角」要按顶点在优弧还是劣弧分类，两解恰好互补，只答一个就是漏解。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"一个圆锥的底面半径为 3，高为 4，求它的侧面积与侧面展开图（扇形）的圆心角。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-yuan-e5","title":"圆锥的侧面展开图","caption":"母线 l=5，展开扇形半径 5、圆心角 216°","view":"square","alt":"左边是底面半径 3、高 4、母线 5 的圆锥；右边是它的侧面展开图，是一个半径等于母线长 5 的扇形，扇形的弧长等于底面圆的周长，算得圆心角为 216 度，中间的箭头表示把圆锥的侧面沿一条母线剪开摊平成扇形的过程。","prims":[{"t":"solid","x":24,"y":68,"kind":"cone","w":32,"h":40,"tone":"main"},{"t":"sector","cx":72,"cy":74,"r":25,"from":0,"to":216,"fill":true,"tone":"accent","label":"216°"},{"t":"arrow","x1":36,"y1":30,"x2":58,"y2":30,"tone":"muted","label":"展开"},{"t":"text","x":24,"y":88,"text":"r=3，h=4，母线 5","size":3.3,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":72,"y":95,"text":"扇形半径 5，圆心角 216°","size":3.2,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["设母线长为 l。半径、高、母线构成直角三角形，由勾股定理得 l=√(r²+h²)=√(3²+4²)=5。","圆锥的侧面展开图是扇形，扇形半径是母线 l=5，扇形弧长等于底面圆的周长 2π r=6π（这是圆锥计算中最关键的对应关系）。","侧面积 S_(侧)=π rl=π× 3× 5=15π（也可以用 S=(1)/(2)lr=(1)/(2)× 6π× 5=15π 验证）。","设展开图圆心角为 n^°，由弧长公式 (nπ× 5)/(180)=6π，解得 n=216，即圆心角为 216^°。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：侧面积为 15π，侧面展开图的圆心角为 216^°。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"圆锥计算的三把钥匙：勾股定理联系半径、高与母线；底面周长等于展开扇形的弧长；侧面积的两个公式 π rl 与 (1)/(2)lr 可以互相检验。"},{"type":"list","title":"易错点","items":["圆周角定理要求顶点在圆上、两边都与圆相交；顶点在圆内或圆外的角不是圆周角，不能套用这条定理。","「同弧或等弧所对的圆周角相等」中的「同弧或等弧」是前提，随便取两个圆周角不一定相等。","垂径定理的推论「平分弦的直径垂直于弦」中，被平分的弦不能是直径——两条直径互相平分但不一定垂直。","切线的判定必须同时满足「经过半径的外端」和「垂直于这条半径」；只说垂直于半径的直线可能平行于该半径所在的直径而与圆不相交。","一条弦所对的圆周角有两类：顶点在优弧上与顶点在劣弧上，它们互补，求角时要按题目条件分类讨论。","弧长公式与扇形面积公式中的 $n$ 是圆心角的度数而不是弧度；扇形面积的另一个表达式中 $l$ 是弧长，不要与角的度数混淆。"]},{"type":"list","title":"解题方法","items":["见弦就作弦心距（过圆心作弦的垂线），用垂径定理得「弦的一半」，再在直角三角形中用勾股定理。","证切线「连半径，证垂直」；已知切线则「连半径，得垂直」，切线问题几乎都从这条思路打开。","见直径想直角（直径所对的圆周角是 90^°），见 90^° 的圆周角想直径。","求弦长、半径、弦心距三个量时统一用「半径的平方等于弦心距的平方加半弦的平方」，知二求一。","求弧长与扇形面积先找圆心角与半径；圆内接四边形、正多边形问题优先连半径，把问题转化为圆心角与圆周角。"]}],"questions":[{"id":"m-geo-yuan-q1","type":"choice","stem":"O 的半径是 5，弦 AB=8，则圆心 O 到弦 AB 的距离是","answer":"B","explain":"过点 O 作 OC⊥ AB 于点 C，由垂径定理得 AC=(1)/(2)AB=4。在 Rt△ OAC 中，OC=√(OA²-AC²)=√(5²-4²)=3。","options":["2","3","4","√(41)"],"difficulty":1,"tags":["垂径定理","勾股定理"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-yuan-q1","title":"圆心到弦的距离","caption":"半径 OA=5、弦 AB=8；过 O 作 OC⊥AB 于 C，由垂径定理得 AC=4，在直角三角形 OAC 中求 OC","view":"wide","alt":"圆 O 中有一条弦 AB，从圆心 O 向弦 AB 作垂线，垂足为 C；半径 OA 标注为 5，弦 AB 标注为 8，OC 待求。","prims":[{"t":"circle","cx":50,"cy":30,"r":26,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":29.2,"y1":45.6,"x2":70.8,"y2":45.6,"width":0.8},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":30,"x2":50,"y2":45.6,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":30,"x2":29.2,"y2":45.6,"dashed":true},{"t":"line","x1":46,"y1":45.6,"x2":46,"y2":41.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":46,"y1":41.6,"x2":50,"y2":41.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":35,"y":34,"text":"OA = 5","anchor":"end","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":55,"text":"AB = 8","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":53,"y":39,"text":"OC = ?","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":30,"label":"O","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":29.2,"y":45.6,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":70.8,"y":45.6,"label":"B","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":45.6,"label":"C","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":2.6}]}},{"id":"m-geo-yuan-q2","type":"choice","stem":"AB 是 O 的直径，点 C、D 都在 O 上且位于 AB 的同侧，∠ BAC=40^°，则 ∠ BDC 的度数是","answer":"A","explain":"∠ BAC 与 ∠ BDC 的顶点都在圆上、两边都与圆相交，且所对的弧都是弧 BC，由「同弧所对的圆周角相等」得 ∠ BDC=∠ BAC=40^°。用圆周角定理检验：∠ BOC=2× 40^°=80^°，而 ∠ BDC=(1)/(2)∠ BOC=40^°，结果一致。","options":["40^°","50^°","80^°","100^°"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["圆周角定理","同弧所对的圆周角"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-yuan-q2","title":"同弧所对的圆周角相等","caption":"AB 是直径，C、D 在 AB 同侧的圆上：∠BAC 与 ∠BDC 对的是同一条弧 BC，所以两角相等","view":"wide","alt":"圆 O 中 AB 是直径，点 C 与点 D 在 AB 同侧的圆上；连接 AC、BD、CD，角 BAC 标为 40 度，角 BDC 待求。","prims":[{"t":"circle","cx":50,"cy":32,"r":26,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":24,"y1":32,"x2":76,"y2":32,"width":0.8},{"t":"line","x1":24,"y1":32,"x2":54.5,"y2":6.4,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":27.5,"y1":19,"x2":76,"y2":32,"width":0.7},{"t":"line","x1":27.5,"y1":19,"x2":54.5,"y2":6.4,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":24,"y":32,"from":0,"to":40.01,"r":9,"tone":"ok","label":"40°"},{"t":"angle","x":27.5,"y":19,"from":-15,"to":25.02,"r":8,"tone":"danger","label":"?"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":32,"label":"O","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":2.6},{"t":"dot","x":24,"y":32,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":76,"y":32,"label":"B","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":54.5,"y":6.4,"label":"C","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":27.5,"y":19,"label":"D","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8}]}},{"id":"m-geo-yuan-q3","type":"choice","stem":"下列说法中正确的是","answer":"C","explain":"经过同一条直线上的三点不能作圆，A 错；「平分弦的直径垂直于弦」要求被平分的弦不是直径，B 缺少这个条件；C 正是切线的判定定理，正确；切线长相等需要「从圆外同一点引两条切线」这个前提，D 缺前提，说法不成立。","options":["经过任意三点一定可以作一个圆","平分弦的直径一定垂直于这条弦","经过半径的外端并且垂直于这条半径的直线是圆的切线","同圆的两条切线长一定相等"],"difficulty":3,"tags":["切线的判定","垂径定理条件","条件辨析"]},{"id":"m-geo-yuan-q4","type":"fill","stem":"半径为 6 的圆中，圆心角为 120^° 的扇形面积是 ____π。（只填数字系数，如结果是 5π 就填 5）","answer":"12","explain":"由扇形面积公式 S=(nπ r²)/(360)=(120π× 6²)/(360)=(120π× 36)/(360)=12π，所以系数是 12。也可以用弧长公式算出 l=(120π× 6)/(180)=4π，再由 S=(1)/(2)lr=(1)/(2)× 4π× 6=12π 验证。","difficulty":2,"tags":["扇形面积","弧长公式"]},{"id":"m-geo-yuan-q5","type":"fill","stem":"从 O 外一点 P 引 O 的两条切线，切点分别是 A、B，若 PA=5，则 PB= ____。（只填数字）","answer":"5","explain":"由切线长定理，从圆外一点引圆的两条切线，它们的切线长相等，所以 PB=PA=5。这一结论也可由 Rt△ OAP△ OBP（OA=OB，OP 公共，HL）得到。","difficulty":1,"tags":["切线长定理"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-yuan-q5","title":"从圆外一点引两条切线","caption":"PA、PB 是从点 P 引的两条切线（A、B 是切点）：两条切线长相等，PA=PB","view":"wide","alt":"圆 O 外一点 P 向圆引两条切线，切点分别是 A 与 B；OA、OB 是半径，A、B 处画有直角方框，PA 与 PB 画有相同的等长记号，PA 标为 5。","prims":[{"t":"circle","cx":46,"cy":34,"r":20,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":46,"y1":34,"x2":64.2,"y2":25.7,"width":0.7},{"t":"line","x1":46,"y1":34,"x2":64.2,"y2":42.3,"width":0.7},{"t":"line","x1":94,"y1":34,"x2":64.2,"y2":25.7,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":94,"y1":34,"x2":64.2,"y2":42.3,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":46,"y1":34,"x2":94,"y2":34,"tone":"muted","dashed":true},{"t":"line","x1":60.56,"y1":27.36,"x2":64.41,"y2":28.43,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":64.41,"y1":28.43,"x2":68.05,"y2":26.77,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":60.56,"y1":40.64,"x2":64.41,"y2":39.57,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":64.41,"y1":39.57,"x2":68.05,"y2":41.23,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":78.7,"y1":31.29,"x2":79.5,"y2":28.41,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":79.5,"y1":39.59,"x2":78.7,"y2":36.71,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"text","x":83,"y":25,"text":"PA = 5","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":83,"y":45,"text":"PB = ?","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"dot","x":46,"y":34,"label":"O","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":94,"y":34,"label":"P","labelDx":2.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":64.2,"y":25.7,"label":"A","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":64.2,"y":42.3,"label":"B","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":2.6}]}},{"id":"m-geo-yuan-q6","type":"short","stem":"请说明使用圆周角定理需要满足哪些条件，并解释「一条弦所对的圆周角」为什么可能有两个不同的答案。","answer":"圆周角定理：一条弧所对的圆周角等于它所对的圆心角的一半。使用它的条件有两条：一是角的顶点必须在圆上；二是角的两边都必须与圆相交（这样才能确定它所对的弧）。只有满足这两条，才是圆周角，才能用定理把圆周角与圆心角联系起来。另外，「同弧或等弧所对的圆周角相等」也有前提，必须是同一条弧或两条相等的弧。之所以「一条弦所对的圆周角」可能有两类答案，是因为一条弦（如弦 $BC$）把圆分成优弧 $BC$ 和劣弧 $BC$ 两部分：顶点在优弧上的圆周角都相等，顶点在劣弧上的圆周角也都相等，但这两组值不同，它们互为补角（两组之和为 $180^\\circ$）。所以当题目只说「弦 $BC$ 所对的圆周角」时，必须结合图形或条件判断顶点在哪一段弧上；如果两种位置都可能，就要分类讨论，写出两个答案。","explain":"本题考查圆周角定理的使用条件与分类讨论意识。评分要点：写出定理内容并说明条件（顶点在圆上、两边都与圆相交）；指出「同弧或等弧」是圆周角相等的前提；分析一条弦把圆分成优弧与劣弧，说明两类圆周角互不相等且互补，因而需要分类讨论。常见失分点：忽略「顶点在圆上」，把圆内的角当作圆周角；漏掉「同弧或等弧」的限制；只给出一个角度而不说明顶点位于哪段弧上，答案不完整。","difficulty":3,"tags":["圆周角定理","分类讨论","条件"],"rubric":["写出圆周角定理的内容","说明条件：顶点在圆上、两边都与圆相交","指出「同弧或等弧」是圆周角相等的前提","说明一条弦把圆分成优弧与劣弧，圆周角分两类","指出这两类圆周角互补，求角时需分类讨论"]},{"id":"m-geo-yuan-z1","type":"choice","stem":"点 A、B、C、D 都在 O 上，圆心角 ∠ AOB=100^°，点 C 在劣弧 AB 上（不与 A、B 重合），点 D 在优弧 AB 上，则 ∠ ACB 的度数是","answer":"D","explain":"圆周角 ∠ ADB 与圆心角 ∠ AOB 对同一条劣弧 AB，所以 ∠ ADB=(1)/(2)× 100^°=50^°。四边形 ACBD 的四个顶点都在圆上，是圆内接四边形，∠ ACB 与 ∠ ADB 是一组对角，由对角互补得 ∠ ACB=180^°-50^°=130^°。也可以直接算：∠ ACB 所对的优弧度数为 360^°-100^°=260^°，圆周角为 130^°。选 B 是忽略 C、D 分居两段弧上，把对角误当成同弧圆周角。","options":["40^°","50^°","65^°","130^°"],"difficulty":3,"tags":["圆周角定理","分类讨论"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-yuan-z1","title":"点 C 在劣弧上、点 D 在优弧上","caption":"圆心角 ∠AOB=100°，D 在优弧 AB 上得 ∠ADB=50°；C 在劣弧 AB 上，∠ACB 与 ∠ADB 是圆内接四边形 ACBD 的对角，互补，所以 ∠ACB=130°","view":"wide","alt":"圆 O 上有 A、B、C、D 四点：圆心角 AOB 标为 100 度，C 在劣弧 AB 上、D 在优弧 AB 上；角 ADB 标为 50 度，角 ACB 标为 130 度。","prims":[{"t":"circle","cx":50,"cy":32,"r":26,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":32,"x2":30.1,"y2":15.3,"width":0.7},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":32,"x2":69.9,"y2":15.3,"width":0.7},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":6,"x2":30.1,"y2":15.3,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":6,"x2":69.9,"y2":15.3,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":41.1,"y1":56.4,"x2":30.1,"y2":15.3,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":41.1,"y1":56.4,"x2":69.9,"y2":15.3,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":32,"from":140,"to":40,"r":9,"tone":"accent","label":"100°"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":6,"from":-154.95,"to":-25.05,"r":10,"tone":"ok","label":"130°"},{"t":"angle","x":41.1,"y":56.4,"from":104.98,"to":54.98,"r":9,"tone":"muted","label":"50°"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":32,"label":"O","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":4.6},{"t":"dot","x":30.1,"y":15.3,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":69.9,"y":15.3,"label":"B","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":6,"label":"C","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":41.1,"y":56.4,"label":"D","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4}]}},{"id":"m-geo-yuan-z2","type":"short","stem":"已知：在 △ ABC 中，AB=AC，以 AB 为直径作 O，O 交 BC 边于点 D（D 与 B 不重合），过点 D 作 DE⊥ AC，垂足为 E。求证：DE 是 O 的切线。","answer":"连接 $OD$。因为 $OB=OD$（同圆的半径相等），所以 $\\angle ODB=\\angle OBD$（等边对等角）。因为 $AB=AC$，所以 $\\angle C=\\angle B$（等边对等角）。于是 $\\angle ODB=\\angle C$，所以 $OD\\parallel AC$（同位角相等，两直线平行）。因为 $DE\\perp AC$，所以 $\\angle DEC=90^\\circ$。由 $OD\\parallel AC$ 得 $\\angle ODE=\\angle DEC=90^\\circ$（两直线平行，同位角相等），即 $OD\\perp DE$。又点 $D$ 在 $\\odot O$ 上，$OD$ 是半径，即 $DE$ 经过半径 $OD$ 的外端且垂直于 $OD$，所以 $DE$ 是 $\\odot O$ 的切线（切线的判定定理）。","explain":"本题考查切线的判定与等腰三角形性质的综合。评分要点：连 OD；由 OB=OD 与 AB=AC 得两组等角，推出 ∠ ODB=∠ C，从而 OD∥ AC；由 DE⊥ AC 得 ∠ ODE=90^°；点明「经过半径外端且垂直于这条半径的直线是圆的切线」并下结论。常见失分点：只写 OD⊥ DE 而不说明 D 是半径的外端；把判定依据误写成切线的性质；写平行与垂直时不注明依据（同位角相等，两直线平行）。","difficulty":3,"tags":["切线的判定","等腰三角形"],"rubric":["连接 OD 作辅助线，并用 OB=OD 得等腰三角形","由 AB=AC 得 ∠B=∠C，推出 OD∥AC","由 DE⊥AC 推出 ∠ODE=90°，即 OD⊥DE","说明 D 在圆上且 DE 垂直于过 D 的半径，引用切线判定定理下结论"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-yuan-z2","title":"以 AB 为直径的圆与等腰三角形的边相交","caption":"AB=AC，以 AB 为直径的圆交 BC 于点 D；连接 OD，由 OB=OD 与 AB=AC 得 OD∥AC，再由 DE⊥AC 推出 OD⊥DE，所以 DE 是圆的切线","view":"square","alt":"等腰三角形 ABC，以 AB 为直径的圆经过 A、B 两点并与边 BC 交于点 D；连接 OD，过 D 作 DE 垂直于 AC，垂足为 E。","prims":[{"t":"circle","cx":50,"cy":52,"r":30,"tone":"main"},{"t":"poly","points":[[20,52],[80,52],[54.4,2.9]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":52,"x2":67.2,"y2":27.4,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":67.2,"y1":27.4,"x2":47,"y2":13.5,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":20,"y1":52,"x2":47,"y2":13.5,"tone":"muted","dashed":true},{"t":"line","x1":44.99,"y1":16.37,"x2":47.87,"y2":18.35,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":47.87,"y1":18.35,"x2":49.88,"y2":15.48,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":20,"y":52,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":80,"y":52,"label":"B","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":54.4,"y":2.9,"label":"C","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":0.6},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":52,"label":"O","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":67.2,"y":27.4,"label":"D","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":47,"y":13.5,"label":"E","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8}]}}]},{"id":"m-geo-xiangsi","title":"相似三角形","subtitle":"人教版九下 · 第31章 相似","grade":"9b","tags":["图形与几何","相似"],"blocks":[{"type":"note","title":"教材章节","text":"人教版九下 · 第31章 相似"},{"type":"note","title":"一句话概述","text":"掌握相似三角形的判定与性质，理解相似比与面积比的平方关系，会用相似解决测量问题。"},{"type":"h","text":"先看两个三角形像不像"},{"type":"p","text":"判断相似先看角：三个角分别相等，形状就一样；再看边：三组对应边的比相等，大小才成比例。两个条件同时满足，两个三角形才相似。图中大三角形的每条边都是小三角形对应边的 1.6 倍，三个角也分别相等，所以它们相似。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xiangsi-s1","title":"形状相同、大小成比例的两个三角形","caption":"对应角相等、对应边成比例，才叫相似","view":"square","alt":"左边是较小的三角形 ABC，右边是较大的三角形 A₁B₁C₁，大三角形的每条边都是小三角形对应边的 1.6 倍，三个角分别相等，说明对应角相等且对应边成比例的两个三角形相似。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[12,74],[32,74],[17,54]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"poly","points":[[50,84],[82,84],[58,52]],"closed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":12,"y":74,"label":"A","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":32,"y":74,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":17,"y":54,"label":"C","labelDx":1,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":84,"label":"A₁","labelDx":-7.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":82,"y":84,"label":"B₁","labelDx":2,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":58,"y":52,"label":"C₁","labelDx":2,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":96,"text":"对应角相等、对应边成比例 ⇒ 相似","size":3.3,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"相似只看形状、不看大小；全等是相似比为 1 的特殊情形。"},{"type":"h","text":"抓平行线：A 型相似"},{"type":"p","text":"图里有平行线就找 A 型：DE∥ BC 时，∠ ADE=∠ ABC、∠ AED=∠ ACB（两直线平行，同位角相等），再加上公共角 ∠ A，所以 △ ADE∽△ ABC。对应边成比例写成 (AD)/(AB)=(AE)/(AC)=(DE)/(BC)，分母必须是整条边。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xiangsi-s2","title":"平行线截出的 A 型相似","caption":"DE∥BC ⇒ △ADE∽△ABC","view":"square","alt":"三角形 ABC 中，D 在 AB 上、E 在 AC 上，DE 平行于 BC；由此得到 ∠ADE=∠ABC、∠AED=∠ACB，加上公共角 ∠A，所以三角形 ADE 与三角形 ABC 相似，对应边成比例。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[50,14],[18,84],[86,84]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":35.6,"y1":45.5,"x2":66.2,"y2":45.5,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":14,"label":"A","labelDx":2,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":18,"y":84,"label":"B","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":86,"y":84,"label":"C","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":35.6,"y":45.5,"label":"D","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":66.2,"y":45.5,"label":"E","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":96,"text":"DE∥BC ⇒ △ADE∽△ABC","size":3.5,"anchor":"middle"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"比例式的分母用整条边 AB 而不是 DB；写成 (AD)/(DB) 相似比就错了。"},{"type":"h","text":"建立关系：两种判定最常用"},{"type":"p","text":"常用的判定有两条：两角分别相等的两个三角形相似（AA）；两边成比例且夹角相等的两个三角形相似（SAS）。图中 ∠ A 是公共角，又已知 ∠ ACD=∠ B，两角对应相等，于是 △ ACD∽△ ABC，接着 (AC)/(AB)=(AD)/(AC)，即 AC²=AD· AB。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xiangsi-s3","title":"共角且一角相等的母子型","caption":"∠A=∠A，∠ACD=∠B ⇒ △ACD∽△ABC","view":"square","alt":"三角形 ABC 中，D 在 AB 上，连接 CD；∠A 是公共角，∠ACD 与 ∠B 相等，两角分别相等，所以三角形 ACD 与三角形 ABC 相似，由此可得 AC 的平方等于 AD 乘 AB。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[30,20],[65,80.6],[81.7,38.8]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":81.7,"y1":38.8,"x2":51.65,"y2":57.5,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":30,"y":20,"from":-60,"to":-20,"r":9,"label":"∠A"},{"t":"angle","x":65,"y":80.6,"from":68.2,"to":120,"r":7,"label":"∠B","tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":81.7,"y":38.8,"from":160,"to":211.8,"r":7,"label":"∠ACD","tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":30,"y":20,"label":"A","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":65,"y":80.6,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":81.7,"y":38.8,"label":"C","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-2},{"t":"dot","x":51.65,"y":57.5,"label":"D","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":96,"text":"∠A=∠A，∠ACD=∠B ⇒ △ACD∽△ABC","size":3.1,"anchor":"middle"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"SAS 判定里那个相等的角必须是两条对应边的夹角，「两边一对角」不能判定相似。"},{"type":"h","text":"换情境：相似比与面积比"},{"type":"p","text":"把两个相似三角形的相似比记为 k，周长比就是 k；但面积是「长乘长」，两个方向都放大 k 倍，所以面积比是 k²。图中两个三角形的相似比是 1:2，面积比就是 1:4。把面积比直接当相似比用，是最常见的错误。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xiangsi-s4","title":"相似比 1:2 对应面积比 1:4","caption":"对应边之比为 k，面积之比为 k²","view":"square","alt":"两个相似的直角三角形，大的直角边是小的 2 倍，即相似比为 1:2；小三角形内标 S，大三角形内标 4S，说明相似三角形的面积比等于相似比的平方，相似比 1:2 时面积比是 1:4。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[14,74],[34,74],[14,54]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"poly","points":[[50,86],[90,86],[50,46]],"closed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":14,"y":74,"from":0,"to":90,"r":6,"right":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":86,"from":0,"to":90,"r":6,"right":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":24,"y":68,"text":"S","size":3.4,"tone":"main"},{"t":"text","x":66,"y":72,"text":"4S","size":3.8,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":14,"y":74,"label":"A","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":34,"y":74,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":14,"y":54,"label":"C","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":-1},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":86,"label":"A₁","labelDx":-7.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":90,"y":86,"label":"B₁","labelDx":2,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":46,"label":"C₁","labelDx":-7.5,"labelDy":-1},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":96,"text":"相似比 1:2 ⇒ 面积比 1:4","size":3.5,"anchor":"middle"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"已知面积比求相似比要先开方：面积比 9:16 对应相似比 3:4，不是 9:16。"},{"type":"h","text":"核心概念"},{"type":"p","text":"相似多边形与相似比：边数相同的两个多边形，如果它们的角分别相等、边成比例，就叫做相似多边形，对应边的比叫相似比。相似比是有顺序的：△ ABC 与 △ DEF 的相似比是 AB:DE，反过来写就是它的倒数。"},{"type":"p","text":"平行线分线段成比例：两条直线被一组平行线所截，所得的对应线段成比例。由此得推论：平行于三角形一边的直线截其他两边（或两边的延长线），所得的对应线段成比例。这里的「对应线段」指的是在截得的各条直线上位置相同的线段，顺序不能颠倒。"},{"type":"p","text":"相似三角形的判定：平行于三角形一边的直线和其他两边相交，所构成的三角形与原三角形相似；三边成比例的两个三角形相似；两边成比例且夹角相等的两个三角形相似；两角分别相等的两个三角形相似。直角三角形还有「斜边和一条直角边成比例」的判定方法。其中「两角分别相等」是解题中用得最多的一条。"},{"type":"p","text":"相似三角形的性质：相似三角形的对应角相等、对应边成比例；对应边上的高、对应边上的中线、对应角的平分线的比都等于相似比；周长的比等于相似比；面积的比等于相似比的平方。性质用于由「相似」推出边、角、周长、面积的比。"},{"type":"p","text":"相似与全等的联系：全等是相似比为 1 的特殊情形。相似判定中的「两角分别相等」对应全等中的 ASA 或 AAS；「三边成比例」对应 SSS；「两边成比例且夹角相等」对应 SAS。与全等一样，两边及其中一边的对角关系不能判定相似。"},{"type":"p","text":"相似三角形的应用（测高测距）：实际测量中把被测物体与测量工具抽象成两个相似三角形，利用对应边成比例求未知长度。同一时刻的太阳光下，物高与影长的比相等（平行投影），是最常用的测高模型；若光源是灯光（中心投影），则不能直接按比例算，需要另外构造相似三角形。"},{"type":"p","text":"位似图形：两个多边形不仅相似，而且对应顶点的连线相交于一点，对应边互相平行（或在同一条直线上），这样的两个图形叫位似图形，这个点叫位似中心。以原点为位似中心、相似比为 k 时，点 (x,y) 的对应点是 (kx,ky)（两个图形在位似中心同侧）或 (-kx,-ky)（异侧）。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"相似三角形的判定与性质综合求线段\n主流解答题：先用「两角分别相等」或「两边成比例且夹角相等」证相似，再按对应边成比例列式；对应顶点必须写在对应位置，比例式分母用整条边，常与正方形、勾股定理结合。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"等积式与线段比例的证明\n把 a²=bc 型等积式先化成比例式，再用「三点定形」找相似三角形；公共角、公共边、直角或平行线是找等角的关键，书写顺序是「先证相似，再写比例，最后化成等积式」。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"相似在测量与实际问题中的应用\n同一时刻阳光下用「物高与影长的比相等」直接列比例；灯光（中心投影）、镜子反射、遮挡估距等情境要自己构造相似三角形，设未知数列方程，并检验解是否符合线段的取值范围。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"面积比的逆用与位似作图\n面积比等于相似比的平方，反用时先开方求相似比；「三角形与四边形」的面积比要先转化成两个三角形的面积比再开方；位似作图注意同侧、异侧两组坐标，防止漏解。"},{"type":"table","title":"公式与定理","head":["公式/定理","表述","注意"],"rows":[["平行型相似的比例式（A 型）","DE∥ BC⇒(AD)/(AB)=(AE)/(AC)=(DE)/(BC)","D 在 AB 上、E 在 AC 上且 DE∥ BC；三条比相等是最常用的比例式，注意分母是整条边"],["相似三角形的判定（两角分别相等）","∠ A=∠ A₁,\\ ∠ B=∠ B₁⇒△ ABC∽△ A₁B₁C₁","两角分别相等即可判定相似，不必再验证边；这是最常用的判定方法"],["相似三角形的对应边成比例","(AB)/(A₁B₁)=(BC)/(B₁C₁)=(CA)/(C₁A₁)=k","k 是相似比；对应顶点必须写在对应位置，否则比例式会写错"],["周长比与面积比","(C₁)/(C₂)=k, (S₁)/(S₂)=k²","周长比等于相似比，面积比等于相似比的平方；把面积比直接当相似比是最常见的错误"],["对应线段的比","(h₁)/(h₂)=(m₁)/(m₂)=(d₁)/(d₂)=k","h、m、d 分别是相似三角形中对应边上的高、对应边上的中线、对应角的平分线，它们的比都等于相似比"],["以原点为位似中心的坐标变化","以原点为位似中心、相似比为 k 时，对应点的坐标是 (kx,ky)（两个图形在位似中心同侧）或 (-kx,-ky)（异侧）。","同侧与异侧是两种情形，只写一种会漏解"]]},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"在 △ ABC 中，D 是 AB 上一点，DE∥ BC 交 AC 于点 E，AD=2，DB=3，DE=4，求 BC 的长。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xiangsi-e1","title":"平行型相似求线段","caption":"DE∥BC，AD=2，DB=3，DE=4","view":"square","alt":"三角形 ABC 中，D 在 AB 上、E 在 AC 上，DE 平行于 BC；AD 等于 2、DB 等于 3、DE 等于 4，由 △ADE∽△ABC 得 AD 比 AB 等于 DE 比 BC，可求出 BC 等于 10。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[50,12],[18,84],[86,84]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":37.2,"y1":40.8,"x2":64.4,"y2":40.8,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":12,"label":"A","labelDx":2,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":18,"y":84,"label":"B","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":86,"y":84,"label":"C","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":37.2,"y":40.8,"label":"D","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":64.4,"y":40.8,"label":"E","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":96,"text":"AD=2，DB=3，DE=4，求 BC","size":3.3,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["因为 DE∥ BC，所以 △ ADE∽△ ABC（平行于三角形一边的直线和其他两边相交，所构成的三角形与原三角形相似）。","所以 (DE)/(BC)=(AD)/(AB)（相似三角形的对应边成比例）。","因为 AB=AD+DB=2+3=5，所以 (4)/(BC)=(2)/(5)，解得 BC=10。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：BC=10。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"比例式中的分母要用整条边 AB 而不是 DB；把已知量标在图上对应位置，能有效避免把线段对错。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"在 △ ABC 中，D 是 AB 上一点，且 ∠ ACD=∠ B。求证 △ ACD∽△ ABC，并证明 AC²=AD· AB。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xiangsi-e2","title":"母子型相似证明等积式","caption":"∠A=∠A，∠ACD=∠B ⇒ △ACD∽△ABC ⇒ AC²=AD·AB","view":"square","alt":"三角形 ABC 中，D 在 AB 上，连接 CD；∠A 是公共角、∠ACD 与 ∠B 相等，所以三角形 ACD 与三角形 ABC 相似，对应边成比例得 AC 比 AB 等于 AD 比 AC，化为等积式即 AC 的平方等于 AD 乘 AB。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[28,18],[64,82],[84,36]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":84,"y1":36,"x2":51.1,"y2":59.1,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":28,"y":18,"from":-60.6,"to":-17.8,"r":9,"label":"∠A"},{"t":"angle","x":64,"y":82,"from":66.5,"to":119.3,"r":7,"label":"∠B","tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":84,"y":36,"from":162.2,"to":215,"r":7,"label":"∠ACD","tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":28,"y":18,"label":"A","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":64,"y":82,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":84,"y":36,"label":"C","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-2},{"t":"dot","x":51.1,"y":59.1,"label":"D","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":96,"text":"AC²=AD·AB","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["在 △ ACD 与 △ ABC 中：∠ A=∠ A（公共角），∠ ACD=∠ B（已知），所以 △ ACD∽△ ABC（两角分别相等的两个三角形相似）。","由相似得 (AC)/(AB)=(AD)/(AC)（相似三角形的对应边成比例）。","由比例的基本性质（内项之积等于外项之积）得 AC²=AD· AB。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：△ ACD∽△ ABC，且 AC²=AD· AB。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"这种「大三角形中包含一个小三角形且两者共用一个角」的图形叫母子型；见到形如 AC²=AD· AB 的等积式，先化成比例式再找相似三角形。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"小明身高 1.6 m，在阳光下的影长是 2 m，同一时刻某旗杆的影长是 15 m（两次测量都是太阳光下的平行投影），求旗杆的高度。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xiangsi-e3","title":"同一时刻的阳光下测高","caption":"平行光线下，物高与影长的比相等","view":"square","alt":"地面上竖立着一人一杆，太阳光以相同角度斜射下来，人与杆的影子都落在地面上；人的影长与身高之比等于旗杆的影长与杆高之比，由此可求出旗杆的高。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":8,"y1":78,"x2":92,"y2":78,"width":0.8},{"t":"hatch","x":8,"y":78,"w":84,"h":5,"gap":2.2},{"t":"line","x1":24,"y1":44,"x2":24,"y2":78,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":70,"y1":20,"x2":70,"y2":78,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":24,"y1":44,"x2":34,"y2":78,"dashed":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":70,"y1":20,"x2":87,"y2":78,"dashed":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":24,"y":44,"label":"A","labelDx":2,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":24,"y":78,"label":"B","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":34,"y":78,"label":"C","labelDx":-1,"labelDy":5},{"t":"dot","x":70,"y":20,"label":"D","labelDx":2,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":70,"y":78,"label":"E","labelDx":-1,"labelDy":5},{"t":"dot","x":87,"y":78,"label":"F","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":94,"text":"身高:影长 = 杆高:影长","size":3.3,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["设旗杆高为 h m。同一时刻太阳光是平行光，人与旗杆都垂直于地面，所以「人及其影子」构成的直角三角形与「旗杆及其影子」构成的直角三角形有两个角对应相等（都含直角，且平行光与地面的夹角相同），因此两个三角形相似。","由相似三角形的对应边成比例得 (h)/(1.6)=(15)/(2)（同一时刻物高与影长的比相等）。","解得 h=1.6×(15)/(2)=12，即旗杆高 12 m。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：旗杆高 12 m。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"同一时刻的平行投影下「物高与影长的比相等」是测高的核心结论；若题中是灯光（中心投影），就不能直接按比例算，要用相似三角形列方程。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"小华想测量一棵树的高度：他把一面小镜子平放在水平地面上，然后沿直线从镜子处后退，当他退到离镜子 2 m 的点 D 处时，恰好在镜子中看到树梢 A 的像。已知小华的眼睛离地面 1.5 m，镜子离树底部 B 有 8 m，求树 AB 的高度。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xiangsi-e4","title":"利用平面镜反射测树高","caption":"入射角等于反射角，配合两条铅垂线构造相似三角形","view":"square","alt":"水平地面上左边竖立一棵树，树梢为 A、树底为 B；地面中间 E 处平放一面小镜子，右边站着一个人，眼睛为 C、人脚为 D。树梢 A 到镜子 E 的连线与眼睛 C 到镜子 E 的连线在镜面处相接，∠AEB 与 ∠CED 相等，B 与 D 处都是直角，三角形 ABE 与三角形 CDE 相似。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":10,"y1":78,"x2":90,"y2":78,"width":0.8},{"t":"hatch","x":10,"y":78,"w":80,"h":5,"gap":2.2},{"t":"line","x1":30,"y1":20,"x2":30,"y2":78,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":76,"y1":47,"x2":76,"y2":78,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":30,"y1":20,"x2":60,"y2":78,"dashed":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":60,"y1":78,"x2":76,"y2":47,"dashed":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":54,"y1":80,"x2":66,"y2":80,"tone":"ok","width":0.8},{"t":"angle","x":30,"y":78,"from":0,"to":90,"r":5,"right":true},{"t":"angle","x":76,"y":78,"from":90,"to":180,"r":5,"right":true},{"t":"angle","x":60,"y":78,"from":117.4,"to":180,"r":7,"label":"∠AEB","tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":60,"y":78,"from":0,"to":62.7,"r":7,"label":"∠CED","tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":30,"y":20,"label":"A","labelDx":2,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":30,"y":78,"label":"B","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":60,"y":78,"label":"E","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":6.5},{"t":"dot","x":76,"y":78,"label":"D","labelDx":1,"labelDy":6.5},{"t":"dot","x":76,"y":47,"label":"C","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-1.5},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":93,"text":"∠AEB=∠CED，△ABE∽△CDE","size":3.3,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["设树高 AB=h m，小华的眼睛为点 C，人脚为 D，镜子位置为 E，则 CD=1.5 m，DE=2 m，BE=8 m，且 AB⊥ BD，CD⊥ BD。","由光学的反射原理，入射角等于反射角，得 ∠ AEB=∠ CED（树梢的光线与视线相对镜面的倾角相等）。","在 △ ABE 与 △ CDE 中，∠ ABE=∠ CDE=90^°，∠ AEB=∠ CED，所以 △ ABE∽△ CDE（两角分别相等的两个三角形相似）。","所以 (AB)/(CD)=(BE)/(DE)（相似三角形的对应边成比例），即 (h)/(1.5)=(8)/(2)=4，解得 h=6。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：树 AB 的高度是 6 m。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"镜子测高综合了物理的反射原理与相似三角形：入射角等于反射角提供一对相等的角，加上两条铅垂线带来的直角，就能构造相似三角形列比例。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"在 △ ABC 中，AB=9，AC=6，点 D 在边 AC 上，AD=2，点 E 在边 AB 上（E 不与 A、B 重合）。若 △ ADE 与 △ ABC 相似，求 AE 的长。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xiangsi-e5","title":"相似对应关系不确定时的两种情况","caption":"共角的两三角形有两种相似方式，对应边不同","view":"square","alt":"三角形 ABC 中，顶点 A 在上方，B 在左下、C 在右下；点 D 在边 AC 上靠近 A 处。从 D 分别向边 AB 引两条虚线，一条交 AB 于较靠近 A 的点 E₁，另一条交 AB 于较远的点 E₂，形成两个都与三角形 ABC 共用顶角 A 的小三角形 ADE₁ 与 ADE₂，分别对应两种相似关系。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[50,14],[14,86],[88,74]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":62.7,"y1":34,"x2":44.7,"y2":24.7,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":62.7,"y1":34,"x2":38,"y2":38,"dashed":true,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":14,"label":"A","labelDx":-1,"labelDy":-2.5},{"t":"dot","x":14,"y":86,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":2},{"t":"dot","x":88,"y":74,"label":"C","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":2},{"t":"dot","x":62.7,"y":34,"label":"D","labelDx":3,"labelDy":-2},{"t":"dot","x":44.7,"y":24.7,"label":"E₁","labelDx":-4,"labelDy":-2.5,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":38,"y":38,"label":"E₂","labelDx":-5,"labelDy":3,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":95,"text":"AE₁=4/3，AE₂=3","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["两个三角形共用 ∠ A，但题目没有指明对应顶点，所以要分两种情况讨论（分类讨论是本题的突破口）。","情况一：△ ADE∽△ ABC，对应关系为 A 对 A、D 对 B、E 对 C，则 (AD)/(AB)=(AE)/(AC)，即 (2)/(9)=(AE)/(6)，解得 AE=(4)/(3)。","情况二：△ ADE∽△ ACB，对应关系为 A 对 A、D 对 C、E 对 B，则 (AD)/(AC)=(AE)/(AB)，即 (2)/(6)=(AE)/(9)，解得 AE=3。","两种情况的 AE 都满足 0<AE<9，点 E 都在边 AB 上，符合题意，两种结果都要保留。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：AE=(4)/(3) 或 AE=3。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"题目只说「与 △ ABC 相似」而不指明对应顶点时，共角的两个三角形有两种相似方式；先按对应关系列比例再解方程，最后检验解是否在线段的取值范围内。"},{"type":"list","title":"易错点","items":["相似比有顺序：$\\triangle ABC\\sim\\triangle DEF$ 的相似比是 $AB:DE$，写成 $DE:AB$ 就成了它的倒数，后面的比例式会全部出错。","面积比等于相似比的平方，不能把面积比当相似比：两个相似三角形的面积比是 $9:16$ 时，相似比是 $3:4$，周长比也是 $3:4$。","判定中「两边成比例且一个角相等」的角必须是这两条对应边的夹角；若是其中一边的对角，则与全等中的边边角一样不能判定相似。","写相似式时对应顶点要写在对应位置上，$\\triangle ABC\\sim\\triangle DEF$ 表示 $A$ 对 $D$、$B$ 对 $E$、$C$ 对 $F$，顺序写错会导致比例式错误。","平行线分线段成比例要求两条直线被一组平行线所截，且比例式中的线段必须是「对应位置」的线段，顺序颠倒就会写错。","位似变换的坐标变化有同侧、异侧两种情形，相似比为 $k$ 时对应点可能是 $(kx,ky)$，也可能是 $(-kx,-ky)$，漏掉一种就漏解。"]},{"type":"list","title":"解题方法","items":["见平行线就找「A 型」或「X 型」相似，直接写出比例式求线段长。","证等积式先化成比例式（如把 AC²=AD· AB 写成 (AC)/(AB)=(AD)/(AC)），再用「三点定形法」找出两个相似三角形，注意寻找公共角或已知的等角。","求线段长、面积比优先考虑相似，并与勾股定理配合：先用相似求出边，再用勾股求出另一条边。","实际测量问题先把实物抽象成相似三角形，在图上标清对应边，再列比例式求解。","图形中出现两个直角三角形共用一个锐角、或出现等角条件时，主动寻找相似三角形，把角相等转化为线段成比例。"]}],"questions":[{"id":"m-geo-xiangsi-q1","type":"choice","stem":"在 △ ABC 中，D 在 AB 上，E 在 AC 上，DE∥ BC，AD:DB=1:2，则 DE:BC 等于","answer":"B","explain":"因为 DE∥ BC，所以 △ ADE∽△ ABC，从而 (DE)/(BC)=(AD)/(AB)（相似三角形的对应边成比例）。由 AD:DB=1:2 得 AD:AB=1:3，所以 DE:BC=1:3。误选 1:2 是把 AD:DB 直接当成了相似比。","options":["1:2","1:3","1:4","2:3"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["平行型相似","比例式"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xiangsi-q1","title":"AD:DB=1:2 时求 DE:BC","caption":"AD 与 DB 按 1:2 画上 1 道与 2 道记号，所以 AD:AB=1:3；由 △ADE∽△ABC 得 DE:BC=AD:AB=1:3","view":"wide","alt":"三角形 ABC，D 在 AB 上、E 在 AC 上且 DE 平行于 BC；AD 上画有 1 道等长记号、DB 上画有 2 道，表示 AD 与 DB 的比是 1 比 2。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[10,52],[90,52],[30,12]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":36.7,"y1":52,"x2":16.7,"y2":38.7,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"poly","points":[[29.11,45.15],[26.28,45.07],[27.45,47.65]],"tone":"accent"},{"t":"poly","points":[[62.41,31.81],[59.58,31.72],[60.75,34.3]],"tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":23,"y":58,"text":"AD","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":63,"y":58,"text":"DB","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":65,"y":30,"text":"DE : BC = ?","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"dot","x":10,"y":52,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":90,"y":52,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":30,"y":12,"label":"C","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":36.7,"y":52,"label":"D","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":16.7,"y":38.7,"label":"E","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8}]}},{"id":"m-geo-xiangsi-q2","type":"choice","stem":"两个相似三角形的相似比是 2:3，则它们的面积比是","answer":"B","explain":"相似三角形面积的比等于相似比的平方，((2)/(3))²=(4)/(9)，所以面积比是 4:9。选 2:3 是把面积比当成了相似比，这是高频错误。","options":["2:3","4:9","√(2):√(3)","8:27"],"difficulty":1,"tags":["相似三角形的性质","面积比"]},{"id":"m-geo-xiangsi-q3","type":"choice","stem":"在 △ ABC 与 △ DEF 中，已知 (AB)/(DE)=(AC)/(DF)，要使 △ ABC∽△ DEF，还需添加的一个条件是","answer":"A","explain":"∠ A 与 ∠ D 分别是 AB、AC 与 DE、DF 的夹角，配上已知的两边成比例正好是「两边成比例且夹角相等」，可以判定相似。∠ B=∠ E 中的角不是这两组边的夹角（∠ B 是 AB 与 BC 的夹角），与「两边一对角」同类，不能判定；∠ C=∠ F 同理；BC=EF 是两边相等而不是成比例，条件不足。","options":["∠ A=∠ D","∠ B=∠ E","∠ C=∠ F","BC=EF"],"difficulty":3,"tags":["相似三角形的判定","夹角","条件辨析"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xiangsi-q3","title":"两边成比例，还要夹角相等","caption":"已知 AB:DE = AC:DF；再补 ∠A=∠D（绿弧）就是「两边成比例且夹角相等」。若补 ∠B=∠E，那个角不是已知两边的夹角","view":"wide","alt":"两个三角形 ABC 与 DEF：左边把 AB 与 AC 加粗、标出角 A，右边把 DE 与 DF 加粗、标出角 D；两处角 A 与角 D 画有相同的弧线。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[6,12],[46,12],[18,46]],"closed":true},{"t":"poly","points":[[54,12],[94,12],[66,46]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":6,"y1":12,"x2":46,"y2":12,"tone":"accent","width":0.9},{"t":"line","x1":6,"y1":12,"x2":18,"y2":46,"tone":"accent","width":0.9},{"t":"line","x1":54,"y1":12,"x2":94,"y2":12,"tone":"accent","width":0.9},{"t":"line","x1":54,"y1":12,"x2":66,"y2":46,"tone":"accent","width":0.9},{"t":"angle","x":6,"y":12,"from":0,"to":-70.56,"r":6.5,"tone":"ok","label":"∠A"},{"t":"angle","x":54,"y":12,"from":0,"to":-70.56,"r":6.5,"tone":"ok","label":"∠D"},{"t":"dot","x":6,"y":12,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":46,"y":12,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":18,"y":46,"label":"C","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":54,"y":12,"label":"D","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":94,"y":12,"label":"E","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":66,"y":46,"label":"F","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":2.4}]}},{"id":"m-geo-xiangsi-q4","type":"fill","stem":"在 △ ABC 中，DE∥ BC，D 在 AB 上，E 在 AC 上，AD=3，AB=9，DE=2，则 BC= ____。（只填数字）","answer":"6","explain":"由 DE∥ BC 得 △ ADE∽△ ABC，所以 (DE)/(BC)=(AD)/(AB)=(3)/(9)=(1)/(3)，于是 BC=3DE=6。","difficulty":1,"tags":["平行型相似","求线段长"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xiangsi-q4","title":"已知 AD、AB、DE，求 BC","caption":"DE∥BC 得 △ADE∽△ABC，所以 DE:BC = AD:AB = 3:9 = 1:3，于是 BC=3DE","view":"wide","alt":"三角形 ABC，D 在 AB 上、E 在 AC 上，DE 平行于 BC；AD 标注为 3、AB 标注为 9、DE 标注为 2，BC 待求。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[10,52],[90,52],[30,12]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":36.7,"y1":52,"x2":16.7,"y2":38.7,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"poly","points":[[29.11,45.15],[26.28,45.07],[27.45,47.65]],"tone":"accent"},{"t":"poly","points":[[62.41,31.81],[59.58,31.72],[60.75,34.3]],"tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":22,"y":57,"text":"AD = 3","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":52,"y":57,"text":"AB = 9","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":21,"y":47,"text":"DE = 2","anchor":"end","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":65,"y":30,"text":"BC = ?","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"dot","x":10,"y":52,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":90,"y":52,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":30,"y":12,"label":"C","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":36.7,"y":52,"label":"D","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":16.7,"y":38.7,"label":"E","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8}]}},{"id":"m-geo-xiangsi-q5","type":"fill","stem":"身高 1.5 m 的小明在阳光下的影长是 2 m，同一时刻某旗杆的影长是 12 m，则旗杆的高度是 ____ m。（只填数字）","answer":"9","explain":"同一时刻的平行投影下，物高与影长的比相等。设旗杆高为 h m，则 (h)/(1.5)=(12)/(2)=6，解得 h=9，即旗杆高 9 m。","difficulty":2,"tags":["相似三角形的应用","测高"]},{"id":"m-geo-xiangsi-q6","type":"short","stem":"说明「相似三角形的周长比等于相似比、面积比等于相似比的平方」的理由，并解释为什么面积比不是相似比。","answer":"设 $\\triangle ABC\\sim\\triangle A_1B_1C_1$，相似比为 $k$，即 $\\frac{AB}{A_1B_1}=\\frac{BC}{B_1C_1}=\\frac{CA}{C_1A_1}=k$。周长比：$\\frac{AB+BC+CA}{A_1B_1+B_1C_1+C_1A_1}=\\frac{k(A_1B_1+B_1C_1+C_1A_1)}{A_1B_1+B_1C_1+C_1A_1}=k$，所以周长比等于相似比。面积比：分别作 $BC$ 与 $B_1C_1$ 边上的高 $h$ 与 $h_1$，由相似可得 $\\frac{h}{h_1}=k$（对应高的比等于相似比），于是 $\\frac{S}{S_1}=\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}BC\\cdot h}{\\frac{1}{2}B_1C_1\\cdot h_1}=\\frac{BC}{B_1C_1}\\cdot\\frac{h}{h_1}=k\\cdot k=k^2$，所以面积比等于相似比的平方。面积是两个长度相乘的结果：相似变换把图形的每个方向都放大 $k$ 倍，面积就被放大 $k^2$ 倍，因此面积比不是相似比。例如相似比为 $2:3$ 时，面积比是 $4:9$，而不是 $2:3$。","explain":"本题考查相似三角形性质的两个结论及其推导。评分要点：写出相似比与三组对应边的关系，说明周长比的推导（提取公因式）；用「对应高之比等于相似比」推出面积比为 k²；用具体数值验证结论。常见失分点：只记结论不会推导；把面积比误当作相似比（如把 4:9 说成 2:3）；推导面积比时忘记「高也按相似比变化」，只对底作比而漏掉平方关系。","difficulty":3,"tags":["相似三角形的性质","周长比","面积比"],"rubric":["写出相似比与三组对应边的关系","说明周长比的推导（提取公因式 k）","说明面积比的推导（用到对应高之比也等于 k）","指出面积比是相似比的平方而非相似比本身","用具体数值举例说明（如相似比 2:3 对应面积比 4:9）"]},{"id":"m-geo-xiangsi-z1","type":"choice","stem":"在 △ ABC 中，D、E 分别在边 AB、AC 上，DE∥ BC。若 △ ADE 与四边形 DBCE 的面积之比为 4:5，则 AD:AB 等于","answer":"A","explain":"四边形 DBCE 与 △ ADE 拼成整个 △ ABC，所以 S_(△ ADE):S_(△ ABC)=4:(4+5)=4:9。因为 DE∥ BC，所以 △ ADE∽△ ABC，面积比等于相似比的平方，即 ((AD)/(AB))²=(4)/(9)，所以 AD:AB=2:3。选 C 是把面积比 4:9 直接当成了相似比，选 B 是把「与四边形的面积比」误当成「与整个三角形的面积比」。","options":["2:3","4:5","4:9","2:5"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["相似三角形的性质","面积比"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xiangsi-z1","title":"面积比 4:5 时的相似比","caption":"小三角形与四边形拼成整个三角形，所以 S△ADE:S△ABC=4:9；面积比等于相似比的平方，得 AD:AB=2:3","view":"wide","alt":"三角形 ABC，D 在 AB 上、E 在 AC 上且 DE 平行于 BC；小三角形 ADE 内标出「4 份」，四边形 DBCE 内标出「5 份」，两部分的面积比是 4 比 5。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[10,52],[90,52],[30,12]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":63.3,"y1":52,"x2":23.3,"y2":25.3,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"poly","points":[[45.71,38.46],[42.88,38.37],[44.05,40.95]],"tone":"accent"},{"t":"poly","points":[[62.41,31.81],[59.58,31.72],[60.75,34.3]],"tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":32,"y":42,"text":"4 份","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":52,"y":34,"text":"5 份","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":10,"y":52,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":90,"y":52,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":30,"y":12,"label":"C","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":63.3,"y":52,"label":"D","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":23.3,"y":25.3,"label":"E","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8}]}},{"id":"m-geo-xiangsi-z2","type":"short","stem":"已知：在正方形 ABCD 中，AB=6，点 E 在边 BC 上，BE=2，点 F 在边 CD 上，且 ∠ AEF=90^°。求 CF 的长。","answer":"在正方形 $ABCD$ 中，$\\angle B=\\angle C=90^\\circ$，所以 $\\angle BAE+\\angle AEB=90^\\circ$（直角三角形两锐角互余）。因为 $\\angle AEF=90^\\circ$，且 $B$、$E$、$C$ 三点共线，所以 $\\angle AEB+\\angle FEC=180^\\circ-\\angle AEF=90^\\circ$，于是 $\\angle BAE=\\angle FEC$（同角的余角相等）。因为 $\\angle B=\\angle C=90^\\circ$，$\\angle BAE=\\angle FEC$，所以 $\\triangle ABE\\sim\\triangle ECF$（两角分别相等的两个三角形相似）。所以 $\\frac{AB}{EC}=\\frac{BE}{CF}$（相似三角形的对应边成比例）。因为 $EC=BC-BE=6-2=4$，所以 $\\frac{6}{4}=\\frac{2}{CF}$，解得 $CF=\\frac{4}{3}$。","explain":"本题考查「一线三直角」基本图形中相似三角形的构造与应用。评分要点：由 ∠ B=∠ C=90^°、∠ AEF=90^° 与 B、E、C 共线推出 ∠ BAE=∠ FEC；证 △ ABE∽△ ECF；按对应边列比例式 (AB)/(EC)=(BE)/(CF)；代入 EC=4 解得 CF=(4)/(3)。常见失分点：对应顶点顺序写错导致比例式颠倒（写成 (AB)/(CF)=(BE)/(EC)）；把 EC 误算成 6；只写相似结论不写判定依据。","difficulty":3,"tags":["相似三角形的判定","求线段长"],"rubric":["由互余关系推出 ∠BAE=∠FEC（一线三直角的基本图形）","证 △ABE∽△ECF（两角分别相等）","按对应边写出比例式 AB/EC=BE/CF","正确计算 EC=4 并解得 CF=4/3"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-xiangsi-z2","title":"一线三直角：正方形中的相似三角形","caption":"正方形 ABCD 中 ∠AEF=90°：由 ∠BAE=∠FEC（两角画有相同的弧线）得 △ABE∽△ECF，所以 AB:EC=BE:CF","view":"square","alt":"正方形 ABCD，点 E 在边 BC 上、点 F 在边 CD 上，∠AEF 是直角（画有方框）；∠BAE 与 ∠FEC 画有相同的弧线，表示两角相等。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[26,56],[70,56],[70,12],[26,12]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":26,"y1":56,"x2":70,"y2":41.3,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":70,"y1":41.3,"x2":60.2,"y2":12,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":66.21,"y1":42.57,"x2":64.94,"y2":38.77,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":64.94,"y1":38.77,"x2":68.73,"y2":37.51,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":26,"y":56,"from":0,"to":18.47,"r":9,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"angle","x":70,"y":41.3,"from":90,"to":108.49,"r":9,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"text","x":48,"y":62,"text":"AB = 6","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":74,"y":49,"text":"BE = 2","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":65,"y":7,"text":"CF = ?","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"dot","x":26,"y":56,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":70,"y":56,"label":"B","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":70,"y":12,"label":"C","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":26,"y":12,"label":"D","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":70,"y":41.3,"label":"E","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":60.2,"y":12,"label":"F","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":-2.8}]}}]},{"id":"m-geo-ruijiao-sanjiao","title":"锐角三角函数","subtitle":"人教版九下 · 第32章 锐角三角函数","grade":"9b","tags":["图形与几何","锐角三角函数"],"blocks":[{"type":"note","title":"教材章节","text":"人教版九下 · 第32章 锐角三角函数"},{"type":"note","title":"一句话概述","text":"掌握锐角三角函数的定义与特殊角函数值，会解直角三角形并处理测量中的实际问题。"},{"type":"h","text":"先认准对边、邻边和斜边"},{"type":"p","text":"直角三角形里的三条边，只有斜边是固定的（直角所对的边最长）；另外两条边谁叫「对边」、谁叫「邻边」，要看你说的是哪个锐角。在 Rt△ ABC 中 ∠ C=90^°，若盯住 ∠ A，那么 BC 是它的对边、AC 是它的邻边、AB 是斜边；换成 ∠ B，对边与邻边正好互换。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-ruijiao-s1","title":"直角三角形中三条边的名字","caption":"对边、邻边都是相对于锐角 A 而言的","view":"wide","alt":"直角三角形 ABC，直角在顶点 C，斜边 AB 最长。相对锐角 A 来说，BC 是对边、AC 是邻边、AB 是斜边；若换成锐角 B，对边与邻边正好互换。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[18,12],[18,52],[76,52]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"angle","x":18,"y":52,"from":0,"to":90,"r":5,"right":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":18,"y":12,"from":-90,"to":-34.6,"r":8,"label":"∠A"},{"t":"text","x":47,"y":59,"text":"a（对边）","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle"},{"t":"text","x":14,"y":32,"text":"b（邻边）","size":3.6,"anchor":"end"},{"t":"text","x":52,"y":27,"text":"c（斜边）","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle"},{"t":"dot","x":18,"y":12,"label":"A","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":18,"y":52,"label":"C","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":76,"y":52,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"对边、邻边是「相对于某个锐角」说的，换一个角就要重新认边。"},{"type":"h","text":"三个比，分别比什么"},{"type":"p","text":"把 ∠ A 的对边记作 a、邻边记作 b、斜边记作 c，三个三角函数就是三个比：正弦是对边比斜边（sin A=(a)/(c)），余弦是邻边比斜边（cos A=(b)/(c)），正切是对边比邻边（tan A=(a)/(b)）。三者都只用两条边，记住「正弦、余弦的分母是斜边，正切不含斜边」就不会混。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-ruijiao-s2","title":"三个比各自的分子与分母","caption":"sin、cos 的分母都是斜边，tan 不含斜边","view":"wide","alt":"直角三角形 ABC，直角在 C，∠A 标在顶点 A 处。斜边 AB 标为 c，∠A 的对边 BC 标为 a，邻边 AC 标为 b；右侧列出三个比：正弦是对边比斜边，余弦是邻边比斜边，正切是对边比邻边。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[10,12],[10,50],[62,50]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"angle","x":10,"y":50,"from":0,"to":90,"r":5,"right":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":10,"y":12,"from":-90,"to":-36.2,"r":7,"label":"∠A"},{"t":"text","x":36,"y":57,"text":"a","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":6,"y":31,"text":"b","size":3.6,"anchor":"end","tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":38,"y":26,"text":"c","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":99,"y":18,"text":"sin A = 对边 ÷ 斜边","size":3.8,"anchor":"end"},{"t":"text","x":99,"y":32,"text":"cos A = 邻边 ÷ 斜边","size":3.8,"anchor":"end"},{"t":"text","x":99,"y":46,"text":"tan A = 对边 ÷ 邻边","size":3.8,"anchor":"end"},{"t":"dot","x":10,"y":12,"label":"A","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":10,"y":50,"label":"C","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":62,"y":50,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"sin A、cos A 的值都小于 1，只有 tan A 可以大于 1。"},{"type":"h","text":"特殊角靠两个三角形来记"},{"type":"p","text":"两个特殊直角三角形值得单独记住：含 30^° 角的直角三角形三边比是 1:√(3):2（最短边对着 30^° 角），等腰直角三角形三边比是 1:1:√(2)。把这两组比按定义代入，30^°、45^°、60^° 的九个函数值就能当场推出来，比死记硬背可靠。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-ruijiao-s3","title":"两个特殊直角三角形的三边比","caption":"左边的三边比 1:√3:2，右边的三边比 1:1:√2","view":"square","alt":"左边是含 30 度角的直角三角形，30 度角在顶点 A、60 度角在顶点 B，直角在 C，两条直角边分别是 1 与 √3，斜边是 2；右边是等腰直角三角形，两个锐角都是 45 度，两条直角边都是 1，斜边是 √2。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[12,28],[12,62],[32,62]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"angle","x":12,"y":62,"from":0,"to":90,"r":5,"right":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":12,"y":28,"from":-90,"to":-59.5,"r":8,"label":"30°"},{"t":"angle","x":32,"y":62,"from":120.5,"to":180,"r":8,"label":"60°"},{"t":"text","x":22,"y":69,"text":"1","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":7,"y":45,"text":"√3","size":3.4,"anchor":"end","tone":"accent"},{"t":"poly","points":[[58,42],[58,62],[78,62]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"angle","x":58,"y":62,"from":0,"to":90,"r":5,"right":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":58,"y":42,"from":-90,"to":-45,"r":8,"label":"45°"},{"t":"angle","x":78,"y":62,"from":135,"to":180,"r":8,"label":"45°"},{"t":"text","x":68,"y":69,"text":"1","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":53,"y":52,"text":"1","size":3.6,"anchor":"end","tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":12,"y":28,"label":"A","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":-1},{"t":"dot","x":32,"y":62,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":12,"y":62,"label":"C","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":58,"y":42,"label":"A₁","labelDx":-8,"labelDy":-1},{"t":"dot","x":78,"y":62,"label":"B₁","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":58,"y":62,"label":"C₁","labelDx":-7.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":84,"text":"sin30°=1/2，cos30°=√3/2，tan30°=√3/3","size":3.3,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":92,"text":"sin45°=cos45°=√2/2，tan45°=1","size":3.3,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"最容易混的两个：sin 30^°=(1)/(2)（不是 √(2)2）、tan 30^°=√(3)3（不是 √(3)）。"},{"type":"h","text":"换个情境：仰角与俯角"},{"type":"p","text":"测量问题里，角不再画在三角形里面，而是画在水平线上：视线在水平线上方的夹角叫仰角，在下方的叫俯角，两者都是视线与水平线的夹角，不是与铅垂线的夹角。先画水平线（地面）与铅垂线（楼高），再把视线连起来，就能把实际情境翻译成直角三角形，用三角函数列方程求高。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-ruijiao-s4","title":"仰角与俯角都是视线与水平线的夹角","caption":"视线在水平线上方叫仰角，下方叫俯角","view":"square","alt":"观察点 O 处画出一条水平线，从 O 向右上方引一条视线，与水平线的夹角标为仰角；从 O 向右下方引另一条视线，与水平线的夹角标为俯角。两个角都以水平线为一边。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":10,"y1":46,"x2":92,"y2":46,"dashed":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"arrow","x1":50,"y1":46,"x2":88,"y2":18,"tone":"accent","label":"视线","labelDx":6,"labelDy":-2},{"t":"arrow","x1":50,"y1":46,"x2":88,"y2":74,"tone":"danger","label":"视线","labelDx":6,"labelDy":2},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":46,"from":0,"to":36.4,"r":13,"label":"仰角","tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":50,"y":46,"from":-36.4,"to":0,"r":13,"label":"俯角","tone":"danger"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":46,"label":"O","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":5},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":90,"text":"仰角、俯角都以水平线为一边","size":3.5,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"note","title":"","text":"坡度 i=h:l=tanα 里的 α 是坡面与水平面的夹角，与仰角是两回事。"},{"type":"h","text":"核心概念"},{"type":"p","text":"正弦、余弦、正切的定义：在 Rt△ ABC 中，∠ C=90^°，设 ∠ A 的对边为 a、邻边为 b、斜边为 c，则 sin A=(a)/(c)，cos A=(b)/(c)，tan A=(a)/(b)。对边、邻边都是相对于这个锐角而言的，换一个角，对边与邻边就随之改变。"},{"type":"p","text":"三角函数值与三角形的大小无关：当锐角 A 的度数确定时，无论直角三角形画得多大，sin A、cos A、tan A 的值都不变——这一点由相似三角形对应边成比例可以说明。所以三角函数值只与角的度数有关，与图形的大小无关。"},{"type":"p","text":"特殊角的三角函数值：30^°、45^°、60^° 的三角函数值必须背熟：sin 30^°=(1)/(2)，cos 30^°=√(3)2，tan 30^°=√(3)3；sin 45^°=cos 45^°=√(2)2，tan 45^°=1；sin 60^°=√(3)2，cos 60^°=(1)/(2)，tan 60^°=√(3)。可借助两个特殊直角三角形的三边比 1:√(3):2（含 30^° 角）与 1:1:√(2)（等腰直角三角形）记忆，特别提醒 sin 30^°=(1)/(2) 不要记成 √(2)2。"},{"type":"p","text":"三角函数值的增减性：当 0^°<α<90^° 时，sinα 与 tanα 都随 α 的增大而增大，cosα 随 α 的增大而减小。例如 sin 30^°<sin 60^°，而 cos 30^°>cos 60^°。这个规律可用来比较大小、检验计算结果是否合理。"},{"type":"p","text":"解直角三角形：在直角三角形中，除直角外还有三条边与两个锐角共五个元素，由已知元素求出未知元素的过程叫解直角三角形。已知一条边再加上一个锐角或一条边，就可以解出其余元素；只给两个锐角时三角形大小不确定，求不出任何边长。"},{"type":"p","text":"仰角、俯角、坡度与方位角：视线与水平线所成的角中，视线在水平线上方的叫仰角，在下方的叫俯角；坡面的垂直高度 h 与水平宽度 l 的比叫坡度（坡比），记作 i=h:l，并且 i=tanα（α 为坡角）；方位角用来描述方向，如「北偏东 30^°」表示从正北方向向东转 30^°。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"特殊角函数值与解直角三角形\n选择填空考特殊角函数值的混合运算，解答考「已知一边一角或两边」解三角形；选公式时让已知元素与所求元素出现在同一个三角函数式中，结果化成最简根式并用勾股检验。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"一般三角形中作高构造直角三角形\n非直角三角形先作高（常作垂线），拆成两个直角三角形，用公共的高或公共边联系；注意高可能落在形外，需要分类讨论，这是中档解答题的主要得分点。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"仰角俯角与方位角应用\n测塔高、航海避礁等情境先画水平线、铅垂线与视线，把实际问题翻译成直角三角形，设未知数列三角方程求解，最后写答并保留单位；两个观测点常通过一段水平距离联系。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"坡度（坡比）问题\n坡度 i=tanα 是竖直高度与水平宽度之比，常与梯形、堤坝结合：把坡面补成矩形与直角三角形，坡长用勾股或三角函数求，注意区分坡长与水平宽度。"},{"type":"table","title":"公式与定理","head":["公式/定理","表述","注意"],"rows":[["正弦","在 Rt△ ABC 中，∠ C=90^°，a 是 ∠ A 的对边，c 是斜边。","对边是相对于 ∠ A 而言的，换角就要换边"],["余弦","b 是 ∠ A 的邻边（与斜边一起构成 ∠ A 的那条直角边），c 是斜边。","余弦值随锐角增大而减小，与正弦、正切的变化方向相反"],["正切","a 是 ∠ A 的对边，b 是 ∠ A 的邻边。","正切有明确的几何意义：在坡度问题中，坡角的正切就是坡度（坡比）"],["特殊角的三角函数值","sin 30^°=(1)/(2), cos 60^°=(1)/(2), tan 45^°=1","其余值：sin 45^°=cos 45^°=√(2)2，sin 60^°=cos 30^°=√(3)2，tan 30^°=√(3)3，tan 60^°=√(3)；tan 30^° 不是 √(3)，sin 30^° 不是 √(2)2"],["直角三角形中的边角关系式","a=csin A, b=ccos A, a=btan A","解直角三角形时，选择「已知元素与所求元素同时出现在一个式子中」的那一条，一步到位"],["坡度（坡比）","i=(h)/(l)=tanα","h 是坡面的垂直高度，l 是水平宽度，α 是坡角；坡度也常写成 1:m 的形式，注意不是「高度与坡长之比」"]]},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"在 Rt△ ABC 中，∠ C=90^°，∠ A=30^°，c=10，求 a、b 的长。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-ruijiao-e1","title":"已知斜边与一个锐角解直角三角形","caption":"∠A=30°，斜边 c=10，求 a 与 b","view":"square","alt":"直角三角形 ABC，直角在 C，30 度角标在顶点 A 处。斜边 AB 长 10，∠A 的对边 BC 长 5，邻边 AC 长 5√3，三边之比为 1 比 √3 比 2。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[20,22.4],[20,64],[44,64]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"angle","x":20,"y":64,"from":0,"to":90,"r":5,"right":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":20,"y":22.4,"from":-90,"to":-60,"r":9,"label":"30°"},{"t":"text","x":32,"y":71,"text":"a=5","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":15,"y":43,"text":"b=5√3","size":3.4,"anchor":"end","tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":34,"y":38,"text":"c=10","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"main"},{"t":"dot","x":20,"y":22.4,"label":"A","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":20,"y":64,"label":"C","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":44,"y":64,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":86,"text":"sinA=a/c ⇒ a=10×1/2=5","size":3.3,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["选择含 ∠ A 与斜边 c 的三角函数式：sin A=(a)/(c)，所以 a=csin A=10×sin 30^°=10×(1)/(2)=5。","再求 b：由 cos A=(b)/(c) 得 b=ccos A=10×cos 30^°=10×√(3)2=5√(3)。","检验：a²+b²=25+75=100=c²，符合勾股定理；又有 a:b:c=5:5√(3):10=1:√(3):2，与含 30^° 角直角三角形的三边比一致。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：a=5，b=5√(3)。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"解直角三角形时按「已知元素与所求元素都出现在同一个三角函数式中」来选公式，可以一步求出结果，避免多次开方。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"在 Rt△ ABC 中，∠ C=90^°，∠ B=60^°，AC=6，求 BC 与 AB 的长。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-ruijiao-e2","title":"已知一条直角边与一个锐角","caption":"∠B=60°，AC=6，求 BC 与 AB","view":"square","alt":"直角三角形 ABC，直角在 C，60 度角标在顶点 B 处。∠B 的对边 AC 长 6，邻边 BC 长 2√3，斜边 AB 长 4√3。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[26,41],[26,74],[45,74]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"angle","x":26,"y":74,"from":0,"to":90,"r":5,"right":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":45,"y":74,"from":119.9,"to":180,"r":8,"label":"60°"},{"t":"text","x":22,"y":57,"text":"6","size":3.6,"anchor":"end","tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":35,"y":81,"text":"2√3","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":41,"y":55,"text":"4√3","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"main"},{"t":"dot","x":26,"y":41,"label":"A","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":1},{"t":"dot","x":26,"y":74,"label":"C","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":45,"y":74,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":90,"text":"tanB=AC/BC ⇒ BC=6/tan60°=2√3","size":3.2,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["已知 ∠ B 与它的对边 AC，要求邻边 BC，选正切：tan B=(AC)/(BC)。","所以 BC=(AC)/(tan B)=(6)/(tan 60^°)=6√(3)=2√(3)。","再求斜边 AB：由 sin B=(AC)/(AB) 得 AB=(AC)/(sin B)=(6)/(sin 60^°)=6√(3)2=12√(3)=4√(3)。","检验：AC²+BC²=6²+(2√(3))²=36+12=48=AB²，结果正确。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：BC=2√(3)，AB=4√(3)。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"已知「一条边加一个锐角」就能解直角三角形；先求与已知条件联系最紧的边，再求剩余的边。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"某斜坡的坡角是 30^°，坡面的长是 20 m，求这个斜坡的垂直高度与水平宽度（结果保留根号）。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-ruijiao-e3","title":"斜坡的坡面、垂直高度与水平宽度","caption":"坡角 30°、坡面 20 m，分出一个直角三角形","view":"square","alt":"地面上从坡底 B 到坡顶 A 是一条坡面，坡面长 20 米，坡角 30 度标在点 B 处；从 A 向地面作垂线，垂足为 C，AC 是垂直高度 10 米，BC 是水平宽度 10√3 米，C 处是直角。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":10,"y1":80,"x2":94,"y2":80,"width":0.8,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"hatch","x":10,"y":80,"w":84,"h":4,"gap":2.2},{"t":"poly","points":[[18,80],[70,80],[70,50]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"angle","x":18,"y":80,"from":0,"to":30,"r":10,"label":"30°"},{"t":"angle","x":70,"y":80,"from":90,"to":180,"r":5,"right":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":38,"y":59,"text":"坡面 20 m","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":74,"y":66,"text":"10 m","size":3.4,"anchor":"start","tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":44,"y":88,"text":"10√3 m","size":3.4,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":18,"y":80,"label":"B","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":70,"y":50,"label":"A","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":-1},{"t":"dot","x":70,"y":80,"label":"C","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":5}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["把坡面抽象成直角三角形：坡面长 20 m 是斜边，坡角 30^° 是坡面与水平面的夹角，垂直高度是 30^° 角的对边，水平宽度是它的邻边。","垂直高度 =20×sin 30^°=20×(1)/(2)=10（m）。","水平宽度 =20×cos 30^°=20×√(3)2=10√(3)（m）。","检验：10²+(10√(3))²=100+300=400=20²，符合勾股定理；i=1010√(3)=√(3)3=tan 30^°，与坡角一致。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：垂直高度是 10 m，水平宽度是 10√(3) m（坡度 i=1:√(3)）。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"把实际问题抽象成直角三角形时，先判断哪条边是斜边、哪个角是坡角，再选三角函数；结果要用勾股关系检验一遍。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"数学兴趣小组测量教学楼的高度：在地面上的点 D 处测得楼顶 A 的仰角为 30^°，沿 DB 方向向教学楼前进 40 m 到达点 C 处，测得楼顶 A 的仰角为 45^°。点 B 是楼底，A、B、C、D 在同一竖直平面内，AB⊥ BD。求教学楼 AB 的高度（结果保留根号）。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-ruijiao-e4","title":"两个观测点的仰角测楼高","caption":"C 处仰角 45°，D 处仰角 30°，CD=40 m","view":"square","alt":"地面上竖立着教学楼 AB，B 是楼底、A 是楼顶，B 处是直角。地面左侧依次有点 D 与点 C，D 在 C 的左侧；从 C 看楼顶 A 的仰角为 45 度，从 D 看楼顶 A 的仰角为 30 度，CD 之间的距离是 40 米，BC 记为 x，要求楼高 AB。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":8,"y1":82,"x2":94,"y2":82,"width":0.8,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"hatch","x":8,"y":82,"w":86,"h":4,"gap":2.2},{"t":"line","x1":66,"y1":52,"x2":66,"y2":82,"tone":"main","width":1.1},{"t":"line","x1":36,"y1":82,"x2":66,"y2":52,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":14,"y1":82,"x2":66,"y2":52,"dashed":true,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":66,"y":82,"from":90,"to":180,"r":4,"right":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":36,"y":82,"from":0,"to":45,"r":9,"label":"45°","tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":14,"y":82,"from":0,"to":29.98,"r":9,"label":"30°","tone":"accent"},{"t":"text","x":63,"y":66,"text":"h","size":3.6,"anchor":"end","tone":"main"},{"t":"text","x":51,"y":90,"text":"x","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":25,"y":90,"text":"40 m","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":66,"y":52,"label":"A","labelDx":-6,"labelDy":-2},{"t":"dot","x":66,"y":82,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":5},{"t":"dot","x":36,"y":82,"label":"C","labelDx":-1,"labelDy":5},{"t":"dot","x":14,"y":82,"label":"D","labelDx":-5.5,"labelDy":5},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":97,"text":"45° 得 BC=AB=x，30° 得 h/(x+40)=tan30°","size":3.1,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["设 AB=h m，BC=x m。在 Rt△ ABC 中，∠ ACB=45^°，所以 △ ABC 是等腰直角三角形，x=h（等角对等边）。","在 Rt△ ABD 中，∠ ADB=30^°，BD=x+40。由 tan∠ ADB=(AB)/(BD) 得 tan 30^°=(h)/(h+40)。","代入 tan 30^°=√(3)3：√(3)3=(h)/(h+40)，即 √(3)(h+40)=3h，整理得 (3-√(3))h=40√(3)，解得 h=40√(3)3-√(3)=20√(3)+20。","所以教学楼 AB 的高度是 20(√(3)+1) m（约 54.6 m）。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：教学楼 AB 的高度是 20(√(3)+1) m。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"两个观测点的仰角差是测高问题的常见条件：先用 45^° 得「高度等于水平距离」，再对 30^° 列含未知数的方程，设未知数解方程比逐段求线段更稳。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"在 △ ABC 中，AB=8，AC=5，∠ A=60^°，求 BC 的长与 △ ABC 的面积。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-ruijiao-e5","title":"作高把一般三角形拆成两个直角三角形","caption":"∠A=60°，AB=8，AC=5，作 CD⊥AB","view":"square","alt":"三角形 ABC，顶点 A 在左下、B 在右下，边 AB 长 8，∠A 等于 60 度；从 C 向 AB 作垂线，垂足为 D，D 处是直角，AD 长 2.5、CD 是高、BD 长 5.5，由此可在直角三角形 BCD 中用勾股定理求出 BC。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[16,78],[64,78],[31,52]],"closed":true,"tone":"main"},{"t":"line","x1":31,"y1":52,"x2":31,"y2":78,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":31,"y":78,"from":90,"to":180,"r":4,"right":true,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":16,"y":78,"from":0,"to":60,"r":9,"label":"60°"},{"t":"text","x":46,"y":86,"text":"8","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":20,"y":61,"text":"5","size":3.6,"anchor":"middle","tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":16,"y":78,"label":"A","labelDx":-6.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":64,"y":78,"label":"B","labelDx":2.5,"labelDy":4},{"t":"dot","x":31,"y":52,"label":"C","labelDx":-1,"labelDy":-3},{"t":"dot","x":31,"y":78,"label":"D","labelDx":-1,"labelDy":5.5},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":95,"text":"CD⊥AB，把 △ABC 分成两个直角三角形","size":3.2,"anchor":"middle","tone":"muted"}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["△ ABC 不是直角三角形，作 CD⊥ AB 于点 D（∠ A=60^° 是锐角，垂足 D 落在线段 AB 上），把原三角形分成两个直角三角形。","在 Rt△ ACD 中，AD=AC·cos 60^°=5×(1)/(2)=(5)/(2)，CD=AC·sin 60^°=5√(3)2。","所以 BD=AB-AD=8-(5)/(2)=(11)/(2)。在 Rt△ BCD 中，BC=√(BD²+CD²)=√((121)/(4)+(75)/(4))=√(49)=7。","面积 S=(1)/(2)AB· CD=(1)/(2)× 8×5√(3)2=10√(3)。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：BC=7，△ ABC 的面积为 10√(3)。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"「两边一夹角」求第三边的通法是作高：先用三角函数求出公共的高与一段投影，再在另一个直角三角形中用勾股定理；求出的三边可以用「短边平方加高平方」快速验算。"},{"type":"list","title":"易错点","items":["定义中的对边、邻边是相对于某个锐角而言的，换角就换边；求 $\\cos A$ 时错用 $\\angle A$ 的对边是最常见的错误。","特殊角函数值容易记混：$\\sin 30^\\circ=\\frac{1}{2}$ 不要记成 $\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$，$\\tan 30^\\circ=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$ 不是 $\\sqrt{3}$，$\\tan 60^\\circ=\\sqrt{3}$ 不是 $\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$。","坡度是垂直高度与水平宽度的比（$i=\\tan\\alpha$），不要写成「高度与坡长的比」，也不要把坡角当成仰角。","仰角、俯角都是视线与水平线的夹角，不是与铅垂线的夹角；作图时先画水平线，再画视线。","解直角三角形至少需要已知一条边，只给两个锐角无法确定三角形的大小，因此求不出任何边长。","非直角三角形不能直接套用锐角三角函数，要先作高构造直角三角形，并注意所作的高可能落在图形外部。"]},{"type":"list","title":"解题方法","items":["解直角三角形先画图、把已知元素标在图上，再选同时含「一个已知元素与一个所求元素」的三角函数式。","见 30^°、45^°、60^° 就利用三边比（1:√(3):2 与 1:1:√(2)）设份数直接算，比反复查值更快。","遇到一般三角形就作高，把它转化为两个直角三角形，用公共的高或公共边把两个三角形联系起来。","实际问题（仰角俯角、方位角、坡度）先翻译成图形语言，标出水平线与铅垂线，再抽象成直角三角形。","求线段长优先设未知数并用三角函数列方程，一次求出结果，避免多次开方导致误差累积。"]}],"questions":[{"id":"m-geo-ruijiao-sanjiao-q1","type":"choice","stem":"在 Rt△ ABC 中，∠ C=90^°，AC=3，BC=4，则 sin A 的值是","answer":"B","explain":"先用勾股定理求斜边：AB=√(3²+4²)=5。∠ A 的对边是 BC=4，所以 sin A=(BC)/(AB)=(4)/(5)。(3)/(5) 是 cos A，(3)/(4) 是 tan A。","options":["(3)/(5)","(4)/(5)","(3)/(4)","(4)/(3)"],"difficulty":1,"tags":["锐角三角函数定义","勾股定理"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-ruijiao-q1","title":"已知两条直角边，求 sin A","caption":"∠C=90°、AC=3、BC=4：先用勾股定理求斜边 AB=5；∠A 的对边是 BC，所以 sin A = BC/AB","view":"wide","alt":"直角三角形 ABC，顶点 C 处画有直角方框，顶点 A 处标出角 A；直角边 AC 标注为 3、BC 标注为 4，斜边 AB 待求。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[60,54],[24,6],[24,54]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":28,"y1":54,"x2":28,"y2":50,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":28,"y1":50,"x2":24,"y2":50,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":60,"y":54,"from":126.87,"to":180,"r":9,"tone":"ok","label":"∠A"},{"t":"text","x":42,"y":59,"text":"AC = 3","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":18,"y":30,"text":"BC = 4","anchor":"end","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":45,"y":25,"text":"AB = ?","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"dot","x":60,"y":54,"label":"A","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":24,"y":6,"label":"B","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":24,"y":54,"label":"C","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4}]}},{"id":"m-geo-ruijiao-sanjiao-q2","type":"choice","stem":"sin 30^°+cos 60^°-tan 45^° 的值是","answer":"A","explain":"sin 30^°=(1)/(2)，cos 60^°=(1)/(2)，tan 45^°=1，所以原式 =(1)/(2)+(1)/(2)-1=0。若把 sin 30^° 记成 √(2)2 就会得出错误结果。","options":["0","(1)/(2)","1","√(3)2"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["特殊角的三角函数值"]},{"id":"m-geo-ruijiao-sanjiao-q3","type":"choice","stem":"在 Rt△ ABC 中，∠ C=90^°，∠ A=45^°，BC=4，则 AB 的长是","answer":"B","explain":"因为 ∠ C=90^°、∠ A=45^°，所以 ∠ B=45^°，△ ABC 是等腰直角三角形，AC=BC=4，斜边 AB=√(4²+4²)=4√(2)。也可由 sin 45^°=(BC)/(AB) 得 AB=4√(2)2=4√(2)。","options":["4","4√(2)","8","4√(3)"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["解直角三角形","等腰直角三角形"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-ruijiao-q3","title":"45 度的直角三角形两直角边相等","caption":"∠C=90°、∠A=45° 时 ∠B 也是 45°，所以 AC=BC=4；斜边用勾股定理或 sin45° 求","view":"wide","alt":"等腰直角三角形 ABC，顶点 C 处画有直角方框，顶点 A 处标出 45 度；两条直角边 AC 与 BC 都标注为 4，斜边 AB 待求。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[64,54],[24,14],[24,54]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":28,"y1":54,"x2":28,"y2":50,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":28,"y1":50,"x2":24,"y2":50,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":64,"y":54,"from":135,"to":180,"r":9,"tone":"ok","label":"45°"},{"t":"text","x":44,"y":59,"text":"AC = 4","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":18,"y":34,"text":"BC = 4","anchor":"end","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":48,"y":29,"text":"AB = ?","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"dot","x":64,"y":54,"label":"A","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":24,"y":14,"label":"B","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":24,"y":54,"label":"C","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4}]}},{"id":"m-geo-ruijiao-sanjiao-q4","type":"fill","stem":"在 Rt△ ABC 中，∠ C=90^°，∠ A=30^°，AB=8，则 BC= ____。（只填数字）","answer":"4","explain":"由 sin A=(BC)/(AB) 得 BC=AB·sin 30^°=8×(1)/(2)=4；也可直接由「30^° 角所对的直角边等于斜边的一半」得到同样结果。","difficulty":1,"tags":["解直角三角形","特殊角函数值"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-ruijiao-q4","title":"已知斜边与 30 度角，求对边","caption":"∠C=90°、∠A=30°、斜边 AB=8：30° 角所对的直角边 BC 等于斜边的一半，也可由 sin30° 求得","view":"wide","alt":"直角三角形 ABC，顶点 C 处画有直角方框，顶点 A 处标出 30 度；斜边 AB 标注为 8，与 30 度角相对的直角边 BC 待求。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[20,54],[80,54],[65,28]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":61.54,"y1":30,"x2":63.54,"y2":33.47,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":63.54,"y1":33.47,"x2":67,"y2":31.46,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":20,"y":54,"from":0,"to":30.02,"r":8,"tone":"ok","label":"30°"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":59,"text":"AB = 8","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":77,"y":40,"text":"BC = ?","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"dot","x":20,"y":54,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":80,"y":54,"label":"B","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":65,"y":28,"label":"C","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":-2.8}]}},{"id":"m-geo-ruijiao-sanjiao-q5","type":"fill","stem":"某斜坡的坡角为 45^°，坡面的长为 6√(2) m，则这个斜坡的垂直高度是 ____ m。（只填数字）","answer":"6","explain":"坡面长是斜边，垂直高度是 45^° 角所对的直角边，所以垂直高度 =6√(2)×sin 45^°=6√(2)×√(2)2=6（m）。此时水平宽度也是 6 m，坡度 i=1:1。","difficulty":2,"tags":["坡度","特殊角函数值"]},{"id":"m-geo-ruijiao-sanjiao-q6","type":"short","stem":"写出 30^°、45^°、60^° 的正弦、余弦、正切值，并说明可以怎样借助直角三角形的三边之比来记忆它们。","answer":"函数值：$\\sin 30^\\circ=\\frac{1}{2}$，$\\cos 30^\\circ=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$，$\\tan 30^\\circ=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$；$\\sin 45^\\circ=\\cos 45^\\circ=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$，$\\tan 45^\\circ=1$；$\\sin 60^\\circ=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$，$\\cos 60^\\circ=\\frac{1}{2}$，$\\tan 60^\\circ=\\sqrt{3}$。记忆方法：借助两个特殊直角三角形。一是含 $30^\\circ$ 角的直角三角形，它的三边之比为 $1:\\sqrt{3}:2$（依次是 $30^\\circ$ 角的对边、邻边、斜边），按定义即可读出 $\\sin 30^\\circ=\\frac{1}{2}$，$\\cos 30^\\circ=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$，$\\tan 30^\\circ=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$，以及 $60^\\circ$ 的三个值（把对边、邻边互换）。二是等腰直角三角形，三边之比为 $1:1:\\sqrt{2}$，于是 $\\sin 45^\\circ=\\cos 45^\\circ=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$，$\\tan 45^\\circ=1$。还要记住变化规律：$\\sin\\alpha$ 与 $\\tan\\alpha$ 随锐角增大而增大，$\\cos\\alpha$ 随锐角增大而减小，所以 $\\sin 30^\\circ<\\sin 45^\\circ<\\sin 60^\\circ$，而 $\\cos 30^\\circ>\\cos 45^\\circ>\\cos 60^\\circ$，用它可以快速检验结果是否合理。","explain":"本题考查特殊角三角函数值的记忆准确度与来源说明。评分要点：九个值写全写对；说明可以借助两个特殊直角三角形（三边比 1:√(3):2 与 1:1:√(2)）按定义读出；补充增减性规律用于检验结果。常见失分点：把 sin 30^° 记成 √(2)2、把 tan 30^° 记成 √(3) 这类混记；只背数值说不出依据；漏写或写错 45^° 的正切值。","difficulty":2,"tags":["特殊角的三角函数值","记忆方法"],"rubric":["三组特殊角的九个函数值全部写对","说明可以用含 30^° 角的直角三角形三边比 1:√(3):2 记忆","说明可以用等腰直角三角形的三边比 1:1:√(2) 记忆","指出 sin、tan 随锐角增大而增大，cos 随锐角增大而减小","（加分）指出易混点，如 sin 30^° 不要记成 √(2)2"]},{"id":"m-geo-ruijiao-sanjiao-z1","type":"choice","stem":"如图意，一轮船在灯塔 P 的北偏东 30^° 方向、距灯塔 80 海里的点 A 处，正沿正南方向航行。航行过程中轮船与灯塔 P 的最短距离是","answer":"B","explain":"轮船沿正南方向航行，航线是过点 A 的南北方向的直线，到直线以垂线段最短，所以最短距离是灯塔 P 到这条南北线的距离（即点 A 相对灯塔的东向偏移量）。A 在 P 的北偏东 30^° 方向，80 海里是斜边，最短距离是 30^° 角所对的直角边，等于 80×sin 30^°=40 海里。选 C 求的是 80cos 30^°=40√(3)，那是轮船从 A 航行到垂足位置所走的距离。","options":["20 海里","40 海里","40√(3) 海里","80 海里"],"difficulty":3,"tags":["解直角三角形","实际应用"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-ruijiao-z1","title":"轮船到灯塔的最短距离","caption":"船在灯塔 P 的北偏东 30° 方向、距 80 海里的点 A，沿正南方向航行；P 到航线的垂线段 PH 最短，在直角三角形 APH 中 PH=80sin30°=40 海里","view":"square","alt":"灯塔 P 到点 A 的连线与正北方向成 30 度，PA 等于 80 海里；轮船从 A 沿正南方向的直线航行，从 P 向这条航线作垂线，垂足为 H，PH 就是最短距离。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":6,"x2":50,"y2":94,"tone":"muted","dashed":true},{"t":"line","x1":30,"y1":60,"x2":30,"y2":6,"tone":"muted","dashed":true},{"t":"line","x1":30,"y1":60,"x2":50,"y2":25.4,"width":0.9},{"t":"line","x1":30,"y1":60,"x2":50,"y2":60,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":46,"y1":60,"x2":46,"y2":56,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":46,"y1":56,"x2":50,"y2":56,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":30,"y":60,"from":90,"to":59.97,"r":15,"tone":"ok","label":"30°"},{"t":"text","x":52,"y":6,"text":"正南航线","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":26,"y":8,"text":"北","anchor":"end","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":43,"y":39,"text":"80 海里","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":40,"y":67,"text":"最短距离 = ?","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"dot","x":30,"y":60,"label":"P","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":25.4,"label":"A","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":60,"label":"H","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":2.4}]}},{"id":"m-geo-ruijiao-sanjiao-z2","type":"short","stem":"已知：在 △ ABC 中，∠ B=45^°，∠ C=30^°，BC 边上的高 AD=6。求 △ ABC 的三边长 AB、AC、BC。","answer":"高 $AD$ 把 $\\triangle ABC$ 分成 $\\mathrm{Rt}\\triangle ABD$ 与 $\\mathrm{Rt}\\triangle ACD$，两个直角三角形共用 $AD=6$。在 $\\mathrm{Rt}\\triangle ABD$ 中，$\\angle B=45^\\circ$，所以 $\\triangle ABD$ 是等腰直角三角形，$BD=AD=6$，$AB=\\sqrt{6^2+6^2}=6\\sqrt{2}$（也可由 $AB=\\frac{AD}{\\sin 45^\\circ}$ 求得）。在 $\\mathrm{Rt}\\triangle ACD$ 中，$\\angle C=30^\\circ$，由「$30^\\circ$ 角所对的直角边等于斜边的一半」得 $AC=2AD=12$，再由勾股定理得 $CD=\\sqrt{AC^2-AD^2}=\\sqrt{144-36}=6\\sqrt{3}$（也可由 $CD=\\frac{AD}{\\tan 30^\\circ}$ 求得）。所以 $BC=BD+CD=6+6\\sqrt{3}$，即三边长分别为 $AB=6\\sqrt{2}$，$AC=12$，$BC=6+6\\sqrt{3}$。","explain":"本题考查利用公共高把一般三角形转化为两个直角三角形求解。评分要点：分清两个直角三角形；在含 45^° 的直角三角形中求 AB 与 BD；在含 30^° 的直角三角形中由 sin 30^°=(AD)/(AC) 或三边比求 AC=12、CD=6√(3)；最后相加得 BC。常见失分点：把 30^° 的对边与邻边弄反（误得 AC=6√(3)、CD=12）；只答两条边而漏掉 BC=BD+CD；根式没有化成最简。","difficulty":3,"tags":["解直角三角形","特殊角函数值"],"rubric":["在 Rt△ABD 中利用 45° 得 BD=AD=6，AB=6√2","在 Rt△ACD 中利用 30° 得 AC=2AD=12","求得 CD=6√3","由 BC=BD+CD 求出 BC=6+6√3"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-ruijiao-z2","title":"已知两角与高，解这个斜三角形","caption":"∠B=45°、∠C=30°，BC 边上的高 AD=6：分别解直角三角形 ABD 与 ACD 求出 AB、AC，再把 BD 与 DC 相加得 BC","view":"wide","alt":"三角形 ABC，BC 为底边，AD 是 BC 边上的高（D 处画有直角方框）；顶点 B 处的角标为 45 度、顶点 C 处的角标为 30 度，高 AD 标注为 6。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[46,30],[22,54],[87.6,54]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":46,"y1":30,"x2":46,"y2":54,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":42.5,"y1":54,"x2":42.5,"y2":50.5,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":42.5,"y1":50.5,"x2":46,"y2":50.5,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"angle","x":22,"y":54,"from":45,"to":0,"r":7,"tone":"ok","label":"45°"},{"t":"angle","x":87.6,"y":54,"from":150.02,"to":180,"r":7,"tone":"ok","label":"30°"},{"t":"text","x":43,"y":43,"text":"AD = 6","anchor":"end","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":28,"y":36,"text":"AB = ?","anchor":"end","size":3.6,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"text","x":72,"y":41,"text":"AC = ?","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"text","x":55,"y":60,"text":"BC = ?","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"danger"},{"t":"dot","x":46,"y":30,"label":"A","labelDx":-1.2,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":22,"y":54,"label":"B","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":87.6,"y":54,"label":"C","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":46,"y":54,"label":"D","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4}]}}]},{"id":"m-geo-touying-shitu","title":"投影与视图","subtitle":"人教版九下 · 第33章 投影与视图","grade":"9b","tags":["图形与几何","投影与视图"],"blocks":[{"type":"note","title":"教材章节","text":"人教版九下 · 第33章 投影与视图"},{"type":"note","title":"一句话概述","text":"认识平行投影与中心投影，掌握三视图的画法与长对正、高平齐、宽相等的对应规律。"},{"type":"h","text":"核心概念"},{"type":"p","text":"投影与平行投影：用光线照射物体，在某个平面上得到的影子叫物体的投影，照射光线叫投影线，投影所在的平面叫投影面。由平行光线（如太阳光）形成的投影叫平行投影。同一时刻的平行投影中，物体的高与它的影长的比相等，这是测高的依据。"},{"type":"p","text":"中心投影：由同一点（点光源，如灯光）发出的光线形成的投影叫中心投影。中心投影中影长与物高不成简单正比例：物体离光源越近，影子越长。求影长或物高要用相似三角形，不能直接按比例算。"},{"type":"p","text":"正投影：投影线垂直于投影面产生的投影叫正投影。物体的正投影能如实反映它在某个方向上的形状和大小，三视图就是物体在三个互相垂直的方向上的正投影。"},{"type":"p","text":"三视图及其位置关系：从正面看物体得到的视图叫主视图（正视图），从左面看得到的叫左视图（侧视图），从上面看得到的叫俯视图。画三视图要遵循「长对正、高平齐、宽相等」：主视图与俯视图的长相等并对正，主视图与左视图的高相等并平齐，俯视图与左视图的宽相等。"},{"type":"p","text":"画三视图的规范：看得见的轮廓线画成实线，被遮挡而看不见的轮廓线画成虚线。三个视图按固定位置摆放：主视图在左上，左视图在主视图的右边，俯视图在主视图的下方，三者之间不留空隙。"},{"type":"p","text":"由三视图想象立体图形：还原几何体时先看俯视图确定底面的形状，再看主视图与左视图确定高度与前后位置。常见对应关系：三视图中两个是矩形、一个是圆，物体是圆柱；两个是三角形、一个是带圆心的圆，物体是圆锥；三个都是矩形时，物体可能是长方体，也可能是圆柱（要结合俯视图判断）。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"由三视图还原几何体并计算面积、体积\n先由俯视图定底面形状，再由主视图与左视图定高，还原成柱、锥或组合体后套公式；注意无盖容器、烟囱帽等是否计入底面，圆锥的半径、高、母线常用勾股定理联系。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"画三视图与「长对正、高平齐、宽相等」\n常考画法正误与尺寸对应：组合体、带孔几何体中被遮挡的轮廓要画虚线；先定主视方向，再逐图核对长、高、宽，小正方体堆叠可用「俯视图标数字法」求个数与表面积。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"平行投影测高与影长\n与相似三角形综合：同一时刻「物高与影长的比相等」，把竹竿、旗杆、楼房抽象成两个相似的直角三角形列比例式，注意单位统一，结果写明实际意义。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"中心投影与点光源问题\n光源、物体顶端与影子端点共线，构成相似三角形，设未知数列方程求灯高或影长；两次测量常列两个比例式消元，解题第一步先分清是平行投影还是中心投影。"},{"type":"table","title":"公式与定理","head":["公式/定理","表述","注意"],"rows":[["三视图的对应关系（长对正、高平齐、宽相等）","主视图与俯视图的长对正；主视图与左视图的高平齐；俯视图与左视图的宽相等。","这是画三视图与由三视图还原立体图形的核心口诀，方向记混会把图形画错"],["圆柱的侧面积","S_(侧)=2π rh","r 是底面半径，h 是高；圆柱侧面展开图是矩形，长为底面周长 2π r，宽为高 h"],["圆锥的侧面积","S_(侧)=π rl","r 是底面半径，l 是母线长；圆锥侧面展开图是扇形，扇形弧长等于底面周长 2π r，与扇形面积公式 (1)/(2)lr 的结果一致"],["圆锥的全面积","S_(全)=π rl+π r²","侧面积加底面积；计算实际问题时先判断是否要算底面（无盖容器只算侧面积与一个底面）"],["正方体与长方体的表面积、体积","S=6a², V=a³","正方体棱长为 a；长方体对应为 S=2(ab+bc+ca)，V=abc"]]},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"一个几何体的三视图是：主视图和左视图都是长为 4、宽为 2 的矩形，俯视图是直径为 4 的圆。指出这个几何体是什么，并求它的侧面积。"},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["俯视图是圆，说明底面是圆；主视图与左视图都是相同的矩形，说明该几何体上下一样粗、侧面是曲面，所以它是圆柱。","由俯视图的直径是 4 得底面半径 r=2；由主视图的高为 2 得圆柱的高 h=2。","侧面积 S_(侧)=2π rh=2π× 2× 2=8π。","验证：把圆柱的侧面展开，得到长为底面周长 2π r=4π、宽为高 2 的矩形，面积为 4π× 2=8π，与公式结果一致。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：该几何体是底面半径为 2、高为 2 的圆柱，侧面积是 8π。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"由三视图还原几何体：先看俯视图定底面形状，再看主视图与左视图定高；求表面积前先判断要不要计入底面。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"一个几何体的三视图都是边长为 2 的正方形，求它的表面积和体积。"},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["三个视图都是正方形，说明这个几何体是棱长为 2 的正方体（从正面、左面、上面看到的都是同一个正方形）。","表面积 S=6a²=6× 2²=24。","体积 V=a³=2³=8。","补充说明各方向的对应：主视图的横向对应实物的长（左右方向），纵向对应高（上下方向）；俯视图的横向对应长，纵向对应宽（前后方向）；左视图的横向对应宽，纵向对应高。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：表面积是 24，体积是 8。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"「宽」在俯视图与左视图中都表示前后方向，但在两张图里分别是纵向与横向，这是最容易记混的地方。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"一根高 1.5 m 的木杆在阳光下的影长是 2 m，同一时刻一根旗杆的影长是 12 m（两次都是平行投影），求旗杆的高；如果把太阳光换成点光源，这个比例关系还成立吗？"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-touying-e1","title":"中心投影：用相似三角形求物高","caption":"光源 P、地面上的垂足 O、杆 AB 与影端 B1：△POB1 与 △BAB1 相似（都有一个直角，且在 B1 处有公共角），据此列比例式","view":"square","alt":"地面上立着一根杆 AB，点光源 P 在上方，从 P 向地面作垂线，垂足为 O；灯光经过杆顶 B 落到地面的点 B1 就是影子端点，B1 处与 O 处各画有直角方框。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":4,"y1":78,"x2":96,"y2":78,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":46,"y1":14,"x2":46,"y2":78,"dashed":true},{"t":"line","x1":64,"y1":78,"x2":64,"y2":44,"width":0.9},{"t":"line","x1":46,"y1":14,"x2":84.4,"y2":78,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":46,"y1":74,"x2":50,"y2":74,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":74,"x2":50,"y2":78,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":64,"y1":74,"x2":60,"y2":74,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":60,"y1":74,"x2":60,"y2":78,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":50,"y":20,"text":"点光源 P","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":40,"y":84,"text":"O","anchor":"end","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":86,"y":84,"text":"B1（影子端点）","anchor":"end","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":46,"y":14,"label":"P","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8},{"t":"dot","x":64,"y":78,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":64,"y":44,"label":"B","labelDx":2.6,"labelDy":-2.8}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["太阳光是平行光，属于平行投影。同一时刻的平行投影中，物高与影长的比相等，设旗杆高为 h m，则 (h)/(1.5)=(12)/(2)=6，解得 h=9（m）。","若光源改为点光源（灯光），属于中心投影：物体离光源越近影子越长，影长与物高不再成固定比例，上述比例式不能再用。","此时要用相似三角形求解：把光源记为 P，两个物体的顶端与它们的影子端点分别与 P 构成两个三角形，这两个三角形相似，按对应边成比例列出方程求解。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：旗杆高 9 m；换成点光源后比例关系不再成立，必须用相似三角形计算。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"投影问题的第一步是先判断投影类型：平行投影用「同一时刻物高与影长的比相等」，中心投影用相似三角形。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"一个几何体的三视图如下：主视图与左视图都是底边长为 6、高为 4 的等腰三角形，俯视图是直径为 6 的圆（含圆心）。指出这个几何体是什么，并求它的侧面积与全面积。"},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["俯视图是带圆心的圆，说明底面是圆；主视图与左视图都是三角形，说明从侧面看顶部收成一点，所以这个几何体是圆锥。","由俯视图得底面直径为 6，即底面半径 r=3；由主视图（等腰三角形）的高得圆锥的高 h=4。","设母线长为 l，半径、高、母线构成直角三角形，由勾股定理 l=√(r²+h²)=√(3²+4²)=5。","侧面积 S_(侧)=π rl=π× 3× 5=15π；全面积 S_(全)=S_(侧)+S_(底)=15π+π× 3²=24π。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：该几何体是底面半径为 3、高为 4 的圆锥，侧面积为 15π，全面积为 24π。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"「两个三角形加一个带圆心的圆」对应圆锥；由三视图还原后，半径、高、母线构成直角三角形，求全面积时别忘了加底面积。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"夜里，一根高 1.5 m 的标杆 AB 直立在路灯下，测得它的影长为 2.5 m；把标杆沿影子的方向向外平移 4 m 后，影长变为 3.5 m。求路灯的高度（路灯与标杆都垂直于地面）。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-touying-e2","title":"用两次影长求路灯高","caption":"路灯高 H、标杆 AB=1.5 m：灯光过杆顶落到地面就是影端；两次测量各构成一对相似三角形，联立两个比例式即可求 H","view":"square","alt":"地面上立着路灯与一根标杆 AB；灯光经过杆顶在地面形成影子。标杆向外平移 4 米后的第二个位置画出更长的影子，两次都构成直角三角形。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":4,"y1":78,"x2":96,"y2":78,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":10,"y1":78,"x2":10,"y2":48,"width":1},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":78,"x2":50,"y2":72,"width":0.9},{"t":"line","x1":66,"y1":78,"x2":66,"y2":72,"width":0.9},{"t":"line","x1":10,"y1":48,"x2":60,"y2":78,"tone":"accent","dashed":true},{"t":"line","x1":10,"y1":48,"x2":80,"y2":78,"tone":"accent","dashed":true},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":78,"x2":60,"y2":78,"tone":"ok","width":1},{"t":"line","x1":66,"y1":78,"x2":80,"y2":78,"tone":"ok","width":1},{"t":"text","x":14,"y":44,"text":"H","anchor":"start","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":46,"y":71,"text":"标杆 AB = 1.5 m","anchor":"end","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":55,"y":84,"text":"影长 2.5 m","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":58,"y":68,"text":"向外平移 4 m","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"text","x":74,"y":84,"text":"影长 3.5 m","anchor":"middle","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":78,"label":"A","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":2.4},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":72,"label":"B","labelDx":-5.4,"labelDy":-2.8}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["设路灯高 H m，灯在地面的射影到标杆初始位置的距离为 s m。灯光是点光源，属于中心投影：标杆顶端、影子端点与光源在同一条直线上，构成相似三角形。","第一次测量：由相似得「物高与灯高之比等于影长与（灯到杆距离加影长）之比」，即 (1.5)/(H)=(2.5)/(s+2.5)。","第二次标杆离灯更远了 4 m，影长为 3.5 m，同理得 (1.5)/(H)=(3.5)/(s+4+3.5)。","两个比相等：(s+2.5)/(2.5)=(s+7.5)/(3.5)，交叉相乘得 3.5(s+2.5)=2.5(s+7.5)，解得 s=10。代入第一式得 (1.5)/(H)=(2.5)/(12.5)，解得 H=7.5。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：路灯的高度是 7.5 m。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"中心投影中「物高与影长」不成固定比例，但「灯高、灯到物体的距离、影长」之间始终满足相似比例；两次测量列两个比例式，消去中间量即可求灯高。"},{"type":"list","title":"易错点","items":["画三视图时，看得见的轮廓线要画实线、看不见的轮廓线要画虚线，把虚线画成实线会改变几何体的结构。","「长对正、高平齐、宽相等」的对应关系容易记混：长对正说的是主视图与俯视图，高平齐说的是主视图与左视图，宽相等说的是俯视图与左视图。","中心投影（灯光）与平行投影（太阳光）不能混用：中心投影中影长与物高不成固定比例，直接套比例式是典型错误。","由三视图还原几何体时容易忽略位置关系：三个视图都是矩形时，物体可能是长方体也可能是圆柱，必须结合俯视图判断。","俯视图与左视图中的虚线表示前后方向被遮挡的轮廓，忽略虚线会导致对几何体内部结构的判断出错。","求表面积时没有判断实际问题是否需要计算底面（如无盖水桶、圆锥形帐篷），多算或漏算都会出错。"]},{"type":"list","title":"解题方法","items":["画三视图按「从正面看、从上面看、从左面看」的顺序进行，再用「长对正、高平齐、宽相等」逐项检查。","由三视图还原几何体：先看俯视图确定底面形状，再由主视图、左视图确定高度与前后位置。","小正方体堆叠问题用「俯视图标数字法」：在俯视图每个格子里标出该位置垒起的小正方体个数，再加总得到总数。","投影问题先判断投影类型：平行投影用「同一时刻物高与影长的比相等」，中心投影用相似三角形。","求表面积与体积先还原几何体，再套用公式，并判断底面是否要计入。"]}],"questions":[{"id":"m-geo-touying-shitu-q1","type":"choice","stem":"下列投影中，属于中心投影的是","answer":"B","explain":"中心投影是由同一点发出的光线形成的投影，灯光正是点光源，所以 B 属于中心投影；太阳光与题目所说的平行光都是平行光线，A、C、D 都属于平行投影。","options":["阳光下树的影子","灯光下人的影子","阳光下旗杆的影子","平行光下正方形的投影"],"difficulty":1,"tags":["中心投影","平行投影"]},{"id":"m-geo-touying-shitu-q2","type":"choice","stem":"一个几何体的主视图和左视图都是矩形，俯视图是圆，则这个几何体是","answer":"A","explain":"俯视图是圆，说明底面是圆；主视图与左视图都是相同的矩形，说明几何体上下一样粗、侧面是曲面，所以是圆柱。圆锥的主视图与左视图应是三角形；球的三视图都是圆；棱柱的俯视图应是多边形。","options":["圆柱","圆锥","球","棱柱"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["由三视图还原几何体"]},{"id":"m-geo-touying-shitu-q3","type":"choice","stem":"关于三视图之间的对应关系，下列说法正确的是","answer":"C","explain":"正确的对应关系是：主视图与俯视图长对正，主视图与左视图高平齐，俯视图与左视图宽相等。A、B 把方向说错了，D 表述的长对正也不成立。","options":["主视图与左视图的长对正","主视图与俯视图的高平齐","俯视图与左视图的宽相等","左视图与俯视图的长对正"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["三视图","对应关系"]},{"id":"m-geo-touying-shitu-q4","type":"fill","stem":"一个圆柱的底面半径是 3，高是 4，则它的侧面积是 ____π。（只填数字系数）","answer":"24","explain":"圆柱的侧面展开图是矩形，长为底面周长 2π r=6π，宽为高 4，所以侧面积 S_(侧)=2π rh=6π× 4=24π，系数是 24。","difficulty":2,"tags":["圆柱侧面积","侧面展开图"]},{"id":"m-geo-touying-shitu-q5","type":"fill","stem":"身高 1.6 m 的小明在阳光下的影长是 2 m，同一时刻旁边一棵树的影长是 10 m，则这棵树高 ____ m。（只填数字）","answer":"8","explain":"太阳光是平行光，同一时刻平行投影下物高与影长的比相等。设树高为 h m，则 (h)/(1.6)=(10)/(2)=5，解得 h=8，即树高 8 m。","difficulty":1,"tags":["平行投影","测高"]},{"id":"m-geo-touying-shitu-q6","type":"short","stem":"说明平行投影与中心投影的区别，并指出在这两种投影下分别怎样求物体的高（或影长）。","answer":"平行投影是由平行光线（如太阳光）形成的投影；中心投影是由同一点（点光源，如灯光）发出的光线形成的投影。两者的区别在于光线的形状：平行投影的光线互相平行，同一时刻所有物体的投影都与实物成同一比例；中心投影的光线交于一点，物体离光源越近影子越大，影长与物高不成固定比例。平行投影下求高或影长：利用「同一时刻物高与影长的比相等」，即 $\\frac{物高_1}{影长_1}=\\frac{物高_2}{影长_2}$，列比例式求解（也可以直接用相似三角形，因为阳光与地面所成夹角相同）。中心投影下求高或影长：把光源、物体顶端与物体影子端点抽象成两个三角形，由光线同源得两个三角形相似，按对应边成比例列方程求解；注意此时影长与物高不成简单正比例，不能直接套用比例式。","explain":"本题考查两种投影的区别与实际计算方法的迁移。评分要点：说明平行投影的光线互相平行、中心投影的光线交于一点；指出平行投影中同一时刻物高与影长的比相等（可列比例式），中心投影中影长与物高不成固定比例、要用相似三角形列方程。常见失分点：把灯光下的问题按太阳光的比例关系直接套用；只答出「光线不同」而不说明由此带来的计算方法差异；中心投影下误以为「离光源越远景长越大」。","difficulty":2,"tags":["平行投影","中心投影","实际应用"],"rubric":["说明平行投影的光线平行、中心投影的光线交于一点（点光源）","指出平行投影同一时刻物高与影长的比相等","指出中心投影中影长与物高不成固定比例（离光源越近影子越大）","给出平行投影的计算方法（比例式或相似）","给出中心投影的计算方法（用相似三角形列方程）"]},{"id":"m-geo-touying-shitu-z1","type":"choice","stem":"一个圆锥的底面半径为 3，母线长为 6，把它的侧面展开得到的扇形的圆心角是","answer":"C","explain":"圆锥侧面展开图的弧长等于底面圆的周长 2π r=6π。设圆心角为 n^°，由弧长公式 (nπ× 6)/(180)=6π，解得 n=180，所以圆心角是 180^°。直观检验：展开图半径即母线 6，圆心角 180^° 说明展开图恰好是半圆，面积 (1)/(2)π× 6²=18π，与 π rl=π× 3× 6=18π 一致。","options":["60^°","90^°","180^°","270^°"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["侧面展开图","弧长公式"]},{"id":"m-geo-touying-shitu-z2","type":"short","stem":"用若干个棱长相同的小立方体搭成一个几何体，其俯视图是 2 行 3 列的矩形，且每个位置都至少有 1 个小立方体；主视图从左到右共 3 列，各列的最大层数依次为 2、3、1；左视图从左到右共 2 列，分别对应俯视图的上、下两行，最大层数依次为 3、2。搭成这个几何体最少需要多少个小立方体？最多需要多少个？","answer":"每个位置的层数同时受主视图（所在列的最大层数）与左视图（所在行的最大层数）限制，不能超过两者中较小的一个。最多情形：让每个位置取「主视图该列最大层数」与「左视图该行最大层数」中的较小者，上行各位置为 $2,3,1$，下行各位置为 $2,2,1$，总数 $=2+3+1+2+2+1=11$ 个，此时每列、每行的最大层数都恰好达标。最少情形：先按俯视图每格放 $1$ 个（共 $6$ 个）；第 $2$ 列必须有一处达到 $3$ 层，而下行的最大层数只能是 $2$，所以把上行第 $2$ 列加高到 $3$（增加 $2$ 个）；第 $1$ 列必须有一处达到 $2$ 层，把下行第 $1$ 列加高到 $2$（增加 $1$ 个），同时下行的最大层数也就达到了 $2$。总数 $=6+2+1=9$ 个。检验：上行层数 $1,3,1$，下行层数 $2,1,1$，各列最大层数为 $2,3,1$，两行最大层数为 $3,2$，与三个视图都相符。所以最少 $9$ 个，最多 $11$ 个。","explain":"本题考查由三视图确定几何体中小立方体数量的最值问题。评分要点：明确每个位置最多取「主视图列高」与「左视图行高」的较小值，逐格计算得最多 11 个；最少情形先放保底的 6 个，再用最少的增量满足「第 2 列有 3 层、第 1 列有 2 层（兼作下行行高）」，得最少 9 个；最后用一种方案对照三个视图检验。常见失分点：忽略俯视图「每格至少 1 个」而把最少算成 8 或更少；最多情形忘记取较小者，把所有格子都填成 3；只答一个最值。","difficulty":3,"tags":["三视图","分类讨论"],"rubric":["理解每个位置层数受主视图列高与左视图行高的双重限制","最多情形：每个位置取列限制与行限制中的较小者，得 11 个","最少情形：每格保底 1 个，再把第 2 列加高到 3、第 1 列加高到 2（兼作下行行高），得 9 个","给出一种满足三个视图的摆放方案并检验"]}]},{"id":"m-geo-zhengming-yiucuo","title":"几何证明常见错误与辅助线","subtitle":"人教版初中 · 几何证明","grade":"all","tags":["图形与几何","几何证明"],"blocks":[{"type":"note","title":"教材章节","text":"人教版初中 · 几何证明"},{"type":"note","title":"一句话概述","text":"梳理几何证明中的高频错误与常用辅助线作法，掌握基本图形识别与规范书写。"},{"type":"h","text":"核心概念"},{"type":"p","text":"判定与性质的区别：几何定理大多成对出现：由条件推出结论的是判定，如「两组对边分别相等的四边形是平行四边形」；由已知结论推出关系的是性质，如「平行四边形的两组对边分别相等」。书写证明时依据必须与推理方向一致——把判定当性质用（或反之）是最常见的失分点。"},{"type":"p","text":"几何证明的基本结构：完整的证明要写清三部分：已知（题目给出的条件）、求证（要证明的结论）、证明（推理过程）。推理的每一步都应有依据，依据可以是定义、基本事实、已学定理，也可以是证明过程中已经推出的结论。"},{"type":"p","text":"隐含条件的挖掘：公共边、公共角、对顶角、同角（等角）的余角与补角、同圆或等圆的半径相等、折叠得到的等量关系，都是图形中隐含的相等关系。它们往往是找到全等或相似的关键，但挖掘出来之后必须在证明中明确写出来，不能用「由图可知」代替。"},{"type":"p","text":"辅助线的作用与书写规范：辅助线的作用是把分散的条件集中起来，构造基本图形（全等三角形、相似三角形、等腰三角形、直角三角形）。作法要写清楚，例如「延长 AD 到 E，使 DE=AD，连接 BE」；只写「作辅助线」而不说明作法，后面的推理就没有依据。"},{"type":"p","text":"常用的基本图形：常见的基本图形有：平行线的「三线八角」；全等的「共顶点角」「8 字形（对顶角加平行）」；相似的「A 型」「X 型」「母子型」「一线三等角」；等腰的「角平分线加平行线」；圆的「直径与直角」。读题时能识别出基本图形，就能迅速定位思路。"},{"type":"p","text":"证明中的常见逻辑错误：典型错误包括：循环论证（用要证的结论去证它自己）；用图形代替推理（「由图可见」「显然」）；漏写前提（如用「同旁内角互补」而不先说明两直线平行）；把相似的性质与全等的判定混用；只写结论不写依据。"},{"type":"p","text":"由已知到求证的双向分析：寻找证明思路有两种方式：「由因导果」从已知条件出发逐步推出结论，「执果索因」从结论出发寻找使结论成立所需的条件。两者结合、在中间会合，思路就找到了；条件较多的题目先画图、把已知标在图上，再在基本图形中寻找突破口。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"全等三角形判定的规范书写与易错辨析\n每一步依据写清楚，公共边、公共角、对顶角要明确写出再引用；SSA 与「两边成比例且对角相等」不能判定全等与相似，是选择、纠错题的高频陷阱。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"辅助线的作法与选择\n见中线倍长中线、见两个中点连中位线、见角平分线作垂线或平行线、见特殊角构造直角三角形；作法必须写完整（延长到某点使某段等于某段，再连接），否则推理缺少依据。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"线段和差、等积式与不等关系的证明\n证 a²=bc 先化比例式找相似；证「长边等于两短边之和」用截长补短或旋转把线段集中；证不等式用三角形三边关系配合全等转移线段，落笔前先想清「把哪些线段搬到哪里」。"},{"type":"note","title":"中考考法","text":"证明的逻辑规范与纠错\n纠错题先指出错误依据（如误用 SSA、把判定当性质、用「由图可知」代替推理），再给出正确条件组合（把对角换成夹角用 SAS，或补一个角用 AAS）；依据必须与推理方向一致。"},{"type":"table","title":"公式与定理","head":["公式/定理","表述","注意"],"rows":[["面积法（同一面积两种表示）","S=(1)/(2)ah₁=(1)/(2)bh₂","同一个三角形用不同的底和对应的高表示面积，可得到线段之间的比例关系，常用来证明线段相等或求线段长"],["三角形中位线（中点问题的通用工具）","DE∥ BC, DE=(1)/(2)BC","D、E 分别是 AB、AC 的中点；图形中有两个中点时首先考虑中位线"],["倍长中线构造全等","若 AD 是 △ ABC 的中线，延长 AD 到 E 使 DE=AD，连接 BE，则 △ ADC≌△ EDB（SAS），从而 AC=BE 且 AC∥ BE。","见中点（中线）就想倍长中线，它把分散的线段集中到同一个三角形中，是证明线段不等关系与线段相等的常用手法"],["两个特殊直角三角形的三边之比","1:√(3):2, 1:1:√(2)","依次是含 30^° 角的直角三角形（30^° 角的对边、邻边、斜边）与等腰直角三角形；求线段长时可直接设份数"],["相似基本图形（A 型）的比例式","(AD)/(AB)=(AE)/(AC)=(DE)/(BC)","DE∥ BC 且 D 在 AB 上、E 在 AC 上；X 型（8 字形）的比例式与之对应，注意对应边的顺序不能颠倒"]]},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"在 △ ABC 中，AD 是 BC 边上的中线，求证 AB+AC>2AD。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zhengming-e1","title":"把中线倍长，用三边关系证不等式","caption":"延长 AD 到 E 使 DE=AD，连接 BE：△BDE≌△CDA 得 BE=AC；在 △ABE 中 AB+BE>AE，即 AB+AC>2AD","view":"square","alt":"三角形 ABC，AD 是 BC 边上的中线；延长 AD 到点 E 使 DE 等于 AD，连接 BE，AD 与 DE 画有相同的等长记号。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[30,14],[10,54],[88,54]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":30,"y1":14,"x2":68,"y2":94,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":10,"y1":54,"x2":68,"y2":94},{"t":"line","x1":40.85,"y1":33.36,"x2":38.15,"y2":34.64,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":59.85,"y1":73.36,"x2":57.15,"y2":74.64,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"dot","x":30,"y":14,"label":"A","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":10,"y":54,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":88,"y":54,"label":"C","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":49,"y":54,"label":"D","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":68,"y":94,"label":"E","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["延长 AD 到 E，使 DE=AD，连接 BE（辅助线作法：见中线考虑「倍长中线」）。","因为 AD 是 BC 边上的中线，所以 BD=CD（中线的定义）；又 ∠ ADC=∠ EDB（对顶角相等），AD=ED（已作），所以 △ ADC≌△ EDB（SAS）。","所以 AC=BE（全等三角形的对应边相等）。","在 △ ABE 中，由三角形三边关系得 AB+BE>AE（三角形任意两边之和大于第三边）。","把 BE=AC、AE=AD+DE=2AD 代入得 AB+AC>2AD。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：AB+AC>2AD。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"倍长中线的本质是把 AC「搬」成 BE，让 AB、AC、2AD 集中到同一个三角形里；这条辅助线也常用于证明线段相等或线段平行。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"在 △ ABC 中，D 在 BC 上，DE⊥ AB 于点 E，DF⊥ AC 于点 F，且 DE=DF。求证 AD 平分 ∠ BAC。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zhengming-e2","title":"到角两边距离相等的点","caption":"D 在 BC 上，DE⊥AB、DF⊥AC（E、F 处画直角方框）且 DE=DF（两段画相同的等长记号）：Rt△ADE≌Rt△ADF，所以 AD 平分 ∠BAC","view":"square","alt":"三角形 ABC，点 D 在边 BC 上；从 D 向 AB、AC 分别作垂线，垂足为 E 与 F，两处画有直角方框，DE 与 DF 画有相同的等长记号。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[46,12],[10,54],[90,50]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":46,"y1":12,"x2":49.6,"y2":52,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":49.6,"y1":52,"x2":27.7,"y2":33.3},{"t":"line","x1":49.6,"y1":52,"x2":67.8,"y2":30.8},{"t":"line","x1":29.98,"y1":30.65,"x2":32.64,"y2":32.92,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":32.64,"y1":32.92,"x2":30.36,"y2":35.57,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":65.15,"y1":28.51,"x2":62.87,"y2":31.17,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":62.87,"y1":31.17,"x2":65.52,"y2":33.46,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":37.68,"y1":43.79,"x2":39.62,"y2":41.51,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":57.56,"y1":40.42,"x2":59.84,"y2":42.38,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"dot","x":46,"y":12,"label":"A","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":10,"y":54,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":90,"y":50,"label":"C","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":49.6,"y":52,"label":"D","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":27.7,"y":33.3,"label":"E","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":67.8,"y":30.8,"label":"F","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["因为 DE⊥ AB、DF⊥ AC（已知），所以 DE、DF 分别是点 D 到直线 AB、AC 的距离（点到直线的距离的定义）。","因为 DE=DF（已知），所以点 D 到 ∠ BAC 两边的距离相等。","又点 D 在 ∠ BAC 的内部（因为 D 在 BC 上），所以点 D 在 ∠ BAC 的平分线上（在角的内部，到角两边距离相等的点在角的平分线上）。","所以 AD 平分 ∠ BAC。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：AD 平分 ∠ BAC。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"这里用的是角平分线的判定，不是三角形全等；「点在角的内部」是判定的前提，必须写明，否则结论不成立。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"在 △ ABC 中，∠ ABC 的平分线与 AC 相交于点 D，过点 D 作 DE∥ BC 交 AB 于点 E。求证 △ BDE 是等腰三角形。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zhengming-e3","title":"角平分线遇到平行线：角等则边等","caption":"BD 平分 ∠ABC（B 处两段相等的角弧），DE∥BC（两处平行箭头）：∠EDB=∠DBC=∠EBD，所以 △BDE 是等腰三角形，BE=DE","view":"wide","alt":"三角形 ABC，BD 是角 ABC 的平分线与 AC 交于点 D；过 D 作 DE 平行于 BC 交 AB 于点 E，顶点 B 处的两个角画有相同的弧线。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[36,10],[14,54],[88,54]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":14,"y1":54,"x2":56.8,"y2":27.6,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":56.8,"y1":27.6,"x2":27.2,"y2":27.6,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"poly","points":[[43.9,26.1],[41.5,27.6],[43.9,29.1]],"tone":"accent"},{"t":"poly","points":[[49.1,55.5],[51.5,54],[49.1,52.5]],"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":14,"y":54,"from":63.43,"to":31.67,"r":9,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"angle","x":14,"y":54,"from":31.67,"to":0,"r":9,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"dot","x":36,"y":10,"label":"A","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":14,"y":54,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":88,"y":54,"label":"C","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":56.8,"y":27.6,"label":"D","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":27.2,"y":27.6,"label":"E","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["因为 DE∥ BC，所以 ∠ EDB=∠ DBC（两直线平行，内错角相等）。","因为 BD 平分 ∠ ABC，所以 ∠ EBD=∠ DBC（角平分线的定义）。","所以 ∠ EBD=∠ EDB（等量代换）。","所以 BE=DE（等角对等边），即 △ BDE 是等腰三角形。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：△ BDE 是等腰三角形（其中 BE=DE）。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"「角平分线加平行线必得等腰三角形」是高频基本图形：见到这两个条件同时出现，就去寻找相等的角，再由「等角对等边」得等腰。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"已知：在 △ ABC 中，AD 平分 ∠ BAC 交 BC 于点 D，且 ∠ B=2∠ C。求证：AC=AB+BD。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zhengming-e4","title":"角平分线配截长：在 AC 上截 AE=AB","caption":"AD 平分 ∠BAC（A 处两段相等的角弧）；在 AC 上截 AE=AB（相等的两段画有相同的记号），得 △ABD≌△AED，于是 BD=DE；再由 ∠ADE=∠B=2∠C 得 DE=EC，所以 AC=AE+EC=AB+BD","view":"wide","alt":"三角形 ABC，AD 平分角 A 并与 BC 交于点 D；在 AC 上取点 E 使 AE 等于 AB，连接 DE，顶点 B 处的角标 2x、顶点 C 处的角标 x。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[27.2,11.1],[20,52],[76,52]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":27.2,"y1":11.1,"x2":42.1,"y2":52,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":42.1,"y1":52,"x2":59,"y2":37.8,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":27.2,"y":11.1,"from":-99.98,"to":-69.98,"r":10,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"angle","x":27.2,"y":11.1,"from":-69.98,"to":-39.97,"r":10,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"angle","x":20,"y":52,"from":80.02,"to":0,"r":9,"tone":"muted","label":"2x"},{"t":"angle","x":76,"y":52,"from":140.03,"to":180,"r":9,"tone":"muted","label":"x"},{"t":"line","x1":25.08,"y1":31.81,"x2":22.12,"y2":31.29,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":44.06,"y1":23.3,"x2":42.14,"y2":25.6,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":29.85,"y1":50.5,"x2":29.85,"y2":53.5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":32.25,"y1":50.5,"x2":32.25,"y2":53.5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":48.67,"y1":44.52,"x2":50.6,"y2":46.82,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":50.5,"y1":42.98,"x2":52.43,"y2":45.28,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":67.54,"y1":42.98,"x2":65.62,"y2":45.28,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":69.38,"y1":44.52,"x2":67.46,"y2":46.82,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"dot","x":27.2,"y":11.1,"label":"A","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":20,"y":52,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":76,"y":52,"label":"C","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":42.1,"y":52,"label":"D","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":59,"y":37.8,"label":"E","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["要证「长线段等于两段之和」，考虑截长法：在 AC 上截取 AE=AB，连接 DE。","因为 AD 平分 ∠ BAC，所以 ∠ BAD=∠ EAD；又 AB=AE，AD=AD，所以 △ ABD≌△ AED（SAS），得 BD=ED，∠ AED=∠ B=2∠ C。","∠ AED 是 △ DEC 的外角，所以 ∠ AED=∠ EDC+∠ C（三角形的外角等于与它不相邻的两个内角的和）。于是 2∠ C=∠ EDC+∠ C，得 ∠ EDC=∠ C。","由等角对等边得 ED=EC。所以 AC=AE+EC=AB+ED=AB+BD。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：AC=AB+BD。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"证明「长边等于两短边之和」先想截长或补短：本题在长边上截取等于短边的线段，用角平分线构造全等，再用外角定理把角的倍数关系转化成等腰三角形。"},{"type":"note","title":"例题","text":"已知：在 △ ABC 中，∠ ACB=90^°，AC=BC，直线 l 经过点 C，A、B 两点在直线 l 的同侧，AD⊥ l 于点 D，BE⊥ l 于点 E，且垂足 D、E 分别位于点 C 的两侧。求证：△ ACD≌△ CBE，且 DE=AD+BE。"},{"type":"figure","figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zhengming-e5","title":"一线三直角：构造全等三角形","caption":"∠ACB=90°、AC=BC（相等的两腰画有相同的等长记号），直线 l 过点 C，AD⊥l 于 D、BE⊥l 于 E：△ACD≌△CBE，所以 DE=DC+CE=AD+BE","view":"square","alt":"等腰直角三角形 ABC 的顶点 C 在一条水平直线 l 上；从 A、B 分别向直线 l 作垂线，垂足为 D 与 E，且 D 与 E 分别位于点 C 的两侧，三处直角都画有方框。","prims":[{"t":"line","x1":8,"y1":40,"x2":92,"y2":40,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"poly","points":[[26,16],[74,16],[50,40]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":26,"y1":16,"x2":26,"y2":40},{"t":"line","x1":74,"y1":16,"x2":74,"y2":40},{"t":"line","x1":26,"y1":36.5,"x2":29.5,"y2":36.5,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":29.5,"y1":36.5,"x2":29.5,"y2":40,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":74,"y1":36.5,"x2":70.5,"y2":36.5,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":70.5,"y1":36.5,"x2":70.5,"y2":40,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":47.53,"y1":37.53,"x2":50,"y2":35.05,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":35.05,"x2":52.47,"y2":37.53,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":39.06,"y1":26.94,"x2":36.94,"y2":29.06,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":60.94,"y1":26.94,"x2":63.06,"y2":29.06,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"text","x":90,"y":36,"text":"l","anchor":"end","size":3.6,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"dot","x":26,"y":16,"label":"A","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":74,"y":16,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":40,"label":"C","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":26,"y":40,"label":"D","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":74,"y":40,"label":"E","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6}]}},{"type":"list","title":"解题步骤","items":["因为 AD⊥ l，BE⊥ l，所以 ∠ ADC=∠ CEB=90^°（垂直的定义）。","因为 ∠ ACB=90^°，且 D、C、E 在同一条直线上，所以 ∠ ACD+∠ ACB+∠ BCE=180^°，得 ∠ ACD+∠ BCE=90^°。","在 Rt△ CBE 中，∠ CBE+∠ BCE=90^°（直角三角形两锐角互余），所以 ∠ ACD=∠ CBE（同角的余角相等）。","又 ∠ ADC=∠ CEB=90^°，AC=CB，所以 △ ACD≌△ CBE（AAS）。由全等得 CD=BE，AD=CE，因为 D、E 在点 C 的两侧，所以 DE=CD+CE=BE+AD。"]},{"type":"p","text":"答案：△ ACD≌△ CBE，且 DE=AD+BE。"},{"type":"note","title":"方法小结","text":"「一线三直角」是构造全等与相似的高频基本图形：直线上的平角拆成 90^°+90^° 后，用「同角的余角相等」转移一对锐角，再配一条相等的边即可。"},{"type":"list","title":"易错点","items":["用边边角（SSA）判定全等是最高频的硬错误；判定全等必须用 SAS（夹角），判定相似时「两边成比例且一角相等」的角同样必须是夹角。","把判定与性质用反：由「两直线平行」推出「内错角相等」是性质，由「内错角相等」推出「两直线平行」是判定；「等边对等角」是性质，「等角对等边」是判定，依据写错即失分。","用到公共边、对顶角、公共角、同圆半径相等等隐含条件却不写依据；或者辅助线只写「作辅助线」而不写明「延长……使……连接……」的作法，推理都缺少支撑。","由相似得出面积比时忘记平方关系，把面积比当成相似比，导致结论数值错误。","写全等式时对应顶点顺序写错，例如由 $\\triangle ABC\\cong\\triangle DEF$ 得出 $AB=EF$，后续的对应关系会全部错位。","用「由图可知」「显然」代替推理，或用要证的结论去证明它自己（循环论证）；图形只能帮助思考，不能作为证明的依据。"]},{"type":"list","title":"解题方法","items":["见中点想两条路：有两个中点时连中位线，只有一个中点（中线）时倍长中线构造全等。","见角平分线想两条路：向角的两边作垂线段，用角平分线的性质得线段相等；或作平行线，用「角平分线加平行线出等腰」得等边等角。","证切线「连半径，证垂直」；证明垂直可用等腰三角形的三线合一，也可用勾股定理的逆定理。","求线段长优先考虑勾股定理与相似三角形，设未知数列方程比逐步推算更稳；遇到 30^°、45^°、60^° 直接利用三边比设份数。","条件分散时用旋转、平移、轴对称把图形「搬家」，把散落的边和角集中到同一个三角形中；读题时主动识别基本图形（三线八角、A 型与 X 型相似、母子型、一线三等角、角平分线加平行线、直径与直角）。"]}],"questions":[{"id":"m-geo-zhengming-yiucuo-q1","type":"choice","stem":"在 △ ABC 和 △ DEF 中，已知 AB=DE，AC=DF，∠ B=∠ E，则这两个三角形","answer":"D","explain":"这三组条件是「两边和其中一边的对角分别相等」，即边边角（SSA）。∠ B 是 AB 与 BC 的夹角，并不是 AB、AC 的夹角，因此不能判定全等，两个三角形可能不全等，所以只能选「不一定全等」。","options":["一定全等，依据是 SSS","一定全等，依据是 SAS","一定全等，依据是 ASA","不一定全等"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["全等判定","边边角","错误辨析"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zhengming-q1","title":"边边角不能判定全等","caption":"AB=DE、AC=DF（1 道与 2 道记号），但 ∠B 与 ∠E 是其中一边的对角：这样的两组条件不能判定全等","view":"wide","alt":"两个三角形 ABC 与 DEF：左边把边 AB 与 AC 加粗并标出角 B，右边把边 DE 与 DF 加粗并标出角 E，表示两边与其中一边的对角分别相等。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[6,12],[46,12],[18,46]],"closed":true},{"t":"poly","points":[[54,12],[94,12],[66,46]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":26,"y1":10.5,"x2":26,"y2":13.5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":74,"y1":10.5,"x2":74,"y2":13.5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":13.02,"y1":27.37,"x2":10.19,"y2":28.37,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":13.81,"y1":29.63,"x2":10.98,"y2":30.63,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":61.02,"y1":27.37,"x2":58.19,"y2":28.37,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":61.81,"y1":29.63,"x2":58.98,"y2":30.63,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"angle","x":46,"y":12,"from":-180,"to":-129.47,"r":7,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"angle","x":94,"y":12,"from":-180,"to":-129.47,"r":7,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"dot","x":6,"y":12,"label":"A","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":46,"y":12,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":18,"y":46,"label":"C","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":54,"y":12,"label":"D","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":94,"y":12,"label":"E","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":66,"y":46,"label":"F","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6}]}},{"id":"m-geo-zhengming-yiucuo-q2","type":"choice","stem":"在 △ ABC 中，D 是 AB 的中点，E 是 AC 的中点，则下列结论正确的是","answer":"B","explain":"D、E 分别是 AB、AC 的中点，所以 DE 是 △ ABC 的中位线，由中位线定理得 DE∥ BC 且 DE=(1)/(2)BC。中位线平行于第三边，所以 D 错；长度是第三边的一半，所以 A、C 也错。","options":["DE=(1)/(2)AB","DE∥ BC 且 DE=(1)/(2)BC","DE=BC","DE∥ AB"],"difficulty":1,"tags":["中位线定理","基本图形"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zhengming-q2","title":"中位线的两个结论","caption":"D、E 是 AB、AC 的中点：DE∥BC 且 DE 等于 BC 的一半（两处画有平行箭头与等长记号）","view":"wide","alt":"三角形 ABC，D 是 AB 的中点、E 是 AC 的中点，连接 DE；DE 与 BC 上画有平行的箭头。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[10,52],[90,52],[30,12]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":52,"x2":20,"y2":32,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":30,"y1":50.5,"x2":30,"y2":53.5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":70,"y1":50.5,"x2":70,"y2":53.5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":13.12,"y1":42.4,"x2":15.8,"y2":43.74,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":14.2,"y1":40.26,"x2":16.88,"y2":41.6,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":23.12,"y1":22.4,"x2":25.8,"y2":23.74,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":24.2,"y1":20.26,"x2":26.88,"y2":21.6,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"poly","points":[[37.41,41.81],[34.58,41.72],[35.75,44.3]],"tone":"accent"},{"t":"poly","points":[[62.41,31.81],[59.58,31.72],[60.75,34.3]],"tone":"accent"},{"t":"dot","x":10,"y":52,"label":"A","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":90,"y":52,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":30,"y":12,"label":"C","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":52,"label":"D","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":20,"y":32,"label":"E","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6}]}},{"id":"m-geo-zhengming-yiucuo-q3","type":"choice","stem":"要证明「经过半径外端且垂直于半径的直线是圆的切线」，画图后最恰当的第一步辅助线是","answer":"A","explain":"切线问题的通用第一步是「连半径」：连接圆心与直线上的已知点（即半径的外端），得到半径后就可以用「垂直于半径」来判定切线，或用「切线垂直于过切点的半径」来使用已知切线。","options":["连接圆心与直线上的已知点，得到半径","过切点作一条弦","过圆心作任意一条直线","把切线向两端延长"],"difficulty":1,"tags":["辅助线","切线"]},{"id":"m-geo-zhengming-yiucuo-q4","type":"fill","stem":"在 △ ABC 中，AD 是 BC 边上的中线，AD=5，把 AD 延长到 E 使 DE=AD，则 AE= ____。（只填数字）","answer":"10","explain":"由作法得 DE=AD=5，且点 D 在线段 AE 上，所以 AE=AD+DE=5+5=10。倍长中线后由 △ ADC≌△ EDB（SAS）可得 AC=BE，这是把分散线段集中到同一三角形的常用方法。","difficulty":1,"tags":["倍长中线","辅助线"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zhengming-q3","title":"把中线延长一倍","caption":"AD 是 BC 边上的中线；延长 AD 到 E 使 DE=AD，于是 AE=2AD","view":"square","alt":"三角形 ABC，AD 是 BC 边上的中线；延长 AD 到点 E 使 DE 等于 AD，连接 BE，AD 与 DE 画有相同的等长记号。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[30,14],[10,54],[88,54]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":30,"y1":14,"x2":68,"y2":94,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":10,"y1":54,"x2":68,"y2":94},{"t":"line","x1":40.85,"y1":33.36,"x2":38.15,"y2":34.64,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":59.85,"y1":73.36,"x2":57.15,"y2":74.64,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"dot","x":30,"y":14,"label":"A","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":10,"y":54,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":88,"y":54,"label":"C","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":49,"y":54,"label":"D","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":68,"y":94,"label":"E","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6}]}},{"id":"m-geo-zhengming-yiucuo-q5","type":"fill","stem":"在 △ ABC 中，BD 平分 ∠ ABC，DE∥ BC 交 AB 于点 E，若 BE=4，则 DE= ____。（只填数字）","answer":"4","explain":"由 DE∥ BC 得 ∠ EDB=∠ DBC（两直线平行，内错角相等）；由 BD 平分 ∠ ABC 得 ∠ EBD=∠ DBC（角平分线的定义）。所以 ∠ EBD=∠ EDB，由「等角对等边」得 DE=BE=4。","difficulty":2,"tags":["角平分线加平行线","等腰三角形"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zhengming-q4","title":"角平分线 + 平行线 = 等腰三角形","caption":"BD 平分 ∠ABC，DE∥BC：∠EDB=∠DBC=∠EBD，所以 BE=DE","view":"wide","alt":"三角形 ABC，BD 平分角 ABC 与 AC 交于点 D；过 D 作 DE 平行于 BC 交 AB 于点 E，顶点 B 处两个角画有相同的弧线，DE 与 BC 上画有平行的箭头。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[36,10],[14,54],[88,54]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":14,"y1":54,"x2":56.8,"y2":27.6,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":56.8,"y1":27.6,"x2":27.2,"y2":27.6,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"poly","points":[[43.9,26.1],[41.5,27.6],[43.9,29.1]],"tone":"accent"},{"t":"poly","points":[[49.1,55.5],[51.5,54],[49.1,52.5]],"tone":"accent"},{"t":"angle","x":14,"y":54,"from":63.43,"to":31.67,"r":9,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"angle","x":14,"y":54,"from":31.67,"to":0,"r":9,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"dot","x":36,"y":10,"label":"A","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":14,"y":54,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":88,"y":54,"label":"C","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":56.8,"y":27.6,"label":"D","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":27.2,"y":27.6,"label":"E","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6}]}},{"id":"m-geo-zhengming-yiucuo-q6","type":"short","stem":"指出下面证明中的错误并加以改正：已知在 △ ABC 和 △ DEF 中，AB=DE，BC=EF，∠ A=∠ D，所以 △ ABC≌△ DEF。","answer":"错误在于使用了边边角（SSA）：已知的是两条边 $AB$、$BC$ 和其中一边 $BC$ 的对角 $\\angle A$ 相等，这样的条件不能唯一确定三角形的形状，因此不能判定两个三角形全等。改正方法一：把相等的角换成两条对应边的夹角，例如把条件改为 $\\angle B=\\angle E$，此时 $AB=DE$、$\\angle B=\\angle E$、$BC=EF$ 构成「两边和它们的夹角分别相等」，用 SAS 可以判定全等。改正方法二：保留角的条件再补充一个角，例如再加上 $\\angle C=\\angle F$，此时已知两角（$\\angle A=\\angle D$、$\\angle C=\\angle F$）与其中一角的对边（$BC=EF$）分别相等，用 AAS 可以判定全等。总之，判定全等时角必须是两边的夹角（SAS），或者已知两角与一条边（ASA、AAS），边边角不能判定全等。","explain":"本题考查全等判定条件的辨析与证明纠错表达。评分要点：指出错误在于使用边边角，说明该条件不能唯一确定三角形；给出至少一种正确改正（换成夹角用 SAS，或补充一个角用 AAS、ASA）；归纳判定全等对条件的要求。常见失分点：只说「错了」而不指出错在哪一条判定上；改正时换成了同样无效的条件；把相似判定与全等判定的依据混写。","difficulty":3,"tags":["全等判定","错误辨析","证明规范"],"rubric":["指出错误是使用了边边角（SSA）","说明 SSA 不能唯一确定三角形的形状，故不能判定全等","给出至少一种正确的改正（换成夹角用 SAS，或补充一个角用 AAS/ASA）","概括判定全等对条件的要求（夹角，或两角一边）"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zhengming-q5","title":"错在用边边角判定全等","caption":"AB=DE、BC=EF（1 道与 2 道记号），∠A=∠D；但 ∠A 不是 AB 与 BC 的夹角，属边边角，不能判定全等","view":"wide","alt":"两个三角形 ABC 与 DEF：左边把边 AB 与 BC 加粗并标出角 A，右边把边 DE 与 EF 加粗并标出角 D，表示两边与其中一边的对角分别相等。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[6,12],[46,12],[18,46]],"closed":true},{"t":"poly","points":[[54,12],[94,12],[66,46]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":26,"y1":10.5,"x2":26,"y2":13.5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":74,"y1":10.5,"x2":74,"y2":13.5,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":33.92,"y1":29.03,"x2":31.6,"y2":27.12,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":32.4,"y1":30.88,"x2":30.08,"y2":28.97,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":81.92,"y1":29.03,"x2":79.6,"y2":27.12,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":80.4,"y1":30.88,"x2":78.08,"y2":28.97,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"angle","x":6,"y":12,"from":0,"to":-70.56,"r":7,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"angle","x":54,"y":12,"from":0,"to":-70.56,"r":7,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"dot","x":6,"y":12,"label":"A","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":46,"y":12,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":18,"y":46,"label":"C","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":54,"y":12,"label":"D","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":94,"y":12,"label":"E","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":66,"y":46,"label":"F","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6}]}},{"id":"m-geo-zhengming-yiucuo-z1","type":"choice","stem":"下列关于几何证明的说法中，正确的是","answer":"D","explain":"图形只能帮助思考，不能作为推理依据，A 错；「等边对等角」是由两边相等推出两角相等，反过来由角相等得边相等用的是「等角对等边」，B 把方向弄反了；判定与性质的前提和结论互换、推理方向不同，不能互相替代，C 错；D 正是证明规范的基本要求，正确。","options":["证明中写「由图可知」「显然」即可，不必再写推理依据","由「等边对等角」可以推出两条线段相等","只要推理的大方向对，判定与性质可以互相替代使用","证明中每一步都要有依据，依据可以是定义、基本事实、定理或已经推出的结论"],"difficulty":2,"tags":["证明规范","判定与性质"]},{"id":"m-geo-zhengming-yiucuo-z2","type":"short","stem":"已知：在 △ ABC 中，AB=AC，D 是 BC 边的中点，DE⊥ AB 于点 E，DF⊥ AC 于点 F。求证：AE=AF，BE=CF。","answer":"连接 $AD$。因为 $AB=AC$，$BD=CD$，$AD=AD$，所以 $\\triangle ABD\\cong\\triangle ACD$（SSS），得 $\\angle BAD=\\angle CAD$（也可由等腰三角形「三线合一」直接得到 $AD$ 平分顶角）。因为 $DE\\perp AB$，$DF\\perp AC$，所以 $\\angle AED=\\angle AFD=90^\\circ$。又 $\\angle EAD=\\angle FAD$，$AD=AD$，所以 $\\triangle AED\\cong\\triangle AFD$（AAS），得 $AE=AF$。因为 $AB=AC$，$AE=AF$，所以 $BE=AB-AE=AC-AF=CF$。","explain":"本题考查等腰三角形性质与全等三角形判定的综合运用。评分要点：连 AD 并用 SSS 或「三线合一」得 ∠ BAD=∠ CAD；由两直角、一组等角与公共边用 AAS 证 △ AED≌△ AFD；利用 AB=AC 与 AE=AF 作差得 BE=CF。常见失分点：直接写两个三角形全等却不先证角相等；把 AAS 误写成 SSA；只证 AE=AF 而漏掉 BE=CF。","difficulty":3,"tags":["辅助线","三线合一"],"rubric":["连接 AD，用 SSS（或三线合一）说明 ∠BAD=∠CAD","用 AAS 证 △AED≌△AFD，得 AE=AF","由 AB=AC 与 AE=AF 作差得 BE=CF"],"figure":{"id":"fig-m-geo-zhengming-z2","title":"等腰三角形三线合一 + 双垂","caption":"AB=AC、D 是 BC 的中点：AD 也是高与顶角平分线；再由 DE⊥AB、DF⊥AC 得 △ADE≌△ADF，所以 AE=AF、BE=CF","view":"square","alt":"等腰三角形 ABC，AB 与 AC 画有相同的等长记号；D 是 BC 的中点，连接 AD，从 D 分别向 AB、AC 作垂线，垂足为 E 与 F。","prims":[{"t":"poly","points":[[50,12],[14,54],[86,54]],"closed":true},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":12,"x2":50,"y2":54,"tone":"accent"},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":54,"x2":29.2,"y2":36.2},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":54,"x2":70.8,"y2":36.2},{"t":"line","x1":31.48,"y1":33.55,"x2":34.14,"y2":35.82,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":34.14,"y1":35.82,"x2":31.86,"y2":38.48,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":68.52,"y1":33.55,"x2":65.86,"y2":35.82,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":65.86,"y1":35.82,"x2":68.14,"y2":38.48,"tone":"muted"},{"t":"line","x1":33.14,"y1":33.98,"x2":30.86,"y2":32.02,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"line","x1":69.14,"y1":32.02,"x2":66.86,"y2":33.98,"tone":"ok"},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":12,"label":"A","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":14,"y":54,"label":"B","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":86,"y":54,"label":"C","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":50,"y":54,"label":"D","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":29.2,"y":36.2,"label":"E","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6},{"t":"dot","x":70.8,"y":36.2,"label":"F","labelDx":2.2,"labelDy":-2.6}]}}]}];
